":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#错误","content":"已取消","locale":"zh-CN"},"173":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-171","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#错误","content":"访问控制本身的拒绝另有三种：`bad_host`（400）、`bad_origin`（403）、`auth_required`（401）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"174":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-172","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"每个请求依次经过三项检查（`mizuoto/api/security.py`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"175":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-173","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"**Host 头。** 服务器绑定在本机地址（默认 `127.0.0.1`）时，`Host` 必须是 `localhost`、`127.0.0.1`、`::1`、绑定的地址，或嵌入方用 `extra_hosts` / `allow_host()` 加入的名称，否则返回 400 `bad_host`。这可以防止 DNS 重绑定。绑定到非本机地址（如 `0.0.0.0`）时不检查 `Host`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"176":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-174","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"**来源（Origin）。** 改变状态的请求（`GET`、`HEAD`、`OPTIONS` 以外）和 WebSocket，如果带 `Origin`，它必须是页面自己的来源或列在 `server.allowed_origins` 中，否则返回 403 `bad_origin`；没有 `Origin` 但 `Sec-Fetch-Site` 表明是跨站请求时同样拒绝。curl、Python 等非浏览器客户端不带这些头，不受影响。`server.allowed_origins` 非空时服务器还会为这些来源开启 CORS。","locale":"zh-CN"},"177":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-175","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"**访问令牌。** 设置了 `server.access_token` 时，`/api/`、`/ws/`、`/v1/`、`/openapi.json` 和 `/docs` 下的每个请求都要带上令牌，否则返回 401 `auth_required`。唯一的例外是 `GET /api/v1/app/health`。令牌可以用以下任一方式提供：","locale":"zh-CN"},"178":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-176","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"179":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-177","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"示例","locale":"zh-CN"},"180":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-178","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs