nt":"`GET /api/v1/jobs/{id}`；列表 `GET /api/v1/jobs?state=active`","locale":"zh-CN"},"212":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-210","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"日志","locale":"zh-CN"},"213":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-211","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"`GET /api/v1/jobs/{id}/log?offset=0`（返回 `lines` 和 `next_offset`，下次从这里继续读）","locale":"zh-CN"},"214":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-212","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"取消","locale":"zh-CN"},"215":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-213","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"`POST /api/v1/jobs/{id}/cancel`","locale":"zh-CN"},"216":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-214","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"重试","locale":"zh-CN"},"217":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-215","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"`POST /api/v1/jobs/{id}/retry`（失败、已取消或已中断的任务）","locale":"zh-CN"},"218":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-216","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"不排队直接运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"219":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-217","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"`POST /api/v1/jobs/{id}/run-anyway`（在等 GPU 的任务；确认显存够用时）","locale":"zh-CN"},"220":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-218","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"合成可以直接等待结果：`POST /api/v1/tts/speak?wait=true&timeout=600`。任务结束后返回完成的任务，`result.output_id`（批量时为 `result.output_ids`）是结果的 id；超过 `timeout` 秒（默认 600，最多 3600）仍未结束时返回 504 `timeout`，`detail.job_id` 是仍在继续运行的任务，之后照常查询即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"221":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-219","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"结果音频用 `GET /api/v1/outputs/{id}/content` 下载，`GET /api/v1/outputs/{id}` 返回它的参数、时长、采样率和生成耗时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"222":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-220","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"不想轮询的话，订阅 事件 中的 `job_updated`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"223":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-221","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#合成并下载","content":"请求体就是 `SpeakRequest`，主要字段如下（完整定义见 `/docs`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"224":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-222","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#合成并下载","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"225":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-223","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#合成并下载","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"226":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-224","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#合成并下载","content":"`model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"227":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-225","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#合成并下载","content":"`<引擎>/<模型>`，如 `cosyvoice/cosyvoice3-0.5b`","locale":"zh-CN"},"228":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-226","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#合成并下载","content":"`text` / `texts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"229":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-227","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#合成并下载","content":"文本；`texts` 是一批文本，每条一个结果（模型需支持批量）","locale":"zh-CN"},"230":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-228","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#合成并下载","content":"`language`","locale":"zh-CN"},"231":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-229","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#合成并下载","content":"`zh`、`en`……或 `auto`","locale":"zh-CN"},"232":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-230","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advan