仍然照常保存为一个结果（`output_id`）。客户端随时可以发送 `{\"type\": \"cancel\"}` 取消。","locale":"zh-CN"},"283":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-281","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#websocketapiv1ttsstream","content":"`granularity` 说明音频有多“细”：`token` 是模型逐 token 输出（CosyVoice、VoxCPM、Qwen3-TTS），`segment` 是每段一次，`emulated` 是模型本身不分段输出、由 Mizuoto 切分文本来模拟。","locale":"zh-CN"},"284":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-282","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#websocketapiv1ttsstream","content":"**流式文本输入**：模型支持 **流式文本输入**（CosyVoice 2 和 3）时，请求中设 `\"text_stream\": true`，`text` 只是开头；之后发送 `{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"…\"}` 追加文本，最后发送 `{\"type\": \"flush\"}`。在 `flush` 之前断开连接会取消任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"285":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-283","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#httppost-ttsspeakstreamtrue","content":"不方便用 WebSocket 时，同一个请求加上 `stream=true`，响应就是边生成边发送的音频（分块传输）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"286":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-284","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#httppost-ttsspeakstreamtrue","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"287":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-285","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#httppost-ttsspeakstreamtrue","content":"响应","locale":"zh-CN"},"288":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-286","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#httppost-ttsspeakstreamtrue","content":"`stream_format=wav`（默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"289":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-287","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#httppost-ttsspeakstreamtrue","content":"长度未知的 WAV（头部之后直接是 PCM16 数据）","locale":"zh-CN"},"290":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-288","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#httppost-ttsspeakstreamtrue","content":"`stream_format=pcm`","locale":"zh-CN"},"291":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-289","page_id":"/doc