-docker-22","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建阶段","content":"`python:<PYTHON>-slim`","locale":"zh-CN"},"344":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-23","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建阶段","content":"由 `scripts/build_wheels.py` 构建的 Mizuoto wheel，`GATED=1` 时还有 Fish Speech 和 IndexTTS 的 wheel，以及为 GPT-SoVITS 日语前端编译的 pyopenjtalk wheel","locale":"zh-CN"},"345":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-24","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建阶段","content":"（最终镜像）","locale":"zh-CN"},"346":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-25","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建阶段","content":"`python:<PYTHON>-slim`","locale":"zh-CN"},"347":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-26","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建阶段","content":"先从 `TORCH_INDEX` 安装 torch，再安装这些 wheel 及所有可选前端；运行 `mizuoto webui`","locale":"zh-CN"},"348":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-27","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建阶段","content":"`web` 阶段使用 `bun install --frozen-lockfile` 安装依赖，再用 `npm run build` 执行 `vue-tsc --noEmit && vite build`。`vue-tsc` 需要真正的 Node.js：仅使用 Bun 镜像时，其 `node` 回退命令实际运行 Bun，可能使 Vue 组件的属性和导出类型无法识别。Node.js 和 bun 只用于构建，不进入最终的 Python 镜像。","locale":"zh-CN"},"349":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-28","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"350":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-29","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建参数","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"351":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-30","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建参数","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"352":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-31","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建参数","content":"`TORCH_INDEX`","locale":"zh-CN"},"353":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-32","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建参数","content":"`https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu128`","locale":"zh-CN"},"354":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-33","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建参数","content":"torch 的来源，也就决定了它的构建：download.pytorch.org 上其他 CUDA（`cu126` … `cu132`）、ROCm（`rocm6.4` … `rocm7.2`）或 `cpu` 的索引","locale":"zh-CN"},"355":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-34","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建参数","content":"`TORCH`","locale":"zh-CN"},"356":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-35","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建参数","content":"`torch>=2.8`","locale":"zh-CN"},"357":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-36","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建参数","content":"torch 的版本要求，例如 `torch==2.8.0`","locale":"zh-CN"},"358":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-37","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建参数","content":"`GATED`","locale":"zh-CN"},"359":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-38","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建参数","content":"`0`","locale":"zh-CN"},"360":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-39","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建参数","content":"`1`：加入 Fish Speech 和 IndexTTS（含 IndexTTS-2.5 的日语支持）","locale":"zh-CN"},"361":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-40","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建参数","content":"`PYTHON`","locale":"zh-CN"},"362":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-41","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建参数","content":"`3.11`","locale":"zh-CN"},"363":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-42","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建参数","content":"镜像中的 Python（`python:<版本>-slim`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"364":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-43","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#构建参数","content":"构建镜像时看不到 GPU，所以 torch 的构建由索引指定，而不是按驱动自动选择。默认的 CUDA 12.8 构建需要 NVIDIA 驱动 570 或更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"365":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-44","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"没有额外的系统软件包：torch、PyAV 和文本处理库的原生代码都在各自的 wheel 里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"366":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-45","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"torch，然后是 Mizuoto 及 `mizuoto[gptsovits-ja,gptsovits-ko]`（`GATED=1` 时还有 `mizuoto-indextts[ja]`）；其余依赖在构建镜像时从 PyPI 安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"367":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-46","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"没有 C 编译器，所以 **编译模型（torch.compile）** 不起作用：引擎照常运行，并给出一次警告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"368":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-47","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"使用 `ACCEL=1` 时，加入不需要编译器就能安装的可选注意力包：`mizuoto doctor` 为镜像中的 torch 给出的 xFormers 版本（CPU 版 torch 没有），以及 CUDA 版上的 SageAttention 1.0.6。不包含 FlashAttention：除非有与 torch 匹配的 wheel，否则它要编译很久，而它唯一的 torch 2.8 wheel 会让 xFormers 0.0.32 无法导入。在 设置 › 计算 › 加速 中选择它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"369":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-48","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"环境变量：","locale":"zh-CN"},"370":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-49","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"变量","locale":"zh-CN"},"371":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-50","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"值","locale":"zh-CN"},"372":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-51","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"373":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-52","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR`","locale":"zh-CN"},"374":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-53","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"`/data`","locale":"zh-CN"},"375":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-54","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"数据文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"376":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-55","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"`MIZUOTO_SERVER__OPEN_BROWSER`","locale":"zh-CN"},"377":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-56","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"`false`","locale":"zh-CN"},"378":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-57","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"不打开浏览器","locale":"zh-CN"},"379":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-58","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"`PYTHONUNBUFFERED`","locale":"zh-CN"},"380":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-59","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"`1`","locale":"zh-CN"},"381":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-60","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"日志立即出现在 `docker logs` 中","locale":"zh-CN"},"382":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-61","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"`VOLUME /data`、`EXPOSE 7869`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"383":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-62","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"健康检查：每 30 秒请求 `http://127.0.0.1:7869/api/v1/app/health`（这个地址不需要令牌）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"384":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-63","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"启动命令：`mizuoto webui --host 0.0.0.0 --port 7869 --no-open`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"385":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-64","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#运行","content":"然后在浏览器打开 `http://<主机地址>:7869`，网页界面会要求输入一次 **访问令牌**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"386":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-65","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#运行","content":"`--gpus all` 需要宿主机安装 NVIDIA 驱动和 NVIDIA Container Toolkit。不加 `--gpus` 时引擎在 CPU 上运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"387":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-66","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#运行","content":"只想用某一块 GPU：`--gpus '\"device=1\"'`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"388":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-67","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#运行","content":"`docker exec -it mizuoto mizuoto doctor` 检查镜像里的 torch 是否适合容器能看到的 GPU。","locale":"zh-CN"},"389":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-68","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#运行","content":"容器里的服务器绑定在 `0.0.0.0`，这时 Mizuoto 不再检查 `Host` 头，任何能连到端口的人都能使用全部功能（下载模型、删除文件）。请用 `MIZUOTO_SERVER__ACCESS_TOKEN` 设置令牌，或只把端口映射到本机：`-p 127.0.0.1:7869:7869`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"390":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-69","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#数据卷","content":"Mizuoto 写入的一切都在 `/data` 中：`settings.toml`、数据库、模型、共享文件、音色、结果、数据集、实验、项目、缓存和日志。镜像本身不保存状态，重新构建的镜像可以继续使用同一个数据卷。","locale":"zh-CN"},"391":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-70","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#设置与环境变量","content":"任何设置都可以用 `MIZUOTO_<分组>__<字段>` 环境变量给出（见 配置与环境变量）。环境变量的值只在内存中生效，不写入 `/data/settings.toml`，在网页界面中显示为 **由环境变量设置**：","locale":"zh-CN"},"392":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-71","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#设置与环境变量","content":"`HF_TOKEN` 只会发送给 huggingface.co（见 模型下载）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"393":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-72","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#在容器里使用命令行","content":"镜像的环境变量对 `docker exec` 同样有效，所以命令行直接作用于同一个数据文件夹：","locale":"zh-CN"},"394":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-73","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#需要接受许可的引擎","content":"只有用 `--build-arg GATED=1` 构建的镜像才包含 Fish Speech 和 IndexTTS；否则它们的卡片显示 **不可用**（缺少 `mizuoto-fishspeech` 或 `mizuoto-indextts`）。即使包含了，下载它们的模型和合成之前仍要接受许可：","locale":"zh-CN"},"395":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-74","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#需要接受许可的引擎","content":"或在网页界面 **模型** › **引擎** 中点击 **接受许可**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"396":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-75","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#在容器里运行-agent","content":"GPU 机器可以用同一个镜像作为 远程主机，运行 `mizuoto agent` 而不是网页界面：","locale":"zh-CN"},"397":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-76","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#在容器里运行-agent","content":"agent 有自己的数据卷和模型；它的镜像与主机的镜像构建方式相同（相同的 Mizuoto 版本，要提供需许可的引擎时用 `GATED=1`）。镜像的健康检查请求的是网页界面的 7869 端口，agent 不提供它，所以这里用 `--no-healthcheck` 关掉。agent 没有 TLS 时请求和音频以明文传输，请只在可信的网络中使用，或用 `--ssl-certfile` / `--ssl-keyfile` 提供证书（把证书文件挂载进容器）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"398":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-77","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#在容器里运行-agent","content":"然后在主机一侧：","locale":"zh-CN"},"399":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","page_id":"/docs/ad