ld整理已安装的模型","content":"`build`：整理已安装的模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"410":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-10","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy下载整个目录","content":"`mirror_fetch.py`：下载整个目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"411":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-11","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_readmepy说明页和许可文件","content":"`mirror_readme.py`：说明页和许可文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"412":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-12","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#upload发布","content":"`upload`：发布","locale":"zh-CN"},"413":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-13","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#check检查缺少的文件","content":"`check`：检查缺少的文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"414":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-14","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#自建镜像","content":"自建镜像","locale":"zh-CN"},"415":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-15","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads","content":"模型目录中的每个模型都写明了它的仓库，以及一份固定版本的文件清单（`mizuoto/core/engines/manifests/files/*.files.json`）：仓库的提交、每个文件的路径、大小和 SHA-256。下载时 Mizuoto 只取清单里的文件，下载完逐个核对大小和 SHA-256，所以无论从哪个来源下载，得到的文件都完全相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"416":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-16","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#下载来源","content":"`downloads.source`","locale":"zh-CN"},"417":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-17","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#下载来源","content":"地址","locale":"zh-CN"},"418":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-18","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#下载来源","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"419":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-19","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#下载来源","content":"`huggingface`（默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"420":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-20","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#下载来源","content":"`https://huggingface.co`","locale":"zh-CN"},"421":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-21","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#下载来源","content":"官方仓库","locale":"zh-CN"},"422":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-22","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#下载来源","content":"`hf-mirror`","locale":"zh-CN"},"423":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-23","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#下载来源","content":"`https://hf-mirror.com`","locale":"zh-CN"},"424":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-24","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#下载来源","content":"Hugging Face 的镜像，在中国大陆通常更快","locale":"zh-CN"},"425":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-25","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#下载来源","content":"`modelscope`","locale":"zh-CN"},"426":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-26","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#下载来源","content":"`https://www.modelscope.cn`","locale":"zh-CN"},"427":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-27","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#下载来源","content":"魔搭社区，只用于写明了 ModelScope 仓库的模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"428":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-28","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#下载来源","content":"`custom`","locale":"zh-CN"},"429":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-29","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#下载来源","content":"`downloads.endpoint`","locale":"zh-CN"},"430":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-30","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#下载来源","content":"任何与 Hugging Face 兼容的服务器（地址形式见自建镜像）","locale":"zh-CN"},"431":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-31","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#下载来源","content":"**设置** › **下载** › **下载来源**；选 **自定义** 时填写 **自定义地址**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"432":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-32","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#下载来源","content":"在 ModelScope 上有仓库的模型：Qwen3-TTS、CosyVoice 和 VoxCPM 的全部模型，以及 OmniVoice。CosyVoice 的共享文件 `cosyvoice/wetext` 只在 ModelScope 上有，所以无论选哪个来源都从那里下载。其他模型（F5-TTS、GPT-SoVITS、IndexTTS、Fish Speech、语音识别的 Whisper）和它们的共享文件只来自 Hugging Face 及其兼容地址。ModelScope 上取 `master` 分支（`cosyvoice/wetext` 固定在一个提交），文件同样按清单里的大小和 SHA-256 核对。ModelScope 可能对同时进行的多个匿名下载返回 403；把 `downloads.concurrency` 设为 1 即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"433":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-33","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#来源的顺序与回退","content":"每个文件单独选择来源：","locale":"zh-CN"},"434":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-34","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#来源的顺序与回退","content":"`downloads.repository` 为 `mizuoto-model`（默认值）时，先试 mizuoto-model 镜像；","locale":"zh-CN"},"435":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-35","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#来源的顺序与回退","content":"然后是 `downloads.source` 选中的来源；","locale":"zh-CN"},"436":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-36","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#来源的顺序与回退","content":"然后依次是其余的 `huggingface`、`hf-mirror`、`modelscope`（选了 `custom` 时，`custom` 排在这三者之前）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"437":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-37","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#来源的顺序与回退","content":"某个来源对一个文件返回 401、403 或 404，或者给出的文件大小、SHA-256 不对时，立即换下一个来源；其他错误（网络中断、超时、5xx）在同一来源重试，最多 4 次，间隔 1、2、4、8 秒（最长 30 秒）。所有来源都失败时任务以 `download_failed`（退出码 12）结束，错误详情列出试过的来源和最后几条错误。任务日志里每个文件记一行，写明它来自哪个来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"438":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-38","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"文件先写到 `<文件名>.part`，大小和 SHA-256 都对上后才改名。中断后再次下载时用 HTTP Range 从断点继续；服务器不支持 Range 时从头下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"439":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-39","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"已经存在且大小正确的文件不会重新下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"440":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-40","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"`downloads.verify_checksums`（**校验文件**，默认开）关闭后只核对大小，不计算 SHA-256。","locale":"zh-CN"},"441":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-41","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"`downloads.concurrency`（**同时下载的文件数**，1–8，默认 2）：同时下载几个文件，大文件优先。","locale":"zh-CN"},"442":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-42","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"下载任务占用 `io` 资源，最多 4 个下载任务同时进行，其余排队（界面显示 **等待其他下载**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"443":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-43","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"模型的状态：","locale":"zh-CN"},"444":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-44","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"445":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-45","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"界面","locale":"zh-CN"},"446":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-46","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"447":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-47","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"`missing`","locale":"zh-CN"},"448":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-48","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"**未下载**","locale":"zh-CN"},"449":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-49","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"没有文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"450":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-50","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"`partial`","locale":"zh-CN"},"451":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-51","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"**部分下载**","locale":"zh-CN"},"452":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-52","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"有文件夹但没有 `model.json`（下载未完成），或它需要的共享文件还没下载","locale":"zh-CN"},"453":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-53","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"`downloading`","locale":"zh-CN"},"454":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-54","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"**下载中**","locale":"zh-CN"},"455":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-55","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"正在下载","locale":"zh-CN"},"456":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-56","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"`installed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"457":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-57","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"**已安装**","locale":"zh-CN"},"458":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-58","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"`model.json` 已写入（它在最后写）","locale":"zh-CN"},"459":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-59","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"`corrupt`","locale":"zh-CN"},"460":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-60","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"**已损坏**","locale":"zh-CN"},"461":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-61","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"某个文件大小不对，或上次校验失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"462":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-62","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#续传与校验","content":"校验会列出损坏的文件。因为大小正确的文件不会重新下载，修复时先删除这些文件（或用 `mizuoto model delete` 删除整个模型），再下载一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"463":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-63","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#hugging-face-令牌与代理","content":"设置了环境变量 `HF_TOKEN` 时，它只作为 `Authorization: Bearer` 发送给 huggingface.co，不会发给 hf-mirror、ModelScope、自定义地址或 mizuoto-model 镜像。","locale":"zh-CN"},"464":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-64","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#hugging-face-令牌与代理","content":"下载使用 httpx，读取标准的代理环境变量 `HTTPS_PROXY`、`HTTP_PROXY`、`ALL_PROXY` 和 `NO_PROXY`。在启动 `mizuoto webui` 或 `mizuoto model download` 的环境里设置它们即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"465":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-65","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#共享文件","content":"一个引擎的多个模型共用的文件（GPT-SoVITS 的编码器和文本前端数据，IndexTTS-2/2.5 的 w2v-BERT、语义编解码器、CAM++、BigVGAN，CosyVoice 的文本规范化语法等）是“共享文件”，放在 `<模型文件夹>/_assets/<引擎>/<名称>/`，带一个 `asset.json`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"466":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-66","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#共享文件","content":"下载第一个需要它们的模型时一起下载（任务的步骤里会列出）；缺少共享文件的模型显示为 **部分下载**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"467":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-67","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#共享文件","content":"单独管理：**模型** › **共享文件**，或命令行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"468":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-68","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#共享文件","content":"有些共享文件是压缩包（GPT-SoVITS 的 G2PW、NLTK 数据、Open JTalk 词典）：下载并校验后解压到文件夹里，再删除压缩包，校验和重新下载针对解压出的文件。解压时成员不能跑出目标文件夹。","locale":"zh-CN"},"469":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-69","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#导入模型文件夹","content":"已经在别处有模型文件（以前下载过、别的程序里用过、自己微调的），可以导入而不重新下载：","locale":"zh-CN"},"470":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-70","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#导入模型文件夹","content":"Mizuoto 根据文件夹里的文件识别引擎和变体，GPT-SoVITS 权重还会识别版本。识别不出时报错。","locale":"zh-CN"},"471":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-71","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#导入模型文件夹","content":"文件大小与某个目录模型的清单完全一致时，导入为这个目录模型，然后逐个核对 SHA-256；有文件不一致则报错。","locale":"zh-CN"},"472":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-72","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#导入模型文件夹","content":"否则（或给了 `--name`）导入为用户模型 `<引擎>/<名称>`；名称不能与目录模型重名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"473":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-73","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#导入模型文件夹","content":"网页界面：**模型** › **导入模型文件夹**。它要读服务器上的路径，只在服务器本机的浏览器中可用，路径还要在 `paths.browse_roots` 之内。","locale":"zh-CN"},"474":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-74","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#mizuoto-model-镜像","content":"mizuoto-model 是一个镜像仓库，按 Mizuoto 保存的方式存放它下载的文件：","locale":"zh-CN"},"475":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-75","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#mizuoto-model-镜像","content":"`<路径>` 是文件在模型文件夹中的位置。所有模型的文件都在一个仓库里，所以只需能访问这一个仓库。镜像在 Hugging Face 上是 `licyk/mizuoto-model`，在 ModelScope 上是 `licyks/mizuoto-model`，两者都收录了整个目录：所有模型和共享文件，包括压缩包和需要接受许可的引擎（附带它们的许可和声明文件）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"476":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-76","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#mizuoto-model-镜像","content":"**设置** › **下载** › **仓库** 选 **优先使用 mizuoto-model 镜像**（默认）。镜像从 **下载来源** 选中的地方访问。选 **各模型自己的仓库** 则不使用镜像。","locale":"zh-CN"},"477":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-77","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#mizuoto-model-镜像","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"478":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-78","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#mizuoto-model-镜像","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"479":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-79","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#mizuoto-model-镜像","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"480":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-80","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#mizuoto-model-镜像","content":"`downloads.repository`","locale":"zh-CN"},"481":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-81","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#mizuoto-model-镜像","content":"`mizuoto-model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"482":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-82","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#mizuoto-model-镜像","content":"`mizuoto-model`：先试镜像；`official`：各模型自己的仓库","locale":"zh-CN"},"483":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-83","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#mizuoto-model-镜像","content":"`downloads.mirror_repo`","locale":"zh-CN"},"484":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-84","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#mizuoto-model-镜像","content":"`licyk/mizuoto-model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"485":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-85","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#mizuoto-model-镜像","content":"Hugging Face 上的镜像仓库，通过 hf-mirror 和自定义地址访问时也用它","locale":"zh-CN"},"486":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-86","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#mizuoto-model-镜像","content":"`downloads.mirror_repo_modelscope`","locale":"zh-CN"},"487":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-87","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#mizuoto-model-镜像","content":"`licyks/mizuoto-model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"488":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-88","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#mizuoto-model-镜像","content":"ModelScope 上的镜像仓库，`downloads.source` 为 `modelscope` 时使用","locale":"zh-CN"},"489":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-89","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#mizuoto-model-镜像","content":"镜像在 `downloads.source` 选中的地方访问：Hugging Face、hf-mirror 和自定义地址取 `main` 分支，ModelScope 取 `master` 分支。","locale":"zh-CN"},"490":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-90","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#mizuoto-model-镜像","content":"镜像不按提交固定版本，但每个文件同样按清单核对大小和 SHA-256；不对的文件从官方仓库下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"491":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-91","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#mizuoto-model-镜像","content":"镜像中没有的文件（未收录的模型；用 `build` 做的镜像中压缩包形式的共享文件）自动从各模型的官方仓库下载，所以不完整的镜像也能用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"492":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-92","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#维护镜像","content":"三个脚本（在源码目录中运行）用来制作和发布镜像：`scripts/mirror_models.py` 把本机已安装的模型整理成镜像，并发布或检查它；`scripts/mirror_fetch.py` 按镜像的布局下载整个目录；`scripts/mirror_readme.py` 写出仓库的说明页和许可文件。发布镜像是镜像维护者的事：权重保留各自的许可，`MIRROR.json` 写明每个文件的来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"493":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-93","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#build整理已安装的模型","content":"参数或选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"494":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-94","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#build整理已安装的模型","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"495":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-95","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#build整理已安装的模型","content":"`OUT`","locale":"zh-CN"},"496":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-96","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#build整理已安装的模型","content":"输出文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"497":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-97","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#build整理已安装的模型","content":"`IDS...`","locale":"zh-CN"},"498":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-98","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#build整理已安装的模型","content":"只整理这些模型和共享文件（默认全部已安装的）","locale":"zh-CN"},"499":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-99","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#build整理已安装的模型","content":"`--models-dir <路径>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"500":{"id":"/docs/advanced-downloads-100","page_id":"/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-downloads#build整理已安装的模型","content":"模型文件夹，默认为数据文件夹中的模型文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"501