直接调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"718":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-142","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#方法与属性","content":"对象也是上下文管理器：","locale":"zh-CN"},"719":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-143","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#方法与属性","content":"`serve(block=False, **options)` 用同样的参数创建并启动一个服务器，返回它；`block=True` 时在前台运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"720":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-144","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#固定设置","content":"`settings` 中的值叠加在设置文件和环境变量之上，**不会写回文件**，也不能通过网页界面或接口修改：","locale":"zh-CN"},"721":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-145","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#固定设置","content":"网页界面 **设置** 中被固定的项目标注 **由运行 Mizuoto 的应用程序设置**（环境变量设置的项目标注 **由环境变量设置**）。`settings.view().pinned` 列出被固定的设置名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"722":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-146","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#路径前缀外部访问与令牌","content":"`api_prefix=\"/voice\"` 后，网页界面在 `<地址>/voice/`，接口在 `/voice/api/v1/...`，兼容 OpenAI 的接口在 `/voice/v1/...`。网页界面会根据自己脚本的地址确定前缀，不需要另外配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"723":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-147","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#路径前缀外部访问与令牌","content":"默认只接受本机名称作为 `Host`（防止 DNS 重绑定）。通过隧道或反向代理对外提供时，用 `extra_hosts=[\"abc.example.com\"]` 或 `server.allow_host(\"https://abc.example.com\")` 加入公开域名。通过这些名称来的请求不会被当作本机请求，所以只能在本机使用的功能（浏览服务器文件等）对它们不可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"724":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-148","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#路径前缀外部访问与令牌","content":"开放之后，任何知道地址的人都能访问，请设置 `access_token`，或自己加上身份验证。访问控制的细节见 HTTP 接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"725":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-149","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#路径前缀外部访问与令牌","content":"服务器启动后在数据文件夹写入 `server.json`（`host`、`port`、`url`、`pid`），供其他程序找到正在运行的服务器；`stop()` 时删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"726":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-150","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#挂载到已有的-fastapi-应用","content":"宿主程序本身是 FastAPI（或其他 ASGI）应用时，可以直接挂载 Mizuoto，而不再开一个端口：","locale":"zh-CN"},"727":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-151","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#挂载到已有的-fastapi-应用","content":"宿主要在自己的事件循环上进入子应用的 `lifespan`（它负责把事件转发到 socket），并在退出时调用 `services.close()`。`start_background=True` 启动任务调度器和空闲模型的卸载，没有它，排队的任务不会运行。`create_app` 还接受 `extra_hosts`（一个集合，之后加入的名称立即生效）和 `serve_ui=False`（只提供接口）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"728":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","type":"page","content":"引擎详解","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-engines","locale":"zh-CN"},"729":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines","content":"逐个介绍 Mizuoto 内置的八个语音合成引擎和语音识别引擎：模型目录、能力、音色方式、语言、许可、训练方法和各自需要安装什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"730":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-engines#一览","content":"一览","locale":"zh-CN"},"731":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-engines#各引擎需要什么","content":"各引擎需要什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"732":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-engines#许可","content":"许可","locale":"zh-CN"},"733":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"Qwen3-TTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"734":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-5","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"CosyVoice","locale":"zh-CN"},"735":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-6","pa