"content":"24 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"1093":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-364","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#indextts","content":"**克隆音色**、**无文本克隆**、**发音控制**、**长文本**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1094":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-365","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#indextts","content":"v2","locale":"zh-CN"},"1095":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-366","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#indextts","content":"22.05 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"1096":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-367","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#indextts","content":"以上加 **参考音频情感**、**情感滑块**、**文本情感**、**流式输出**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1097":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-368","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#indextts","content":"v2_5","locale":"zh-CN"},"1098":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-369","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#indextts","content":"22.05 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"1099":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-370","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#indextts","content":"同 v2，另有 **语速**；语言 zh、en、ja、es","locale":"zh-CN"},"1100":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-371","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#indextts","content":"**情感权重**（八个，上游顺序）：happy、angry、sad、afraid、disgusted、melancholic、surprised、calm。参考音频情感可以设强度；文本情感需要加载选项 `use_qwen_emo`（默认开，约 1.2 GB）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1101":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-372","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#indextts","content":"**参考音频**：1–30 秒。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1102":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-373","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#indextts","content":"**许可**：bilibili Model Use License，需要接受（`bilibili-model-use@2025-09-09`）；允许商用，但结果不能用于训练其他引擎；结果下方的提示会提醒：IndexTTS 的免责声明禁止未经声音主人许可克隆其声音。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1103":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-374","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#indextts","content":"**语言**：IndexTTS-2.5 的日语文本需要可选依赖 `mizuoto-indextts[ja]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1104":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-375","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#indextts","content":"**共享文件**：IndexTTS-2 和 2.5 需要 `indextts/w2v-bert`（2.2 GB）、`indextts/campplus`、`indextts/bigvgan`，IndexTTS-2 还需要 `indextts/semantic-codec`，随模型一起下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1105":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-376","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#indextts","content":"**训练**：无。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1106":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-377","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#indextts","content":"**流式输出**：流式请求在每句生成完后发送这一句的音频。想更早听到声音，可设选项 `stream_chunk`（v2/v2.5；100 是不错的取值，约 1.6 秒语音）：每生成这么多个编码就发送一段交叉淡化的音频，在 RTX 3060 上约 2 秒后就有第一段，而不必等第一句全部生成。它使用单束采样，整个请求耗时更长（IndexTTS 2 约 1.5 倍）；详见 IndexTTS。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1107":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-378","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#indextts","content":"**加载选项**：`use_qwen_emo`（默认开）、`use_torch_compile`（v2/v2.5：与 `compute.compile` 一样编译 s2mel DiT 和 BigVGAN，见 性能与加速）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1108":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-379","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#语音识别asr","content":"Mizuoto 自己使用的内部引擎，由 Mizuoto 自己实现，为没有文本的参考音频、音色和数据集生成文本：Whisper large-v3-turbo 支持约 100 种语言；中文还可以用 FunASR 的 Paraformer-large，带语音活动检测和标点，也就是 GPT-SoVITS 识别中文所用的模型（普通话夹带英文单词，带标点）。它不出现在合成的模型列表里，也不出现在 `GET /v1/models` 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1109":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-380","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","