ced-engines#语音识别asr","content":"用于中文","locale":"zh-CN"},"1121":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-392","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#语音识别asr","content":"要让中文音频用 Paraformer、其他语言用 Whisper，下载它并设置 `tts.asr_model_zh`（**设置** › **语音** › **中文音频的语音识别模型**）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1122":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-393","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#语音识别asr","content":"转写结果按音频的 SHA-256、模型和束宽缓存，设置不变时同一段音频不会重复识别。设置 `tts.auto_transcribe`（默认开）、`tts.asr_model` 和 `tts.asr_beams`（默认 5）控制自动转写，见 配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1123":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"page","content":"常见问题","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq","locale":"zh-CN"},"1124":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq","content":"按主题整理的常见问题：启动、访问令牌、torch 与引擎、显存、许可、下载、日志和远程主机。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1125":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#启动与数据","content":"启动与数据","locale":"zh-CN"},"1126":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#访问令牌","content":"访问令牌","locale":"zh-CN"},"1127":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#首次运行","content":"首次运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"1128":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#torch-与引擎","content":"torch 与引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"1129":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-5","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与速度","content":"显存与速度","locale":"zh-CN"},"1130":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-6","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#许可","content":"许可","locale":"zh-CN"},"1131":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-7","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#下载","content":"下载","locale":"zh-CN"},"1132":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-8","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#日志","content":"日志","locale":"zh-CN"},"1133":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-9","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#远程主机","content":"远程主机","locale":"zh-CN"},"1134":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-10","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq","content":"遇到问题时，先看任务的日志（**任务** 面板中的 **日志**，或 `mizuoto job log <任务 id>`），再运行 `mizuoto doctor`：它检查 torch 的构建是否与硬件匹配、各引擎是否可用以及缺少哪些可选扩展，并给出修复命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1135":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-11","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#启动与数据","content":"默认端口是 7869。被占用时服务器依次尝试后面的端口（最多 20 个），日志中提示 \"Port 7869 is unavailable. Using port 7870.\"，浏览器打开实际使用的端口；启动成功后标准输出打印一行 `SERVER_READY url=…`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1136":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-12","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#启动与数据","content":"默认的数据文件夹：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1137":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-13","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#启动与数据","content":"系统","locale":"zh-CN"},"1138":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-14","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#启动与数据","content":"位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"1139":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-15","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#启动与数据","content":"Windows","locale":"zh-CN"},"1140":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-16","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#启动与数据","content":"`%APPDATA%\\mizuoto`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1141":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-17","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#启动与数据","content":"macOS","locale":"zh-CN"},"1142":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-18","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#启动与数据","content":"`~/Library/Application Support/mizuoto`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1143":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-19","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#启动与数据","content":"Linux","locale":"zh-CN"},"1144":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-20","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#启动与数据","content":"`$XDG_DATA_HOME/mizuoto`，默认 `~/.local/share/mizuoto`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1145":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-21","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#启动与数据","content":"里面有 `settings.toml`、数据库 `mizuoto.db`、`models/`、`voices/`、`outputs/`、`datasets/`、`experiments/`、`projects/`、`cache/`、`jobs/`（任务日志）和 `logs/`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1146":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-22","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#启动与数据","content":"用环境变量 `MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR` 或 `mizuoto webui --data-dir <路径>` 换到别处；只想移动某一类文件，改 `paths.*`（**设置** › **存储**）。`mizuoto config show` 的 `data_dir` 和 `resolved_paths` 显示实际位置，网页界面在 **设置** › **关于** 显示 **数据文件夹** 和 **设置文件**。详见 配置与环境变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1147":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-23","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#启动与数据","content":"先停止服务器，再删除或改名 `settings.toml`（`mizuoto config path` 打印它的路径）。下次启动时使用全部默认值；音色、模型和结果不受影响。注意 `MIZUOTO_<GROUP>__<FIELD>` 环境变量设置的值始终优先。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1148":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-24","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#启动与数据","content":"可以，但两者是**各自独立的进程**：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1149":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-25","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#启动与数据","content":"任务都记录在同一个数据库里，Web UI 的 **任务** 面板和 `mizuoto job list` 都能看到双方的任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1150":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-26","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#启动与数据","content":"命令行的任务在自己的进程里前台运行，不参与服务器的 GPU 排队，也会加载自己的模型：同一个模型可能在显存里加载两份。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1151":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-27","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#启动与数据","content":"`mizuoto job cancel` 只能取消本进程的任务，对服务器正在运行的任务会报 \"is not running\"。取消服务器的任务请用 Web UI，或 `POST /api/v1/jobs/{id}/cancel`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1152":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-28","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#启动与数据","content":"`mizuoto config set` 直接写 `settings.toml`，服务器约 1 秒内读到改动；服务器地址和端口要在下次启动时才生效。改动某个引擎的 `engines.<id>.*` 设置会卸载该引擎的模型，下次使用时按新设置加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1153":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-29","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#访问令牌","content":"服务器设置了 `server.access_token` 时，界面弹出 **访问令牌** 对话框（“该服务器需要访问令牌。”），输入一次即可。接口请求没有令牌时返回 401 `auth_required`；令牌可以放在 `Authorization: Bearer <令牌>` 头、`mizuoto_token` cookie 或 `?token=` 查询参数里，见 HTTP 接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1154":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-30","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#访问令牌","content":"在 **设置** › **常规** 中可以 **设置令牌** 或 **清除令牌**，也可以用命令行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1155":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-31","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#访问令牌","content":"忘记令牌时，在服务器所在的机器上设置一个新的即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1156":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-32","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#访问令牌","content":"Mizuoto 不强制要求，但请设置一个。`mizuoto webui --host 0.0.0.0` 时服务器只在日志里警告 \"Binding to 0.0.0.0 makes the server reachable from other machines.\"，不再检查 `Host` 头；没有令牌时，任何能连到这个地址的人都能使用全部功能（下载模型、删除结果等）。读取服务器上的路径、在文件夹中显示等操作始终只对服务器本机的浏览器开放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1157":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-33","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#首次运行","content":"Web UI 直接打开 **合成** 页，演示引擎（dummy）立即可用，它用音调代替语音；没有单独的设置向导。在 **设置** › **下载** 中选择下载来源，在 **设置** › **计算** 中（或用 `mizuoto doctor`）检查 torch，然后在 **模型** 中下载模型，或在所选模型尚未下载时点替代 **合成** 的那个按钮下载，进度可在 **任务** 中查看。详见 首次运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1158":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-34","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#torch-与引擎","content":"引擎需要 torch（只有演示引擎不需要）和它的实现：除了 Fish Speech 和 IndexTTS 是单独的发行包，其他引擎都内置在 Mizuoto 中。引擎卡片和 `mizuoto doctor <引擎>` 会说明缺什么：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1159":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-35","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#torch-与引擎","content":"`torch`：安装 `mizuoto doctor` 指出的构建（见安装）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1160":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-36","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#torch-与引擎","content":"`mizuoto-fishspeech` 或 `mizuoto-indextts`：把它装到 Mizuoto 所用的 Python 中，例如 `pip install mizuoto-indextts`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1161":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-37","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#torch-与引擎","content":"然后重启 Mizuoto。使用这类模型会以 `engine_not_installed`（退出码 7）失败，提示中带有安装命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1162":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-38","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#torch-与引擎","content":"torch 的构建必须与硬件匹配：NVIDIA 用 CUDA 构建（不高于驱动支持的版本），AMD 用 ROCm 构建，Intel 用 XPU 构建，Apple 芯片用 PyPI 上的默认构建。`mizuoto doctor` 会进行对照，并打印把正确构建装进 Mizuoto 所用 Python 的命令，例如：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1163":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-39","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#torch-与引擎","content":"**设置** › **计算** 中也显示同样的检查结果。提示 \"sees no GPU: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES hides them\" 表示启动 Mizuoto 的环境中设置了这个变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1164":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-40","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#torch-与引擎","content":"GPT-SoVITS 的日语和韩语前端、IndexTTS-2.5 的日语是可选扩展：`pip install 'mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]'`（pyopenjtalk 需要从源码构建：要有 CMake 和 C++ 编译器）、`pip install 'mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]'`、`pip install 'mizuoto-indextts[ja]'`。错误提示中带有安装命令；`mizuoto doctor` 也会列出缺少的扩展。见可选扩展。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1165":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-41","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与速度","content":"放不下 GPU 的模型会部分加载：放得下的层留在 GPU 上，其余权重在运行时从内存流式加载（较慢，结果中会注明）。无论估算如何，Mizuoto 总是尝试加载模型，只有显存分配真正失败时才以 `compute_unavailable` 失败（退出码 9，HTTP 503；`detail.reason` 为 `out_of_memory`），随后与 ComfyUI 一样卸载所有 GPU 上未在使用的模型。可以：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1166":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-42","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与速度","content":"关掉占用 GPU 的其他程序，或在 **内存中的模型** 面板点 **释放显存**（或 **卸载** 某个模型）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1167":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-43","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与速度","content":"把 **设置** › **计算** › **内存** › **模型如何使用显存** 设为“最多使用一半”或“几乎全部从内存流式加载”（`compute.vram_mode` 的 `low`、`none`），或用 `compute.vram_limit_mb` 限制 Mizuoto 的用量；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1168":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-44","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与速度","content":"换一块 GPU：`mizuoto config set engines.<id>.device cuda:1`（**模型** › **引擎** › **设备**）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1169":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-45","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与速度","content":"改用 CPU：`mizuoto config set engines.<id>.device cpu`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1170":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-46","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与速度","content":"换一个更小的模型（如 Qwen3-TTS 0.6B）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1171":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-47","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与速度","content":"运行中仍然显存不足时，Mizuoto 把更多权重留在内存中、用相同的随机数重新运行这一步（结果相同，速度较慢）；开启 `compute.oom_fallback` 后还会尝试更省显存的方式（分块、更小的批次）。同一块 GPU 上同时运行的任务数由 `compute.gpu_jobs`（默认 1）决定；任务在等待 GPU 时，**仍然运行** 可以让它与正在运行的任务并行（显存足够时）。跨所有引擎和设备同时运行的合成任务数由 `compute.inference_jobs`（默认 1）决定。更多见 性能与加速。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1172":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-48","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与速度","content":"每个引擎都能在 CPU 上运行，但比 GPU 慢得多：CPU 上使用 fp32，Fish Speech 这样的大模型尤其慢。可以选更小的模型（Qwen3-TTS 0.6B、GPT-SoVITS v2 系列等），用 远程主机 把引擎放到有 GPU 的机器上，或在合成时开启流式播放，边生成边听。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1173":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-49","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与速度","content":"空闲的模型在 `compute.unload_after_minutes`（默认 20 分钟，0 为不卸载）后卸载，单个引擎可用 `engines.<id>.idle_minutes` 覆盖；同时保持加载的模型最多 `compute.max_resident_models` 个（默认 3），超出时先卸载最久未用的空闲模型。`mizuoto runtime` 列出已加载的模型。`engines.<id>.pinned_models` 中的模型不会为腾出空间或因空闲而卸载。见 性能与加速。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1174":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-50","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#许可","content":"Fish Speech（Fish Audio Research License）和 IndexTTS（bilibili Model Use License）需要接受许可后才能下载模型和共享文件、合成（退出码 5，HTTP 403）。阅读全文后：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1175":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-51","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#许可","content":"或在 **模型** › **引擎** 中点 **接受许可**，勾选 **我已阅读并接受此许可**。接受记录为 `engines.<id>.accepted_licence`（许可 id 与版本）；许可版本更新后需要重新接受。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1176":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-52","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#许可","content":"不需要。引擎的使用受其许可约束（接受时会显示许可全文），结果下方的提示也会提醒：IndexTTS 的免责声明禁止未经声音主人许可克隆其声音。`mizuoto speak --consent` 已经去掉，API 会忽略 `voice_spec.consent`。音色或数据集的同意说明（`mizuoto voice add --consent …`、`voice edit --consent`、`dataset create --consent`）如果填写了仍会保存，但不再是必需的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1177":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-53","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#许可","content":"F5-TTS 的预训练权重是 CC-BY-NC-4.0，结果不得商用，从它微调出的模型同样如此。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1178":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-54","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#许可","content":"Fish Speech 的许可不允许商用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1179":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-55","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#许可","content":"Fish Speech 和 IndexTTS 的结果不能作为训练其他引擎的数据：加入数据集时会保留结果的许可标签，训练时拒绝这些片段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1180":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-56","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#许可","content":"结果会带上引擎的许可标签和说明（例如 \"Built with Fish Audio\"），显示在结果下方。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1181":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-57","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#许可","content":"各引擎的许可见 引擎详解。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1182":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-58","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#下载","content":"在 **设置** › **下载** › **下载来源** 选 **hf-mirror.com** 或 **ModelScope**，或用 `mizuoto config set downloads.source hf-mirror`。**仓库** 保持默认的 **优先使用 mizuoto-model 镜像**。每个文件在一个来源失败时会自动换下一个来源。详见 模型下载与镜像。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1183":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-59","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#下载","content":"模型下载读取标准的代理环境变量 `HTTPS_PROXY`、`HTTP_PROXY`、`ALL_PROXY`、`NO_PROXY`。在启动 `mizuoto webui` 的终端或服务中设置即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1184":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-60","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#下载","content":"中断的下载再下载一次即可，未完成的文件（`.part`）会从断点续传。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1185":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-61","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#下载","content":"**部分下载** 也可能是缺少它需要的共享文件，下载一次模型就会补上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1186":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-62","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#下载","content":"**已损坏**：运行 `mizuoto model verify <模型>` 列出损坏的文件，删除这些文件（或 `mizuoto model delete <模型>`）后重新下载；大小正确的文件不会重新下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1187":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-63","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#下载","content":"所有来源都失败时报 `download_failed`（退出码 12），错误详情列出试过的来源和最后几条错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1188":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-64","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#下载","content":"设置环境变量 `HF_TOKEN`，Mizuoto 会把它发送给 huggingface.co（只发给它，不发给镜像）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1189":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-65","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#日志","content":"日志","locale":"zh-CN"},"1190":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-66","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#日志","content":"位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"1191":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-67","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#日志","content":"查看","locale":"zh-CN"},"1192":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-68","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#日志","content":"任务日志","locale":"zh-CN"},"1193":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-69","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#日志","content":"`<数据文件夹>/jobs/<任务 id>.log`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1194":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-70","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#日志","content":"**任务** › **日志**；`mizuoto job log <任务 id>`；`GET /api/v1/jobs/{id}/log`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1195":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-71","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#日志","content":"服务器日志","locale":"zh-CN"},"1196":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-72","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#日志","content":"标准错误输出（启动 `mizuoto webui` 的终端）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1197":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-73","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#日志","content":"—","locale":"zh-CN"},"1198":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-74","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#日志","content":"日志级别用环境变量 `MIZUOTO_LOG_LEVEL`（`DEBUG`、`INFO`、`WARNING`、`ERROR`，默认 `INFO`）设置；每条命令都接受 `--debug`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1199":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-75","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#日志","content":"引擎出错时，请求以 `engine_error`（退出码 10）失败，错误详情中带有异常及其调用栈（网页界面中错误下方的 **详情**；命令行中 `mizuoto job show <任务 id> --json` 的 `error`）。上一个请求失败的引擎会连同错误列在 **内存中的模型** 面板中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1200":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-76","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#远程主机","content":"**离线**：连不上 agent。确认那台机器上 `mizuoto agent` 正在运行，且监听的是能从本机访问的地址（默认只监听 `127.0.0.1`，需要 `--host 0.0.0.0`）；检查地址、端口（默认 7870）和防火墙；两边的 TLS 设置要一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1201":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-77","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#远程主机","content":"**被拒绝**：令牌不对，或两边的 Mizuoto 版本不兼容。用 `mizuoto remote add <名称> <地址> --token <令牌>` 重新填写令牌；令牌在 agent 那台机器的 `settings.toml` 中（`remote.agent.token`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1202":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-78","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#远程主机","content":"远程主机不可用时，用到它的请求以 `remote_unavailable`（退出码 14）失败；`mizuoto remote use <引擎> --local` 让引擎回到本机运行。详见 远程主机。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1203":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-79","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#远程主机","content":"命令行的约定和退出码见 命令行概览；安装方式见 安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1204":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","type":"page","content":"性能与加速","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-performance","locale":"zh-CN"},"1205":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance","content":"模型在哪里运行、保留多久，显存（比 GPU 大的模型、显存不足），精度，注意力后端，torch.compile，以及合并等待中的请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1206":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-performance#设备与精度","content":"设备与精度","locale":"zh-CN"},"1207":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-performance#mizuoto-能找到哪些-gpu","content":"Mizuoto 能找到哪些 GPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"1208":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"已加载的模型与内存","locale":"zh-CN"},"1209":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"显存","locale":"zh-CN"},"1210":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-5","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-performance#只整体加载high","content":"只整体加载（`high`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1211":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-6","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存不足","content":"显存不足","locale":"zh-CN"},"1212":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-7","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"编译模型（`compute.compile`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1213":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-8","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"注意力后端","locale":"zh-CN"},"1214":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-9","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-performance#合并等待中的请求micro-batching","content":"合并等待中的请求（micro-batching）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1215":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-10","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-performance#在-cpu-上运行","content":"在 CPU 上运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"1216":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-11","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance","content":"每个引擎都运行在服务器自己的进程里，基于 Mizuoto 的运行时（torch）。默认设置在任何机器上都能运行。本页介绍决定模型放在哪里、保留多久的设置，可以额外开启的加速项（注意力后端、`compute.fast`、`compute.compile`），以及等待中的请求如何合并。默认设置让每个结果都与各引擎的原始实现完全相同；会改变结果的选项都会注明。各引擎的基本情况见 引擎详解，全部设置项见 配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1217":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-12","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#设备与精度","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"1218":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-13","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#设备与精度","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"1219":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-14","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#设备与精度","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"1220":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-15","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#设备与精度","content":"`engines.<id>.device`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1221":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-16","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#设备与精度","content":"`auto`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1222":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-17","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#设备与精度","content":"引擎使用的设备：`auto`、`cpu`、`cuda:N`（NVIDIA，或 ROCm 下的 AMD）、`xpu:N`（Intel）、`mps`（Apple 芯片）；`<主机名>/<设备>` 表示在远程主机上运行（见 远程主机）。界面：引擎卡片的 **设备**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1223":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-18","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#设备与精度","content":"`compute.default_device`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1224":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-19","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#设备与精度","content":"`auto`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1225":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-20","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#设备与精度","content":"引擎设为 `auto` 时使用的设备；`auto` 选空闲显存最多的 GPU，没有 GPU 时用 CPU。界面：**设置** › **计算** › **默认设备**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1226":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-21","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#设备与精度","content":"`compute.devices`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1227":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-22","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#设备与精度","content":"空","locale":"zh-CN"},"1228":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-23","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#设备与精度","content":"Mizuoto 可以使用的设备，如 `[\"cuda:0\"]`；空为全部","locale":"zh-CN"},"1229":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-24","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#设备与精度","content":"`engines.<id>.dtype`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1230":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-25","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#设备与精度","content":"`auto`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1231":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-26","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#设备与精度","content":"精度：`auto`、`fp32`、`fp16`、`bf16`。界面：引擎卡片的 **精度**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1232":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-27","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#mizuoto-能找到哪些-gpu","content":"Mizuoto 查找 GPU 时不加载 torch：NVIDIA 显卡用 `nvidia-smi`；AMD 显卡用 `rocm-smi`（或 `amd-smi`），torch 的 ROCm 构建与 NVIDIA 一样把它们命名为 `cuda:0`、`cuda:1`……；Apple 芯片按平台识别（`mps`）。`CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES` 对 `nvidia-smi` 找到的显卡与对 torch 一样生效：只保留它列出的显卡（序号或 `GPU-` UUID），按它的顺序从 `cuda:0` 编号（序号是 `nvidia-smi` 的，按 PCI 总线顺序；Mizuoto 为自己和训练阶段设置 `CUDA_DEVICE_ORDER=PCI_BUS_ID`，所以即使显卡型号不同，torch 的编号也与之相同，而 CUDA 默认把最快的显卡排在最前；环境中已设置的顺序保持不变）。这些都找不到 GPU、而已安装的 torch 是能使用 GPU 的构建时（Intel 显卡的 XPU 构建、没有 `rocm-smi` 的 ROCm 构建、容器里没有 `nvidia-smi` 的 CUDA 构建），Mizuoto 会在单独的进程里询问一次 torch（一两秒）；CPU 构建的 torch 不会被询问。Mizuoto 为运行模型加载了 torch 之后，改用 torch 自己的数据。`mizuoto doctor` 会列出找到的 GPU 及查找方式，**设置** › **计算** 中也会显示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1233":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-28","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#mizuoto-能找到哪些-gpu","content":"所有引擎都能在 NVIDIA（CUDA）、AMD（ROCm）、Intel（XPU）和 Apple（MPS）的 GPU 以及 CPU 上运行。在不支持双精度的 GPU 上（Apple 芯片、Intel Arc 显卡），唯一以双精度计算的模型部件——CosyVoice 3 的音高预测器——在 CPU 上运行，模型的其余部分仍在 GPU 上。在 Apple 芯片上 `compute.compile` 不生效，且 torch 的 MPS 后端可能缺少某个引擎需要的运算；以 `PYTORCH_ENABLE_MPS_FALLBACK=1` 启动 Mizuoto 可让这些运算在 CPU 上执行。ROCm、XPU 和 MPS 路径尚未在真实硬件上测试，遇到问题请反馈。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1234":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-29","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#mizuoto-能找到哪些-gpu","content":"`auto` 精度即各引擎的上游在该设备上使用的精度：GPU 上用半精度（显卡支持时为 bf16 或 fp16），CPU 上用 fp32。例如 Fish Speech 在 GPU 上用 bf16、在 CPU 上用 fp32；CosyVoice 保持 fp32，除非打开它的加载选项 `fp16`。各引擎在 CPU 上以 fp32 运行时输出与上游代码一致；其他精度和设备的结果会有细微差别。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1235":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-30","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"模型在第一次使用时加载到服务器进程中、引擎所在的设备上，之后保留给下一个请求：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1236":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-31","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"1237":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-32","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"1238":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-33","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"1239":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-34","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"`compute.max_resident_models`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1240":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-35","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"`3`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1241":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-36","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"所有引擎合计同时保持加载的模型数，超出时先卸载最久未用的空闲模型。界面：**设置** › **计算** › **保留在内存中的模型数**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1242":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-37","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"`compute.unload_after_minutes`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1243":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-38","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"`20`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1244":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-39","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"模型空闲这么久后卸载；`0` 为一直保留。界面：**空闲多少分钟后卸载模型（0：从不）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1245":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-40","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"`engines.<id>.idle_minutes`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1246":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-41","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"空","locale":"zh-CN"},"1247":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-42","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"为单个引擎覆盖上一项","locale":"zh-CN"},"1248":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-43","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"`engines.<id>.pinned_models`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1249":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-44","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"`[]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1250":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-45","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"这些模型不会被卸载，既不会因空闲，也不会为其他模型腾位置；需要让出显存时最后让出","locale":"zh-CN"},"1251":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-46","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"`compute.gpu_jobs`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1252":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-47","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"`1`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1253":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-48","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"同一块 GPU 上同时运行的 GPU 任务数。界面：**同时运行的 GPU 任务数**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1254":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-49","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"`compute.inference_jobs`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1255":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-50","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"`1`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1256":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-51","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"跨所有引擎和设备同时运行的合成任务数（合成、音色转换、语音编辑）；合并为一个微批次（`tts.micro_batch`）运行的请求算一个。界面：**同时运行的合成任务**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1257":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-52","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"同时运行的合成任务最多 `compute.inference_jobs` 个（默认 1 个），不论它们用哪个引擎和设备；其余任务在队列中按顺序等待（**等待其他合成任务**）。每块 GPU 上的任务数仍受 `compute.gpu_jobs` 限制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1258":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-53","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"一个引擎在一个设备上同时只处理一个请求，下一个请求等待（**等待引擎**）。GPU 被另一个任务占用时，新任务显示 **等待 GPU**；如果显存足够两个任务同时运行，可以在 **任务** 中点 **仍然运行**，或把 `compute.gpu_jobs` 调大。微调任务无论 `compute.gpu_jobs` 是多少都独占整块 GPU，开始前先把这块 GPU 上的空闲模型移到内存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1259":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-54","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"空闲卸载只在服务器中进行。命令（`mizuoto speak` 等）在自己的进程里加载需要的模型，命令结束时模型随之释放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1260":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-55","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"`mizuoto runtime` 列出正在运行的服务器已加载的模型（设备、内存、有多少在设备上、上次使用、忙碌或空闲）；`mizuoto runtime --unload [MODEL]` 卸载一个模型，或所有未在使用的模型。网页界面的 **内存中的模型** 面板做同样的事，并用进度条显示每个模型有多少在 GPU 上，其中的 **释放显存** 释放空闲模型占用的显存。对应接口为 `GET /api/v1/runtime` 和 `POST /api/v1/runtime/unload`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1261":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-56","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#已加载的模型与内存","content":"修改任意 `engines.<id>.*` 设置会卸载该引擎的模型，下次使用时按新设置加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1262":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-57","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"Mizuoto 像 ComfyUI 一样管理显存。一个请求的每一步只放上它需要的模型部分（先是参考音频的编码器，然后是语言模型，再是声码器），不需要的部分在别处需要显存时先让出。模型完全放不下时，**部分加载**：放得下的层留在 GPU 上，其余权重留在内存中，每层运行时再复制到 GPU。这样更慢，但能运行而不是失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1263":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-58","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"1264":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-59","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"1265":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-60","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"1266":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-61","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`compute.vram_mode`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1267":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-62","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`auto`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1268":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-63","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`auto`/`normal`：放得下时整体加载，否则部分加载；`high`：只整体加载；`low`：权重最多占用 GPU 显存的一半，给其他模型留空间；`none`：几乎所有权重都从内存流式加载（最省显存，最慢）。Apple 芯片上模型总是整体加载（其内存与系统共用）。界面：**设置** › **计算** › **内存**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1269":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-64","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`engines.<id>.vram_mode`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1270":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-65","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`auto`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1271":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-66","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"为单个引擎的模型设置（`auto`：使用全局设置）。界面：引擎卡片上的 **此引擎的显存使用**","locale":"zh-CN"},"1272":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-67","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`compute.vram_reserve_mb`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1273":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-68","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`1024`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1274":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-69","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"在请求所需之外保留的空闲显存（MB）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1275":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-70","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`compute.vram_limit_mb`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1276":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-71","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`0`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1277":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-72","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"每块 GPU 最多使用这么多（MB；`0`：全部），用于与其他程序共用 GPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"1278":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-73","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`compute.ram_reserve_mb`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1279":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-74","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"空","locale":"zh-CN"},"1280":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-75","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"保留的空闲内存（MB；空：2 GB 与内存十分之一中较大者）：低于它时丢弃内存中的副本、卸载空闲模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"1281":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-76","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`compute.host_copies`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1282":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-77","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`auto`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1283":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-78","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"为 GPU 上模型的权重在内存中保留一份副本，把模型移出 GPU 时不需要复制（`auto`：内存充足时）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1284":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-79","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`compute.max_pinned_mb`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1285":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-80","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`0`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1286":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-81","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"权重的主机副本使用的锁页内存，包括流式加载到 GPU 的和为重新加载模型而保留的（复制更快；`0`：Windows 上最多内存的 40 %，Linux 上更多）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1287":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-82","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`compute.async_offload`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1288":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-83","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`-1`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1289":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-84","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"在 GPU 计算时复制流式权重的复制流数量（`-1`：NVIDIA 和 AMD 上两个，其他为零）；用于每个输入只运行一次的模型，不用于自回归模型（在那里只会占用显存）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1290":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-85","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`compute.oom_retry`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1291":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-86","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"开","locale":"zh-CN"},"1292":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-87","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"某一步显存不足时，把更多权重留在内存中重新运行这一步：结果相同，速度较慢","locale":"zh-CN"},"1293":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-88","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`compute.oom_fallback`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1294":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-89","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"关","locale":"zh-CN"},"1295":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-90","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"之后允许这一步用更省显存的方式（分块解码、更小的批次）：占用更少显存，输出略有不同并会注明","locale":"zh-CN"},"1296":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-91","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`compute.kv_cache`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1297":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-92","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`dynamic`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1298":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-93","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`static`：Qwen3-TTS 与 CosyVoice 的语言模型把缓存写入预先分配的缓冲区（复制和碎片更少）。在 CPU 上结果相同；在 GPU 上结果的最后几位可能不同，因此需主动开启","locale":"zh-CN"},"1299":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-94","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`compute.cuda_graphs`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1300":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-95","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`true`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1301":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-96","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"在 NVIDIA 显卡上把 Qwen3-TTS、Fish Speech、CosyVoice 2/3、VoxCPM、GPT-SoVITS 与 IndexTTS 每一帧（每个 token、每个 patch）的解码作为 CUDA Graph 一次启动，生成快数倍，结果完全一致；部分权重从内存流式加载的模型不使用 CUDA Graph，Qwen3-TTS 的 talker 除外：它照样使用（流式加载的层在图内复制）；`false` 逐个启动算子","locale":"zh-CN"},"1302":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-97","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`engines.qwen3tts.load_options.fused_projections`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1303":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-98","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`false`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1304":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-99","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"快速模式：Qwen3-TTS 的 q/k/v 与 gate/up 投影各合并为一次矩阵乘法（与 qwen-tts-webui 相同），在 GPU 上再快几个百分点；GPU 上结果不再逐位一致","locale":"zh-CN"},"1305":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-100","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`engines.cosyvoice.load_options.fused_projections`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1306":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-101","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`false`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1307":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-102","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"CosyVoice 2 和 3 的语言模型的同一选项：在 GPU 上快约 1%，用 `fp16` 时快 2–5%；GPU 上结果可能不再逐位一致","locale":"zh-CN"},"1308":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-103","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`engines.voxcpm.load_options.attention_span`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1309":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-104","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`false`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1310":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-105","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"快速模式：VoxCPM 的解码在 GPU 上也只关注缓存中已填充的部分，快 1.4–1.7 倍；那里的结果不再逐位一致","locale":"zh-CN"},"1311":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-106","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`compute.cuda_allocator`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1312":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-107","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`auto`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1313":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-108","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"torch 的 CUDA 显存分配器：`native`、`async`（cudaMallocAsync；其下不使用 CUDA Graph，解码较慢）、`expandable`（可扩展段：结果相同，保留的显存更少）；下次启动时生效","locale":"zh-CN"},"1314":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-109","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"模型如何放置记录在每个结果的详情中（`meta.memory`：从内存流式加载的 MB、在设备上的 MB）；部分从内存运行、或显存不足后重试过的结果带有一条警告。部件只部分加载时，`meta.memory.partial` 逐个说明原因：当时权衡的空闲显存、预留的工作显存和保留量，或它为哪个部件让出了显存。日志中也有同样的信息。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1315":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-110","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"每一步预留的工作显存随请求而定：语言模型的缓存按文本长度估算，而不是按 `max_new_tokens` 允许的最长生成估算。生成远超其文本长度、超出显存时，这一步会以更多权重流式加载的方式重新运行，结果相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1316":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-111","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"部分加载的模型每次运行都要把那些层的权重从内存复制过来：语言模型每生成一帧都要付出这个代价，所以放得下的部分越多越快。在 NVIDIA 和 AMD GPU 上复制与计算重叠；在 Intel GPU 上同步进行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1317":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-112","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"`mizuoto doctor` 打印当前生效的内存设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1318":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-113","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存","content":"内部如何工作（阶段、单元、流式加载、预算、估算）：见显存与内存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1319":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-114","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#只整体加载high","content":"`compute.vram_mode` 为 `high`（**只整体加载**）时，Mizuoto 总是尝试整体加载模型，不看模型目录中的显存估计和显卡的空闲显存，与 ComfyUI 相同。它先把这块 GPU 上空闲的模型移走腾出空间，再复制权重。只有显存分配真正失败时请求才失败：错误码 `compute_unavailable`（`detail.reason` 为 `out_of_memory`，命令行退出码 9），随后所有 GPU 上未在使用的模型都会被卸载（见下文）。`compute.gpu_jobs` 大于 1 时，如果另一个请求占着这块 GPU 导致空间不够，请求先等待它结束（最多 10 分钟），然后再尝试加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1320":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-115","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#只整体加载high","content":"其他模式下，放不下的模型部分加载，最少到最小工作集（从不流式加载的部分和正在复制的副本）。即使估算认为连这也放不下，Mizuoto 也会尝试：在所有模式下，只有显存分配真正失败才算错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1321":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-116","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#显存不足","content":"请求的某一步仍然显存不足时（估计偏小，或其他程序占用了显存），Mizuoto 把这块 GPU 上其他空闲模型移走，把这一步自己的一半权重留在内存中，并用相同的随机数重新运行这一步，所以结果相同，只是更慢；最多重试两次。仍然不够且开启了 `compute.oom_fallback` 时，有更省显存方式的引擎会使用它（语音识别逐个 30 秒窗口，GPT-SoVITS 逐句，F5-TTS、Fish Speech、IndexTTS、OmniVoice 和 VoxCPM 的解码器分块）。否则请求以 `compute_unavailable` 失败（`detail.reason` 为 `out_of_memory`），并且与 ComfyUI 一样，Mizuoto 会卸载所有 GPU 上未在使用的模型，让下一次尝试从空的设备开始（CPU 上的模型保留）。如果再次失败，把引擎换到另一个设备，把 `compute.vram_mode` 设为 `low` 或 `none`，或调小 `compute.max_resident_models`。Mizuoto 还会记住每一步实际用了多少显存，下次预留相应的量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1322":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-117","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"`compute.compile`（默认关，界面为 **设置** › **计算** › **编译模型（torch.compile）**）用 `torch.compile` 编译部分引擎最耗时的模块：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1323":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-118","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"1324":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-119","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"编译的模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"1325":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-120","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"F5-TTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"1326":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-121","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"DiT（E2 为 UNetT）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1327":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-122","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"CosyVoice","locale":"zh-CN"},"1328":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-123","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"flow 估计器","locale":"zh-CN"},"1329":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-124","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"GPT-SoVITS v4、v5 Turbo","locale":"zh-CN"},"1330":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-125","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"CFM 估计器","locale":"zh-CN"},"1331":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-126","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"IndexTTS-2 / 2.5","locale":"zh-CN"},"1332":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-127","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"s2mel DiT 和 BigVGAN（加载选项 `use_torch_compile` 也会开启）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1333":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-128","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"VoxCPM","locale":"zh-CN"},"1334":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-129","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"局部 DiT","locale":"zh-CN"},"1335":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-130","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"Fish Speech S2 Pro","locale":"zh-CN"},"1336":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-131","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"每个解码步骤里的小运算","locale":"zh-CN"},"1337":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-132","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"对修改之后加载的模型生效；已加载的模型保持原样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1338":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-133","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"最初的请求要付出编译时间：在 CPU 上多 30 秒到 160 秒。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1339":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-134","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"在 CPU 上（fp32，8 线程），被编译模块的耗时：F5-TTS 减少 23%（整个请求从 60 秒降到 45 秒），IndexTTS 的 DiT 减少 7%、BigVGAN 减少 20%，GPT-SoVITS v4 减少 7%，CosyVoice 和（bf16 的）VoxCPM 没有变化。音频与不编译时略有差别；VoxCPM 的语音结束位置可能因此改变。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1340":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-135","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"在 GPU（RTX 3090）上，预热请求 F5-TTS 快 1.34 倍，GPT-SoVITS v4 快 1.14 倍，IndexTTS 和 CosyVoice 快 1.03–1.06 倍，代价是 55–134 秒的编译；VoxCPM 编译后不使用 CUDA 图，反而更慢（0.41–0.64 倍）：用 VoxCPM 时请关闭。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1341":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-136","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"Fish Speech S2 Pro 在 RTX 3060 上：每帧快 1.15 倍（3.4 秒的音频用 4.3 秒而不是 4.9 秒）；进程里的第一个请求要编译约 5 秒。它生成的语音与默认设置不同（同一文本和音色的另一次生成），在相同种子下仍可重复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1342":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-137","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"需要可用的 C++ 编译器。没有编译器，或某个模型的代码无法编译时，Mizuoto 记录一条警告，该模型照常不编译运行。Docker 镜像中没有编译器，所以在那里它不起作用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1343":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-138","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#编译模型computecompile","content":"更多测量数据，以及提速工作怎样确保结果不变：见性能记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1344":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-139","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"所有引擎和训练器的注意力计算都经过同一个开关 `compute.attention`（**设置** › **计算** › **注意力**），参照 ComfyUI 的注意力后端：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1345":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-140","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"取值","locale":"zh-CN"},"1346":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-141","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"由谁计算注意力","locale":"zh-CN"},"1347":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-142","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"`auto`（默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1348":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-143","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"按各模型原本实现的方式，结果与之完全相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"1349":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-144","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"`fast`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1350":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-145","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"实测最快的后端：NVIDIA GPU 上，已安装时由 FlashAttention 计算键有填充的 fp16/bf16 注意力（VoxCPM 的解码：快 1.4–1.6 倍），其余用 PyTorch 的 SDPA；其他设备使用 SDPA","locale":"zh-CN"},"1351":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-146","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"`sdpa`、`math`、`sdpa_flash`、`sdpa_efficient`、`sdpa_cudnn`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1352":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-147","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"PyTorch 的 SDPA（由它自己选择内核）、它的精确 math 内核，或它的某个融合内核","locale":"zh-CN"},"1353":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-148","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"`flash`、`xformers`、`sage`、`sage3`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1354":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-149","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"FlashAttention、xFormers、SageAttention 2（或 1）、SageAttention 3（Blackwell）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1355":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-150","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"除 `auto` 以外的取值都会使结果略有不同（SageAttention 会量化注意力分数）。对大多数模型，`sdpa` 给出的音频与 `auto` 相同，也不更快。逐个 token 生成的模型从不使用 SageAttention（用它时会无休止地生成下去），在其他地方它也不更快；xFormers 在结果不同的地方更慢：两者仍可按名称选用。输出会记录计算各部分所用的后端（`params.attention`：各后端的调用次数以及回退的原因），`mizuoto runtime` 会显示每个已加载模型的后端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1356":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-151","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"某个后端无法处理的调用会回退到下一个后端，最后回退到模型自己的计算方式。原因包括：未安装、GPU 不匹配、不支持的掩码、头维度、fp32、缺少反向传播，或内核出错。每种原因只记录一次日志。显存不足不算回退，由显存重试机制处理。开启 `compute.attention_strict` 时，请求会直接失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1357":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-152","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"有些注意力无论如何设置都保持自己的计算方式，因为没有融合内核能计算它们：在分数中加入相对位置的注意力（wenet、w2v-BERT、GPT-SoVITS 的 VITS），以及少数手写的编码器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1358":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-153","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"`engines.<id>.attention`（引擎卡片上的 **此引擎的注意力**）可以按引擎设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1359":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-154","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"训练有自己的设置 `training.attention`（**设置** › **训练** › **注意力**）。它只提供带反向传播的后端，因此不包括 SageAttention。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1360":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-155","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"修改对之后加载的模型生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1361":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-156","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"后端怎样选择和检查：见加速。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1362":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-157","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"这些包都不是依赖。每个包都绑定特定的 torch 版本、CUDA 或 ROCm 运行时和 GPU 架构，需要自行安装，并且不能让它们替换已装好的 torch。`mizuoto doctor` 会列出已安装的包、每个包能否在每块 GPU 上运行（一次小的自检），并给出适合本机的安装命令。例如：torch 2.8.0 用 `pip install \"xformers==0.0.32.post2\" --no-deps`；`pip install flash-attn --no-build-isolation --no-deps`（需要编译）；`pip install sageattention==2.2.0 --no-build-isolation --no-deps`（需要 `nvcc`）。torch 2.8 下 FlashAttention 和 xFormers 只装其一：torch 2.8 唯一的 flash-attn wheel（2.8.3）比 xFormers 0.0.32 接受的版本新，装上后 xFormers 无法加载。对 `fast` 来说，起作用的是 FlashAttention。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1363":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-158","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#注意力后端","content":"`compute.fast`（**设置** › **计算** › **加速**）为整个进程开启 GPU 提速开关，参照 ComfyUI 的 `--fast`：`tf32`、`fp16_accumulation`、`cudnn_benchmark` 和 `sdpa_reduced_precision`。每一项都会使结果略有不同。它们在下次启动 Mizuoto 时生效，输出会记录它们（`params.fast`）。在 RTX 3090 上测量，四项全开使 VoxCPM、F5-TTS、IndexTTS 1.5、Fish Speech、CosyVoice 3 和 GPT-SoVITS v4 快 1.1–1.3 倍，而 `fp16_accumulation` 使 GPT-SoVITS v2 慢约 5 %（v4 快 6–9 %），`tf32` 不影响 GPT-SoVITS 的速度（在空闲 GPU 上与默认设置交替重测：之前测得的慢 1.3–1.6 倍来自机器上的其他工作）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1364":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-159","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#合并等待中的请求micro-batching","content":"`tts.micro_batch`（默认开，Web UI 为 **设置** › **语音** › **合并等待中的请求**）：服务器队列里等待同一模型的请求，如果只是文本不同，就合并成一批交给引擎，每个请求仍得到自己的结果和任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1365":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-160","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#合并等待中的请求micro-batching","content":"满足下列全部条件的请求才会合并：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1366":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-161","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#合并等待中的请求micro-batching","content":"模型变体支持 **批量** 且每批上限至少为 2：Qwen3-TTS（8）、GPT-SoVITS（20）、OmniVoice（8）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1367":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-162","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#合并等待中的请求micro-batching","content":"文本只有一段（没有被切分成多段，也不是批量请求）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1368":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-163","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#合并等待中的请求micro-batching","content":"没有指定种子（批处理中的随机数与单独运行不同）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1369":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-164","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#合并等待中的请求micro-batching","content":"不是流式文本输入；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1370":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-165","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#合并等待中的请求micro-batching","content":"模型、设备、音色、风格、语言、参数、引擎选项和参考音频全部相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1371":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-166","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#合并等待中的请求micro-batching","content":"正在运行的请求在调用引擎前取走队列里同组的请求；整批失败时，这些请求回到队列各自运行。命令行每次只在前台运行一个任务，所以只有服务器（Web UI、HTTP 接口）会合并。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1372":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-167","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#在-cpu-上运行","content":"所有引擎和训练都能在 CPU 上运行，适合试用和短句，但比 GPU 慢很多，长文本和训练尤其如此（GPT-SoVITS 的训练在 GPU 上是几分钟，在 CPU 上是几小时）。选择较小的模型（如 Qwen3-TTS 0.6B、GPT-SoVITS）能明显缩短等待；`compute.compile` 对 F5-TTS 帮助最大。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1373":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-168","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#在-cpu-上运行","content":"两项设置能让 CPU 上的运算更快，且不改变任何结果（Linux；其他系统上不起作用）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1374":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-169","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#在-cpu-上运行","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"1375":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-170","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#在-cpu-上运行","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"1376":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-171","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#在-cpu-上运行","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"1377":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-172","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#在-cpu-上运行","content":"`compute.cpu_allocator`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1378":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-173","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#在-cpu-上运行","content":"`auto`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1379":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-174","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#在-cpu-上运行","content":"CPU 内存分配：`tuned`（Linux 上 `auto` 即此）复用大块内存并把大张量放在大页上（`training.memory = lowest` 的训练除外），CPU 上快 10–20%，结果完全相同；`system` 保持 C 库默认；下次启动时生效","locale":"zh-CN"},"1380":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-175","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#在-cpu-上运行","content":"`compute.cpu_threads`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1381":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-176","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#在-cpu-上运行","content":"`auto`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1382":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-177","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#在-cpu-上运行","content":"`cores`（Linux 上 `auto` 即此）把 torch 的 CPU 线程绑定到不同的物理核心；`off` 交给系统调度（有其他繁忙程序共用 CPU 时更好）；下次启动时生效","locale":"zh-CN"},"1383":{"id":"/docs/advanced-performance-178","page_id":"/docs/advanced-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-performance#在-cpu-上运行","content":"**内存紧张时的大页。** 内存充足时大页有好处，但在内存几乎占满的机器上（小内存里放大模型，其余是页缓存），内核要为每个大页停下来整理内存。在 8 核 CPU、31 GB 内存、空闲不到 400 MB 的机器上，Qwen3-TTS 1.7B 合成一段长文本时开着大页慢 6–8%，加载慢 2–5 秒；同一个模型在 125 GB 内存的机器上微调时，开着大页快 8%。如果在 CPU 上合成比预期慢而内存大多已被占用，用 `THP_MEM_ALLOC_ENABLE=0` 启动 Mizuoto（`tuned` 的其余部分不变），或把 `/sys/kernel/mm/transparent_hugepage/defrag` 设为 `defer`，让内核在后台整理内存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1384":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","type":"page","content":"远程主机","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-remote","locale":"zh-CN"},"1385":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote","content":"让引擎在另一台机器上运行：那台机器运行 mizuoto agent，本机把引擎的设备设为“主机名/设备”，音色、结果和界面都留在本机。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1386":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-remote#什么在哪里运行","content":"什么在哪里运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"1387":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-remote#agent提供引擎的机器","content":"agent：提供引擎的机器","locale":"zh-CN"},"1388":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-remote#主机使用远程引擎的机器","content":"主机：使用远程引擎的机器","locale":"zh-CN"},"1389":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"添加主机","locale":"zh-CN"},"1390":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-5","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-remote#把引擎放到主机上","content":"把引擎放到主机上","locale":"zh-CN"},"1391":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-6","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-remote#查看与移除","content":"查看与移除","locale":"zh-CN"},"1392":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-7","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-remote#出错时","content":"出错时","locale":"zh-CN"},"1393":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-8","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-remote#安全","content":"安全","locale":"zh-CN"},"1394":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-9","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-remote#http-接口","content":"HTTP 接口","locale":"zh-CN"},"1395":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-10","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote","content":"一台机器有 GPU、另一台机器上是你日常使用的 Mizuoto 时，可以让某个引擎在有 GPU 的机器上运行。有 GPU 的一方运行 `mizuoto agent`（下文称 **agent**），日常使用的一方（下文称 **主机**）把它添加为远程主机，再把引擎的设备设为 `<主机名>/<设备>`，例如 `gpu-box/cuda:0`。之后合成、流式播放和取消都与在本机运行时一样，只是引擎以及它加载的模型在 agent 上运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1396":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-11","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#什么在哪里运行","content":"在 agent 上","locale":"zh-CN"},"1397":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-12","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#什么在哪里运行","content":"在主机上","locale":"zh-CN"},"1398":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-13","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#什么在哪里运行","content":"torch 和各引擎的包（在那里运行 `mizuoto doctor`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1399":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-14","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#什么在哪里运行","content":"模型目录与请求的检查（计划）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1400":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-15","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#什么在哪里运行","content":"已安装的模型（`mizuoto model download`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1401":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-16","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#什么在哪里运行","content":"音色库、参考音频和音色缓存","locale":"zh-CN"},"1402":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-17","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#什么在哪里运行","content":"引擎（在 agent 自己的进程里）、加载的模型、空闲卸载","locale":"zh-CN"},"1403":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-18","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#什么在哪里运行","content":"合成结果、历史、任务及其日志","locale":"zh-CN"},"1404":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-19","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#什么在哪里运行","content":"显存：加载与显存不足的处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"1405":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-20","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#什么在哪里运行","content":"网页界面、HTTP 接口、命令行","locale":"zh-CN"},"1406":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-21","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#什么在哪里运行","content":"主机发来的文件的缓存：`<缓存>/remote/files/<sha256>/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1407":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-22","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#什么在哪里运行","content":"训练（始终在本机）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1408":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-23","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#什么在哪里运行","content":"**模型状态来自 agent。** 对设备指向远程主机的引擎，模型是否“已安装”取决于 agent 上已安装的模型列表（主机每 15 秒左右重新询问一次），而不是本机的模型文件夹。模型要在 agent 上用它自己的 `mizuoto` 命令安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1409":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-24","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#什么在哪里运行","content":"**两台机器运行相同的 Mizuoto 版本。** Mizuoto 0.2 使用第 2 版 agent 协议，以“已加载的引擎”为单位工作（加载、准备音色、合成、转换、编辑）。协议版本不同的主机和 agent 会在握手时互相拒绝，并提示在两台机器上安装相同版本的 Mizuoto。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1410":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-25","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#什么在哪里运行","content":"**文件按内容传送。** 请求里用到的文件（参考音频、情感参考音频等）按 SHA-256 发送：agent 已经有的不再发送，没有的分块（每块 8 MB）上传一次。agent 启动时删除一个月内没有被任何主机用到的文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1411":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-26","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#什么在哪里运行","content":"**音色缓存会传回本机。** 引擎为音色准备的缓存（第一次使用某个音色时生成）写在 agent 上，随结果逐个文件传回，保存在本机音色的缓存文件夹里；之后使用同一音色时直接读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1412":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-27","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#什么在哪里运行","content":"**流式输出、流式文本输入和取消都可用。** 音频片段一生成就从 agent 传回；取消请求会转发给 agent 上的引擎。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1413":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-28","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#什么在哪里运行","content":"**训练留在本机。** 引擎在远程主机上时，训练方法会说明原因：`<engine> runs on <host>, and training runs on this machine: mizuoto remote use <engine> --local`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1414":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-29","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#agent提供引擎的机器","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"1415":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-30","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#agent提供引擎的机器","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"1416":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-31","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#agent提供引擎的机器","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"1417":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-32","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#agent提供引擎的机器","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"1418":{"id":"/docs/advance