":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#agent提供引擎的机器","content":"第一次启动且没有令牌时，agent 生成一个随机令牌，保存为 `remote.agent.token`，并在终端上打印：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1440":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-55","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#agent提供引擎的机器","content":"第二行列出在那里可用的引擎。之后再启动会沿用保存的令牌；想查看它，打开那台机器的 `settings.toml`（`mizuoto config path`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1441":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-56","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#agent提供引擎的机器","content":"监听非本机地址又没有 TLS 时，agent 会警告：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1442":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-57","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#agent提供引擎的机器","content":"agent 在前台运行，直到 Ctrl+C。它自己的空闲卸载、显存处理等遵循那台机器的设置（`compute.*`、`engines.<id>.*`）。端口被占用时启动失败，提示换一个 `--port`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1443":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-58","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#agent提供引擎的机器","content":"需要接受许可的引擎（Fish Speech、IndexTTS）：在 agent 上安装它们的包（`mizuoto-fishspeech`、`mizuoto-indextts`），并在下载模型前在 agent 上接受许可（`mizuoto engine accept-licence <id>`）；在主机上合成前，主机上也要接受。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1444":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-59","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"参数或选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"1445":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-60","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"1446":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-61","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"`NAME`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1447":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-62","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"简短的名称，引擎的设备里会用到（`gpu-box/cuda:0`）；不能为空，不能含 `/` 或 `.`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1448":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remot