` 或 `refused`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1459":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-74","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"**设置** › **远程主机** › **添加主机**，填写 **名称**、**地址**、**令牌**，需要时打开 **TLS** 并填写 **本机上的 CA 文件**，点 **添加**。修改已有主机时 **令牌** 留空则保留已保存的令牌。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1460":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-75","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"列表中每台主机显示状态（**在线**、**离线**、**被拒绝**）、**设备**、**已安装的引擎** 和 **使用它的引擎**；**重新检查** 立即重新连接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1461":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-76","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"1462":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-77","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"1463":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-78","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"`online`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1464":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-79","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"握手成功","locale":"zh-CN"},"1465":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-80","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"`offline`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1466":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-81","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"连不上（地址、端口、防火墙，或 agent 没有运行），或 TLS 设置与 agent 不一致","locale":"zh-CN"},"1467":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-82","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"`refused`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1468":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-83","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"能连上，但令牌不对，或两边的协议版本不同","locale":"zh-CN"},"1469":{"id":"/docs/