合成","locale":"zh-CN"},"2613":{"id":"/docs/cli-9","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#克隆与设计音色","content":"克隆与设计音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"2614":{"id":"/docs/cli-10","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#边生成边播放","content":"边生成边播放","locale":"zh-CN"},"2615":{"id":"/docs/cli-11","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#批量与参数","content":"批量与参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"2616":{"id":"/docs/cli-12","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#转写转换与编辑","content":"转写、转换与编辑","locale":"zh-CN"},"2617":{"id":"/docs/cli-13","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#训练","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"2618":{"id":"/docs/cli-14","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#项目","content":"项目","locale":"zh-CN"},"2619":{"id":"/docs/cli-15","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#shell-补全","content":"Shell 补全","locale":"zh-CN"},"2620":{"id":"/docs/cli-16","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#下一步","content":"下一步","locale":"zh-CN"},"2621":{"id":"/docs/cli-17","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"`mizuoto` 命令行能做网页界面能做的事：合成、克隆与设计音色、转换与编辑录音、语音识别、检查 torch 与引擎、管理模型、预设、项目、数据集与训练、远程主机、任务和设置。命令行只是一层很薄的外壳：每条命令解析参数，调用核心里对应的那**一个**方法，再把结果打印出来。网页界面背后的 HTTP 接口调用的也是同一批方法，所以两边的行为一致，`--json` 打印的记录与接口返回的 JSON 结构相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2622":{"id":"/docs/cli-18","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"本页介绍共同约定和常用流程；每条命令的选项见 命令参考，设置项与环境变量见 配置与环境变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2623":{"id":"/docs/cli-19","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#命令一览","content":"任何一级都可以加 `--help`；只输入组名（如 `mizuoto model`）也会显示该组的帮助。每一级都接受 `--debug`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2624":{"id":"/docs/cli-20","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#与网页界面的区别","content":"**任务在前台运行。** `speak`、`design`、`model download`、`train run`、`project render` 等会创建一个任务，并在当前终端里执行到结束；进度条显示在 stderr 上（只在 stderr 是终端时显示，`--json` 时关闭），下载会显示已下载量、速度和剩余时间。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2625":{"id":"/docs/cli-21","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#与网页界面的区别","content":"**Ctrl+C 取消任务。** 任务被标记为 **已取消**，引擎在下一次检查时停下（下一个 token 或下一步），训练阶段的进程被结束，命令以退出码 130 结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2626":{"id":"/docs/cli-22","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#与网页界面的区别","content":"**不需要启动服务器。** 每条命令自己打开数据文件夹（设置、数据库、模型），执行完就关闭；引擎运行在命令自己的进程里，加载的模型随命令一起释放，所以每条 `speak` 都要重新加载一次模型。需要连续合成很多句时，用服务器（网页界面或 HTTP 接口）更快，那里模型会保留在内存中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2627":{"id":"/docs/cli-23","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#与网页界面的区别","content":"**命令行可以使用任何路径。** 网页界面只能读取 **浏览器可以打开的文件夹**（`paths.browse_roots`）里的服务器文件，而 `--ref`、`model import`、`dataset import` 等可以直接给出本机任意路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2628":{"id":"/docs/cli-24","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出与---json","content":"列表和查询类命令默认打印表格；加 `--json` 打印 JSON，结构与对应接口返回的记录相同，适合脚本处理：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2629":{"id":"/docs/cli-25","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出与---json","content":"几处说明：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2630":{"id":"/docs/cli-26","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出与---json","content":"`speak` 结束后逐行打印结果文件的路径、时长和采样率；结果总是保存在结果文件夹（并出现在 **历史** 中），`-o` 再复制一份到指定位置，扩展名决定格式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2631":{"id":"/docs/cli-27","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出与---json","content":"`speak --json` 打印 `{\"job\": …, \"outputs\": […]}`：完成的任务和它生成的结果记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2632":{"id":"/docs/cli-28","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出与---json","content":"`speak --plan` 只检查请求并打印将要执行的计划（模型、设备、音色模式、分段、参数），不运行任何东西。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2633":{"id":"/docs/cli-29","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出与---json","content":"警告（例如被丢弃的模型不接受的参数）以 `warning:` 开头打印在 stderr 上，不会混入 stdout。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2634":{"id":"/docs/cli-30","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"命令出错时，先打印错误信息，如果错误带有修复建议，第二行打印建议的命令；退出码表示错误类别。错误码定义在 `mizuoto/core/codes.py`，每个错误类的退出码定义在 `mizuoto/core/errors.py`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2635":{"id":"/docs/cli-31","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"退出码","locale":"zh-CN"},"2636":{"id":"/docs/cli-32","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"错误码","locale":"zh-CN"},"2637":{"id":"/docs/cli-33","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"典型情况","locale":"zh-CN"},"2638":{"id":"/docs/cli-34","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"0","locale":"zh-CN"},"2639":{"id":"/docs/cli-35","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"成功","locale":"zh-CN"},"2640":{"id":"/docs/cli-36","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"1","locale":"zh-CN"},"2641":{"id":"/docs/cli-37","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`internal_error`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2642":{"id":"/docs/cli-38","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"未分类的内部错误；确认提示时回答了\"否\"","locale":"zh-CN"},"2643":{"id":"/docs/cli-39","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"2","locale":"zh-CN"},"2644":{"id":"/docs/cli-40","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`not_found`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2645":{"id":"/docs/cli-41","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"模型、音色、任务、结果或引擎不存在。命令行参数写错（未知选项、取值超出范围）时 Click 也以 2 退出","locale":"zh-CN"},"2646":{"id":"/docs/cli-42","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"3","locale":"zh-CN"},"2647":{"id":"/docs/cli-43","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`conflict`、`busy`","loc