4":{"id":"/docs/cli-70","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`remote_unavailable`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2675":{"id":"/docs/cli-71","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"远程主机连不上、拒绝了令牌或协议版本不同","locale":"zh-CN"},"2676":{"id":"/docs/cli-72","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"130","locale":"zh-CN"},"2677":{"id":"/docs/cli-73","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`cancelled`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2678":{"id":"/docs/cli-74","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"Ctrl+C 中断，或任务被取消","locale":"zh-CN"},"2679":{"id":"/docs/cli-75","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"缺少依赖包时的输出类似：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2680":{"id":"/docs/cli-76","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#调试与日志","content":"也可以用环境变量 `MIZUOTO_LOG_LEVEL` 设置日志级别（`DEBUG`、`INFO`、`WARNING`、`ERROR`，默认 `INFO`）。每个任务的完整日志保存在数据文件夹的 `jobs/<任务 id>.log`，用 `mizuoto job log <任务 id>` 查看；训练阶段的输出也写进其任务的日志。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2681":{"id":"/docs/cli-77","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#在服务器运行时使用","content":"命令行和服务器可以同时打开同一个数据文件夹。它们是两个独立的进程，共享设置文件、数据库和各个文件夹：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2682":{"id":"/docs/cli-78","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#在服务器运行时使用","content":"**设置**：`mizuoto config set` 写入 `settings.toml`，正在运行的服务器在约 1 秒内读到改动，网页界面随之刷新。服务器地址和端口要在下次启动服务器时生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2683":{"id":"/docs/cli-79","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#在服务器运行时使用","content":"**任务**：命令行的任务也写进数据库，所以 `mizuoto job list` 能看到服务器的任务，网页界面的 **任务** 面板也能看到命令行跑过的任务。任务记录着运行它的进程；一个进程打开数据文件夹时，只把**已经退出的**进程留下的未完成任务标为 **已中断**，不会动另一个仍在运行的进程的任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2684":{"id":"/docs/cli-80","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#在服务器运行时使用","content":"**GPU 不排队**：命令行的任务立即在自己的进程里运行，不进入服务器的 GPU 队列，并加载自己的一份模型。如果服务器已经把同一个模型加载在同一块 GPU 上，显存里会有两份；显存不够时任务以 `compute_unavailable`（退出码 9）失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2685":{"id":"/docs/cli-81","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#在服务器运行时使用","content":"**已加载的模型**：`mizuoto runtime` 列出正在运行的服务器持有的模型（通过数据文件夹中的 `server.json` 找到服务器），`mizuoto runtime --unload [MODEL]` 在服务器上卸载它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2686":{"id":"/docs/cli-82","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#在服务器运行时使用","content":"**取消**：`mizuoto job cancel` 只能取消本进程里的任务，对服务器正在运行的任务会报告 `Job … is not running`。要取消服务器的任务，在网页界面的 **任务** 面板里点 **取消**，或调用 `POST /api/v1/jobs/{job_id}/cancel`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2687":{"id":"/docs/cli-83","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#在服务器运行时使用","content":"`mizuoto job retry` 在前台重新运行一个失败、已取消或已中断的任务（它保存的请求会重新规划）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2688":{"id":"/docs/cli-84","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#检查引擎下载模型合成","content":"不带 `-m` 时使用设置 `tts.default_model`。`mizuoto model spec <模型>` 列出模型接受的音色模式、语言、通用参数和引擎选项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2689":{"id":"/docs/cli-85","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#克隆与设计音色","content":"`-v` 接受音色的 id 或 slug（`mizuoto voice list` 的第一列）；名称里的中文会保留在 slug 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2690":{"id":"/docs/cli-86","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#边生成边播放","content":"`--stream` 把 WAV 写到 stdout，模型生成多少就写多少，适合接播放器：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2691":{"id":"/docs/cli-87","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#边生成边播放","content":"stdout 是终端时 `--stream` 会拒绝运行；结果仍然完整保存，路径打印在 stderr 上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2692":{"id":"/docs/cli-88","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#批量与参数","content":"`-p` 设置通用参数（`temperature`、`top_p`、`top_k`、`repetition_penalty`、`max_new_tokens`、`num_steps`、`guidance_scale`、`speed`、`duration`、`seed`、`text_normalization`、`segment_silence_ms`），`-O` 设置引擎自己的选项；值按 JSON 解析。模型不接受某个参数时默认丢弃并给出警告，加 `--strict` 则报错（退出码 4）；默认值来自 `tts.strict_params`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2693":{"id":"/docs/cli-89","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#训练","content":"所有训练都在 Mizuoto 自己的环境中运行；每个阶段是同一个 Python 的子进程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2694":{"id":"/docs/cli-90","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-补全","content":"安装后重新打开终端即可补全命令、子命令和选项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2695":{"id":"/docs/cli-91","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#下一步","content":"命令参考：每条命令的参数和选项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2696":{"id":"/docs/cli-92","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#下一步","content":"配置与环境变量：设置项、环境变量和数据文件夹。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2697":{"id":"/docs/cli-93","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#下一步","content":"常见问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"2698":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","type":"page","content":"加速","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-acceleration","locale":"zh-CN"},"2699":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-0","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration","content":"不改变结果的提速：注意力分发（调用点、参照计算、策略、后端、结构化掩码、探测），compute.fast，compute.compile，解码步骤的 CUDA Graph，无同步采样，以及 CPU 的内存分配与线程绑定；哪些需主动开启的功能结果不逐位一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2700":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-1","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-acceleration#哪些会改变结果","content":"哪些会改变结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"2701":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-2","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-acceleration#注意力","content":"注意力","locale":"zh-CN"},"2702":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-3","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-acceleration#调用点与参照计算","content":"调用点与参照计算","locale":"zh-CN"},"2703":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-4","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","type":"heading",