ment-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#调用点与参照计算","content":"Fish Speech 的解码步骤（`fishspeech.step`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2783":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-84","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#调用点与参照计算","content":"手写的 softmax","locale":"zh-CN"},"2784":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-85","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#调用点与参照计算","content":"Fish Speech 的快速 transformer（`fishspeech.fast`）、IndexTTS 的 perceiver（`indextts.perceiver`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2785":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-86","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#调用点与参照计算","content":"在分数中加入相对位置、或需要概率矩阵的注意力不是调用点：wenet 的相对位置注意力、IndexTTS 的 Conformer、w2v-BERT、VITS，以及 s3tokenizer（q 和 k 各乘 d^-¼）、MelStyle 和 G2PW 的 BERT。没有融合内核能计算它们，所以保持手写。`Site(swappable=False)` 让一个调用点无论什么策略都使用参照计算；`approx_ok=False` 拒绝所有非精确的后端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2786":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-87","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#策略","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2787":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-88","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#策略","content":"取值","locale":"zh-CN"},"2788":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-89","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#策略","content":"默认","locale":"zh-CN"},"2789":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-90","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#策略","content":"`compute.attention`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2790":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-91","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration