evelopment-api-91","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#路由的写法","content":"约定：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3092":{"id":"/docs/development-api-92","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#路由的写法","content":"**一个操作，一个核心方法。** 路由体只解析、调用、返回；请求体和返回值都是核心层的 `Record` 模型，API 的 JSON 因而等于 CLI 的 `--json`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3093":{"id":"/docs/development-api-93","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#路由的写法","content":"**每个路由都写 `operation_id`**，它是 OpenAPI 中操作的名字。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3094":{"id":"/docs/development-api-94","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#路由的写法","content":"**普通 `def`**：涉及磁盘和数据库的路由在线程池里运行。只有读原始请求体的上传（`uploads.spool()` 把它流式写入临时文件，从不按 multipart 解析）和 WebSocket 是 `async def`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3095":{"id":"/docs/development-api-95","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#路由的写法","content":"**长操作返回 `Job`。** `POST /tts/speak?wait=true` 用 `JobService.wait` 等待，超过 `timeout` 抛 `OperationTimeoutError`（504，`detail.job_id` 指向仍在运行的任务）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3096":{"id":"/docs/development-api-96","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#路由的写法","content":"**音频文件**用 `files.audio_response()`：`FileResponse` 支持 `Range`，长文件可以拖动。流式合成见 `streaming.py`（分块 WAV 或裸 PCM，采样率在 `X-Mizuoto-Sample-Rate`，任务 id 在 `X-Mizuoto-Job`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3097":{"id":"/docs/development-api-97","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"模型在服务器进程里，所以别的程序（以及 `mizuoto runtime`）要通过 API 查看和释放它们。`routers/runtime.py`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3098":{"id":"/docs/development-api-98","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"路由","locale":"zh-CN"},"3099":{"id":"/docs/development-api-99","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"核心方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"3100":{"id":"/docs/development-api-100","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"返回","locale":"zh-CN"},"3101":{"id":"/docs/development-api-101","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"`GET /api/v1/runtime`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3102":{"id":"/docs/development-api-102","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"`runtime.status()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3103":{"id":"/docs/development-api-103","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"`RuntimeStatus`：已安装 torch 的版本、已加载的模型（引擎、设备、字节数、最近使用、是否忙、远程主机）和各引擎的状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"3104":{"id":"/docs/development-api-104","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"`POST /api/v1/runtime/unload`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3105":{"id":"/docs/development-api-105","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"`runtime.unload(body.model)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3106":{"id":"/docs/development-api-106","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"卸载 `UnloadRequest.model` 指定的模型（为 `null` 时卸载所有没在用的模型）之后的 `RuntimeStatus`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3107":{"id":"/docs/development-api-107","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"`GET /api/v1/runtime/doctor`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3108":{"id":"/docs/development-api-108","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"`runtime.doctor()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3109":{"id":"/docs/development-api-109","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"`DoctorReport`：torch 构建与硬件是否匹配、推荐的构建及其安装命令、每个引擎、附加依赖和训练器的检查结果，以及旧的 `<data>/envs` 的大小","locale":"zh-CN"},"3110":{"id":"/docs/development-api-110","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"`GET /api/v1/engines/{id}/doctor` 是单个引擎的同一份报告。引擎详情（`EngineStatus`）带 `available` 和 `missing`（`torch`、`mizuoto-fishspeech` 等），不再有环境信息；`GET /api/v1/app/meta` 带 `torch`，即已安装的版本或 `null`。`POST /api/v1/compute/release`（**释放显存**）卸载所有空闲引擎的模型。这些接口的模型定义在 `mizuoto/core/inference/models.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3111":{"id":"/docs/development-api-111","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#openapi-与事件","content":"socket 事件不是 HTTP 路由，FastAPI 本不会把它们写进模式。`openapi.py` 的 `MizuotoAPI` 覆盖 `openapi()`：遍历 `EventBase.get_events()`（`mizuoto/core/events/models.py` 中每个带 `__event_name__` 的子类），把各自的模型加入 `components.schemas`，再加一个 `ServerEvents` 对象，事件名 → 模型：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3112":{"id":"/docs/development-api-112","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#openapi-与事件","content":"当前的事件：`settings_changed`、`job_updated`、`job_log`、`jobs_cleared`、`outputs_added`、`outputs_removed`、`runtime_changed`、`compute_changed`、`engines_changed`、`voices_changed`、`datasets_changed`、`projects_changed`、`experiments_changed`、`train_metrics`、`presets_changed`、`models_changed`。每个事件携带快照而不是活对象：socket 桥稍后在事件循环上序列化它，而任务线程还在写。桥从 EventBus 订阅（在线程里被调用，用 `call_soon_threadsafe` 进入事件循环），按事件名 `emit`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3113":{"id":"/docs/development-api-113","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#openapi-与事件","content":"socket 只推送变化。客户端收到事件后修补或作废对应的查询，重连后重新拉取屏幕上的内容；任何状态都必须能通过 REST 读到。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3114":{"id":"/docs/development-api-114","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#为-web-ui-生成类型","content":"`scripts/generate_openapi.py` 在临时数据目录里构建服务和应用（`serve_ui=False`），打印 `app.openapi()`，不启动服务器。`python scripts/dev.py typegen` 把它交给 `openapi-typescript`，写出 `mizuoto/webui/src/api/schema.d.ts`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3115":{"id":"/docs/development-api-115","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#为-web-ui-生成类型","content":"`--default-non-nullable false` 让请求体中带默认值的字段保持可选；`Record` 设置了 `json_schema_serialization_defaults_required`，响应中的这些字段则是必填，类型与服务器实际发送的一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3116":{"id":"/docs/development-api-116","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#为-web-ui-生成类型","content":"既作请求体又作响应的模型（`SpeakRequest` 在输出的\"重新运行\"里被返回；项目的 `Chapter`、`Line`、`Speaker`；`CommonParams`、`VoiceInput`、`EmotionInput`、`OutputSpec`……）在模式中分成 `-Input` 和 `-Output` 两份。界面发送 `S['SpeakRequest-Input']`，读取 `S['SpeakRequest-Output']`；`webui/src/api/types.ts` 为常用的几个起了别名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3117":{"id":"/docs/development-api-117","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#新增一个路由","content":"**核心方法。** 在 `mizuoto/core/<领域>/service.py` 写方法，参数和返回值是 `Record` 模型（`mizuoto/core/<领域>/models.py`）；错误只用 `core/errors.py` 的类。若它改变了界面要显示的东西，发布一个事件（新事件就在 `core/events/models.py` 加一个 `EventBase` 子类，模式会自动带上它）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3118":{"id":"/docs/development-api-118","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#新增一个路由","content":"**路由。** 在 `mizuoto/api/routers/` 对应的模块里加函数，带 `operation_id`；新资源则新建模块并加入 `app.py` 的 `ROUTERS`。读服务器路径的操作加 `dependencies=[LocalDep]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3119":{"id":"/docs/development-api-119","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#新增一个路由","content":"**类型。** 运行 `python scripts/dev.py typegen`，提交 `schema.d.ts`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3120":{"id":"/docs/development-api-120","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#新增一个路由","content":"**测试。** 在 `tests/api/test_api.py` 用 `TestClient` 对着 dummy 引擎测试；改变状态的请求带 `headers={\"origin\": \"http://localhost\"}`（文件里的 `ORIGIN`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3121":{"id":"/docs/development-api-121","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"`mizuoto/cli/` 用 Typer。结构：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3122":{"id":"/docs/development-api-122","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"3123":{"id":"/docs/development-api-123","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3124":{"id":"/docs/development-api-124","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"`app.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3125":{"id":"/docs/development-api-125","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"`get_app()` 注册全部命令（且只在这里注册）；`main()` 统一处理错误和退出码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3126":{"id":"/docs/development-api-126","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"`commands/*.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3127":{"id":"/docs/development-api-127","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"每条命令是一个普通函数，参数用 `Annotated[..., typer.Option(...)]` 声明","locale":"zh-CN"},"3128":{"id":"/docs/development-api-128","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"`factory.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3129":{"id":"/docs/development-api-129","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"`typer_factory()`（命令按字母排序的 `AlphabeticalMixedGroup`）、给每条命令和每个组都加 `--debug` 并把领域错误变成退出码的 `DebugTyperCommand`、`report_error()`；`typer._click` 的私有导入只在这里","locale":"zh-CN"},"3130":{"id":"/docs/development-api-130","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":