/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"tokenizers、sentencepiece、tiktoken、kaldifst、numpy","locale":"zh-CN"},"3183":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-41","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"`mizuoto/engines`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3184":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-42","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"`mizuoto.runtime`、`mizuoto.nn`、`mizuoto.text`、`mizuoto.engines`、`mizuoto.training`、`mizuoto.core.codes`、`mizuoto.core.inference.tasks`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3185":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-43","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"numpy、torch、safetensors、tokenizers、sentencepiece、tiktoken、soxr、yaml、inflect、regex，以及各文本前端的包（pypinyin、rjieba、jieba、opencc、wordsegment、budoux、fasttext、ToJyutping、fugashi、pyopenjtalk、jamo、mecab）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3186":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-44","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"`mizuoto/training`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3187":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-45","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"同引擎，另加 `mizuoto.core.jobs.events` 和 `mizuoto.core.jobs.jsonl`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3188":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-46","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"numpy、torch","locale":"zh-CN"},"3189":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-47","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"其他检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3190":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-48","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"`test_only_core_inference_reaches_model_code`：`mizuoto/core` 里除 `core/inference` 之外，没有模块导入运行时、`nn`、引擎或训练器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3191":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-49","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"`test_shared_modules_are_standard_library_only`：`core/codes.py`、`core/jobs/events.py`、`core/jobs/jsonl.py`、`core/remote/frames.py` 和 `core/inference/tasks.py` 只导入标准库（以及彼此）。运行时、引擎和训练阶段都要用它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3192":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-50","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"`check_native_package`，由每个需要接受许可的包的 `test_<id>_package.py` 对自己调用：`packages/native/*/mizuoto_*` 遵守引擎的规则（另可导入自己的包），不改变进程状态，注意力只经 `mizuoto.runtime.accel` 计算。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3193":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-51","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"`test_engines_import_no_other_engine`：`mizuoto/engines/<a>` 永远不导入 `mizuoto/engines/<b>`；两个引擎共用的东西应放进 `nn` 或 `runtime`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3194":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-52","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"`test_native_code_leaves_global_state_alone`：`runtime`、`nn`、`text`、各引擎和需要接受许可的包里，不允许出现改动进程级状态的调用（见运行时）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3195":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-53","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"`test_attention_goes_through_the_accel_entry_point`：`runtime/accel` 之外，运行时、`nn`、引擎、训练器和需要接受许可的包都不直接调用 SDPA 或它的 aten 内核；每次注意力计算都经过 `accel.attention`，`compute.attention` 才能切换它（见注意力加速）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3196":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-54","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"`test_host_never_imports_model_code`：`core`、`api`、`cli` 里没有任何地方导入 torch、torchaudio、transformers、onnxruntime、`mizuoto_fishspeech` 或 `mizuoto_indextts`，函数内也不行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3197":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-55","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"三个子进程测试：`import mizuoto.core.context` 不加载 torch、fastapi 和 typer；`import mizuoto.cli.app` 不加载 torch 和 fastapi；导入引擎契约、请求上下文、dummy 引擎、`core.inference.local` 和 `core.inference.runtime` 不加载 torch。这让 `mizuoto version` 和 `mizuoto --help` 保持快速，也让核心的测试能只靠 dummy 引擎运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3198":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-56","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"`test_one_distribution`：`pyproject.toml` 依赖 torch，不依赖任何其他 `mizuoto-*` 发行包，且 `packages/` 下除 `packages/native` 外没有 worker 包和引擎包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3199":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-57","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"每条规则都有原因：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3200":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-58","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"**核心启动不需要 torch。** 列出模型、改设置、提供界面都不加载模型；运行时在第一次加载模型时才建立。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3201":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-59","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"**`core/inference` 是唯一的入口**，于是核心对模型代码的了解集中在一个包里，而且每处导入都一眼可见是延迟的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3202":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-60","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"**共用模块只用标准库**，因为训练阶段、远程 agent 的帧和引擎都要用它们，而