ime.unload_model`、`engines.inference`、`voices.tts` 等）在构造之后再挂上，构造函数因此没有循环依赖。最后注册一个设置监听器：`engines.<id>.*` 的任何改动都会卸载该引擎的模型（`runtime.unload_engine`；下一个请求用新设置重新加载），`remote.hosts.*` 的改动会结束与旧主机的会话，并发布 `settings_changed` 和 `engines_changed`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3265":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-123","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#组装build_services","content":"服务器（`mizuoto webui`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3266":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-124","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#组装build_services","content":"命令行与 Python","locale":"zh-CN"},"3267":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-125","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#组装build_services","content":"入口","locale":"zh-CN"},"3268":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-126","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#组装build_services","content":"`build_services(start_background=True)`，存在 `app.state.services`；路由通过 `ServicesDep` 取得","locale":"zh-CN"},"3269":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-127","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#组装build_services","content":"`open_services()` 上下文管理器（CLI 经 `cli/output.py` 调用），每条命令建一次、结束后关闭","locale":"zh-CN"},"3270":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-128","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#组装build_services","content":"后台","locale":"zh-CN"},"3271":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-129","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#组装build_services","content":"`jobs.start()`（调度线程）、`runtime.start()`（空闲回收与限频的 `runtime_changed` 事件）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3272":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-130","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#组装build_services","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"3273":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-131","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#组装build_services","content":"任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"3274":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-132","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#组装build_services","content":"`jobs.submit()` 入队，调度器按资源运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"3275":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-133","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#组装build_services","content":"`jobs.run_now()` 在调用线程前台运行，Ctrl+C 取消；模型在 `Services.close()` 时卸载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3276":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-134","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#组装build_services","content":"测试用 `environ=`（代替 `os.environ`）、`data_dir=` 和 `settings_overrides=` 构建完全隔离的服务（`tests/conftest.py` 的 `make_services`）。dummy 引擎和所有引擎一样，运行在测试自己的进程里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3277":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-135","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个请求的路径","content":"在 Web UI 点 **合成**：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3278":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-136","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个请求的路径","content":"逐步来看：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3279":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-137","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个请求的路径","content":"**先规划，再排队。** `TtsService.plan()` 对照清单检查模型状态、引擎是否启用且可用、许可、文本、语言、音色模式、参考音频、参数和设备，这些都在任务创建之前（不估算显存：模型总是尝试加载）；出错立刻带着错误码返回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3280":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-138","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个请求的路径","content":"**任务。** `speak` 占用 `engine:<引擎>:<设备>`（容量 1：一个已加载的引擎一次只服务一个请求），设备不是 CPU 时还占用 `gpu:<设备>`。请求以 JSON 保存，所以**重试**在重启后也会重新规划。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3281":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-139","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个请求的路径","content":"**模型。** `RuntimeService.loaded(ModelRef(id, engine, variant, path), device, dtype, options, request)` 返回模型的 `EngineHandle`：本进程里是 `LocalHandle`，设备名为 `<主机>/<设备>` 时是 `RemoteEngineHandle`。模型没加载就先加载，加载前先把超出 `compute.max_resident_models` 的其他模型卸掉。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3282":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-140","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个请求的路径","content":"**音色。** 有参考音频时，`prepare_voice` 按缓存键把引擎的音色状态（提示码、嵌入）写进音色缓存，只做一次；之后的请求通过 `VoiceSpec.cache` 传入这些文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3283":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-141","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个请求的路径","content":"**合成。** `synthesize(task, request)` 是一个产出 `AudioChunk` 的生成器（float32 单声道 numpy 采样、采样率、段号）。任务逐块取出（客户端流式接收时，也把每块交给 `StreamSink`）；关闭生成器就会让引擎停下。每段一个 `SynthesisTask`，或一个批处理任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3284":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-142","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个请求的路径","content":"**输出。** 各段以段间停顿拼接、归一化、重采样到输出采样率、编码（PyAV），记录为一个 `Output`，带实际参数、耗时（加载、首块、总计、RTF）和许可标签。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3285":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-143","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个请求的路径","content":"**REST 是事实来源，socket 只负责推送。** `SocketBridge`（`mizuoto/api/sockets.py`）订阅 `EventBus`，用 `call_soon_threadsafe` 把任务线程上的事件交给事件循环，按事件名发出。事件携带的是快照，从不是活对象。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3286":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-144","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个请求的路径","content":"同一条合成路径还有几种入口，它们都落到 `TtsService` 的同一套规划和任务上：流式输出（`StreamSink`：WebSocket `/api/v1/tts/stream`、`POST /tts/speak?stream=true`、`mizuoto speak --stream`）、流式文本输入（`TextFeed`，变体有 `stream_text_input` 能力时）、音色转换和语音编辑（`convert`、`edit` 任务），以及兼容 OpenAI 的 `POST /v1/audio/speech`（`TtsService.from_openai` 把模型、音色、`instructions`、`speed` 和格式映射成 `SpeakRequest`）。协议和示例见 HTTP API。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3287":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-145","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#通往模型代码的入口coreinference","content":"核心对模型代码的了解全部集中在 `mizuoto/core/inference/`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3288":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-146","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#通往模型代码的入口coreinference","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"3289":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-147","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#通往模型代码的入口coreinference","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3290":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-148","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#通往模型代码的入口coreinference","content":"`tasks.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3291":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-149","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#通往模型代码的入口coreinference","content":"引擎接收和产出的任务类型（`SynthesisTask`、`VoiceSpec`、`LoadSpec`、`AudioChunk`、`Description`、`OptionSpec` 等），只用标准库的数据类，由 `runtime.engine` 再导出；核心可以在模块顶层构造它们而不加载运行时","locale":"zh-CN"},"3292":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-150","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#通往模型代码的入口coreinference","content":"`service.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3293":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-151","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#通往模型代码的入口coreinference","content":"`InferenceService`：本机装了什么。torch 能导入且实现已注册（内置的 `BUILTIN`，或 `mizuoto.engines` 入口点）时引擎可用；否则 `missing(engine)` 列出缺什么（`torch`、`mizuoto-fishspeech`、`mizuoto-indextts`）。附加依赖和训练器的需要用 `importlib.util.find_spec` 探测，不导入 torch。原生运行时在第一次加载模型时才建立","locale":"zh-CN"},"3294":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-152","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#通往模型代码的入口coreinference","content":"`runtime.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3295":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-153","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#通往模型代码的入口coreinference","content":"`RuntimeService`：每个（引擎，设备）一个引擎，`loaded(ModelRef, device, dtype, options, request)` 给出模型的 `EngineHandle`；最多常驻 `compute.max_resident_models` 个模型、空闲回收、内存不足后的释放、训练前腾空设备、doctor","locale":"zh-CN"},"3296":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-154","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#通往模型代码的入口coreinference","content":"`engine.py`、`local.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3297":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-155","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#通往模型代码的入口coreinference","content":"`EngineHandle` 与 `EngineRequest`（取消事件、超时、流式文本队列、进度回调；返回 `applied`、`warnings`、`timings`）；`LocalEngine` / `LocalHandle` 在本进程里调用引擎。设备名为 `<主机>/<设备>` 时换成 `core/remote` 的 `RemoteEngine` 会话，调用方式相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"3298":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-156","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#通往模型代码的入口coreinference","content":"`models.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3299":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-157","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#通往模型代码的入口coreinference","content":"`RuntimeStatus`、`LoadedModelInfo`、`DoctorReport` 等报告用的模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"3300":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-158","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#通往模型代码的入口coreinference","content":"句柄的方法是 `prepare_voice`、`synthesize` / `convert` / `edit`（返回生成器：引擎只在 `next()` 里运行，每一步绑定请求上下文并进入 `torch.inference_mode()`）和 `call(op, payload)`（ASR 的 `transcribe`、Fish Speech 的 `codec_*`、`mizuoto.snapshot`）。加载在推理模式之外进行。这些细节见运行时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3301":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-159","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#引擎注册表与清单","content":"一个引擎由两部分组成：**清单**（`mizuoto/core/engines/manifests/<id>.toml`，随 wheel 发布的包数据）和**实现**（`mizuoto.runtime.engine.Engine` 的子类）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3302":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-160","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#引擎注册表与清单","content":"清单写明变体与能力、通用参数的映射、引擎选项和加载选项、模型目录（每个模型固定的仓库版本，文件大小和 SHA-256 在 `manifests/files/*.files.json`）、共享资源（`[[assets]]`）、许可，以及训练方法（`[training.<方法>]`）。主机只读清单就能列出引擎、校验请求、渲染参数表单，不导入 torch。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3303":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-161","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#引擎注册表与清单","content":"`EngineRegistry`（`core/engines/registry.py`）加载并校验清单，记录许可是否已接受，并经 `InferenceService` 报告各引擎 `available` / `missing`。`params.py` 检查通用参数（`None` 表示引擎自己的默认值，Mizuoto 从不强加默认值），`languages.py` 把语言码规范化，`licences.py` 管许可全文。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3304":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-162","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#引擎注册表与清单","content":"实现的注册表在 `runtime/engine.py`：内置引擎列在 `BUILTIN`（`id → 模块:类`），别的发行包通过入口点组 `mizuoto.engines` 注册。入口点在每个进程里只读一次，所以装了新的引擎包要重启 Mizuoto。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3305":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-163","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#引擎注册表与清单","content":"引擎的 `OPTION_SCHEMA` 必须与清单的 `[options]` 完全一致，`Engine.DEVICES` 必须与清单的 `devices` 一致（`tests/core/test_engines.py` 检查这两条）；引擎的 `detect_variant()`（只看文件，不用 torch）与主机导入模型时用的 `core/models/detect.py` 得出同样的变体。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3306":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-164","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#引擎注册表与清单","content":"写一个引擎的完整过程见接入引擎。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3307":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-165","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#模型共享资源与许可","content":"**模型。** 目录模型下载到 `models/<引擎>/<模型>/`，`model.json` 最后写入并列出文件。状态是 `missing`、`partial`（有文件夹没有 `model.json`，或缺它需要的共享资源）、`installed`、`corrupt`（大小不符或校验失败）或 `downloading`。`model_download` 任务（资源 `io`）以 `downloads.concurrency` 个线程下载到 `<文件>.part`，用 Range 续传，校验大小和 SHA-256，按来源顺序尝试（`downloads.source` 优先，然后 Hugging Face、hf-mirror、ModelScope；`downloads.repository = \"mizuoto-model\"` 时先试镜像）；某个来源缺的文件从下一个取。`import_model` 按文件识别引擎和变体，大小与目录模型相符时再校验 SHA-256，否则登记为用户模型 `<引擎>/<名字>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3308":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-166","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#模型共享资源与许可","content":"**共享资源**（清单的 `[[assets]]`）是一个引擎的多个模型共用的文件，放在 `models/_assets/<引擎>/<名字>/`，带 `asset.json`；随第一个需要它的模型下载，也可以单独下载。压缩包部分校验后解压到原处。引擎通过 `LoadSpec.options[\"assets\"]`（id → 文件夹）拿到它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3309":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-167","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#模型共享资源与许可","content":"**许可。** `licence.gated` 的引擎（Fish Speech、IndexTTS）要求 `engines.<id>.accepted_licence == \"<许可 id>@<版本>\"`，才能下载模型和共享资源、才能合成；许可全文随包发布（`manifests/licences/`）。`requires_consent` 让克隆需要一段同意声明，`trains_others = false` 让它的输出不能作为别的引擎的训练数据，`notice` 显示在结果下方。输出都带许可标签。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3310":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-168","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#音色","content":"音色是 `voices/<slug>/voice.json` 加 `references/<sha256>.flac`（单声道，保留原采样率）。文件夹就是事实来源，列表是一次扫描；删除进回收站。种类有 `reference`、`designed`（设计结果，生成的片段作为主参考）、`preset`（某个模型的预设说话人）和 `trained`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3311":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-169","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#音色","content":"`fit_voice(voice, model, variant)` 回答“这个模型能否用这个音色、怎样用”：模式（`preset`、`design`、`clone`、`clone_no_transcript`）、还需要什么（`transcribe`、`trim`）、警告，或不能用的原因。合成和界面的音色选择器都用它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3312":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-170","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#音色","content":"**音色缓存。** 加载模型之后，任务对每个键调用一次 `prepare_voice`，写入 `voices/<slug>/cache/<引擎>/<模型>/<键>/` 并记下 `cache.json`；临时参考音频写入 `cache/voices/…`。键是（模型、模型版本、参考音频的 SHA-256 与转写、音色模式、Mizuoto 版本，以及需要接受许可的引擎的发行包版本）的哈希，所以升级 Mizuoto 或该发行包会重建一次缓存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3313":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-171","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#音色","content":"**音色自有权重**（`Voice.weights[engine]`）：清单有 `[weights]` 角色的引擎（GPT-SoVITS 的 `gpt` 和 `sovits`）可以带一个音色专属的微调，存于 `weights/<引擎>/`，随音色导出导入；版本由文件判断，与变体的 `weights_version` 相同时才使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3314":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-172","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#音色","content":"缺少转写时，开启 `tts.auto_transcribe` 且 ASR 可用就先转写（结果按音频 SHA-256、模型和束宽缓存在 `transcripts` 表里，并写回音色）；否则模型有 `clone_no_transcript` 就用它，没有就报 `capability_not_supported` 并提示安装命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3315":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-173","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#远程主机","content":"设备名为 `<主机>/<设备>` 的引擎运行在那台主机的 `mizuoto agent` 上。agent 是一个完整的 Mizuoto：自己的数据目录、模型和引擎、自己的进程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3316":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-174","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#远程主机","content":"协议版本是 `AGENT_PROTOCOL = 2`。`hello` 时用 `hmac.compare_digest` 比较令牌并核对协议；协议不同的主机和 agent 互相拒绝，并提示升级。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3317":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-175","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#远程主机","content":"一个 TCP 连接（可选 TLS）是一个（引擎，设备）的会话：`open`、`load`、`prepare_voice`、`synthesize`、`convert`、`edit`、`call`、`unload`、`status` 依次进行，`cancel` 和 `text` 随时可发。帧是带长度前缀的 JSON 或二进制（`core/remote/frames.py`，只用标准库）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3318":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-176","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#远程主机","content":"请求用到的文件（参考音频、音色缓存、权重）按 SHA-256 只传一次（`have` / `put`，每块 8 MB），agent 存在 `cache/remote/files` 里，30 天未用即清理；`prepare_voice` 写出的文件夹逐个文件传回。agent 每 5 秒发一次心跳。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3319":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-177","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#远程主机","content":"模型状态和引擎是否可用以 agent 为准（报告缓存 15 秒）；训练不能用远程引擎。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3320":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-178","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#远程主机","content":"用法见远程主机，客户端一侧见运行时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3321":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-179","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#设置","content":"`SettingsService` 管理 `settings.toml`（在数据目录，或 `MIZUOTO_CONFIG_DIR` / `config_dir` 指定的目录）。模型定义在 `mizuoto/core/settings/models.py`，分为 `server`、`paths`、`compute`、`downloads`、`tts`、`engines.<id>`、`training`、`outputs` 和 `remote` 几节。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3322":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-180","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#设置","content":"带 `MIZUOTO_` 前缀、层级之间用 `__` 连接的环境变量覆盖文件，如 `MIZUOTO_SERVER__PORT=8000`。`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR` 和 `MIZUOTO_CONFIG_DIR` 例外：它们选择目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3323":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-181","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#设置","content":"宿主应用可以用 `settings_overrides` 钉死某些值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3324":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-182","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#设置","content":"每秒检查一次文件是否被外部修改；无论改动来自哪里，都以点分键名（`changed_keys`）通知 `on_keys_change` 的监听器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3325":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-183","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#设置","content":"读取文件时，模型里没有的键会被忽略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3326":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-184","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#设置","content":"每个设置项的含义见配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3327":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-185","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#数据目录与兼容性","content":"数据目录默认是平台用户数据目录下的 `mizuoto`（Linux 上是 `~/.local/share/mizuoto`，Windows 上是 `%APPDATA%` 下，macOS 上是 `~/Library/Application Support` 下），`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR` 可以指定别处。它包含 `models/`（含 `_assets/`）、`voices/`、`outputs/`、`datasets/`、`experiments/`、`projects/`、`cache/`（含 `scratch/<引擎>/`，请求的临时目录）、`uploads/`、`logs/`、`jobs/`（任务日志）、`server.json`（正在运行的服务器的地址和进程号）和 `mizuoto.db`。大多数目录可以用 `paths.*` 移到别处。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3328":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-186","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#数据目录与兼容性","content":"已安装的模型、音色、数据集、实验和项目都是带 JSON 附属文件的文件夹（`model.json`、`voice.json`、`dataset.json`、`experiment.json`、`project.json`），而不是数据库行：没人需要查询它们，扫描文件夹也不会与文件本身不一致。数据库（`mizuoto/core/db/database.py`：一个共享连接，WAL 模式，`PRAGMA user_version` 记录已运行的迁移，迁移只追加）只存需要查询的内容：任务（含请求 JSON 和所属进程号）、输出（含实际参数、耗时和许可标签）、音频文件、转写、预设和客户端状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3329":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-187","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#数据目录与兼容性","content":"升级时磁盘上的东西这样延续：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3330":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-188","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#数据目录与兼容性","content":"模型文件夹和模型文件清单、音色（文件夹、参考音频、权重）、输出、数据集、实验、项目和预设都原样可用。只校验清单里的文件，所以清单删掉的旧文件留着也无害。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3331":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-189","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#数据目录与兼容性","content":"`settings.toml` 的键保持不变；某个版本改名或删除的键会被忽略。数据库只追加迁移。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3332":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-190","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#数据目录与兼容性","content":"音色缓存的键含 Mizuoto 版本（以及需要接受许可的引擎的发行包版本），升级后第一次使用时重建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3333":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-191","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#数据目录与兼容性","content":"主机和它的远程 agent 必须使用同一个协议版本，不同时互相拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3334":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-192","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#数据目录与兼容性","content":"一个任务记录它所属的进程；打开数据目录时，只有进程已经不在的任务才标为 `interrupted`，所以另一条命令不会打断正在进行的渲染。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3335":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-193","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#记录的文件路径","content":"数据目录可以被移动、改名、复制或通过链接打开，数据库必须跟着它走。所以 `outputs.path` 和 `audio_files.path` 对数据目录内的文件记录相对于数据目录的路径（`outputs/2026-10/a.wav`，所有平台都用 `/`），对其他位置的文件（服务器路径、设在数据目录之外的结果目录）记录绝对路径。这条规则由 `mizuoto/core/storage.py` 负责（`StorageService.store` / `resolve`，基于 `core/files.py` 的 `to_stored` / `from_stored`）；对外给出的记录（`Output.path`、`AudioFile.path`）是文件此刻在磁盘上的绝对路径，文件不在时 `missing` 为真。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3336":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-194","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#记录的文件路径","content":"**在新位置打开**：`meta` 表（迁移 3）记录上次打开的位置（`data_dir`）。位置不同或没有记录（相对路径之前的数据库，处处是绝对路径）时，`StorageService.reconcile` 把数据目录内文件的记录一次性改写为相对路径，在一个 `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` 事务中完成，几个进程同时打开同一目录时也只做一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3337":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-195","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#记录的文件路径","content":"**重新找到**：文件不在记录的位置时，按记录路径的末尾几段到数据目录、结果目录和缓存目录下查找（`relocations`，能读两种平台的分隔符，所以 Windows 上写的数据库在 Linux 容器里也能用）。候选文件必须与记录的大小一致，音频文件还须与记录的 SHA-256 一致；找到后改写记录。对指向数据目录之外的记录，数据目录内的副本优先于原文件：复制出来的数据目录绝不能读取或删除原目录的文件（以前全是绝对路径时确实会这样）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3338":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-196","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#记录的文件路径","content":"**缺失**：哪里都找不到的文件报 `not_found`，`detail.reason` 为 `file_missing`（`codes.FILE_MISSING`；另有 `detail.recorded`、`detail.path`），从不跳过：打包下载会拒绝它，或在 `skip_missing` 时（界面的 **全部下载**）列在 `MISSING.txt` 里；删除这条结果只删记录，不把任何文件移到回收站。`mizuoto output check`（`POST /outputs/check`，`StorageService.check`）列出所有记录，改写它们（`--fix`），把某个已移动的外部目录下的记录指向新位置（`--rebase OLD NEW`），并删除缺失文件的记录（`--prune-missing`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3339":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-197","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#记录的文件路径","content":"相对的 `paths.*` 目录位于数据目录内，而不是当前工作目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3340":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-198","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#记录的文件路径","content":"数据库架构比当前版本新时会记录日志（旧版 Mizuoto 会把新版写的相对记录显示为缺失，但不会删除任何东西）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3341":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-199","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#事件","content":"`mizuoto/core/events/models.py` 里的每个事件都是带 `__event_name__` 的 `Record`：`job_updated`、`job_log`、`jobs_cleared`、`outputs_added` / `outputs_removed`、`voices_changed`、`models_changed`、`presets_changed`、`engines_changed`、`runtime_changed`（已加载的模型和各引擎的状态，即 `RuntimeStatus`）、`compute_changed`、`settings_changed`、`datasets_changed`、`projects_changed`、`experiments_changed`、`train_metrics`。`EventBase.get_events()` 收集所有子类；`mizuoto/api/openapi.py` 把它们写进 OpenAPI 模式，界面据此为 socket 生成类型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3342":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-200","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#事件","content":"`LocalEventBus.publish()` 在发布线程上同步调用每个处理函数；需要在别处（asyncio 循环）运行的订阅者自己转交。`RuntimeService` 发布 `runtime_changed` 的频率最多每 0.5 秒一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3343":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-201","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"每个耗时操作都是一个任务。各服务在构建时用 `jobs.register(kind, factory)` 注册工厂函数，由它把请求（纯 JSON）变成 `JobSpec`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3344":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-202","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"已注册的种类有 `speak`、`voice_prepare`、`convert`、`edit`、`engine_op`、`transcribe`、`model_download`、`asset_download`、`dataset_prepare`、`train`、`project_render` 和 `project_export`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3345":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-203","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"资源有名字和容量。调度器只在任务所需的每种资源都有空位时才运行它；否则任务处于 `waiting`，`waiting_for` 写明哪种资源满了：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3346":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-204","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"资源","locale":"zh-CN"},"3347":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-205","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"容量","locale":"zh-CN"},"3348":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-206","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"使用者","locale":"zh-CN"},"3349":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-207","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"`cpu`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3350":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-208","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"一半的核心数","locale":"zh-CN"},"3351":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-209","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"默认；数据集准备；在 CPU 上的训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"3352":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-210","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"`io`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3353":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-211","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"4","locale":"zh-CN"},"3354":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-212","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"模型和共享资源的下载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3355":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-213","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"`gpu:<设备>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3356":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-214","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"`compute.gpu_jobs`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3357":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-215","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"该设备上的推理和训练；等它的任务可以**强制运行**（`run_anyway`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3358":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-216","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"`inference`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3359":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-217","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"`compute.inference_jobs`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3360":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-218","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"所有合成任务（`speak`、`convert`、`edit`），不论引擎和设备；一个微批次算一个任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"3361":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-219","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"`engine:<引擎>:<设备>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3362":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-220","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"1","locale":"zh-CN"},"3363":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-221","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"一个已加载的引擎一次只服务一个请求；训练也占用它","locale":"zh-CN"},"3364":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-222","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"`project:<id>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3365":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-223","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"1","locale":"zh-CN"},"3366":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-224","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"一个项目的渲染（它再提交普通的 speak 任务）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3367":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-225","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#任务与命名资源","content":"`JobContext` 是运行中的任务汇报进度、检查取消的接口：`progress`、`step`、`message`、`log`、`transfer`（5 秒窗口的下载速度）、`check_cancel`、`cancel_event`（作为 `EngineRequest.cancel` 交给引擎）、`run_worker(WorkerTarget, …)`（任务 worker，如训练阶段，读取它的 JSON 行事件；任何一行输出都会重置看门狗），以及微批处理用的 `adopt` / `complete` / `fail` / `release`。任务会记录自己的进程号；打开数据目录时，只有进程已经不在的任务才被标为 `interrupted`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3368":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-226","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#微批处理","content":"开启 `tts.micro_batch` 时，若变体有 `batch` 能力且 `max_batch > 1`，请求只有一段、没有种子（批处理时随机数的取法不同）且不是流式，`TtsService._batch_group()` 就给 speak 任务一个 `JobSpec.group`，即除文本外所有内容的哈希。正在运行的任务在调用引擎前调用 `JobContext.adopt(max_batch - 1)`，取走同组里最早排队的任务，发一个 `texts` 包含全部文本的 `SynthesisTask`；引擎以 `segment = i` 产出第 *i* 段文本的音频块，任务为每个任务各存一份输出，并用 `complete()` / `fail()` 结束被带上的任务。批处理调用失败时，它们被 `release()` 回队列，各自运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3369":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-227","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`mizuoto/core/errors.py` 包含全部错误类型。每个类都带 `code`、`http_status` 和 `exit_code`，两个前端机械地转换：API 把任何 `MizuotoError` 变成 `{\"code\", \"message\", \"detail\"}`（`mizuoto/api/errors.py`）；CLI 把它变成退出码，并把 `detail[\"hint\"]` 作为第二行打出（`cli/factory.report_error`）。错误码字符串在 `mizuoto/core/codes.py`（只用标准库），所以引擎和训练阶段不需要 pydantic，抛出 `EngineError(message, detail, code=codes.…)` 即可，核心再用 `error_from_code()` 还原成对应的类。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3370":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-228","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"异常","locale":"zh-CN"},"3371":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-229","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`code`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3372":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-230","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"HTTP","locale":"zh-CN"},"3373":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-231","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"退出码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3374":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-232","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`MizuotoError`（基类）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3375":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-233","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`internal_error`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3376":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-234","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"500","locale":"zh-CN"},"3377":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-235","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"1","locale":"zh-CN"},"3378":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-236","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`NotFoundError`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3379":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-237","p