e-305","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`timeout`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3448":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-306","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"504","locale":"zh-CN"},"3449":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-307","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"11","locale":"zh-CN"},"3450":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-308","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`DownloadError`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3451":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-309","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`download_failed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3452":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-310","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"502","locale":"zh-CN"},"3453":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-311","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"12","locale":"zh-CN"},"3454":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-312","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`InstallError`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3455":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-313","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`install_failed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3456":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-314","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"500","locale":"zh-CN"},"3457":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-315","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"13","locale":"zh-CN"},"3458":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-316","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`RemoteError`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3459":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-317","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`remote_unavailable`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3460":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-318","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"502","locale":"zh-CN"},"3461":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-319","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"14","locale":"zh-CN"},"3462":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-320","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`CancelledError`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3463":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-321","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`cancelled`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3464":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-322","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"499","locale":"zh-CN"},"3465":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-323","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"130","locale":"zh-CN"},"3466":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-324","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`compute_unavailable` 的 `detail[\"reason\"]` 区分 `out_of_memory` 与 `no_device`。任务 worker 的进程退出码另有约定（`codes.EXIT_*`）：`EXIT_RETRY = 75` 表示请求重跑，`EXIT_CANCELLED = 130` 表示已取消。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3467":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","type":"page","content":"开发约定","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-conventions","locale":"zh-CN"},"3468":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-0","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions","content":"为 Mizuoto 写代码要遵守的约定：代码风格、分层规则、原生代码的规则、结果一致性规则，新增命令、路由、设置和引擎选项的步骤，测试要求，双语文档和提交信息的格式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3469":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-1","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-conventions#代码风格","content":"代码风格","locale":"zh-CN"},"3470":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-2","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-conventions#分层规则","content":"分层规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"3471":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-3","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-conventions#原生代码的规则","content":"原生代码的规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"3472":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-4","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-conventions#结果一致性","content":"结果一致性","locale":"zh-CN"},"3473":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-5","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-conventions#新增东西的步骤","content":"新增东西的步骤","locale":"zh-CN"},"3474":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-6","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-conventions#测试要求","content":"测试要求","locale":"zh-CN"},"3475":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-7","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-conventions#文档","content":"文档","locale":"zh-CN"},"3476":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-8","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-conventions#提交信息","content":"提交信息","locale":"zh-CN"},"3477":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-9","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions","content":"本页列出改动 Mizuoto 时必须遵守的约定。大多数约定都有测试或检查守着：`python scripts/dev.py check` 通过，是一个改动可以合并的最低要求。每条约定背后的设计见整体架构和设计参考与决策。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3478":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-10","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#代码风格","content":"**Python ≥ 3.10**，支持 3.10–3.14。`ty` 以 3.10 为目标检查类型，所以不要用 3.11 之后才有的语法和标准库（`tomllib` 要有 `tomli` 回退）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3479":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-11","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#代码风格","content":"**ruff 与 ty 不锁版本**，`pyproject.toml` 把 `lint.select` 逐条写出（`E4`、`E7`、`E9`、`F`、`I`、`UP`、`B`、`SIM`、`RUF100`、`ANN`），所以升级 ruff 不会悄悄改变规则集。行宽 180，缩进 4。ty 以 `error-on-warning` 运行。`python scripts/dev.py format` 格式化并做安全的自动修复，`lint` 和 `typecheck-py` 只检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3480":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-12","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#代码风格","content":"**每个函数都有类型标注**（`mizuoto/` 和 `packages/native/` 下；测试和脚本除外）。`Any` 只用在值确实可以是任何东西的地方（JSON）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3481":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-13","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#代码风格","content":"**跨越 API 边界的模型都继承 `Record`**（`mizuoto/core/record.py`，pydantic v2，`json_schema_serialization_defaults_required`）：设置、请求、响应、事件、`--json` 的输出都是。有默认值的字段在输出模式里是必填的，生成的 TypeScript 类型因此与服务器实际发送的一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3482":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-14","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#代码风格","content":"**重依赖在函数内导入**：核心里的 av、numpy 热路径，命令行里的 fastapi、uvicorn，以及 `core/inference` 里的所有模型代码。`mizuoto version` 和 `mizuoto --help` 因此保持快速，测试会检查这一点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3483":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-15","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#代码风格","content":"**有类注解里用到 `list[...]` 的类不定义名为 `list` 的方法**（ty 会把这个名字解析成方法）。写成 `list_models`、`list_voices`、`list_presets`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3484":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-16","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#代码风格","content":"**标识符和时间**用 `mizuoto/core/clock.py`：`new_id(prefix)`（毫秒时间戳的十六进制加 8 个随机十六进制字符，大致按创建时间排序）和 `now_iso()`（UTC，毫秒，以 `Z` 结尾，可按文本排序）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3485":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-17","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#代码风格","content":"**错误只用 `mizuoto/core/errors.py` 的类**，错误码只在 `mizuoto/core/codes.py`。给用户的修复命令放在 `detail[\"hint\"]`，命令行会把它作为第二行打出，界面显示在错误下方。不要在路由或命令里自己拼 HTTP 状态码或退出码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3486":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-18","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#代码风格","content":"**日志**用 `mizuoto` 日志记录器（`logging.getLogger(__name__)` 位于 `mizuoto.*` 之下）；只有入口（`mizuoto/logger.py` 的 `setup_logging`）配置处理器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3487":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-19","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#代码风格","content":"与上游库逐行对应、需要保持可比对的代码（`mizuoto/nn/dsp/kaldi.py`，torchaudio 的 fbank）按原样保留，在 `pyproject.toml` 里单独豁免 lint 规则，而不是改写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3488":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-20","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#分层规则","content":"`tests/test_architecture.py` 用 `ast` 检查每个模块的导入，规则表见整体架构。要点：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3489":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-21","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#分层规则","content":"`core`、`api`、`cli` 永远不导入 torch、torchaudio、transformers、onnxruntime 或需要接受许可的引擎包，函数内也不行。`core` 只在 `core/inference` 的函数内部触及 `runtime`、`nn`、`engines` 和 `training`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3490":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-22","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#分层规则","content":"路由和命令很薄：解析输入、调用**一个**核心方法、整理输出。每个操作只有一个核心方法，所以 API 的 JSON 与命令行的 `--json` 形状相同。业务逻辑不进 `api/` 和 `cli/`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3491":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-23","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#分层规则","content":"引擎只导入 `runtime`、`nn`、`text`、`training`、`core.codes`、`core.inference.tasks` 和自己的包，**从不导入另一个引擎**。两个引擎共用的代码放进 `nn` 或 `runtime`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3492":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-24","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#分层规则","content":"`core/codes.py`、`core/jobs/events.py`、`core/jobs/jsonl.py`、`core/remote/frames.py` 和 `core/inference/tasks.py` 只用标准库：训练阶段、远程帧和引擎都要用它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3493":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-25","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#分层规则","content":"新加一个第三方依赖，要同时把它加到 `pyproject.toml` 和该层在 `tests/test_architecture.py` 里允许的列表中，并说明它为什么必要（见发布）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3494":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-26","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#原生代码的规则","content":"引擎、训练器、运行时和服务器共用一个进程，所以 `runtime`、`nn`、`text`、`engines` 和 `packages/native` 下的代码要守这些规则（细节见运行时）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3495":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-27","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#原生代码的规则","content":"**不改动进程级状态。** 不给全局随机数生成器播种，不改 `os.environ`、工作目录或 `sys.path`，不调用 `logging.basicConfig`、`torch.set_default_dtype`、`torch.use_deterministic_algorithms`、`torch.set_float32_matmul_precision`，不给 `torch.backends.*` 或 `torch._inductor.config` 赋值，不用 `sdpa_kernel`（它对所有线程切换 SDPA 的内核）。`compute.fast` 的那几个开关只在 `mizuoto/runtime/accel/features.py` 里设置，由主机和训练阶段调用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3496":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-28","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#原生代码的规则","content":"**随机数来自请求。** 用 `ctx.generator_for(device)` 和 `ctx.rng`，每个随机操作都显式传入生成器（`torch.randn(..., generator=g)`），并按上游的顺序、形状和设备抽取。`randn_like` 等不接受生成器的调用改写成等价的显式形式。上游在构建模型时从全局生成器抽过随机数的，用私有生成器重放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3497":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-29","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#原生代码的规则","content":"**加载不抽随机数。** 模块用 `runtime.ops` 的层构建（`ops.default` 跳过随机初始化），检查点严格加载（缺少或多出的键都是错误，除非引擎明确列为可忽略）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3498":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-30","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#原生代码的规则","content":"**加载在推理模式之外进行，参数保持 `nn.Module` 创建时的样子**（不调用 `requires_grad_(False)`）。CPU 上有两个会改变结果的内核陷阱：对非连续的三维输入，`F.linear` 在权重 `requires_grad` 或权重是推理张量（在 `torch.inference_mode()` 里创建）时会选用另一个内核，即使处在 `no_grad` 或推理模式下。上游的权重是需要梯度的普通参数，所以原生引擎也这样保留；请求仍在推理模式里运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3499":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-31","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#原生代码的规则","content":"**注意力都经过 `accel.attention(q, k, v, site=…)`**，不直接调用 SDPA 或它的 aten 内核，这样 `compute.attention` 才能切换后端（见注意力加速）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3500":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-32","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#原生代码的规则","content":"**不下载任何东西。** 引擎用的文件都是模型文件或共享资源，由 `ModelService` 下载并通过 `LoadSpec` 交给引擎。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3501":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-33","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#原生代码的规则","content":"**模块级缓存要以完整输入为键**（包括每个参数、dtype 和设备），或者干脆每次调用时构建。只按部分参数作键的全局缓存，会让同一进程里的第二种配置用上第一种的结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3502":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-34","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#原生代码的规则","content":"**按阶段放置组件，按请求估算显存。** 引擎用 `ctx.use` / `ctx.run` 把每个阶段需要的组件放上设备，在模块 `forward` 之外读取权重的模块要标成 `fixed`；需要 float64 的模块经 `DeviceService.float64_device` 放置。见显存管理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3503":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-35","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#原生代码的规则","content":"**可取消。** 每个循环（自回归 token、ODE 步、分段、束搜索步）里调用 `ctx.check_cancel()`。`Cancelled` 继承自 `BaseException`，不要用宽泛的 `except BaseException` 吞掉它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3504":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-36","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#结果一致性","content":"Mizuoto 的每个引擎都是对上游项目的移植，必须给出与上游**相同**的结果：在 CPU 上以 fp32、相同种子运行时，音频逐采样相同（训练器则是损失、学习率和保存的权重逐字节相同）。这条规则决定了很多写法：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3505":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-37","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#结果一致性","content":"**先复现，再修正。** 上游的怪癖（采样顺序、填充方式、对齐的边界情况）先原样复现，用对照工具证实一致；确有必要修正时，作为单独的改动，并记录偏差及原因。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3506":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-38","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#结果一致性","content":"**偏差要记录。** 每个与上游不同的地方（为了跨平台、为了不改全局状态、因为上游行为依赖线程时序等）写进该引擎的说明和设计记录 `AGENTS.md`，附上对照数字。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3507":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-39","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#结果一致性","content":"**提速不改变结果。** 性能工作（CUDA 图、同步消除、编译、内存流式加载）必须得到相同的 token、相同的音频；每一轮都用 `scripts/parity/perf.py` 和 `train_perf.py` 与上一轮对照（见性能工作）。确实会改变比特的优化（如 Qwen3-TTS 的 `fused_projections`、`compute.kv_cache = static`）只能是需要用户主动开启的选项，并在输出的参数里注明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3508":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-40","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#结果一致性","content":"GPU 上降精度运行时不要求逐比特相同，以模块级误差和统计指标判断。各层级的容差见测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3509":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-41","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#新增东西的步骤","content":"要新增","locale":"zh-CN"},"3510":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-42","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#新增东西的步骤","content":"步骤","locale":"zh-CN"},"3511":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-43","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#新增东西的步骤","content":"一条命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"3512":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-44","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#新增东西的步骤","content":"在 `mizuoto/cli/commands/` 写普通函数并提供 `--json`，在 `cli/app.py` 的 `get_app()` 中注册（名字和帮助写在注册处），加进 `tests/cli/test_cli.py` 的 `EXPECTED_TREE`。见新增一条命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"3513":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-45","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#新增东西的步骤","content":"一个路由","locale":"zh-CN"},"3514":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-46","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#新增东西的步骤","content":"核心方法（`Record` 进出）→ `api/routers/` 里带 `operation_id` 的路由 → `python scripts/dev.py typegen` 并提交 `schema.d.ts` → `tests/api/test_api.py`。见新增一个路由","locale":"zh-CN"},"3515":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-47","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#新增东西的步骤","content":"一个事件","locale":"zh-CN"},"3516":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-48","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#新增东西的步骤","content":"在 `core/events/models.py` 加 `EventBase` 子类（`__event_name__`），它自动进入 OpenAPI 模式；重新生成类型，并在界面的 `api/socket.ts` 里处理它","locale":"zh-CN"},"3517":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-49","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#新增东西的步骤","content":"一个设置项","locale":"zh-CN"},"3518":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-50","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#新增东西的步骤","content":"在 `core/settings/models.py` 对应的组里加字段，带默认值和说明文档字符串；需要界面时在 Settings 界面加控件、两种语言的文字和 `typegen`；在配置页面的两个语言版本里写明。`engines.<id>.*` 的改动会让该引擎的模型卸载，下次按新设置加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3519":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-51","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#新增东西的步骤","content":"一个引擎选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"3520":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-52","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#新增东西的步骤","content":"在清单里加 `[options.<名字>]`（或加载选项 `[load_options.<名字>]`），并在引擎的 `OPTION_SCHEMA` 里加同样的项，测试要求两者完全一致。见接入引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"3521":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-53","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#新增东西的步骤","content":"一种任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"3522":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-54","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#新增东西的步骤","content":"在服务的构造函数里 `jobs.register(kind, factory)`，工厂返回带资源（`engine:<引擎>:<设备>`、`gpu:<设备>`、`cpu`、`io`…）的 `JobSpec`；结束时会影响哪些列表，就在界面 `socket.ts` 的 `AFFECTS` 里登记","locale":"zh-CN"},"3523":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-55","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#新增东西的步骤","content":"一个引擎或训练器","locale":"zh-CN"},"3524":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-56","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#新增东西的步骤","content":"见接入引擎和训练器","locale":"zh-CN"},"3525":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-57","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#新增东西的步骤","content":"一个界面","locale":"zh-CN"},"3526":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-58","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#新增东西的步骤","content":"见 Web UI：只从 `@/ui` 取组件、只用令牌写样式、两种语言的文字同时加","locale":"zh-CN"},"3527":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-59","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#测试要求","content":"**每个改动都带测试**，并让 `python scripts/dev.py check`（lint、typecheck-py、test-py、test-web、typegen-check）通过。CI 在 Linux、Windows、macOS 和 Python 3.10–3.14 上运行同样的测试，所以注意路径、编码和换行在 Windows 上的行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3528":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-60","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#测试要求","content":"核心的行为用 dummy 引擎测（不需要 torch 和模型）；外部网络用 `httpx.MockTransport` 替代；测试用 `make_services` 得到隔离的数据目录和空环境变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3529":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-61","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#测试要求","content":"**改动引擎或训练器**：更新 `tests/engines_native/` 的小模型测试（包括模拟设备上的流式加载检查），用真实模型跑契约套件，并用对照工具与上游比较。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3530":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-62","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#测试要求","content":"API 改了就重新生成类型并提交，否则 `typegen-check` 失败。界面改动要通过规则测试（导入、令牌、布局、浮层、i18n 键一致）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3531":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-63","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#文档","content":"**两种语言。** 文档站的每个页面都有 `<slug>.mdx`（简体中文，默认语言）和 `<slug>.en.mdx`（英文），结构逐节对应；侧边栏是 `meta.json` 和 `meta.en.json`，顺序相同。测试检查每个中文页面都有英文版。README 也有两份（`README.md`、`README.zh-CN.md`），界面文字在 `en.ts` 和 `zh-CN.ts` 里，键必须一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3532":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-64","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#文档","content":"**改行为就改文档**：用户可见的变化写进使用教程、命令行或进阶页面，开发者需要知道的写进开发文档。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3533":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-65","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#文档","content":"**设计记录。** 仓库根目录的 `AGENTS.md` 记录代码实际做了什么、守着哪些规则、为什么，以及长期有效的发现（例如为得到与上游相同的输出复现了哪些行为）。改了设计或得出了新发现，就同时更新它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3534":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-66","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#文档","content":"中文页面沿用已有页面的术语（音色、合成、克隆、模型、引擎、共享资源、许可、任务……）。写清楚是什么、为什么，不写开发过程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3535":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-67","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#提交信息","content":"提交信息采用 `类型(范围): 摘要` 的格式，摘要用英文小写开头的祈使句或名词短语，说明改动做了什么：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3536":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-68","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#提交信息","content":"类型：`feat`（新功能）、`fix`（修复）、`perf`（不改变结果的提速）、`refactor`（不改变行为的重构）、`test`、`docs`、`build`（构建、CI、Docker）、`chore`（杂项）。不兼容的改动在类型后加 `!`，如 `refactor!:`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3537":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-69","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#提交信息","content":"范围是受影响的部分：`runtime`、`webui`、`training`、`models`、`scripts`、`site`，或引擎 id（`qwen3tts`、`gptsovits` 等）；跨越多处时可以写多个（`runtime,training`）或省略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3538":{"id":"/docs/development-conventions-70","page_id":"/docs/development-conventions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-conventions#提交信息","content":"正文说明为什么这样做、对照或测量的结果，以及有意保留的行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3539":{"id":"/docs/development-design","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"page","content":"设计参考与决策","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design","locale":"zh-CN"},"3540":{"id":"/docs/development-design-0","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design","content":"Mizuoto 的设计从哪里来：骨架的谱系，从 InvokeAI、ani2xcur、Material Design 3 和 ComfyUI 取了什么、没取什么，以及一张写明理由的设计决策表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3541":{"id":"/docs/development-design-1","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#谱系","content":"谱系","locale":"zh-CN"},"3542":{"id":"/docs/development-design-2","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"来自 InvokeAI：FastAPI 加单页应用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3543":{"id":"/docs/development-design-3","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#前端随-wheel-发布","content":"前端随 wheel 发布","locale":"zh-CN"},"3544":{"id":"/docs/development-design-4","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#端口选择","content":"端口选择","locale":"zh-CN"},"3545":{"id":"/docs/development-design-5","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#命令行typer-的注册方式","content":"命令行：Typer 的注册方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"3546":{"id":"/docs/development-design-6","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#material-design-3-的分层","content":"Material Design 3 的分层","locale":"zh-CN"},"3547":{"id":"/docs/development-design-7","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"来自 ComfyUI：运行时","locale":"zh-CN"},"3548":{"id":"/docs/development-design-8","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#设计决策","content":"设计决策","locale":"zh-CN"},"3549":{"id":"/docs/development-design-9","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"环境与发行","locale":"zh-CN"},"3550":{"id":"/docs/development-design-10","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"引擎与结果一致性","locale":"zh-CN"},"3551":{"id":"/docs/development-design-11","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"运行时与内存","locale":"zh-CN"},"3552":{"id":"/docs/development-design-12","page_id":"/docs/development-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-design#任务接口与数据","content":"任务、接口与数据","locale":"zh-CN"},"3553":{"id":"/docs/development-design-13","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design","content":"Mizuoto 不是从零设计的。它的应用骨架（核心服务、薄的 API 与命令行、随 wheel 发布的 Vue 界面、工具链）来自一系列同源项目，模型运行时借鉴 ComfyUI。本页记录这些来源里哪些被采用、为什么采用、哪些有意没有采用，最后列出塑造了现在这套代码的设计决策及其理由。代码是什么样的，见整体架构。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3554":{"id":"/docs/development-design-14","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#谱系","content":"项目","locale":"zh-CN"},"3555":{"id":"/docs/development-design-15","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#谱系","content":"是什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"3556":{"id":"/docs/development-design-16","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#谱系","content":"留给 Mizuoto 的","locale":"zh-CN"},"3557":{"id":"/docs/development-design-17","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#谱系","content":"SD Model Hub","locale":"zh-CN"},"3558":{"id":"/docs/development-design-18","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#谱系","content":"Stable Diffusion 模型管理器","locale":"zh-CN"},"3559":{"id":"/docs/development-design-19","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#谱系","content":"骨架本身：所有逻辑在 `core`、其上两个薄的入口（FastAPI 与 Typer），`build_services()` 组装服务，`Record` 基类，带 HTTP 状态码与退出码的领域错误，三层设置（宿主覆盖 > 环境变量 > 文件），事件总线与 socket 桥，安全中间件，端口绑定与 `server.json`，嵌入用的 `embed.py`，`scripts/dev.py`，以及用测试守住的分层规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"3560":{"id":"/docs/development-design-20","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#谱系","content":"Hanaikada","locale":"zh-CN"},"3561":{"id":"/docs/development-design-21","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#谱系","content":"同一骨架上的 AI 图片浏览器","locale":"zh-CN"},"3562":{"id":"/docs/development-design-22","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#谱系","content":"证明了骨架可以换领域复用；它的图片元数据与索引部分与 Mizuoto 无关","locale":"zh-CN"},"3563":{"id":"/docs/development-design-23","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#谱系","content":"rvc-next","locale":"zh-CN"},"3564":{"id":"/docs/development-design-24","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#谱系","content":"同一骨架上的 RVC 变声应用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3565":{"id":"/docs/development-design-25","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#谱系","content":"机器学习负载下的骨架：带命名资源和优先级的任务队列、持久化的请求与重试、任务 worker 与 JSON 行事件、显存持有者与内存不足后的释放、音色库、训练实验与阶段指纹；Material 3 前端（`theme/`、`ui/`、动效、浮层、外壳、store、i18n、规则测试）；文档站","locale":"zh-CN"},"3566":{"id":"/docs/development-design-26","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#谱系","content":"Mizuoto 0.1","locale":"zh-CN"},"3567":{"id":"/docs/development-design-27","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#谱系","content":"每个引擎一个 Python 环境和一个 worker 进程，上游代码原样 vendoring","locale":"zh-CN"},"3568":{"id":"/docs/development-design-28","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#谱系","content":"能力按变体声明、通用参数加引擎选项的两层参数、许可门控、音色与模型目录、参数映射；以及作为对照基准的行为（git 标签 `v1-engine-workers`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3569":{"id":"/docs/development-design-29","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#谱系","content":"Mizuoto 0.2","locale":"zh-CN"},"3570":{"id":"/docs/development-design-30","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#谱系","content":"一个环境，所有引擎在仓库内原生实现，运行在仿 ComfyUI 的运行时上","locale":"zh-CN"},"3571":{"id":"/docs/development-design-31","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#谱系","content":"现在的代码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3572":{"id":"/docs/development-design-32","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#谱系","content":"骨架是 GPL-3.0 的，Mizuoto 也是（`GPL-3.0-only`）。需要接受许可的两个引擎因为许可证不同而单独发布（见下文的决策表）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3573":{"id":"/docs/development-design-33","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"InvokeAI 的前后端结构是这个骨架的出发点。采用的部分：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3574":{"id":"/docs/development-design-34","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"**一份 OpenAPI 模式作为契约。** 每个路由有显式的 `operation_id`，输入输出都是 pydantic 模型。`mizuoto/api/openapi.py` 把每个事件模型和一个 `ServerEvents` 映射（事件名 → 模式）加进模式，所以 socket 推送的负载和 REST 一样有类型。`scripts/dev.py typegen` 用 `openapi-typescript` 生成 `schema.d.ts` 并提交，`typegen-check` 在 CI 里发现接口与类型的偏差。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3575":{"id":"/docs/development-design-35","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"**命令走 REST，socket 只推送。** socket.io 挂在 `/ws`，只从服务器发往客户端。REST 是事实来源，事件只用来修补或作废客户端的查询缓存；重连后重新拉取，丢掉的事件不会让界面过期。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3576":{"id":"/docs/development-design-36","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"**耗时工作是任务加事件**，请求本身很快返回；进度和取消随之而来。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3577":{"id":"/docs/development-design-37","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"**阻塞工作不进事件循环。** 访问磁盘和数据库的路由是普通 `def`（在线程池里运行）；任务线程上的事件用 `call_soon_threadsafe` 交给事件循环。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3578":{"id":"/docs/development-design-38","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"**薄路由加服务层**，每种资源一个路由模块，界面一侧每种资源一个查询模块，两边一一对应。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3579":{"id":"/docs/development-design-39","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"**相对地址加开发代理**：前端代码在开发和生产中使用同样的相对 URL。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3580":{"id":"/docs/development-design-40","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"界面偏好经 `/api/v1/client-state/{key}` 存到服务器，跟随用户换浏览器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3581":{"id":"/docs/development-design-41","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"有意不同的部分：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3582":{"id":"/docs/development-design-42","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"InvokeAI","locale":"zh-CN"},"3583":{"id":"/docs/development-design-43","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"Mizuoto","locale":"zh-CN"},"3584":{"id":"/docs/development-design-44","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"原因","locale":"zh-CN"},"3585":{"id":"/docs/development-design-45","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"静态的服务定位器 `ApiDependencies.invoker`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3586":{"id":"/docs/development-design-46","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"`app.state.services` 加 FastAPI 依赖 `ServicesDep`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3587":{"id":"/docs/development-design-47","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"路由的依赖写在签名里，测试可以传入隔离的服务；不需要图节点共享服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"3588":{"id":"/docs/development-design-48","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"多用户：JWT、滑动刷新、socket 房间、按用户脱敏","locale":"zh-CN"},"3589":{"id":"/docs/development-design-49","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"一个可选的访问令牌（Bearer 头、`mizuoto_token` cookie 或 `?token=`），加上 Host 检查（防 DNS 重绑定）和改变状态的请求的 Origin 检查；绑定到非回环地址时启动会警告","locale":"zh-CN"},"3590":{"id":"/docs/development-design-50","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"本地使用的单用户或可信小团队；复杂度只在多租户时才值得","locale":"zh-CN"},"3591":{"id":"/docs/development-design-51","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"运行时解析 `/openapi.json` 生成节点模板","locale":"zh-CN"},"3592":{"id":"/docs/development-design-52","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"只在构建时生成类型","locale":"zh-CN"},"3593":{"id":"/docs/development-design-53","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"后端类型不由用户扩展","locale":"zh-CN"},"3594":{"id":"/docs/development-design-54","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"React、Redux Toolkit、RTK Query","locale":"zh-CN"},"3595":{"id":"/docs/development-design-55","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"Vue 3、Pinia、TanStack Vue Query、`openapi-fetch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3596":{"id":"/docs/development-design-56","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-invokeaifastapi-加单页应用","content":"沿用骨架已有的前端","locale":"zh-CN"},"3597":{"id":"/docs/development-design-57","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#前端随-wheel-发布","content":"`mizuoto/webui/` 既是 Vue 项目，也是一个 Python 包。Vite 把界面构建到 `mizuoto/webui/dist/`；`dist/` 不入库，作为包数据进入 wheel，所以用户 `pip install` 之后不需要 Node 或 bun。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3598":{"id":"/docs/development-design-58","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#前端随-wheel-发布","content":"服务器通过包的 `__path__` 找到 `dist/`（`api/static.py` 的 `web_dist_dir()`），源码检出、已安装的 wheel 和容器里都是同一行代码。`SPAStaticFiles` 最后挂载，只接收 API、socket 和文档都不匹配的路径。没有构建产物时记一条警告，只提供 API，这是后端开发的正常状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3599":{"id":"/docs/development-design-59","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#前端随-wheel-发布","content":"未知路径只在请求接受 `text/html` 时回退到 `index.html`（客户端路由在刷新和深链接时有效），拼错的资源或 API 路径仍得到 404。`assets/` 下带内容哈希的文件缓存一年（`immutable`），其余（包括 `index.html`）`no-cache`，升级后浏览器不会拿旧界面配新后端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3600":{"id":"/docs/development-design-60","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#前端随-wheel-发布","content":"构建时 `base: './'`，运行时 `api/baseUrl.ts` 从入口脚本的 URL 推出部署根（最后一个 `/assets/` 之前的部分），路由用 hash 历史；同一份构建在根路径和 `--api-prefix` 子路径下都能用，无需改写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3601":{"id":"/docs/development-design-61","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#前端随-wheel-发布","content":"界面在 wheel 之前构建：`scripts/build_wheels.py` 先 `bun install --frozen-lockfile` 和 `bun run build`，再构建 sdist 和 wheel；Docker 用单独的 bun 阶段构建，最终镜像里没有 Node 工具链。见发布。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3602":{"id":"/docs/development-design-62","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#端口选择","content":"服务器用**绑定**而不是连接来判断端口是否可用（`mizuoto/core/net/ports.py` 的 `bind_first_free_port`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3603":{"id":"/docs/development-design-63","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#端口选择","content":"在配置的主机和端口上创建并绑定监听套接字；`EADDRINUSE` 或 `EACCES`（覆盖 Windows 的保留端口段）时试下一个端口，最多 20 次，从不超过 65535；全部失败时给出明确的错误。Windows 上用 `SO_EXCLUSIVEADDRUSE`，其他平台用 `SO_REUSEADDR`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3604":{"id":"/docs/development-design-64","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#端口选择","content":"绑定好的套接字直接交给 uvicorn（`server.run(sockets=[sock])`），检查和监听之间没有空档。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3605":{"id":"/docs/development-design-65","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#端口选择","content":"严格模式（`server.strict_port`、`--strict-port`）在端口被占用时失败而不顺延，适合端口映射固定的反向代理和容器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3606":{"id":"/docs/development-design-66","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#端口选择","content":"实际端口告诉其他程序：标准输出打印一行 `SERVER_READY url=…`，数据目录写入 `server.json`（主机、端口、URL、进程号），关闭时删除。`mizuoto runtime` 等命令据此找到正在运行的服务器。前端从自己被加载的 URL 推出后端地址，不需要额外通知。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3607":{"id":"/docs/development-design-67","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#命令行typer-的注册方式","content":"命令行沿用 ani2xcur 的 Typer 布局：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3608":{"id":"/docs/development-design-68","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#命令行typer-的注册方式","content":"`mizuoto/cli/app.py` 的 `get_app()` 在一个函数里注册所有命令和命令组，名字和帮助文字写在注册处；这个文件就是整个命令行的目录。命令函数（`cli/commands/*.py`）是不带装饰器的普通函数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3609":{"id":"/docs/development-design-69","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#命令行typer-的注册方式","content":"应用在函数里构建而不是在导入时，测试每次拿到全新的应用；`tests/cli/test_cli.py` 的 `EXPECTED_TREE` 比较整棵命令树，漏注册会失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3610":{"id":"/docs/development-design-70","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#命令行typer-的注册方式","content":"`typer_factory()`（`cli/factory.py`）给每个应用和命令组同样的设置；`DebugOptionTyper`、`DebugTyperCommand` 和 `AlphabeticalMixedGroup` 让 `--debug` 在每一层都可用，帮助按字母排序。对 Typer 私有模块 `typer._click` 的导入只在这个文件里，`typer` 的版本上限也锁住了（`<0.28`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3611":{"id":"/docs/development-design-71","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#命令行typer-的注册方式","content":"`main()` 自己处理错误：`MizuotoError` 打印消息和 `detail[\"hint\"]` 并以它的退出码退出，Ctrl+C 退出码 130，其他异常打印回溯并退出码 1。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3612":{"id":"/docs/development-design-72","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#命令行typer-的注册方式","content":"重依赖在命令函数里导入，`mizuoto version` 不加载 FastAPI 或 torch。`python -m mizuoto` 与 `mizuoto` 等价。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3613":{"id":"/docs/development-design-73","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#material-design-3-的分层","content":"界面采用 Material Design 3，分两层：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3614":{"id":"/docs/development-design-74","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#material-design-3-的分层","content":"**令牌层**（`mizuoto/webui/src/theme/`）：颜色角色 `--md-sys-color-*` 由 `@material/material-color-utilities` 的 Tonal Spot 方案从一个种子色（默认 `#4f6b3a`）生成，有亮色、暗色和三档对比度；字号、圆角、动效、状态层都是 Google 官方名字的 CSS 变量。界面里只用令牌，不写字面颜色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3615":{"id":"/docs/development-design-75","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#material-design-3-的分层","content":"**组件层**（`src/ui/`）：`@material/web` 已有的组件（按钮、图标按钮、FAB、复选框、筛选 chip、分隔线、文本框、滑块、进度条、开关、标签页）包一层项目自己的 Vue 组件，其余（外壳、导航、对话框、侧栏、菜单、卡片、提示条、步骤条、图表、波形……）用令牌自己实现。业务代码只从 `@/ui` 导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3616":{"id":"/docs/development-design-76","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#material-design-3-的分层","content":"`@material/web` 处于维护模式、组件集不再增长，包装层把这个风险限制在 `src/ui/` 内：某个组件出问题时在这里替换，业务代码不变。MUI 没有采用（它实现的是 Material Design 2），M3 Expressive 也没有采用。图标用 Lucide（只在 `ui/icons.ts` 导入），字体 Roboto Flex 随包自带，不从外部加载。细节见 Web UI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3617":{"id":"/docs/development-design-77","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"模型运行时（`mizuoto/runtime/`）借鉴 ComfyUI。ComfyUI 是模式来源，不是被采用的代码库：Mizuoto 保留自己的服务、任务、API、命令行和界面，代码注释写明每处对应的 ComfyUI 概念。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3618":{"id":"/docs/development-design-78","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"取自 ComfyUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"3619":{"id":"/docs/development-design-79","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"在 Mizuoto 里","locale":"zh-CN"},"3620":{"id":"/docs/development-design-80","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"设备与内存管理（`model_management.py`）：设备探测、可用显存（驱动空闲加上 torch 已缓存未使用的）、显存预留、硬件精度表、`load_models_gpu` 与最近使用顺序、部分加载与动态显存、内存不足后卸载全部空闲模型、锁页内存预算","locale":"zh-CN"},"3621":{"id":"/docs/development-design-81","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"`runtime/device.py`（`DeviceService`）、`runtime/manager.py`（`ModelManager`）、`runtime/policy.py`、`runtime/stream.py`，都是服务对象而不是模块全局变量。见显存管理","locale":"zh-CN"},"3622":{"id":"/docs/development-design-82","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"模型包装（`ModelPatcher`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3623":{"id":"/docs/development-design-83","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"`runtime/handle.py` 的 `ModelHandle`，去掉了扩散相关的部分：整体或部分放置、按单元流式加载权重、主机副本","locale":"zh-CN"},"3624":{"id":"/docs/development-design-84","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"`ops` 注入（`comfy.ops`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3625":{"id":"/docs/development-design-85","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"`runtime/ops.py`：`ops.default` 不做随机初始化（构建快、加载不抽随机数），`ops.cast` 在每次前向时把权重转成输入的精度和设备","locale":"zh-CN"},"3626":{"id":"/docs/development-design-86","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"注意力选择（一个签名、SDPA 为默认、可选后端带保护地导入并回退）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3627":{"id":"/docs/development-design-87","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"`runtime/accel/`：每个注意力调用点经 `accel.attention`，后端由 `compute.attention` 选择，自检、约束检查和回退。见注意力加速","locale":"zh-CN"},"3628":{"id":"/docs/development-design-88","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"加载与识别（safetensors 或 `weights_only` 的 pickle、键名替换）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3629":{"id":"/docs/development-design-89","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"`runtime/loading.py`，默认严格加载；识别先看模型目录的明确元数据（大小与 SHA-256），再由各引擎的 `detect_variant` 只看文件判断","locale":"zh-CN"},"3630":{"id":"/docs/development-design-90","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"仓库内的语言模型代码（不依赖 transformers 的 Qwen/Llama 家族、带种子的生成器、逐 token 中断）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3631":{"id":"/docs/development-design-91","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"`runtime/lm/`（Qwen2/3 解码器，复现 transformers 的数值）、`runtime/sampling.py`、`runtime/graphs.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3632":{"id":"/docs/development-design-92","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"音频信号处理的移植（不依赖 torchaudio）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3633":{"id":"/docs/development-design-93","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"`mizuoto/nn/dsp/`，与 torchaudio、librosa、Whisper 逐比特一致","locale":"zh-CN"},"3634":{"id":"/docs/development-design-94","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"没有采用的：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3635":{"id":"/docs/development-design-95","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"**模块级可变全局变量**（显存状态、已加载模型列表、中断标志、深处读取的命令行参数）。Mizuoto 用 `Services` 和设置对象，设备和取消令牌显式传递，因为 CPU 任务和 GPU 任务可以同时运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3636":{"id":"/docs/development-design-96","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"**巨大的文件和长 `if` 链**（例如按顺序匹配的模型识别表）。每个引擎在自己的包里有自己的识别、配置和构建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3637":{"id":"/docs/development-design-97","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"**节点图和自定义节点生态。** 一个有类型的引擎注册表加入口点就够了，需要接受许可的引擎正是这样注册的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3638":{"id":"/docs/development-design-98","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"扩散相关的机制（采样器、钩子、ControlNet），以及把语言模型当作文本编码器运行的做法。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3639":{"id":"/docs/development-design-99","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"**对 `comfy-aimdo`（原生显存分配器）和锁定版本的 `comfy-kitchen` 的依赖。** 显存管理用 torch 自己的分配器实现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3640":{"id":"/docs/development-design-100","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#来自-comfyui运行时","content":"**有意偏离参考实现的数值**（例如默认启用融合的 RMSNorm）。Mizuoto 默认路径上保持参考数学，融合等会改变比特的做法只作为可选项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3641":{"id":"/docs/development-design-101","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#设计决策","content":"下表列出塑造了现在这套代码的决策：决定了什么，为什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3642":{"id":"/docs/development-design-102","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"决策","locale":"zh-CN"},"3643":{"id":"/docs/development-design-103","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"理由","locale":"zh-CN"},"3644":{"id":"/docs/development-design-104","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"一个 Python 环境，所有引擎在仓库内原生移植，在服务器自己的进程里运行；不 vendoring 上游代码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3645":{"id":"/docs/development-design-105","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"引擎之间的依赖冲突（transformers 4.51 到 5.3、torch 2.3 与 2.8、numpy 1 与 2）都来自上游对库内部接口的使用和版本锁，而不是模型本身的需要。移植后一个 torch、一套依赖即可，引擎环境、worker 进程和进程间协议都不再需要","locale":"zh-CN"},"3646":{"id":"/docs/development-design-106","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"进程内运行的代价（原生代码崩溃会拖垮服务器、无法靠进程退出释放内存）由规则补偿","locale":"zh-CN"},"3647":{"id":"/docs/development-design-107","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"原生代码不改全局状态（有测试），每个请求后有残留检查，卸载真正释放内存；需要进程隔离时可以把引擎放到远程 agent 上；训练仍在子进程里","locale":"zh-CN"},"3648":{"id":"/docs/development-design-108","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"Fish Speech 和 IndexTTS 作为独立发行包（`mizuoto-fishspeech`、`mizuoto-indextts`），装进同一环境，经入口点组 `mizuoto.engines` 注册","locale":"zh-CN"},"3649":{"id":"/docs/development-design-109","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"它们的许可（Fish Audio Research License、bilibili Model Use License）覆盖代码，移植版是衍生作品，并入 GPL-3.0 的 `mizuoto` 会冲突","locale":"zh-CN"},"3650":{"id":"/docs/development-design-110","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"每个发行包有自己的版本，各自检查、各自发布；需要接受许可的包写明它适用的 Mizuoto 版本（`mizuoto>=0.2.0,<0.3`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3651":{"id":"/docs/development-design-111","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"修一个引擎不应等待、也不应强迫其他包发布。范围的两端都有测试：每次提交的 Mizuoto，以及范围允许的最旧发布版","locale":"zh-CN"},"3652":{"id":"/docs/development-design-112","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"torch 是依赖，但构建（CUDA、ROCm、XPU、MPS、CPU）由用户先装；`mizuoto doctor` 给出适合本机的安装命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"3653":{"id":"/docs/development-design-113","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"正确的构建取决于硬件和驱动，包管理器无法替用户选择","locale":"zh-CN"},"3654":{"id":"/docs/development-design-114","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"运行时不导入 transformers、onnxruntime、torchaudio、librosa","locale":"zh-CN"},"3655":{"id":"/docs/development-design-115","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"它们带来版本冲突、平台限制或全局状态；分词用 `tokenizers`、`tiktoken`、`sentencepiece`，ONNX 模型的权重由仓库内的协议缓冲区读取器转换成 torch 模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"3656":{"id":"/docs/development-design-116","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"只在平台受限的地方保留可选附加依赖：`gptsovits-ja`（`pyopenjtalk==0.4.1`，只有源码包）、`gptsovits-ko`、`mizuoto-indextts[ja]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3657":{"id":"/docs/development-design-117","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"必需的依赖在 CI 覆盖的每个平台上都有 wheel；缺少附加依赖时，相应语言的文本以 `capability_not_supported` 失败并给出安装命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"3658":{"id":"/docs/development-design-118","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"日语用 `pyopenjtalk==0.4.1` 而非 pyopenjtalk-plus；简繁转换用 C++ 的 `opencc==1.4.2`；中文分词用 `jieba` 代替 `jieba_fast`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3659":{"id":"/docs/development-design-119","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"pyopenjtalk-plus 改了 OpenJTalk 的规则（18% 的日语句子结果不同），纯 Python 的 OpenCC 结果不同；`jieba` 与 `jieba_fast` 词典相同、结果一致，且是纯 Python","locale":"zh-CN"},"3660":{"id":"/docs/development-design-120","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"可选的注意力包（flash-attn、xFormers、SageAttention）只作为后端，带版本检查、自检和回退，从不是依赖","locale":"zh-CN"},"3661":{"id":"/docs/development-design-121","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"它们只支持部分平台；默认路径必须处处可用且结果不变","locale":"zh-CN"},"3662":{"id":"/docs/development-design-122","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"一个 Docker 镜像包含服务器、界面和所有引擎；需要接受许可的引擎用 `GATED=1` 构建","locale":"zh-CN"},"3663":{"id":"/docs/development-design-123","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#环境与发行","content":"用户只需选择 torch 的构建；许可仍需在运行时接受","locale":"zh-CN"},"3664":{"id":"/docs/development-design-124","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"决策","locale":"zh-CN"},"3665":{"id":"/docs/development-design-125","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"理由","locale":"zh-CN"},"3666":{"id":"/docs/development-design-126","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"每个移植与参照逐采样一致（CPU、fp32、相同种子）；参照是 Mizuoto 0.1 实际调用上游的方式，而不是上游 demo 的调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3667":{"id":"/docs/development-design-127","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"用户的输出不应因换了实现而改变；0.1 有意与上游不同的地方（如 F5-TTS 按顺序而不是在线程池里生成多段）以 0.1 为准","locale":"zh-CN"},"3668":{"id":"/docs/development-design-128","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"先复现上游的怪癖，再把修正作为单独的改动；无产品价值的怪癖也复现（如 IndexTTS-1.5 在非 fp16 时不用 KV 缓存）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3669":{"id":"/docs/development-design-129","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"修正和移植混在一起会让对照失败变得含糊；行为一致是默认，偏差要有理由并记录","locale":"zh-CN"},"3670":{"id":"/docs/development-design-130","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"训练器复现上游配方，包括训练与推理不一致的地方（Qwen3-TTS 的训练不经 `text_projection`、Fish Speech 的训练不对码本嵌入做 1/√11 缩放）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3671":{"id":"/docs/development-design-131","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"这样损失、学习率和导出的权重与上游逐字节一致，导出的模型在两种实现里都能加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3672":{"id":"/docs/development-design-132","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"CosyVoice 以 torch 2.8 上运行的参照为基准","locale":"zh-CN"},"3673":{"id":"/docs/development-design-133","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"它自己的 torch 2.3.1 与 2.8 之间采样就会分叉","locale":"zh-CN"},"3674":{"id":"/docs/development-design-134","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"语音识别用原生的 Whisper large-v3-turbo，复现 0.1 的管线（30 秒重叠窗口、5 束搜索、窗口内的 seek 循环、合并）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3675":{"id":"/docs/development-design-135","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"转写完全相同，不依赖 CTranslate2 和 cuDNN 的版本搭配","locale":"zh-CN"},"3676":{"id":"/docs/development-design-136","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"Whisper 编码器在 ASR 引擎里，不与 CosyVoice 的语音分词器共享","locale":"zh-CN"},"3677":{"id":"/docs/development-design-137","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"s3tokenizer 的注意力（缩放方式、掩码）是另一种计算","locale":"zh-CN"},"3678":{"id":"/docs/development-design-138","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"CosyVoice 和 IndexTTS 的 CAM++ 不合并为一个共享资源；IndexTTS 2 与 2.5 各自文件夹里的 Qwen 情感模型也不合并","locale":"zh-CN"},"3679":{"id":"/docs/development-design-139","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"合并会让 CosyVoice 需要接受门控引擎的许可；情感模型在各模型仓库的文件夹里，共享意味着移动已安装模型的文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"3680":{"id":"/docs/development-design-140","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"模型目录只下载引擎会读的文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"3681":{"id":"/docs/development-design-141","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"例如 CosyVoice-BlankEN 的权重和 IndexTTS-2.5 从不读取的语义编解码器，徒占空间","locale":"zh-CN"},"3682":{"id":"/docs/development-design-142","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"GPT-SoVITS 用普通的 T2S，把它的每一步作为 CUDA 图重放，而不用上游的 CUDA 图版 T2S","locale":"zh-CN"},"3683":{"id":"/docs/development-design-143","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"上游的加速版会改变结果；重放即时执行的内核结果不变","locale":"zh-CN"},"3684":{"id":"/docs/development-design-144","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"VoxCPM 的文本规范化用 wetext 0.1.2 自带的 FST，随包发布","locale":"zh-CN"},"3685":{"id":"/docs/development-design-145","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"上游锁定 wetext 0.1.2，它的 FST 与 CosyVoice、IndexTTS 用的都不同","locale":"zh-CN"},"3686":{"id":"/docs/development-design-146","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"VoxCPM 的参照是上游自己的包","locale":"zh-CN"},"3687":{"id":"/docs/development-design-147","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"Mizuoto 0.1 没有 VoxCPM","locale":"zh-CN"},"3688":{"id":"/docs/development-design-148","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"能力静态声明（如 Qwen3-TTS 0.6B CustomVoice 是没有 `instruct` 的独立变体 `custom_voice_lite`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3689":{"id":"/docs/development-design-149","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"能力在加载模型之前就要知道，用于规划和界面","locale":"zh-CN"},"3690":{"id":"/docs/development-design-150","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"OmniVoice 只支持按属性设计音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"3691":{"id":"/docs/development-design-151","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"模型只接受封闭的属性词表","locale":"zh-CN"},"3692":{"id":"/docs/development-design-152","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"不提供 VoxCPM 的 ZipEnhancer 降噪、时间戳和 CUDA `optimize`；目录里没有 Fish Speech S2 Pro int8","locale":"zh-CN"},"3693":{"id":"/docs/development-design-153","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"前者需要另一个模型和 ModelScope 管线，且在上游默认的生成里都关闭；后者没有公开的 int8 仓库","locale":"zh-CN"},"3694":{"id":"/docs/development-design-154","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"F5-TTS 的许可登记为 `cc-by-nc-4.0`，不设门控，输出带标签","locale":"zh-CN"},"3695":{"id":"/docs/development-design-155","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#引擎与结果一致性","content":"那是权重的许可；非商用限制通过标签和提示告知","locale":"zh-CN"},"3696":{"id":"/docs/development-design-156","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"决策","locale":"zh-CN"},"3697":{"id":"/docs/development-design-157","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"理由","locale":"zh-CN"},"3698":{"id":"/docs/development-design-158","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"估算从不拒绝加载：放不下时部分加载、流式加载，最低限度也会尝试；只有真正分配失败才算错误，之后卸载所有 GPU 上的空闲模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"3699":{"id":"/docs/development-design-159","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"与 ComfyUI 相同；估算来自文件大小，拒绝会挡住本来能运行的请求","locale":"zh-CN"},"3700":{"id":"/docs/development-design-160","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"流式加载用单元和层上的 forward 钩子临时替换 `param.data`，不改 `ops` 层的代码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3701":{"id":"/docs/development-design-161","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"覆盖所有调用路径（`layer.forward_step`、`vae.decode`、自定义层），模型整体在设备上时没有任何开销","locale":"zh-CN"},"3702":{"id":"/docs/development-design-162","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"只有线性层和卷积层的权重流式加载，嵌入从不","locale":"zh-CN"},"3703":{"id":"/docs/development-design-163","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"码本嵌入常通过 `.weight` 直接读取（余弦搜索、`F.embedding`）；ComfyUI 同样只流式加载它的 ops 层","locale":"zh-CN"},"3704":{"id":"/docs/development-design-164","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"GPT-SoVITS 的 T2S 整体常驻设备","locale":"zh-CN"},"3705":{"id":"/docs/development-design-165","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"它的块经 `prompt` / `step` 直接读取融合的投影权重；模型只有 150 MB","locale":"zh-CN"},"3706":{"id":"/docs/development-design-166","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"只为部分解码器提供分块回退（ASR、GPT-SoVITS、F5-TTS 的 Vocos、Fish Speech 的编解码器、IndexTTS 2 的 BigVGAN、OmniVoice 的音频分词器、VoxCPM 的 VAE）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3707":{"id":"/docs/development-design-167","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"Qwen3-TTS 的编解码器本来就分块解码；CosyVoice 的 HiFT 带有贯穿全句的相位，分块会破坏它；其余都很短","locale":"zh-CN"},"3708":{"id":"/docs/development-design-168","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"训练前估算显存超出时只在日志里警告并给出能放下的预设，不拒绝","locale":"zh-CN"},"3709":{"id":"/docs/development-design-169","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"估算按方法和预设在一块 GPU（RTX 3090）上以配方默认批量校准；数据和其他 GPU 会使它偏离","locale":"zh-CN"},"3710":{"id":"/docs/development-design-170","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"训练显存工具只提供保持结果的手段和少数轻微改变结果的手段；不提供 Adafactor 或内存不足时拆分 micro-batch","locale":"zh-CN"},"3711":{"id":"/docs/development-design-171","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"后者改变训练配方，超出预设的承诺","locale":"zh-CN"},"3712":{"id":"/docs/development-design-172","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"`compute.max_resident_models` 全局限制常驻模型数（默认 3），最久未用的空闲模型先卸载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3713":{"id":"/docs/development-design-173","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"所有引擎的模型共用一个进程和它的内存","locale":"zh-CN"},"3714":{"id":"/docs/development-design-174","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"主机探测设备时不导入 torch：先问 nvidia-smi、rocm-smi / amd-smi 和平台信息，只在 torch 的构建可能看到工具漏掉的 GPU 时才用子进程","locale":"zh-CN"},"3715":{"id":"/docs/development-design-175","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"列出设备、提供界面不应付出导入 torch 的一两秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"3716":{"id":"/docs/development-design-176",