-design-185","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#任务接口与数据","content":"理由","locale":"zh-CN"},"3726":{"id":"/docs/development-design-186","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#任务接口与数据","content":"命名资源与容量（`gpu:<设备>`、`engine:<引擎>:<设备>`、`inference`、`cpu`、`io`、`project:<id>`），而不是一个全局 GPU 锁","locale":"zh-CN"},"3727":{"id":"/docs/development-design-187","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#任务接口与数据","content":"按引擎和设备串行化同时覆盖推理和训练，不同设备上的工作可以并行","locale":"zh-CN"},"3728":{"id":"/docs/development-design-188","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#任务接口与数据","content":"一次训练运行是一个 `train` 任务，各阶段是它的步骤，每个阶段一个子进程；阶段在清单里静态声明","locale":"zh-CN"},"3729":{"id":"/docs/development-design-189","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#任务接口与数据","content":"整个运行持有一次设备；界面和指纹不必运行任何东西就知道有哪些阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"3730":{"id":"/docs/development-design-190","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#任务接口与数据","content":"任务 worker 的任何一行输出都重置看门狗，训练阶段另外每 10 秒发心跳","locale":"zh-CN"},"3731":{"id":"/docs/development-design-191","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#任务接口与数据","content":"会打日志的阶段显然还活着，不打日志的也有心跳","locale":"zh-CN"},"3732":{"id":"/docs/development-design-192","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#任务接口与数据","content":"只有只差文本、只有一段、没有种子的请求才合并为微批次","locale":"zh-CN"},"3733":{"id":"/docs/development-design-193","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#任务接口与数据","content":"批处理时随机数的取法不同；音色和参数是每次调用的","locale":"zh-CN"},"3734":{"id":"/docs/development-design-194","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deve