locale":"zh-CN"},"4435":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-293","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"5.90","locale":"zh-CN"},"4436":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-294","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"**4.88**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4437":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-295","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"×1.21","locale":"zh-CN"},"4438":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-296","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"开不开图，音频都相同，每次运行之间也相同；真实模型在这张卡上通过契约测试（8 项通过；2 项跳过：S2 Pro 不按 token 流式输出，且没有安装其他引擎）。无论开不开图，加载后的第一个请求都多花约 4 秒（声音的编码、首批内核的加载），所以捕获图的代价很小。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4439":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-297","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"使用图时一帧的 64 毫秒花在哪里（`--torch-profile`，clone-en，95 帧；设备 97 % 的时间在忙）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4440":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-298","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"**矩阵乘法，约 50 毫秒**。每帧读取约 16 GB 权重：36 个慢速层和共享的输出头（约 8 GB），以及每个码本读一遍的 4 个快速层（0.8 GB，十次）。3060 最多每秒传输 360 GB，所以一帧不可能少于约 45 毫秒。矩阵乘法达到了其中约 90 %。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4441":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-299","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"**每帧约 5,900 个小内核，约 14 毫秒**：归一化、旋转位置编码、残差相加、采样和 eager 注意力。无论大小，每个内核都要占用设备几微秒。图去掉了 CPU 的启动开销，去不掉这部分。只有融合内核才能去掉它，而融合会改变舍入（只能作为可选项，就像其他引擎的 `compute.compile`）。Fish Speech 没有编译路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4442":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-300","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"**慢速层的 eager 注意力，在 300 个位置时每帧约 6 毫秒**，随上下文变长而增加。600 个键时，一次调用在 22 个内核里占 330 微秒设备时间：增长缓存的 `cat`、从 8 头到 32 头的 `repeat_interleave`、数学内核对键的缩放副本、两次乘法以及把掩码转成加性掩码。在 3060 上检查了三种精确改写，在长度 150 到 1,280 上与当前调用逐位比较：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4443":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-301","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"不传掩码（这一步的掩码全为真）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4444":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-302","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"原地写入缓存；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4445":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-303","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"让缓存保持展开为 32 头。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4446":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-304","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"前两种节省约 5 % 的注意力时间（不到一帧的 1 %）。第三种节省约 20 %（300 个位置时约为一帧的 2 %，1,200 个位置时 7 %），但在设备上要多存四倍的键和值。三种都没有采用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4447":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-305","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"`compute.compile`（可选，不精确；加速）在同样的 CUDA 图里把这些小内核融合起来。显卡和条件相同：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4448":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-306","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"用例","locale":"zh-CN"},"4449":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-307","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"默认","locale":"zh-CN"},"4450":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-308","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"