","content":"3.68","locale":"zh-CN"},"4642":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-500","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"1.02，首段音频 0.14","locale":"zh-CN"},"4643":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-501","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"0.28","locale":"zh-CN"},"4644":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-502","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"—","locale":"zh-CN"},"4645":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-503","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"model+vae 1.02","locale":"zh-CN"},"4646":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-504","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"5,103","locale":"zh-CN"},"4647":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-505","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"峰值 MB 是请求的峰值分配量，包括进程里已加载的所有模型。GPT-SoVITS 的流式用例在第一个音频块之前解码完整段文本（首段音频 0.95 秒，共 0.96 秒）；VoxCPM 按块流式输出（0.14 秒）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4648":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-506","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"**重复性。** 在默认模式下，每个用例在同一进程的多次运行之间、以及在新进程中都给出相同的音频，只有 VoxCPM 2 的第一个请求例外。`--deterministic` 会改变 CosyVoice 2、IndexTTS 2、OmniVoice 和 VoxCPM 的二进制位（cuBLAS 和 cuDNN 选了别的算法），同样可以重复，并且没有列出任何缺少确定性内核的运算。所以之后的 GPU 轮次在默认模式下精确比较输出，丢弃 VoxCPM 的第一个请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4649":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-507","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"**VoxCPM 的第一个请求。** Snake 是 TorchScript 函数，与上游一样。在 CUDA 上，TorchScript 的 profiling executor 对某个形状的第一次调用按单独的运算执行（与即时执行的代码和 CPU 逐位相同），之后改用融合内核，结果最多相差 4.8·10⁻⁷。没见过的形状会退回未融合的运算，直到它被分析过。因此哪些调用被融合取决于进程之前解码过什么，在加载时预热也不能让每个请求都重复。关闭融合器后（仅为实验；原生代码从不设置它），第一个请求与之后的请求一致。融合器还在默认设备上编译内核：在 `cuda:1` 上工作的进程会在 `cuda:0` 上打开一个 256 MB 的上下文（在 VoxCPM 和 GPT-SoVITS 的训练中都观察到，后者的 WaveNet 门控同样是 TorchScript 函数）。CPU 不受影响（那里不做融合）。（之后已修复：Snake 以 eager 方式运行，每个请求都相同，也与 CPU 相同；VAE 慢约 1 %。见 VoxCPM。）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4650":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-508","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"**时间花在哪里**（在 torch 的 profiler 下多跑一次，按阶段统计设备忙碌时间，对比不开 profiler 时该阶段的预热时间；profiler 会拖慢主机一侧）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4651":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-509","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"受设备计算量限制（忙碌约 90 % 或更高）：F5-TTS 的 DiT、IndexTTS 的 s2mel、BigVGAN 和 1.5 的 GPT、CosyVoice 3 的 flow、Fish Speech、Qwen3-TTS 1.7B、VoxCPM 和 OmniVoice 的语言模型。（G2 中尝试把 OmniVoice 每步的前向捕获为 CUDA Graph，只快了 2 %。）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4652":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-510","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"受内核发出限制：GPT-SoVITS 的 GPT（约 56 %）和 CosyVoice 2 的语言模型（约 69 %）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4653":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-511","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"主机等待：每个自回归解码器大约每生成一个 token 等待一次（GPT-SoVITS v2 157 个 token 等待 157 次，Fish Speech 约 87 帧等待 92 次，Qwen3-TTS 约 73 帧等待 82 次），与设计一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4654":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-512","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"**工作内存**与各阶段的估计值比较（估计值必须不小于阶段实际用量）：语言模型只用到估计值的 2–17 %（Qwen3-TTS 的 talker 用 28 MB，估计 328 MB；Fish Speech 用 128 MB，估计 733 MB）。两个解码器用量超过估计：IndexTTS 1.5 的 BigVGAN 用 326 MB，估计 279 MB；VoxCPM 1.5 的 VAE 用 278 MB，估计 183 MB；VoxCPM 2 的 VAE 接近（190 MB 对 203 MB）。在显存紧张的 GPU 上由 OOM 重试兜底；这些估计值需要调高。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4655":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-513","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"**与 0.1 的 GPU 一致性**，限于 0.1 规定了 GPU 行为的情形（每边各运行两次；两边都能精确重复自身）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4656":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-514","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"用例","locale":"zh-CN"},"4657":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-515","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"0.1 在 GPU 上","locale":"zh-CN"},"4658":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-516","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"原生与 0.1 比较","locale":"zh-CN"},"4659":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-517","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"F5-TTS clone-en，fp16","locale":"zh-CN"},"4660":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-518","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"正常运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"4661":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-519","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"**逐样本相同**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4662":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-520","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","content":"IndexTTS v15-clone-en，fp16 GPT 带 KV 缓存","locale":"zh-CN"},"4663":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-521","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-基线g0","cont