ontent":"5,992 → 6,005","locale":"zh-CN"},"5037":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-895","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#不复制到内存的加载g10","content":"Fish S2 Pro","locale":"zh-CN"},"5038":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-896","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#不复制到内存的加载g10","content":"10.0–17.2 → 4.4–5.4","locale":"zh-CN"},"5039":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-897","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#不复制到内存的加载g10","content":"3,770 → 1,546","locale":"zh-CN"},"5040":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-898","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#不复制到内存的加载g10","content":"10,542 → 9,071","locale":"zh-CN"},"5041":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-899","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#不复制到内存的加载g10","content":"10,923 → 10,877","locale":"zh-CN"},"5042":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-900","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#不复制到内存的加载g10","content":"预热后的请求、重新载入（0.25–3.6 秒）和显存都没有变化。默认保留主机副本时，模型占用的内存无论如何都是它锁页的主机副本（锁页会复制文件的页面）。关闭主机副本时剩下的峰值来自加载前的 dtype 转换：它先写入模块自己的内存，随后才被检查点的张量替换（Fish S2 Pro：9 GB；见下文，已去掉）。什么都没加载的进程占用 0.43 GB。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5043":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-901","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#不复制到内存的加载g10","content":"**不复制的转换**（`loading.cast`，后续改动）：加载前的转换不再在内存里写出整个模型。关闭主机副本时，峰值内存（与加载后占用的内存现在相同）对比 0.2.26：Fish S2 Pro 9,071 → 1,507 MB，VoxCPM 2 4,757 → 1,524 MB，Qwen3-TTS 3,952 → 1,637 MB；加载再次变快（Fish S2 Pro 默认设置下 4.4–5.4 → 2.1 秒，关闭主机副本时 1.4 秒；VoxCPM 2 2.7 → 1.7 秒；Qwen3-TTS 1.9–2.4 → 1.4 秒）。默认设置下内存与之前相差不到 4%。输出完全相同。第一个版本自己逐个转换参数和缓冲区，跳过了模块自己的 `_apply`：`Rotary` 的 `inv_freq` 本由它的 `_apply` 保持 float32，却被舍入成 bfloat16，Qwen3-TTS 和 OmniVoice 的音频因此改变；现在经由 `_apply` 转换，与 `Module.to` 一样（五个引擎在 CPU 上以 bfloat16 用两种方式加载，所有张量完全相同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5044":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-902","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#不复制到内存的加载g10","content":"过程中发现：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5045":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-903","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#不复制到内存的加载g10","content":"**glibc 留住了释放的内存。** 没有 `trim_heap` 时，转换后释放的分配（每块都小于 glibc 32 MB 的 mmap 阈值）一直常驻：保留主机副本时，Qwen3-TTS 占用 7.2 GB 而不是 5.2 GB，VoxCPM 2 占用 9.0 GB 而不是 6.0 GB。改动之前，关闭主机副本时，同样的滞留也有 2–3 GB。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5046":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-904","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#不复制到内存的加载g10","content":"**CPU 上留在文件里的权重更慢。** IndexTTS 2 在 CPU 上、它 64 字节对齐的 pickle 留在文件里时，背靠背测得解码 48.8–49.1 秒，对比 43.0–43.3 秒（音频相同）；在同样的文件页面上做大的矩阵乘法并不更慢。现在 CPU 用来计算的权重总是复制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5047":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-905","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#不复制到内存的加载g10","content":"**在 CPU 设置之前导入了 torch。** 第一个版本在 `LocalEngine.load` 里、运行时应用 `compute.cpu_allocator` 和线程绑定之前就导入了 `runtime/loading.py`（也就导入了 torch）：所有 CPU 算子都慢了 40%（F5-TTS 由 42.8 秒变成 60 秒，注意力也一样）。现在有测试在新进程中加载模型并检查这个顺序。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5048":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-906","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#不复制到内存的加载g10","content":"**对齐。** 在这颗 CPU 上，对一行做 float32 的 `F.linear` 时，起始地址偏离 16 字节边界 8 字节的权重会得到不同的末位（bf16、fp16 以及两行以上：每个偏移都相同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5049":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-907","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"2026-11-04，RTX 3060（torch 2.8 + CUDA 12.8），G1 的长用例（约 30 秒语音），预热后的请求（每个进程两次），两种方式各两轮，交替进行。在语言模型上调用 `QwenDecoder.fuse`（每层的 q/k/v 与 gate/up 各合并为一次乘法，与 Qwen3-TTS 的 `fused_projections` 相同）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5050":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-908","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"5051":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-909","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"精确路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"5052":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-910","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"合并后","locale":"zh-CN"},"5053":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-911","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"音频","locale":"zh-CN"},"5054":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-912","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"CosyVoice 2，fp32（默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5055":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-913","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"10.42–10.45 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5056":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-914","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"10.31–10.32 秒（−1.1%）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5057":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-915","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"5058":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-916","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"CosyVoice 3，fp32","locale":"zh-CN"},"5059":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-917","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"12.17–12.19 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5060":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-918","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"12.04–12.06 秒（−1.1%）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5061":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-919","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"5062":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-920","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"CosyVoice 2，`fp16`（G12 之后）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5063":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-921","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"每秒音频 204 毫秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5064":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-922","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"200 毫秒（−1.8%）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5065":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-923","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"不同","locale":"zh-CN"},"5066":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-924","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"CosyVoice 3，`fp16`（G12 之后）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5067":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-925","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"198 毫秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5068":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-926","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"189 毫秒（−4.5%）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5069":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-927","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"不同","locale":"zh-CN"},"5070":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-928","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"OmniVoice（bf16）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5071":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-929","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"6.59–6.63 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5072":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-930","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"6.63–6.67 秒（+0.6%）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5073":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-931","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"不同","locale":"zh-CN"},"5074":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-932","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-和-omnivoice-的合并投影g11","content":"CosyVoice 2 和 3 提供这个选项（`engines.cosyvoice.load_options.fused_projections`，关；两个一致性用例在 CPU 上结果相同）。OmniVoice 的解码器每一步都在整个序列上运行，乘法已经足够大，把三次合并为一次省不下什么：不提供。当时 CosyVoice 2 用 `fp16` 比用 fp32 更慢（19.8 秒对 10.4 秒），而且每个进程里第一个请求的音频与之后的不同：在 G12 中找到并修正，见下文。（用 `fp16` 时合并后的音频长短不同，所以那两行比较的是每秒音频的耗时。）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5075":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-933","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-的-fp16g12","content":"2026-11-04，同一块 RTX 3060 和同样的长用例。在 `fp16` 下，语言模型的每个 token 都在各自的 autocast 区域中运行（引擎只在 `next()` 中运行），而 autocast 只在一个区域内保留权重的 float16 副本：每个 token 都要把语言模型的全部权重重新转换一次（一个短请求中有 47,416 次复制，占设备 0.5 秒）。上游在整个生成过程中只用一个区域。使用 CUDA graphs 时这还改变了音频：第一个请求的音频与之后的不同，两者又都与即时执行路径（上游的计算顺序）不同。现在在 `fp16` 下，语言模型的线性层以 float16 保存权重（即 autocast 转换得到的值；嵌入和归一化保持 float32）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5076":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-934","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-的-fp16g12","content":"修正前（每个请求）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5077":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-935","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-的-fp16g12","content":"修正后（每个请求，每秒音频的毫秒数）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5078":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-936","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-的-fp16g12","content":"fp32，作对比","locale":"zh-CN"},"5079":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-937","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-的-fp16g12","content":"CosyVoice 2，约 30 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5080":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-938","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-的-fp16g12","content":"19.8 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5081":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-939","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-的-fp16g12","content":"6.2 秒（204）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5082":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-940","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-的-fp16g12","content":"10.4 秒（345）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5083":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-941","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-的-fp16g12","content":"CosyVoice 3，约 31 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5084":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-942","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-的-fp16g12","content":"15.5 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5085":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-943","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-的-fp16g12","content":"6.1 秒（198）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5086":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-944","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-的-fp16g12","content":"12.2 秒（361）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5087":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-945","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-的-fp16g12","content":"音频（每个进程三个请求，各自取哈希）：修正前，即时执行每次给出同一段音频，graphs 在第一个请求给出另一段、之后又给出第三段；现在即时执行和 graphs 每个请求都给出即时执行的音频，两个模型都如此，与修正前的代码即时执行的结果相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5088":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-946","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#各模型的显存占用g13","content":"2026-11-04，RTX 3060 12 GB，默认设置（GPU 上为 bf16 或 fp16、CUDA graphs、主机副本），每个进程一个模型，运行它的短一致性用例和 G1 的长用例（约 30 秒语音），各两个请求。每个模型都是整个加载的。“进程”是 nvidia-smi 给出的该进程最大显存（包括 CUDA 上下文和分配器的缓存）；“torch”是 torch 占用的最大值（新的 `meta.memory.peak_mb`）。模型目录中的 `vram_mb`（网页界面显示为模型所需的显存，doctor 的 `fits` 也以它为依据）原先是估算值，现在是 torch 的数字向上取整（其余由保留量 `compute.vram_reserve_mb` 覆盖）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5089":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-947","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/de