performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#各模型的显存占用g13","content":"1,170","locale":"zh-CN"},"5168":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1026","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#各模型的显存占用g13","content":"2,500 → 1,200","locale":"zh-CN"},"5169":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1027","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#各模型的显存占用g13","content":"F5-TTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"5170":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1028","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#各模型的显存占用g13","content":"1,013","locale":"zh-CN"},"5171":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1029","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#各模型的显存占用g13","content":"799","locale":"zh-CN"},"5172":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1030","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#各模型的显存占用g13","content":"2,500 → 800","locale":"zh-CN"},"5173":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1031","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#各模型的显存占用g13","content":"Qwen3-TTS 1.7B CustomVoice 和 VoiceDesign 取 4,300（CustomVoice 的短用例：4,000），CosyVoice-300M 及其 instruct 版本取 SFT 的 1,900；这里没有测量的 Drama 3 和 F5-TTS 较早的 Base、E2 Base 保留原来的估算值。0.6B 的 Qwen3-TTS 模型、GPT-SoVITS v2Pro、v2ProPlus 和 v5 Turbo、IndexTTS 2.5 和 VoxCPM 0.5B 是同一天用同样方法测量的（CustomVoice 模型只有短用例）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5174":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1032","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#各模型的显存占用g13","content":"**集中传输：测过，不实现。** 让流式单元的权重从每个单元一个锁页缓冲区复制，而不是逐个张量复制（内存计划中的一项），能省下每次复制的固定开销。在同一块显卡上设 `vram_mode = none`（几乎所有权重都流式传输），Qwen3-TTS 的 talker 复制了 222 GB，共 32,543 次（每次 6.8 MB），速度 2.87 GB/s；OmniVoice 复制 26 GB，共 6,152 次，2.88 GB/s：这块显卡的链路（PCIe x4）一次复制 1 GB 是 2.85 GB/s，每次 1 MB 是 2.82 GB/s。在完整的 x16 链路（13.4 GB/s）上，一次 4–7 MB 的复制要 0.3–0.5 毫秒，相比之下每次复制几微秒的开销约为 1%。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5175":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1033","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"在 RTX 3090 上测量（2026-10-18），测试工具现在记录每个阶段中最紧的那一次调用（工作内存对比它自己的估算；一个阶段最大的工作内存和最大的估算可能来自不同的调用，例如参考音频的编码和解码）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5176":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1034","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"**解码器**，每个输出位置的字节数（在短文本和约 30 秒的文本上测量，再加五分之一）：VoxCPM 的 VAE 解码每个位置 1,277（1.5）和 643（2），原估算 256；参考音频编码每个采样 1,395 和 3,100，原估算 256；Fish Speech 的编解码器每个采样 1,922（自 G1 起非原地的 Snake 用得更多），原估算 384；IndexTTS 的 BigVGAN 1,057（2）以及 771 加 256 MB（1.5），原估算 256。提高之后，每一次解码器调用，无论冷启动还是预热、短文本、长文本还是 8 条一批（OmniVoice、GPT-SoVITS），都不超过估算的 82 %（IndexTTS 1.5 的 BigVGAN；Fish 的编解码器 73 %，VoxCPM 的 VAE 74 %）；所有阶段中最接近估算的是长文本上 IndexTTS 2 的 GPT，90 %，未改动且在估算之内。Qwen3-TTS 1.7B 在 8 GB 上限下完整加载；在 4 GB 下它的 talker 部分加载，`meta.memory.partial` 和日志说明是哪个组件、为什么、预算多少。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5177":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1035","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"**训练**，每种方法以配方的默认批量运行（G1 用的是测试夹具较小的批量），各预设下的峰值（MB）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5178":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1036","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"微调","locale":"zh-CN"},"5179":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1037","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"`standard`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5180":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1038","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"`low`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5181":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1039","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"`lowest`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5182":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1040","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"CosyVoice 2 / 3 `llm`（以及 2 的 `llm_flow`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5183":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1041","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"10,319 / 10,398","locale":"zh-CN"},"5184":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1042","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"9,691 / 9,693","locale":"zh-CN"},"5185":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1043","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"9,691 / 9,693","locale":"zh-CN"},"5186":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1044","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"F5-TTS `full`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5187":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1045","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"8,821","locale":"zh-CN"},"5188":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1046","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"7,395","locale":"zh-CN"},"5189":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1047","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"5,374","locale":"zh-CN"},"5190":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1048","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs