velopment-performance-1058","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"11,714 / 2,099（2026-11-04 前为 2,971）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5201":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1059","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"4,713 / 1,053（2,766）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5202":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1060","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"Qwen3-TTS 1.7B `speaker`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5203":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1061","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"18,276","locale":"zh-CN"},"5204":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1062","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"18,267","locale":"zh-CN"},"5205":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1063","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"7,356","locale":"zh-CN"},"5206":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1064","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"VoxCPM 0.5B `full`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5207":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1065","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"16,733","locale":"zh-CN"},"5208":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1066","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"12,719","locale":"zh-CN"},"5209":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1067","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"12,719","locale":"zh-CN"},"5210":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1068","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"VoxCPM 0.5B / 1.5 / 2 LoRA（批量 16；0.5B 批量 2：4,343）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5211":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1069","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"8,661 / 10,222 / 14,498","locale":"zh-CN"},"5212":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1070","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"3,116 / 3,301 / 9,094","locale":"zh-CN"},"5213":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1071","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"2,970 / 3,301 / 9,094","locale":"zh-CN"},"5214":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1072","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"原来的经验公式几乎都低于这些峰值（GPT-SoVITS 低 5 倍，VoxCPM 的 `lowest` LoRA 低至 3.4 倍），对 Fish Speech 的 LoRA 估算为 14.1 GB，而它在默认批量下会超出 24 GB 显卡。现在的估算是这些峰值按基础模型大小缩放，再加一成和 512 MB，峰值随批量变化的地方也随批量调整；没有预设放得下时，警告会给出放得下的批量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5215":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1073","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"**所有 LoRA 训练器的冻结权重（2026-11-04）。** OmniVoice 和 Fish Speech 的 LoRA 训练器用上了 VoxCPM 的两种工具：`low` 下冻结的线性层权重以自动混合精度的类型存放（OmniVoice；Fish Speech 在 `bf16-true` 下本来就是 bfloat16），`lowest` 下 LoRA 层的冻结权重留在锁页内存中，每次矩阵乘法时复制到 GPU（两者都有）。现在模型移到设备时不带这些权重（`place`），所以设备上从不存放它们，加载时也不例外。在 RTX 3060（12 GB，PCIe x4）上测量，OmniVoice 的 LoRA 在 `standard` 下的峰值与 3090 相同（7,300 对 7,301 MB）：OmniVoice 的 LoRA 在 `low` 下峰值 2,099 MB，`lowest` 下 1,053 MB（每步 `standard` 0.35 秒、`low` 0.54 秒、`lowest` 0.76 秒）；Fish Speech S2 Pro 的 LoRA 在批量 2、`lowest` 下峰值 7,861 MB，这张卡上每步 15.6 秒，而 `standard`（15,641 MB）根本放不下，其默认批量 4 估算为 12.6 GB，24 GB 的卡放得下。结果相同：在 CPU 上，训练器的测试比较每个损失值和每个适配器权重；在 GPU 上开启确定性内核时，OmniVoice 的一步分别用 float32 和 bfloat16 的冻结权重，损失值和全部 394 个可训练梯度逐位相同（不开确定性内核时，它的反向传播每次运行本来就不同，float32 对 float32 也一样）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5216":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1074","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"在 RTX 3090 上测量（2026-10-18），torch 2.8.0+cu128、flash-attn 2.8.3（torch 2.8 唯一的 wheel）、xFormers 0.0.32.post2（单独一个环境：它与 flash-attn 2.8.3 不能同时导入）和 SageAttention 1.0.6（Triton；2.x 需要 `nvcc`，SageAttention 3 需要 Blackwell GPU）。从 G0 用例集的请求中记录了每个调用点的调用（17 个调用点，36 种调用），每个能接受某次调用的后端都在它上面运行，并与 `auto` 的结果比较。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5217":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1075","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"**内核。** FlashAttention 和 xFormers 与 `auto` 的差别处处都在 bf16/fp16 的舍入以内（余弦 1.000000）；SageAttention 会量化：在 BERT 上余弦 0.98，在 VoxCPM 的双向 DiT 注意力上 0.78（最大误差 12）。在这些尺寸下，这些包每次调用都比 SDPA 慢（单查询步骤 0.13–0.5 倍，提示 0.15–0.9 倍），只有 FlashAttention 能跳过填充键的地方例外：VoxCPM 在预分配缓存上的步骤，4.4 倍（head dim 128）和 2.3 倍（64）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5218":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1076","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"**请求**，预热时间对比 `auto`，音频对比 `auto` 的音频（G0 用例集，一块 GPU，空闲，每个用例三次；\"另一次生成\"：同一请求的另一种结果，如同换了一个种子）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5219":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1077","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"用例","locale":"zh-CN"},"5220":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1078","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"`sdpa`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5221":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1079","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"`flash`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5222":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1080","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"`xformers`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5223":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1081","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"`sage`（设置 `approx_ok` 之前）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5224":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1082","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"`fast`（现在）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5225":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1083","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"Qwen3-TTS base / 自定义音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"5226":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1084","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"1.00 相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"5227":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1085","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"1.02 / 0.99 另一次生成","locale":"zh-CN"},"5228":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1086","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"0.98 / 0.94 另一次生成","locale":"zh-CN"},"5229":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1087","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"无休止：112 倍 / 6 倍的音频","locale":"zh-CN"},"5230":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1088","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content"