真实的显存不足","content":"`none` 在每个阶段流式加载每个单元，所以模型只用其显存的十分之一到五分之一；自回归模型每个 token 都要复制一遍流式加载的层，时间主要花在这里，而较小的模型（F5-TTS、OmniVoice、GPT-SoVITS）慢不到约 2.5 倍。`none` 下的契约测试（在 `cuda:1` 上运行所有已安装的模型，包括需要接受许可的）：165 项通过（3 项跳过：不支持流式输出的模型），耗时 3 小时 20 分。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5396":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1254","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存模式与真实的显存不足","content":"**真实的显存不足**，而不是测试中注入的：在 8 或 12 GB 限额下（分配器也一并限额），一个线程在请求生成期间占满剩余显存，直到只剩 64 KB 的碎片。Qwen3-TTS 的 talker 和 IndexTTS 2 的 GPT（在两个时刻）都在分配器中真正用尽了显存，然后把一半权重改为流式加载后重新运行（`oom_retries`、警告，以及 `meta.memory.partial` 中的“capped at half its weights after running out of memory”），给出的音频与未受干扰的运行逐采样相同。如果晚一点才占满（talker 已经结束），编解码器解码器放置时只看到 218 MB 可用，于是由 talker 让出显存：没有报错，音频相同。（单独设置 `compute.vram_limit_mb` 只告知运行时，并不限制分配器：那样占满的就是整块 GPU，所以这次检验也限制了分配器。）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5397":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1255","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#在-cpu-上的-torchcompile","content":"`compute.compile`，fp32，8 线程；被编译模块预热后的耗时：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5398":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1256","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#在-cpu-上的-torchcompile","content":"引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"5399":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1257","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#在-cpu-上的-torchcompile","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"5400":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1258","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#在-cpu-上的-torchcompile","content":"变化","locale":"zh-CN"},"5401":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1259","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#在-cpu-上的-torchcompile","content":"F5-TTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"5402":{"id":"/docs/development-performa