ent-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"相差不超过 0.004","locale":"zh-CN"},"6199":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-314","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"相差不超过 0.03","locale":"zh-CN"},"6200":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-315","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"通过（GPT-SoVITS 的最差片段在噪声范围内）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6201":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-316","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"未安装 flash-attn 时，`compute.attention=fast` 处处都是 SDPA，所以音频相同。安装后，F5-TTS 没有可交给 FlashAttention 的带填充的半精度调用。GPT-SoVITS v4 的 DiT 对引导时大小为 2 的批量只给出一行键长度，flash-attn 因此拒绝（`seqlens_k must have shape (batch_size)`），直到后端把长度扩展到查询的批大小；现在这 704 次调用都由它计算。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6202":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-317","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"第一次可选项运行暴露了评测工具的一个错误：请求和对照用例把引擎选项写在 `options` 下，而请求模型没有这个字段，pydantic 会直接忽略它，所以 `packed_guidance` 和六个 T3 用例（GPT-SoVITS 的 cut5、批量和串行用例，VoxCPM 的续写和重试用例）实际上都用默认值运行。现在它们改用 `engine_options`；在 CPU 上重跑后，这六个用例在应用了各自选项的情况下与 0.1 和上游逐采样相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6203":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-318","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"`mizuoto/webui/src/**/*.test.ts` 用 vitest 运行；`python scripts/dev.py test-web` 先运行 `bun run test`，再运行 `bun run typecheck`（vue-tsc）。除了组件和 store 的单元测试，还有几个守护整个界面的规则测试：`imports.test.ts`、`tokens.test.ts`、`layout.test.ts`、`ui/layers.test.ts` 和 `i18n/i18n.test.ts`（两种语言的键相同）；见 Web UI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6204":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-319","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"`python scripts/dev.py typegen-check` 重新生成 `schema.d.ts` 并与提交的版本比较；API 改了而类型没有重新生成时失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6205":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-320","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"**浏览器测试。** `tests/e2e/`（标记 `e2e`）通过 Playwright 在无头 Chromium 里操作构建好的界面（`mizuoto/webui/dist`），由一个真实的服务器（`python -m mizuoto webui`）在新的数据文件夹上提供，使用 dummy 引擎，因此不下载任何东西：每个页面加载时没有控制台错误或未捕获的异常；一次合成从输入文本一直走到结果列表和历史中的那一行；320 与 390 px 宽的窗口既不横向滚动，也不会丢掉页面（底部导航栏的 **更多**）；中文界面能够加载。先 `pip install playwright` 和 `python -m playwright install chromium`，再用 `python scripts/dev.py web`（构建）和 `python scripts/dev.py test-e2e` 运行；缺少它们或没有构建时测试会跳过。选择器使用角色、标签和组件自己的类名（`nav.bar`、`section.results li.row`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6206":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-321","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"文档站（`site/`）有自己的 vitest 测试；`src/lib/i18n-content.test.ts` 要求每个中文 `<slug>.mdx` 都有对应的 `<slug>.en.mdx`，且两个侧栏的页面顺序相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6207":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-322","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`.github/workflows/ci.yml` 在每次推送到分支和每个拉取请求时运行，使用 torch 的 CPU 构建（`https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu`）。Mizuoto 和两个需要接受许可的包各自发布，所以各自检查，一次改动只运行它所改内容的检查。依赖用 uv 安装（`astral-sh/setup-uv`，`UV_SYSTEM_PYTHON=1`：装进 `setup-python` 提供的 Python，不建虚拟环境；缓存关闭，因为解包后的 torch wheel 会挤占 10 GB 的缓存上限）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6208":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-323","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"第一个作业 `scope` 读取改动的文件（推送的来自 compare API，拉取请求的来自它的文件列表），由 `python scripts/ci.py scope` 映射为检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6209":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-324","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"改动","locale":"zh-CN"},"6210":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-325","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags"