testing#ci","content":"同一分支较新的运行会取消较旧的运行。推送到 `main` 且改动了某个版本文件时会启动发布工作流，它把 `ci.yml` 作为自己的检查，检查这次推送改动的内容；CI 自己对这次推送的运行会跳过所有作业（`scope` 看到了版本文件），所以检查只跑一次。标签只启动发布工作流，它的检查是全部。把文档站推送到 GitHub Pages 由 `site.yml` 负责，不在 CI 里（见发布）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6257":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-372","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`python scripts/dev.py check` 在本地运行全部内容（只在你的平台和 Python 上，装上需要接受许可的包，基于你检出的 Mizuoto）。契约套件和对照工具需要模型（对照还需要参照实现的环境），权重有几十 GB，所以不进 CI；发布工作流有自己的 wheel 冒烟测试（见发布）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6258":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-373","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"CI 只有 CPU 版 torch。GPU 上的路径（CUDA 图、可选的注意力后端、显存流式加载的异步预取）在 CPU 上测的是逻辑；它们在 GPU 上的表现要在有 GPU 的机器上用契约套件和对照工具检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6259":{"id":"/docs/development-training","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"page","content":"训练器","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training","locale":"zh-CN"},"6260":{"id":"/docs/development-training-0","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training","content":"训练方法怎样在清单里声明，数据集怎样添加、准备和检查，各阶段怎样作为 Mizuoto 自身解释器的子进程依次运行，指纹怎样决定哪些阶段过期，训练器怎样编写，以及导出会登记什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6261":{"id":"/docs/development-training-1","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"清单里的训练方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"6262":{"id":"/docs/development-training-2","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#数据集","content":"数据集","locale":"zh-CN"},"6263":{"id":"/docs/development-training-3","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#实验指纹与过期阶段","content":"实验、指纹与过期阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"6264":{"id":"/docs/development-training-4","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":