文本）、上传、某个音色的参考音频、已有的输出（保留它们的许可标签），或已知布局的文件夹（GPT-SoVITS 的 `.list`、LJSpeech、CSV、普通文件夹）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6331":{"id":"/docs/development-training-71","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#数据集","content":"**准备。** `prepare`（`dataset_prepare` 任务，资源 `cpu`）按 GPT-SoVITS 的默认参数用 slicer2 在静音处切分，经 ASR 转写，并做峰值归一化。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6332":{"id":"/docs/development-training-72","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#数据集","content":"**检查。** `check` 给出 `DatasetReport`：时长直方图、过短或过长的片段、空文本、削波、采样率和许可标签；可以按报告里的问题筛选行，逐条排除或删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6333":{"id":"/docs/development-training-73","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#数据集","content":"**许可。** 交给训练器的行是 `training_rows(数据集, 目标引擎)`：排除被标记的和没有文本的行；如果某些行的许可标签不允许用来训练目标引擎（引擎清单的 `trains_others = false`），整个请求被拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6334":{"id":"/docs/development-training-74","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#实验指纹与过期阶段","content":"一个实验是 `experiments/<引擎>/<名字>/`：`experiment.json`（基础模型、数据集、方法、超参数、各阶段状态）、训练器的工作目录 `work/` 和 `metrics.jsonl`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6335":{"id":"/docs/development-training-75","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#实验指纹与过期阶段","content":"每个完成的阶段都记录一个指纹，由 `fingerprints()` 按阶段顺序链式计算：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6336":{"id":"/docs/development-training-76","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#实验指纹与过期阶段","content":"数据集的指纹是它 `manifest.jsonl` 的 SHA-256；`hp` 是方法的默认值与实验设定值的合并。读取状态时（`_with_status`），指纹与当前不同的已完成阶段是 `stale`，它之后的每个已完成阶段也是。所以改学习率只会让读取它的训练阶段及其后续过期，之前的特征提取仍然算完成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6337":{"id":"/docs/development-training-77","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#实验指纹与过期阶段","content":"还有一条规则：某个阶段**重新运行**后，它之后那些不在同一次运行里的已完成阶段会丢掉指纹。它们读的是旧阶段的文件，所以即使输入（和指纹）相同，也已经过期。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6338":{"id":"/docs/development-training-78","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#实验指纹与过期阶段","content":"`run()` 选择要运行的阶段：带 `restart` 时全部；给了 `stages` 时就是这些（前提是它们之前的阶段都已完成）；否则从第一个未完成的阶段一直到最后。全部完成时它会拒绝，并提示 `mizuoto train run <exp> --restart`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6339":{"id":"/docs/development-training-79","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#训练任务","content":"一次运行是一个 `train` 任务，它的步骤就是选中的阶段：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6340":{"id":"/docs/development-training-80","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#训练任务","content":"**资源**：`engine:<引擎>:<设备>` 和 `gpu:<设备>`（CPU 上是 `cpu`），所以它会等引擎自己的推理和 GPU 上的其他任务。设备取 `training.devices[0]`，没有就用引擎的设备。GPU 上的运行整个占用 `gpu:<设备>`（`JobSpec.exclusive`，不受 `compute.gpu_jobs` 限制）；开始前卸载该引擎已加载的模型（`runtime.unload_engine`），并把该设备上其他空闲模型的权重移到内存（`runtime.release_device`），运行期间没有模型回到这个设备。随后估算这次运行的显存峰值，超出空闲显存时在日志里警告，并给出能放下的预设。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6341":{"id":"/docs/development-training-81","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#训练任务","content":"**每个阶段一个进程**：`host_target(\"mizuoto.training.stage\", cwd=work)` 通过 `JobContext.run_worker`，用服务器自己的解释器运行 `python -m mizuoto.training.stage <request.json>`。阶段进程看得到所有设备，名字不变。心跳超时是 30 分钟（`STAGE_HEARTBEAT_TIMEOUT`）；任何一行输出都会重置它，而阶段本身每 10 秒也会发一次心跳。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6342":{"id":"/docs/development-training-82","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#训练任务","content":"**请求内容**：`trainer`、`stage`、`engine`、`method`、`experiment`、`workdir`、`dataset_dir`、`rows`（绝对音频路径、文本、说话人、语言、时长、采样率；已经在 `training_rows` 里按许可过滤过）、`base_model`（`id`、`dir`、`variant`）、`assets`、`device`、`precision`（`training.precision`）、`hyperparams`、`language`、`results`（已完成阶段的返回值），设置 `training.previews` 和 `training.keep_checkpoints`，以及供预览使用的 `compute`（决定权重放置的设置，`PLACEMENT_SETTINGS`：预留显存、`vram_limit_mb`、锁页内存预算、OOM 重试、`vram_mode` 等）和 `calibration`（主机的校准文件）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6343":{"id":"/docs/development-training-83","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#训练任务","content":"**事件**：`MetricEvent` 每秒批量写进 `metrics.jsonl`，并以 `train_metrics` 发布（界面的损失曲线实时跟随）；`ProgressEvent` 变成步骤的进度和消息；`OutputEvent(kind=\"sample\")` 复制为一个 `sample` 类型的输出。重新运行的阶段会先从 `metrics.jsonl` 里删掉它以前的点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6344":{"id":"/docs/development-training-84","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#为什么用子进程","content":"阶段在自己的进程里运行，而不在服务器进程里：一次运行结束时把内存全部还回去，阶段崩溃也拖不垮服务器，而且阶段可以给进程级随机数生成器播种（上游方案里的 dropout 掩码和数据打乱都从它们抽取），不会影响任何别人的随机数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6345":{"id":"/docs/development-training-85","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#为什么用子进程","content":"`mizuoto/training/stage.py` 就是这个进程：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6346":{"id":"/docs/development-training-86","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#为什么用子进程","content":"它把真正的 stdout 留给事件，把文件描述符 1 指向 stderr，于是各种库打印的东西进入日志，而不会混进事件流。事件是带 `@mizuoto ` 前缀的 JSON 行（`mizuoto/core/jobs/jsonl.py`），`mizuoto` 日志记录器的记录会变成 `LogEvent`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6347":{"id":"/docs/development-training-87","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#为什么用子进程","content":"一个线程每 10 秒发一次 `HeartbeatEvent`（`HEARTBEAT_SECONDS`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6348":{"id":"/docs/development-training-88","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#为什么用子进程","content":"`stage_main` 给 Python、NumPy 和 torch 的生成器播种（`seed_everything`，用请求里的 `seed`，没有则为 1234；训练服务目前不传种子，所以每次运行都以 1234 播种，结果可以复现），在 `training.deterministic` 开启时启用确定性内核（`features.deterministic`，`CUBLAS_WORKSPACE_CONFIG` 由主机设置；torch 对未初始化内存的填充保持关闭，因为原生代码会写入它分配的全部内存，而填充会让从未使用的分配常驻内存：Fish Speech 的 LoRA 阶段因此多占 17 GB），并在 GPU 上、`training.attention = auto` 时改用 math 注意力内核，构建 `StageContext`，用 `load_trainer(request[\"trainer\"])` 加载训练器并调用 `run_stage(stage, ctx)`；结果必须能序列化为 JSON，以 `ResultEvent` 送回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6349":{"id":"/docs/development-training-89","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#为什么用子进程","content":"失败映射为事件和退出码（`mizuoto.core.codes`）：`Cancelled` 或 SIGTERM → `EXIT_CANCELLED`（130）；`EngineError` → 带其错误码的 `ErrorEvent`；内存不足 → `compute_unavailable`；其他 → 把回溯作为日志行，并报 `engine_error`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6350":{"id":"/docs/development-training-90","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#为什么用子进程","content":"`python -m mizuoto.training.stage --entry 模块:函数 <request.json>` 以同样的方式运行别的任务函数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6351":{"id":"/docs/development-training-91","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#为什么用子进程","content":"任务 worker 的 stdout（事件）和 stderr（库的输出）经同一条管道到达主机，所以一个事件可能紧贴在进度条某个未换行的 `\\r` 行后面。主机在事件前缀处切分行（`mizuoto/core/jobs/jsonl.py` 的 `parse_lines`）；在这之前，进度条重绘之后的每个指标都会丢失。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6352":{"id":"/docs/development-training-92","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"训练器是 `mizuoto.training.Trainer` 的子类，它的各方法声明的每个阶段 id 都对应一个 `stage_<id>(ctx)` 方法；`ctx.request[\"method\"]` 说明正在运行哪个方法。训练器模块顶层不导入 torch：主机会导入它来读取 `REQUIRES` 和 `DEVICES`（`InferenceService.trainer_needs`），并询问 `refuses(method, model_dir)`：它不加载 torch 就说明某个方法为什么不能从某个模型开始（Qwen3-TTS：`speaker` 不能从 0.6B Base 开始；该方法随之显示为不可用，运行也无法开始），所以数学部分放在阶段方法内部才导入的模块里。例如 CosyVoice 的训练器设置了 `DEVICES = (\"cuda\", \"cpu\")`：上游用 torchrun 只在 CUDA 上训练，而原生移植没有任何地方需要 CUDA。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6353":{"id":"/docs/development-training-93","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"阶段方法返回一个可序列化为 JSON 的字典，存为该阶段的 `result`；后面的阶段从 `ctx.results` 读取。`StageContext`（`mizuoto/training/context.py`）提供：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6354":{"id":"/docs/development-training-94","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"成员","locale":"zh-CN"},"6355":{"id":"/docs/development-training-95","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"6356":{"id":"/docs/development-training-96","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"`workdir`、`rows`、`base_model`、`assets`、`device`、`precision`、`results`、`hyperparams`、`name`、`engine`、`request`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6357":{"id":"/docs/development-training-97","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"解析后的请求；`rows` 是 `Row`（`id`、`audio`、`text`、`speaker`、`language`、`duration`、`sample_rate`）；数据集里的音频是 FLAC（用 `mizuoto.nn.dsp.flac.read_audio` 读取）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6358":{"id":"/docs/development-training-98","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"`hp(name, default)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6359":{"id":"/docs/development-training-99","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"生效的超参数值，为 `None` 时取 `default`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6360":{"id":"/docs/development-training-100","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"`progress(value, message)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6361":{"id":"/docs/development-training-101","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"0–1，或 `None`（不确定）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6362":{"id":"/docs/development-training-102","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"`metric(epoch, step, values, lr)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6363":{"id":"/docs/development-training-103","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"一个损失点","locale":"zh-CN"},"6364":{"id":"/docs/development-training-104","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"`output(path, label, kind)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6365":{"id":"/docs/development-training-105","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"阶段产出的文件：`sample` 是预览，`checkpoint` 是权重","locale":"zh-CN"},"6366":{"id":"/docs/development-training-106","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"`log(message, level)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6367":{"id":"/docs/development-training-107","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"一行日志","locale":"zh-CN"},"6368":{"id":"/docs/development-training-108","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"`preview(text, reference, label, weights=…, model_dir=…, variant=…, preset=…)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6369":{"id":"/docs/development-training-109","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"在阶段进程里加载引擎自己的实现（一个私有的 `Runtime`，其管理器像主机一样放置权重：用请求中主机的 `compute` 设置，以及主机校准过的工作内存估计，只读不写回；每次预览都在导出阶段里进行，那是一个独立的进程，所以设备上没有优化器状态或梯度），用新权重（`weights`，套在基础模型上）或新模型（`model_dir`）以种子 1234 说出 `text`，存为样例。失败只是一条警告，绝不会让阶段失败；`training.previews` 关闭时跳过","locale":"zh-CN"},"6370":{"id":"/docs/development-training-110","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"阶段必须可以重跑：每个阶段先清空自己的输出目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6371":{"id":"/docs/development-training-111","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#显存","content":"训练的显存预设（`training.memory`：`standard`、`low`、`lowest`）和工具都在 `mizuoto/training/memory.py`：梯度检查点在反向重算时还原全局生成器和训练器自己的生成器，所以损失和权重不变；`low` 只加不改变结果的工具，`lowest` 再加轻微改变结果的工具；方法自己的超参数优先。GPU 上的阶段在指标里附带 `memory/peak_mb`，`MethodInfo.memory_mb` 按预设估算一次运行的峰值。详见显存管理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6372":{"id":"/docs/development-training-112","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#导出","content":"`export` 阶段返回 `{\"artifacts\": [...]}`，由主机的 `_register` 接收：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6373":{"id":"/docs/development-training-113","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#导出","content":"`{\"kind\": \"voice_weights\", \"files\": {\"gpt\": …, \"sovits\": …}}`：移进实验所属音色的 `Voice.weights[engine]`；实验没有音色时，用数据集中最多三段 3–10 秒、带文本、最接近 6 秒的音频新建一个音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6374":{"id":"/docs/development-training-114","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#导出","content":"`{\"kind\": \"model\", \"folder\": …, \"variant\": …, \"title\": …, \"speakers\": …}`：通过 `register_user_model` 成为一个用户模型，其 `model.json` 记录 `trained_from` 和实验（以及 Qwen3 的 `speakers`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6375":{"id":"/docs/development-training-115","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#导出","content":"同一个音色或模型再次导出只列一次，以最新的那次为准。`mizuoto train export <exp>` 单独运行 `export` 阶段。导出沿用上游方案的格式和权重的键名，所以上游的实现（以及 Mizuoto 0.1）也能加载它们，反之亦然。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6376":{"id":"/docs/development-training-116","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#以-omnivoice-的训练器为例","content":"`mizuoto/engines/omnivoice/train.py`，方法 `full` 和 `lora`，导出 `model`，依照上游的 `examples/run_finetune.sh` 和 `run_finetune_lora.sh`，不依赖 transformers、peft、accelerate 或 webdataset：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6377":{"id":"/docs/development-training-117","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#以-omnivoice-的训练器为例","content":"`tokens`：以种子 42 打乱各段音频，逐段读取、转单声道、重采样到 24 kHz、峰值归一化，再用模型自己的 HiggsAudio 分词器编码（用推理引擎的 `load_audio_tokenizer` 加载），写成 WebDataset 风格的分片，由 `data.lst` 列出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6378":{"id":"/docs/development-training-118","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#以-omnivoice-的训练器为例","content":"`train`：上游的微调循环及其 SDPA 配置：分片由数据加载 worker 读取，worker 的播种方式与上游相同；按长度分组成批，使用四维掩码；带掩码的交叉熵、带余弦调度的 AdamW、梯度裁剪和梯度累积。LoRA 就是 peft 的那种，但不依赖 peft 实现。每次更新的损失记为一次 `ctx.metric`。最后以上游的目录结构写出 `out/checkpoint-<步数>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6379":{"id":"/docs/development-training-119","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#以-omnivoice-的训练器为例","content":"`export`：即 `merge_lora`：把适配器合并进基础权重（全量微调的权重则原样使用），存为 `model.safetensors`，旁边放基础模型的配置、分词器和聊天模板，然后用 `ctx.preview` 克隆数据集里的一段音频。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6380":{"id":"/docs/development-training-120","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#以-omnivoice-的训练器为例","content":"上游在构建模型之后会用配置里的种子把一切重新播种；原生训练器把之后的那些抽样放在以同样方式播种的私有生成器上进行（数据加载 worker 的种子、LoRA 的 dropout 掩码），只有 LoRA 的初始化从阶段进程的全局生成器按模块顺序抽取，与上游相同，所以带种子的运行能得到与上游相同的损失和权重。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6381":{"id":"/docs/development-training-121","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#添加一个训练器","content":"在清单里写 `[training.<id>]`：各阶段及其 `uses`、超参数、`export`，需要时加 `assets` 和 `devices`。在引擎类上设置 `TRAINER = \"mizuoto.engines.<id>.train:<类>\"`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6382":{"id":"/docs/development-training-122","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#添加一个训练器","content":"写一个 `Trainer` 子类，每个阶段一个 `stage_<id>(ctx)`，重依赖在方法内导入。按上游的顺序从进程级生成器抽随机数，上游重新播种过的地方改用私有生成器；用 `ctx.progress`、`ctx.metric` 和 `ctx.log` 汇报。训练在推理之外需要的包写进 `REQUIRES`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6383":{"id":"/docs/development-training-123","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#添加一个训练器","content":"`export` 返回 `artifacts` 并调用 `ctx.preview`。加上 `tests/engines_native/test_<id>_train_tiny.py`（小型随机模型、几段音频、每个阶段），然后用一个小数据集完整地训练一遍（界面的训练页面，或 `mizuoto train new` / `mizuoto train run`），并与上游对照（`scripts/parity/train.py`，见测试）。为得到相同结果复现了哪些上游行为，记进设计记录 `AGENTS.md` 和该引擎的说明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6384":{"id":"/docs/development-webui","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"page","content":"Web UI","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui","locale":"zh-CN"},"6385":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-0","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui","content":"Vue 3 + Material 3 界面的结构：Material Design 3 的令牌层与组件层、ui/ 包装层与规则测试、API 客户端与查询、socket 事件、引擎可用性检查、store、保活视图和 i18n，以及以项目页为例新增一个界面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6386":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-1","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#material-design-3-的分层","content":"Material Design 3 的分层","locale":"zh-CN"},"6387":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-2","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"令牌层：`src/theme/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6388":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-3","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#组件层srcui","content":"组件层：`src/ui/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6389":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-4","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#ui-包装层","content":"`ui/` 包装层","locale":"zh-CN"},"6390":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-5","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"规则测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"6391":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-6","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#api-客户端与查询","content":"API 客户端与查询","locale":"zh-CN"},"6392":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-7","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#socket-事件","content":"Socket 事件","locale":"zh-CN"},"6393":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-8","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#引擎可用性","content":"引擎可用性","locale":"zh-CN"},"6394":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-9","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#随模型变化的表单","content":"随模型变化的表单","locale":"zh-CN"},"6395":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-10","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"Store","locale":"zh-CN"},"6396":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-11","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#保活视图","content":"保活视图","locale":"zh-CN"},"6397":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-12","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#i18n","content":"i18n","locale":"zh-CN"},"6398":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-13","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"新增一个界面：以\"项目\"为例","locale":"zh-CN"},"6399":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-14","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui","content":"Web UI 是 `mizuoto/webui/` 下的一个 Vue 3 项目，组件基于 Material Web（`@material/web`），图标是 Lucide（`@lucide/vue`），数据层是 TanStack Query（`@tanstack/vue-query`）+ `openapi-fetch`，状态用 Pinia。构建产物 `mizuoto/webui/dist/` 作为包数据随 wheel 发布，由 API 的 `SPAStaticFiles` 提供（见 HTTP API 与命令行）。基础部分（`theme/`、`ui/`、动效、层、外壳、store、i18n、规则测试）沿用 rvc-next，来源见设计参考与决策。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6400":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-15","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui","content":"开发时用 `python scripts/dev.py dev` 同时启动 API 服务器和 Vite（`http://localhost:5173`），Vite 把 `/api` 和 `/ws` 代理到 `MIZUOTO_BACKEND`（默认 `http://127.0.0.1:7869`）。API 服务器重启时代理的连接错误只打印一行（`vite.config.ts`，`devProxy.test.ts` 测试）。环境准备见开发环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6401":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-16","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#material-design-3-的分层","content":"界面按 Material Design 3（M3）构建，分两层：所有东西都读取的**令牌层**，以及建立在它上面的**组件层**。令牌层与任何组件库无关；组件层可以逐个替换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6402":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-17","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"6403":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-18","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"6404":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-19","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"`scheme.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6405":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-20","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"用 `@material/material-color-utilities` 的 Tonal Spot 方案，从一个种子色生成全部颜色角色（`primary`、`on-primary`、`surface-container`、`outline`……），亮色与暗色各一套，对比度 0（标准）、0.5（中）、1（高）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6406":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-21","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"`applyTheme.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6407":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-22","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"把角色写成 `:root` 上的 `--md-sys-color-*`，并设置 `data-theme`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6408":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-23","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"`tokens.css`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6409":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-24","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"静态令牌：15 种字号（`--md-sys-typescale-*`，Roboto Flex 可变字体）、圆角（`--md-sys-shape-corner-*`）、动效的缓动和时长（`--md-sys-motion-*`）、状态层不透明度（悬停 8%、聚焦 10%、按下 10%、拖动 16%，取自 `@material/web` 2.5.0 的令牌文件；禁用的内容 38%、容器 12%，取自其组件令牌）、阴影、间距（4px 为单位）、层内 z 序和随窗口变化的宽度；还有首帧用的回退颜色","locale":"zh-CN"},"6410":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-25","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"`breakpoints.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6411":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-26","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"M3 的窗口尺寸分级：compact（\\< 600px）、medium（\\< 840px）、expanded（\\< 1200px）、large（\\< 1600px）、extra-large","locale":"zh-CN"},"6412":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-27","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"**颜色只来自种子色。** 默认种子色是 `#4f6b3a`；用户可以在“设置 › 外观”里换任意颜色、对比度、亮暗（跟随系统、亮、暗）和动效。偏好存在 localStorage，并经 `/api/v1/client-state/{key}` 同步到服务器。`index.html` 里的一小段脚本在打包代码运行前读取偏好、设置 `data-theme`，避免首屏闪烁。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6413":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-28","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"**令牌用的是 Google 官方的名字**（`--md-sys-*`），所以 `@material/web` 的组件不经任何映射就能读取它们；项目自己的令牌以 `--app-` 开头。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6414":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-29","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"**层级首先用表面色调表达**（`surface`、`surface-container-low` … `surface-container-highest`），阴影其次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6415":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-30","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"**颜色角色成对使用**：`primary` 容器上的内容用 `on-primary`，`surface-container` 上的用 `on-surface`；生成的成对角色保证对比度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6416":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-31","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"**动效**：命名的过渡（`fade-through`、`shared-axis-x`、`container`、`sheet`、`scrim`、`list` 等，`ui/motion/`），在支持的浏览器里用 View Transitions 做列表到详情的容器变换。系统或应用内选择“减少动效”时，所有过渡变成 100 ms 的淡入淡出，没有涟漪。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6417":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-32","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"**布局**：compact 窗口用底部导航栏，更宽时用导航轨（`AppShell`）。底部导航栏遵守 Material 3 的三到五个目的地：超过五个时显示前四个和 **更多**，后者是放着其余目的地的 `AppMenu`（其中某个是当前页面时它显示为当前；其中有带徽标的目的地时显示导航轨的圆点）；目的地随窗口变窄，所以导航栏不会撑宽页面（八个目的地全放时，在 390 px 的手机上每个页面都有 512 px 宽）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6418":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-33","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"字体（`@fontsource-variable/roboto-flex`）和图标都打包进 `dist/`，界面不从任何外部来源加载东西，离线也能用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6419":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-34","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#组件层srcui","content":"`@material/web` 有的组件包一层项目自己的 Vue 组件：按钮（`AppButton`：填充、色调、描边、文本）、图标按钮、FAB、复选框、筛选 chip、分隔线、文本框与多行文本框、滑块、线性与环形进度条、开关、标签页。包装组件拥有属性、事件名和类型；`vite.config.ts` 把 `md-*` 标签声明为自定义元素。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6420":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-35","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#组件层srcui","content":"`@material/web` 没有的组件用令牌自己实现，放在同一个目录：外壳、导航栏与导航轨、顶部应用栏、卡片、对话框、侧栏、菜单与选择菜单、提示条（snackbar）、工具提示、分段按钮、选择框、展开面板、步骤条、数据列表、折线图、波形、频谱图、电平表等。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6421":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-36","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#组件层srcui","content":"两种组件读取同一套令牌，看起来一致。`@material/web` 处于维护模式，不再增加组件；万一某个组件在未来的浏览器或 Vue 版本中出问题，就在 `src/ui/` 里替换它，业务代码不变。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6422":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-37","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#组件层srcui","content":"图标用 Lucide（`@lucide/vue`），不用 Material Symbols：只在 `ui/icons.ts` 导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6423":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-38","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#组件层srcui","content":"按钮的强调层级：一个区域里最多一个填充按钮（视图的主要操作，如“合成”、“训练”），次要操作用色调按钮，其余用描边或文本按钮。可交互元素有可见的焦点指示，点击目标一般不小于 48×48px（紧凑的行和卡片里的复选框等以 `dense` 例外）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6424":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-39","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#组件层srcui","content":"不使用 MUI（它实现的是 Material Design 2），也没有采用 M3 Expressive；令牌层把形状和动效的值集中在一处，需要时可以只改令牌。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6425":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-40","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#ui-包装层","content":"`src/ui/index.ts` 是共享组件的唯一出口：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6426":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-41","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#ui-包装层","content":"只有 `ui/` 下的组件（以及 `theme/tokens.css` 和测试的 `test/setup.ts`）导入 `@material/web`。视图和功能组件从 `@/ui` 导入 `AppButton`、`TextField`、`AppDialog`、`SegmentedButton`、`Stepper`、`LineChart` 等。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6427":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-42","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#ui-包装层","content":"图标也经过 `ui/icons.ts` 再导出，`ui/` 是唯一导入 `@lucide/vue` 的地方。新图标先加到这里，再以 `icons.X` 使用。`AppIcon` 设置了 `fill: none`：Material 按钮会填充插槽里的图标，Lucide 的描边因此会变成色块。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6428":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-43","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#ui-包装层","content":"样式只用令牌：颜色角色 `--md-sys-color-*`（由 `applyTheme.ts` 从种子色生成），间距 `--app-space-*`，层内 z 序 `--app-z-*`，字号类 `type-title-large` 等。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6429":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-44","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#ui-包装层","content":"`ui/layers.ts` 是所有浮层（对话框、侧栏、菜单、选择器）的唯一记录，按打开顺序决定绘制层级、Escape 和外部点击只关闭最上层、模态层下面的内容设为 `inert`、焦点打开时进入并在关闭时归还。新的浮层组件要通过它注册，而不是自己设 z-index。提示（`Tooltip`）不入栈：它渲染在文档末尾、按内容的位置固定定位并限制在窗口内，层级取 `tooltipZ`（高于所有已打开的浮层和提示条），因此底栏或导航栏旁的面板不会裁切或遮住它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6430":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-45","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#ui-包装层","content":"`/dev` 路由（`DevComponentsView.vue`）列出全部 `ui/` 组件，用来目视检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6431":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-46","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"几条约定由 vitest 检查，违反时 `dev.py test-web` 失败：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6432":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-47","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"6433":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-48","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"6434":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-49","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"`src/imports.test.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6435":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-50","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"`src/` 内的模块互相导入一律用 `@/` 别名，不用相对路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"6436":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-51","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"`src/tokens.test.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6437":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-52","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"`src/theme/` 之外的 `.vue` 和 `.css` 中（`<script>` 除外）没有十六进制颜色","locale":"zh-CN"},"6438":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-53","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"`src/layout.test.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6439":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-54","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"放文件名的行，其文本元素要有 `min-width: 0`（长名字不把按钮挤出视野）；Speak 与音色页是一列分节，操作按钮在 `PageFooter` 里；字段旁的按钮居中对齐；分节从不并排","locale":"zh-CN"},"6440":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-55","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"`src/ui/layers.test.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6441":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-56","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"浮层的键盘、绘制、外部点击、模态和焦点规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"6442":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-57","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"`src/i18n/i18n.test.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6443":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-58","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"`zh-CN` 与 `en` 的键完全一致，占位符一致；固定术语（\"音色\"、\"合成\"、\"克隆\"）不变；每个服务器错误 code 都有标题","locale":"zh-CN"},"6444":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-59","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"`src/ui/ui.test.ts` 等","locale":"zh-CN"},"6445":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-60","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"单个组件、动效辅助函数、主题生成、窗口尺寸分级、导航","locale":"zh-CN"},"6446":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-61","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"\"视图只从 `@/ui` 导入组件\"是约定，目前没有测试强制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6447":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-62","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#api-客户端与查询","content":"`api/client.ts` 用生成的 `paths` 类型创建一个 `openapi-fetch` 客户端：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6448":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-63","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#api-客户端与查询","content":"`BASE_URL`（`api/baseUrl.ts`）由运行中脚本的 URL 推出：最后一个 `/assets/` 之前的部分就是部署根。不编译进任何 API 地址，所以挂在 `api_prefix` 下也无需改动。路由用 hash 历史，任何子路径都不需要服务端改写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6449":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-64","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#api-客户端与查询","content":"`unwrap(call)` 返回数据，失败时抛 `ApiError(status, code, message, detail)`；FastAPI 自己的 422 校验错误被转成 `invalid_input`。`components/errors.ts` 把它变成界面上的标题（`errors.<code>`）、提示（`detail.hint`）和详情。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6450":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-65","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#api-客户端与查询","content":"媒体 URL（`urls.output()`、`urls.audioFile()`）由 `<audio>` 直接请求，靠 `mizuoto_token` cookie 认证；上传用 `uploadRaw()`（XMLHttpRequest，可报告进度，请求体是原始字节）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6451":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-66","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#api-客户端与查询","content":"类型来自 `api/types.ts`：`S = components['schemas']`，以及常用模型的别名。既作请求又作响应的模型分成两份，例如发送 `S['SpeakRequest-Input']`、读取 `S['SpeakRequest-Output']`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6452":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-67","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#api-客户端与查询","content":"`api/queries/<资源>.ts` 把端点包装成组合式函数：读取用 `useQuery`，写入用 `useMutation`。查询键集中在 `api/queries/keys.ts`，查询模块和 socket 处理器共用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6453":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-68","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#api-客户端与查询","content":"层级化的键让作废 `keys.projects` 同时作废列表和每个项目。`main.ts` 中的 `QueryClient` 关闭了窗口聚焦时重新获取，4xx 错误不重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6454":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-69","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#socket-事件","content":"`api/socket.ts` 的 `connectSocket(qc)` 只连接一次（`App.vue` 挂载时），路径是 `${BASE_PATH}/ws/socket.io`，令牌放在握手的 `auth` 中。监听器的类型来自模式里的 `ServerEvents`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6455":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-70","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#socket-事件","content":"REST 是事实来源，事件只修补或作废查询：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6456":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-71","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#socket-事件","content":"`job_updated` 进入 jobs store（`upsert` 丢弃比已有状态更旧的快照），写入 `keys.job(id)`；任务结束时按 `AFFECTS` 表作废它影响的列表，例如 `project_render` → `keys.projects`，`train` → 实验、音色、模型和输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6457":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-72","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#socket-事件","content":"`runtime_changed`（已加载的模型，供**内存中的模型**侧栏 `LoadedModelsSheet` 使用）和 `compute_changed` 直接写入查询数据（`keys.runtime`、`keys.computeUsage`）；`train_metrics` 把新点追加到实验的指标上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6458":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-73","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#socket-事件","content":"其余 `*_changed` 事件经 `createInvalidator()` 作废对应的键，300 ms 内的一串事件只引起一次重新获取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6459":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-74","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#socket-事件","content":"连接和重连时重新拉取活动任务（`resync()`），重连时还作废屏幕上常见的全部列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6460":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-75","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#socket-事件","content":"`job_log` 分发给打开的日志查看器（`onJobLog(jobId, listener)`）；每个事件最多 50 行，其余通过 REST 获取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6461":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-76","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#引擎可用性","content":"所有引擎都随 Mizuoto 一起安装，但某个引擎仍可能*缺*东西：torch，或某个需要接受许可的引擎自己的发行包。引擎列表（`EngineStatus.available`、`missing`）和 doctor 的报告（`api/queries/engines.ts` 的 `useDoctor(engine)`：`GET /api/v1/engines/{id}/doctor`，不指定引擎时为 `GET /api/v1/runtime/doctor`）决定界面提供什么：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6462":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-77","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#引擎可用性","content":"**`ModelGate`**（`components/ModelGate.vue`）把合成页的主按钮换成模型还差的那一个操作，按以下顺序检查：启用引擎、接受许可、安装缺少的包、下载模型。缺包时显示命令：torch 用 doctor 给出的 `install_command`（适合本机的构建），其他包用 `pip install <包名>`；引擎在远程主机上时，提示那台主机缺这个包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6463":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-78","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#引擎可用性","content":"**`EngineCard`** 显示**可用**或**不可用**以及缺少的包，并有一个 doctor 面板，列出该引擎的检查结果（torch、附加依赖、训练）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6464":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-79","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#引擎可用性","content":"**`ModelsView`** 标出引擎不可用的分组，并写明它需要什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6465":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-80","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#引擎可用性","content":"**`SettingsView`** 在 **计算** 中显示 torch 的检查结果（doctor 的 `torch` 一项）：已安装的版本和构建，以及两者不符时安装推荐构建的命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6466":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-81","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#随模型变化的表单","content":"合成页和项目的角色卡片只显示所选模型支持的内容，并保留为其他模型设置的值，换回那个模型时恢复。服务端会拒绝模型不支持的内容（明确给出的请求从不被裁剪），所以一个被隐藏却仍然发出的值会让合成失败。因此只有一条规则：**表单没有显示的值，绝不发送。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6467":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-82","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#随模型变化的表单","content":"**合成页** 只在 `components/speakForm.ts` 中构建请求（`speakRequest(spec, form)`），依据模型的 spec（`ModelParamSpecs`），并使用模板判断显示与否的同一组函数：`emotionWays`/`shownWay`、`instructFit`（指令以及 `instruct_requires`，即指令需要的音色方式）、`designFor`、`speaks`、`fieldsFor`、`takesSeed`。表单新增字段时，在这里写它的规则，并在 `speakForm.test.ts` 中加一个用例；服务端用来检查请求的规则应放进 spec，界面才能遵循。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6468":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-83","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#随模型变化的表单","content":"表单状态放在视图里，而不是子组件中：`EmotionPanel` 不持有自己的值。换模型时无法可靠地重置子组件的状态，因为子组件可能在同一次更新中被卸载（它所在的区域被隐藏，或新模型的 spec 还在加载），它的 watcher 也随之停止。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6469":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-84","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#随模型变化的表单","content":"参数和引擎选项属于各个模型：换模型后从新模型的默认值或默认预设开始。“再次生成”在负责重置的同一个 watcher 中为新模型设置它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6470":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-85","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#随模型变化的表单","content":"**项目** 会把角色的设置保存在磁盘上，模型可能在任何界面或命令行中被修改，因此由服务端执行这条规则：`ProjectService._request` 只把句子的模型支持的指令、参数和选项发给它（`TtsService.settings_fit`），`Project.instruct_unused`（读取时计算，从不保存）列出指令被保留但不使用的角色。音色和语言照原样发送，不合适时明确报错。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6471":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-86","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"Store","locale":"zh-CN"},"6472":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-87","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"6473":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-88","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"`auth`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6474":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-89","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"令牌（localStorage 与 `mizuoto_token` cookie）、是否需要令牌","locale":"zh-CN"},"6475":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-90","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"`jobs`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6476":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-91","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"本次会话知道的任务：所有活动任务，以及打开页面期间结束的任务；每个任务从哪个界面启动（`upsert(job, from)`、`fromScreen()`），`onFinished()` 用于\"在其他界面启动的任务已完成\"提示。进度更新很频繁，所以放在这里而不是查询缓存里","locale":"zh-CN"},"6477":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-92","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"`preferences`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6478":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-93","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"主题、种子色、对比度、语言、动效、上次界面、Speak 的上次选择；存 localStorage，并经 `/api/v1/client-state/{key}` 同步到服务器，跟随用户换浏览器","locale":"zh-CN"},"6479":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-94","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"`player`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6480":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-95","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"页面上唯一的播放器（`audio/player.ts`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6481":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-96","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"`handoff`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6482":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-97","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"界面之间的交接：\"用这些设置重新运行\"、\"使用这个音色\"、\"用作参考\"；Speak 打开时取走","locale":"zh-CN"},"6483":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-98","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#保活视图","content":"`App.vue` 用 `KeepAlive :max=\"12\"` 包住 `RouterView`，切换界面时每个页面保留自己的状态。缓存键是：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6484":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-99","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#保活视图","content":"列表页每个路由一个实例；音色、数据集、实验和项目的详情页每个路径一个实例。外壳的滚动容器是共享的，所以每个页面的滚动位置另存在 `offsets` 里，在视图过渡的更新中放回。被保活的页面不会卸载，需要在离开时保存的东西要同时挂 `onDeactivated` 和 `onBeforeUnmount`（`ProjectView.vue` 的草稿保存就是这样）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6485":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-100","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#保活视图","content":"`router.ts` 中每个路由的 `meta.screen` 指明它属于哪个导航目的地；`addressOf(screen)` 记住每个目的地上次的地址，导航回去时回到离开时的那个音色或项目，而不是列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6486":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-101","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#i18n","content":"`i18n/en.ts` 是消息树，`zh-CN.ts` 必须有完全相同的键（测试检查）。`useI18n()` 返回 `t(key, params)`，占位符写成 `{n}`；当前语言来自偏好，`auto` 跟随系统语言。由服务器值拼出的键（错误 code、阶段 id）用 `tOr(key, fallback)`，没有消息时显示可读的回退文字。新增文字时两个文件同时加。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6487":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-102","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"项目界面（长篇脚本，由一组音色逐行朗读）是最近加入的完整界面，可以作为模板。API 侧见 `mizuoto/api/routers/projects.py`，事件是 `projects_changed`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6488":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-103","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"**生成类型。** 后端路由就绪后运行 `python scripts/dev.py typegen`，`schema.d.ts` 中出现 `/api/v1/projects` 等路径和 `Project`、`ProjectInput` 等模型。在 `api/types.ts` 加别名：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6489":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-104","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"**查询键与查询。** 在 `api/queries/keys.ts` 加 `projects` 和 `project(id)`，新建 `api/queries/projects.ts`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6490":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-105","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"**Socket。** 在 `api/socket.ts` 处理新事件，并在 `AFFECTS` 中登记新任务种类影响的键：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6491":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-106","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"并把 `keys.projects` 加入重连时作废的列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6492":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-107","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"**视图。** `views/ProjectsView.vue` 是列表：`useProjects()`、`EmptyState`、一组 `AppCard`，以及 `NewProjectDialog`。`views/ProjectView.vue` 是详情页，接收路由参数 `id` 作为 prop：编辑保存在本地草稿里，停止输入 800 ms 后 `PUT` 保存，`onDeactivated` 与 `onBeforeUnmount` 时也保存；进行中的渲染从 jobs store 中按 `kind` 和 `request.project` 找到，用 `JobCard` 显示；主要操作放在 `PageFooter`。\"在 Speak 中试听\"一行通过 `handoff.sendRequest()` 交给 Speak。只从 `@/ui` 取组件，只用令牌写样式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6493":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-108","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"**路由。** 在 `router.ts` 加路由，`meta.screen` 指向目的地；若它是可记住的上次界面，加入 `SCREENS`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6494":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-109","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"**导航与保活。** 在 `App.vue` 的 `nav` 中加一项（图标先加到 `ui/icons.ts`），详情页要每个项目一个实例时把前缀加进 `viewKey`，需要记住为上次界面时加进 `lastScreen` 的监听：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6495":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-110","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"**文字与测试。** 在 `en.ts` 和 `zh-CN.ts` 加 `nav.projects` 和 `projects.*`；名字可能很长的行加 `min-width: 0`（必要时登记到 `layout.test.ts`）。运行 `python scripts/dev.py test-web`（vitest + `vue-tsc`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6496":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-111","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"测试的写法和 CI 见测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6497":{"id":"/docs/development","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"page","content":"开发文档","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development","locale":"zh-CN"},"6498":{"id":"/docs/development-0","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development","content":"面向贡献者的入口：Mizuoto 由哪几部分组成、以什么为准，以及各开发页面分别讲什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6499":{"id":"/docs/development-1","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development#以什么为准","content":"以什么为准","locale":"zh-CN"},"6500":{"id":"/docs/development-2","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"一个环境，一个进程","locale":"zh-CN"},"6501":{"id":"/docs/development-3","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"页面","locale":"zh-CN"},"6502":{"id":"/docs/development-4","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"几条贯穿全局的约定","locale":"zh-CN"},"6503":{"id":"/docs/development-5","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development","content":"这一部分写给想修改 Mizuoto 的人：修 bug、接入新引擎、加一个训练方法、加一个页面或一条 API。它描述代码现在**是什么样**、遵守哪些规则以及为什么，而不是使用方法（使用方法见使用教程和命令行）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6504":{"id":"/docs/development-6","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#以什么为准","content":"**代码**及其测试：其他任何内容与它们冲突时，以它们为准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6505":{"id":"/docs/development-7","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#以什么为准","content":"**本站的开发文档**：实现后的设计、规则及其原因，每个领域一页；引擎参考每个引擎一页（复现了上游的哪些行为、\n有哪些偏差、训练器以及对照结果）。改动某个领域前先读对应页面；设计有变化时同步修改它，中英文都要改。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6506":{"id":"/docs/development-8","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#以什么为准","content":"**`AGENTS.md`**（仓库根目录，`CLAUDE.md` 指向它）：给贡献者和编码代理的简短工作记录：代码地图、不能破坏的规则、工作流程，\n以及哪一页讲什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6507":{"id":"/docs/development-9","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"Mizuoto 0.2 是装进同一个 Python 环境的一个发行包。每个引擎（Qwen3-TTS、F5-TTS、OmniVoice、CosyVoice、GPT-SoVITS、VoxCPM、Fish Speech、IndexTTS，以及内部使用的 Whisper 语音识别）都在 Mizuoto 里基于它自己的运行时实现，**在服务器自己的进程里**运行。没有上游代码，没有 transformers，没有引擎专用环境，也没有 worker 进程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6508":{"id":"/docs/development-10","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"发行包","locale":"zh-CN"},"6509":{"id":"/docs/development-11","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"6510":{"id":"/docs/development-12","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"6511":{"id":"/docs/development-13","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"`mizuoto`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6512":{"id":"/docs/development-14","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"`mizuoto/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6513":{"id":"/docs/development-15","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"核心、API、命令行、Web UI（构建产物 `dist/` 随 wheel 发布）、运行时、通用构件，以及所有采用宽松许可证的引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"6514":{"id":"/docs/development-16","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"`mizuoto-fishspeech`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6515":{"id":"/docs/development-17","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"`packages/native/fishspeech/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6516":{"id":"/docs/development-18","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"Fish Speech，采用 Fish Audio Research License","locale":"zh-CN"},"6517":{"id":"/docs/development-19","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"`mizuoto-indextts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6518":{"id":"/docs/development-20","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"`packages/native/indextts/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6519":{"id":"/docs/development-21","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"IndexTTS，采用 bilibili Model Use License","locale":"zh-CN"},"6520":{"id":"/docs/development-22","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"两个需要接受许可的引擎单独发布，只是因为它们的许可证。它们装进同一个环境，通过 Python 入口点组 `mizuoto.engines` 自行注册。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6521":{"id":"/docs/development-23","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"决定代码放在哪里的边界如今在包内部：**`mizuoto/core` 从不在模块顶层导入 torch**，`mizuoto/core/inference` 是它通往模型代码（`mizuoto.runtime`、`mizuoto.nn`、`mizuoto.engines`、`mizuoto.training`）的唯一入口，并且总在函数内部导入。所以 `mizuoto version`、`mizuoto --help` 和核心自己的测试都不加载 torch，一条从不加载模型的命令也从不导入运行时。整体架构就从这条规则讲起。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6522":{"id":"/docs/development-24","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"开发环境\" href=\"/docs/development-setup\" description=\"装好 CPU 版 torch 的 .venv、需要接受许可的引擎、bun，以及 scripts/dev.py 的全部任务。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6523":{"id":"/docs/development-25","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"开发约定\" href=\"/docs/development-conventions\" description=\"代码风格、分层规则、原生代码的规则、一致性要求、测试、文档与提交。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6524":{"id":"/docs/development-26","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"整体架构\" href=\"/docs/development-architecture\" description=\"目录布局与分层规则、Services 的组装、一个合成请求的全过程、设置、事件、任务、错误。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6525":{"id":"/docs/development-27","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"设计参考与决策\" href=\"/docs/development-design\" description=\"设计的来源（ComfyUI、InvokeAI、SD Model Hub、Material Design 3）以及做出的决定和理由。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6526":{"id":"/docs/development-28","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"运行时\" href=\"/docs/development-runtime\" description=\"设备、模型管理器与模型句柄、请求上下文、全局状态规则、LocalEngine、取消、流式和远程引擎。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6527":{"id":"/docs/development-29","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"显存与内存\" href=\"/docs/development-memory\" description=\"阶段、预算、部分加载与权重流式加载、结果不变的显存不足重试、估算与校准。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6528":{"id":"/docs/development-30","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"加速\" href=\"/docs/development-acceleration\" description=\"注意力后端、CUDA 图、无同步采样、torch.compile 与 CPU 设置，以及哪些保持结果一致。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6529":{"id":"/docs/development-31","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"性能记录\" href=\"/docs/development-performance\" description=\"怎样在不改变结果的前提下测量速度，以及测得的记录。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6530":{"id":"/docs/development-32","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"接入引擎\" href=\"/docs/development-engine\" description=\"清单与模型文件清单、Engine 与 LoadedEngine 契约、注册、测试与对照，以 OmniVoice 为例。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6531":{"id":"/docs/development-33","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"训练器\" href=\"/docs/development-training\" description=\"Trainer 与 StageContext、作为子进程运行的阶段、指纹与过期阶段、导出。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6532":{"id":"/docs/development-34","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"API 与命令行\" href=\"/docs/development-api\" description=\"FastAPI 应用、安全中间件、错误到 HTTP、带事件的 OpenAPI、类型生成、加路由和加命令。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6533":{"id":"/docs/development-35","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"Web UI\" href=\"/docs/development-webui\" description=\"Vue 3 + Material 3：ui/ 包装层与规则测试、查询、socket 事件、可用性检查、i18n，以及加一个页面。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6534":{"id":"/docs/development-36","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"测试\" href=\"/docs/development-testing\" description=\"测试布局、dummy 引擎、小型随机模型、契约套件、对照工具、前端测试和 CI。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6535":{"id":"/docs/development-37","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"发布\" href=\"/docs/development-release\" description=\"版本同步、wheel、冒烟测试、CI 与发布工作流、Docker、模型镜像和文档站。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6536":{"id":"/docs/development-38","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"引擎参考\" href=\"/docs/engines\" description=\"每个引擎一页：复现了上游的哪些行为、偏差、显存与速度、训练和对照结果。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6537":{"id":"/docs/development-39","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"简要列出（完整内容见开发约定）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6538":{"id":"/docs/development-40","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"Python ≥ 3.10；ruff 与 ty 不锁版本，`lint.select` 逐条写出；行宽 180；每个函数都有类型标注（测试和脚本除外）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6539":{"id":"/docs/development-41","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"跨越 API 边界的模型都继承 `mizuoto/core/record.py` 的 `Record`（pydantic v2，`json_schema_serialization_defaults_required`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6540":{"id":"/docs/development-42","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"重依赖在函数内导入；有类注解里用到 `list[...]` 的类不定义名为 `list` 的方法。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6541":{"id":"/docs/development-43","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"原生代码不改动任何进程级状态：随机数来自请求自己的生成器（见运行时）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6542":{"id":"/docs/development-44","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"新增一个 CLI 命令要同时登记到 `tests/cli/test_cli.py` 的 `EXPECTED_TREE`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6543":{"id":"/docs/development-45","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"只有用户要求时才提交和开 PR。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6544":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","type":"page","content":"语音识别（Whisper、Paraformer）","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","引擎参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-asr","locale":"zh-CN"},"6545":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-0","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr","content":"内部的语音识别引擎：Whisper large-v3-turbo，复现 Mizuoto 0.1 所用的 transformers 流水线；以及识别中文所用的 FunASR Paraformer-large、FSMN-VAD 和 CT-Transformer 标点，与 GPT-SoVITS 的识别方式相同；两者的显存说明和对照结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6546":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-1","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-asr#变体与文件","content":"变体与文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"6547":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-2","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-asr#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh-CN"},"6548":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-3","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-asr#与上游一致的做法","content":"与上游一致的做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"6549":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-4","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-asr#有意的差异","content":"有意的差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"6550":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-5","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-asr#显存","content":"显存","locale":"zh-CN"},"6551":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-6","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-asr#对照结果","content":"对照结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"6552":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-7","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"Paraformer（中文）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6553":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-8","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-asr#限制","content":"限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"6554":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-9","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr","content":"Mizuoto 自己的语音识别：Whisper large-v3-turbo（openai/whisper；权重 MIT），用于转写参考音频和音色、准备数据集，以及计算契约套件的词错误率。代码：`mizuoto/engines/asr`。它不作为合成模型提供。它完全复现 Mizuoto 0.1 运行的东西，即 transformers 4.57.3 的 `pipeline(\"automatic-speech-recognition\")`，给出与 0.1 逐 token 相同的转写结果，在 CPU 上用时约为一半。面向用户的说明见引擎详解。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6555":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-10","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#变体与文件","content":"只有一个变体 `whisper`（目录模型 `asr/whisper-large-v3-turbo`）；模型按 `config.json` 构建，所以同样格式的其他 Whisper 尺寸也能加载。模型目录包含 `config.json`、`generation_config.json`、`model.safetensors`（或 `pytorch_model.bin`）、`preprocessor_config.json`、`tokenizer.json` 和 `tokenizer_config.json`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6556":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-11","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#变体与文件","content":"引擎只响应一个操作 `call(\"transcribe\", {\"path\", \"language\", \"options\"})`，返回 `{text, language, segments, duration}`。`AsrService` 为它持有一把锁，把设置 `tts.asr_beams`（默认 5）作为 `beam_size` 传入，并按音频的 SHA-256、模型和这个束宽缓存转写结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6557":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-12","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#变体与文件","content":"精度：在支持 bf16 的 CUDA GPU 上用 bf16（否则 fp16），其他设备用 fp32；`engines.asr.dtype` 可覆盖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6558":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-13","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#工作原理","content":"0.1 调用流水线时传入 `chunk_length_s=30, batch_size=4, return_timestamps=True`，任务和语言作为生成参数。引擎的做法相同：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6559":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-14","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#工作原理","content":"按 soundfile 的方式读取 WAV（各声道取平均），用 soxr（其默认的 HQ）重采样到 16 kHz。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6560":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-15","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#工作原理","content":"没有指定语言时，在前 30 秒上识别语言（解码器在语言 token 上走一步）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6561":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-16","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#工作原理","content":"音频切成 30 秒的窗口，两侧各重叠 5 秒；每个窗口的特征按 `WhisperFeatureExtractor` 的方式计算；每次 `generate` 调用处理四个窗口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6562":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-17","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#工作原理","content":"`generate` 带时间戳解码每个窗口，用 5 束的束搜索，并在窗口内运行 Whisper 的 seek 循环。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6563":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-18","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#工作原理","content":"流水线的 `_decode_asr` 把各窗口的 token 合并成文本和带时间戳的分段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6564":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-19","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#工作原理","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"6565":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-20","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#工作原理","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"6566":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-21","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#工作原理","content":"`engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6567":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-22","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#工作原理","content":"0.1 的流水线：读取、重采样、语言识别、窗口、`generate`、合并","locale":"zh-CN"},"6568":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-23","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#工作原理","content":"`model.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6569":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-24","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#工作原理","content":"按 transformers 4.57.3 的计算方式实现的 `WhisperForConditionalGeneration`（SDPA 路径、编码器的数值截断、交叉注意力缓存）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6570":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-25","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#工作原理","content":"`decoding.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6571":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-26","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#工作原理","content":"生成设置、按 transformers 顺序排列的 logits 处理器、向量化的束搜索、贪心解码、seek 循环","locale":"zh-CN"},"6572":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-27","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#工作原理","content":"`text.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6573":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-28","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#工作原理","content":"按 `WhisperTokenizerFast` 的方式解码、语言 id、窗口边界、`decode_asr`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6574":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-29","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#工作原理","content":"共享模块：`nn/dsp/mel.py`（`hf_whisper_filters`、`hf_whisper_log_mel`）、`nn/dsp/wav.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6575":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-30","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#与上游一致的做法","content":"**5 束。** 流水线的默认生成配置（`num_beams=5`）优先于模型的贪心默认值，所以无论 `beam_size` 怎么设，0.1 总是用 5 束解码；选项 `beam_size` 为 1 时保持这 5 束，更大的值则设定束数。0.1 从不传这个选项；Mizuoto 传入 `tts.asr_beams`，默认值 5 得到与 0.1 相同的转写。束搜索是 transformers 4.57 向量化的 `_beam_search`（先 log-softmax，再经处理器，`2 × beams` 个候选）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6576":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-31","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#与上游一致的做法","content":"**每个窗口内的 seek 循环。** 每个窗口都补齐到 30 秒；以一对时间戳结束的解码会从该时间戳重新解码（特征平移，后面补零），时间戳对之后的 token 被丢弃。`_decode_asr` 为重新开始的时间戳重新定基，并合并重叠的窗口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6577":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-32","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#与上游一致的做法","content":"**特征**来自 transformers 的 `WhisperFeatureExtractor`，使用它自己的 float64 slaney 滤波器组和转置后的乘法，而不是 openai-whisper 的 log-mel。Turbo 的 `tokenizer_config.json` 设置了 `clean_up_tokenization_spaces`（\" .\" 变成 \".\"），按分段应用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6578":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-33","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#与上游一致的做法","content":"**注意力**：先投影查询再乘以 `head_dim ** -0.5`，SDPA 使用 `scale=1`，q、k、v 都是连续张量；解码器在多 token 提示上为无掩码的因果注意力，每个新 token 不加掩码，缓存按拼接增长。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6579":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-34","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#有意的差异","content":"**模型独立实现。** CosyVoice 的语音分词器里也有一个 Whisper 编码器，但那里用的是 openai 的注意力（q 和 k 各乘以 d^-¼，带掩码），是另一种计算，所以两者不共用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6580":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-35","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#有意的差异","content":"**精确的捷径**：只有一个窗口时复用语言识别时的编码器输出；所有束的行逐位相同时不重排交叉注意力缓存。两者都不改变任何 token。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6581":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-36","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#显存","content":"每次转写一个阶段：整个模型，解码器标为 `hot`（它按 token 和束运行），`kind=\"sequence\"`。开启 `compute.oom_fallback` 时，显存不足的转写改为一次解码一个 30 秒窗口而不是四个；这是另一种批形状，所以在罕见的并列情况下转写结果可能不同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6582":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-37","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#对照结果","content":"在 CPU 上以 fp32 运行，转写结果与 0.1 完全相同：在 57 段语料音频（自动识别或指定语言）和 6 段 50–124 秒的音频上，文本、分段、语言以及每个窗口的 token 都相同；模块层面还包括特征和 `_decode_asr`（3000 个随机生成的窗口）。完整链路中需要转写参考音频的对照用例（一个 Qwen3-TTS 克隆和一个 CosyVoice 2 克隆）也完全相同，所以契约套件的词错误率不变。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6583":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-38","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#对照结果","content":"在完整链路中，`scripts/parity/cases/asr.jsonl`（七段 4–120 秒的音频，英文、中文和混合，自动识别或指定语言）在 CPU 上以 fp32 运行和在 GPU 上（RTX 3090，2026-10-19）运行，都给出与 0.1 完全相同的转写：语言、文本以及每个分段的时间戳。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6584":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-39","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"`paraformer` 变体（模型目录中的 `asr/paraformer-zh`，权重为 Apache-2.0）就是 FunASR 的 `AutoModel(model=paraformer-large, vad_model=fsmn-vad, punc_model=ct-punc).generate(input=path)`，也就是 GPT-SoVITS 的 `tools/asr/funasr_asr.py` 用于中文的“达摩 ASR”：普通话夹带英文单词，带标点，数字写成汉字。代码在 `mizuoto/engines/asr/paraformer`，移植自 FunASR 1.4.21（MIT）。设置 `tts.asr_model_zh = \"asr/paraformer-zh\"` 后，下载完成即用于语言为中文的音频（`AsrService.model_for`）；其他语言仍用 Whisper。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6585":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-40","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"**文件。** 模型文件夹就是识别模型的 ModelScope 仓库（`model.pt`、`config.yaml`、`am.mvn`、`tokens.json`），VAD 在 `vad/`，标点模型在 `punc/`，各自固定到其提交；三者都在 `mizuoto-model` 镜像上。`AsrEngine` 按文件夹区分变体（`config.yaml` 写明 `Paraformer`，旁边有 `vad/` 和 `punc/`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6586":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-41","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"6587":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-42","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"6588":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-43","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"`paraformer/engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6589":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-44","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"`inference_with_vad` 在 CPU 上的流程：读取、重采样、VAD、逐段识别、拼接、加标点","locale":"zh-CN"},"6590":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-45","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"`paraformer/model.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6591":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-46","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"`WavFrontend`（Kaldi fbank、LFR 7/6、CMVN）、`SANMEncoder`（50 层）、`CifPredictorV2`、`ParaformerSANMDecoder`、贪心解码","locale":"zh-CN"},"6592":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-47","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"`paraformer/sanm.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6593":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-48","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"SAN-M 层（带 FSMN 记忆块的注意力），识别模型和标点模型共用","locale":"zh-CN"},"6594":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-49","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"`paraformer/vad.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6595":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-50","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"FSMN-VAD：`WavFrontendOnline`、FSMN，以及文件推理驱动下的流式状态机","locale":"zh-CN"},"6596":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-51","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"`paraformer/punc.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6597":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-52","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"CT-Transformer：分词、带延续的小句、标点规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"6598":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-53","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"`paraformer/text.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6599":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-54","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"`sentence_postprocess`（词元转文本、英文单词、缩写）和 `_join_vad_texts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6600":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-55","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"**与上游一致之处。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6601":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-56","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"音频按 `torchaudio.load` 的方式读取，用 `torchaudio.transforms.Resample` 重采样（`nn/dsp/resample.Resample`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6602":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-57","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"FSMN-VAD 的分段与 FunASR 1.4.21 相同：按 60 秒分块，前端保留的样本、LFR 上下文、FSMN 的记忆和状态机都跨块延续；动态静音表取代配置中的结束静音（先 2 秒，在语音中跨过块边界后为 0.2 秒）和语音阈值（0.5）；超过 60 秒的语音在 60 秒处切开。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6603":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-58","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"每段单独识别，从短到长，与 FunASR 在 CPU 上的做法相同（`batch_size = 0`）；特征带 `dither` 1.0（Paraformer 前端的默认值）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6604":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-59","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"随机数：上游的 dither 取自 torch 的全局生成器，而它的层堆叠（`MultiSequential`）每次前向都为每层抽取一个均匀随机数，用于推理时不起作用的层丢弃。两者都会推进下一段 dither 所用的生成器；移植版按同样的顺序从同一个生成器抽取两者。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6605":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-60","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"文本：去掉特殊词元，拼合英文子词，连续的单字母合成一个大写词；各段文本拼接时汉字之间不加空格；CT-Transformer 以 20 个词为一个小句，把每个小句最后一个句末标点之后的词带到下一个小句，并遵循它的规则（小句开头的 ASCII 词前加空格、句号后首字母大写、末尾补 `。`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6606":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-61","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"**有意的差异。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6607":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-62","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"**dither 的生成器每次转写都以 0 为种子。** 上游的全局生成器停在其进程上一次留下的位置（FunASR 只在构建模型时设一次种子，构建模型又会从中抽取），所以上游对同一段音频每次的识别结果都可能不同。这里的转写结果等于上游在 `generate` 前生成器处于种子 0 时的结果，且每次都相同（转写结果按音频缓存）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6608":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-63","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"**在 GPU 上同样逐段识别。** 上游在 GPU 上会把最长 300 秒的分段补齐后成批识别，这会改变结果；这里在 GPU 上沿用 CPU 的顺序。GPU 上的结果与 CPU 不逐位相同（在 RTX 3060 上，16 段音频中 14 段相同，两段嘈杂的合成音频相差几个字）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6609":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-64","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"**显存。** 三个句柄，各占一个阶段：VAD（2 MB）处理整段音频，识别模型（880 MB）逐段运行，标点模型（290 MB，主要是 272,727 词的嵌入表）处理文本；在任何设备上都用 float32。在 RTX 3060 上一次转写的 torch 分配峰值为 1.1 GB（模型目录中的 `vram_mb` 为 1,200）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6610":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-65","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#paraformer中文","content":"**对照结果。** 在 CPU 上以 fp32（8 线程）与 FunASR 1.4.21 对照 16 段音频（12 段 3–7 秒，来自八个引擎；4 段 60–124 秒，其中两段中英混合）：每份转写和每个 VAD 分段都相同；模块层面的特征、编码器、预测器、解码器、VAD 每块的得分（另有 11 个边界情况：静音、噪声、短于 0.5 秒的音频、恰为或接近 60 秒整数倍的音频）以及标点模型的 logits（32 段文本，包括小句延续）都逐位相同；文本后处理在 14,000 组随机词元上相同。工作区为 `experiment/paraformer`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6611":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-66","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#限制","content":"语音识别在 Mizuoto 内部使用，不作为合成模型提供，也不出现在 `GET /v1/models` 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6612":{"id":"/docs/engines-asr-67","page_id":"/docs/engines-asr","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-asr#限制","content":"显存不足时的回退方式在罕见的并列情况下可能改变转写结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6613":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","type":"page","content":"CosyVoice","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","引擎参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","locale":"zh-CN"},"6614":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-0","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","content":"Mizuoto 中实现的 CosyVoice 引擎：CosyVoice 1、2、3，由 ONNX 文件构建的语音分词器和 CAM++，语言模型、flow 与 HiFT，哪些做法与上游完全一致、为什么完整链路不是逐位一致，GPU 解码路径，LLM 与 flow 微调，以及对照结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6615":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-1","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"变体与文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"6616":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-2","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh-CN"},"6617":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-3","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"与上游一致的做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"6618":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-4","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#有意的差异","content":"有意的差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"6619":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-5","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#为什么完整链路不是逐位一致","content":"为什么完整链路不是逐位一致","locale":"zh-CN"},"6620":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-6","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#显存与速度","content":"显存与速度","locale":"zh-CN"},"6621":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-7","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#训练","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"6622":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-8","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#对照结果","content":"对照结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"6623":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-9","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#限制","content":"限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"6624":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-10","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","content":"阿里通义的 LLM + 流匹配语音合成（QwenAudio/CosyVoice，Apache-2.0）。代码：`mizuoto/engines/cosyvoice`。给定相同的音色提示，它在 CPU 上与上游（torch 2.8）逐采样相同，覆盖每个模型和每种模式；在完整链路中两边各自生成音色提示，结果一致到 23–68 dB SNR，原因见下文。训练器产出的检查点与上游逐字节相同。面向用户的说明见 引擎详解。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6625":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-11","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"6626":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-12","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"目录模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"6627":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-13","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"采样率","locale":"zh-CN"},"6628":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-14","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"语言模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"6629":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-15","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"Flow","locale":"zh-CN"},"6630":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-16","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"声码器","locale":"zh-CN"},"6631":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-17","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"`v1_base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6632":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-18","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"`cosyvoice/cosyvoice-300m`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6633":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-19","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"22.05 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"6634":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-20","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"`TransformerLM`：Conformer 文本编码器 + transformer，Whisper 的词表","locale":"zh-CN"},"6635":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-21","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"`MaskedDiffWithXvec`：Conformer、长度调节器、Matcha U-Net","locale":"zh-CN"},"6636":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-22","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"HiFT","locale":"zh-CN"},"6637":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-23","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"`v1_sft`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6638":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-24","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"`cosyvoice/cosyvoice-300m-sft`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6639":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-25","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"22.05 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"6640":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-26","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"同 `v1_base`，带预置说话人","locale":"zh-CN"},"6641":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-27","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"同 `v1_base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6642":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-28","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"HiFT","locale":"zh-CN"},"6643":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-29","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"`v1_instruct`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6644":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-30","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"`cosyvoice/cosyvoice-300m-instruct`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6645":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-31","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"22.05 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"6646":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-32","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"同 `v1_base`，带指令","locale":"zh-CN"},"6647":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-33","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"同 `v1_base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6648":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-34","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"HiFT","locale":"zh-CN"},"6649":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-35","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"`v2`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6650":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-36","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"`cosyvoice/cosyvoice2-0.5b`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6651":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-37","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"24 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"6652":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-38","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"基于 Qwen2-0.5B 的 `Qwen2LM`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6653":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-39","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"`CausalMaskedDiffWithXvec`：因果 U-Net","locale":"zh-CN"},"6654":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-40","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"HiFT","locale":"zh-CN"},"6655":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-41","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"`v3`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6656":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-42","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"`cosyvoice/cosyvoice3-0.5b`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6657":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-43","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"24 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"6658":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-44","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"`CosyVoice3LM`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6659":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-45","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"`CausalMaskedDiffWithDiT`：22 层 DiT","locale":"zh-CN"},"6660":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-46","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"因果 HiFT，F0 预测器用 float64","locale":"zh-CN"},"6661":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-47","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"变体由目录中的 yaml 决定（`cosyvoice.yaml`、`cosyvoice2.yaml`、`cosyvoice3.yaml`）；带 `spk2info.pt` 的 CosyVoice 1 目录是 SFT 或 Instruct。目录中有 yaml、`llm.pt`、`flow.pt`、`hift.pt`、`campplus.onnx`、`speech_tokenizer_v1.onnx` / `v2` / `v3`、`spk2info.pt`，v2/v3 还有 `CosyVoice-BlankEN` 的配置和分词器（不含其权重，`llm.pt` 会替换它们）。共享资源 `cosyvoice/wetext` 存放文本规范化用的 FST。ONNX 模型只转换一次，缓存为 `<model>/.mizuoto/converted-<key>.safetensors`（ONNX 文件旁的 `<name>.safetensors` 优先）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6662":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-48","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"能力：预置说话人、指令、克隆与跨语种克隆、音色转换、流式输出，v2/v3 还有流式文本输入。精度：fp32；加载选项 `fp16` 让语言模型和 flow 在 CUDA autocast 下运行，与上游的 `fp16` 相同。上游在整个生成过程中只用一个 autocast 区域；这里每个 token 在各自的区域中运行（引擎只在 `next()` 中运行），而 autocast 只在一个区域内保留权重的 float16 副本，于是每个 token 都要把语言模型的全部权重重新转换一次：`fp16` 最多比 fp32 慢一倍，而且使用 CUDA graphs 时第一个请求的音频与之后的请求以及即时执行路径都不同。现在在 `fp16` 下，语言模型的线性层直接以 float16 保存权重，即 autocast 计算时所用的值（`_half_linears`，加载时完成；嵌入和归一化保持 float32，与 autocast 的计算方式相同）：每个请求都得到即时执行路径的音频，无论是否使用 graphs，比 fp32 快 1.7–1.8 倍（性能）。快速模式（加载选项 `fused_projections`，CosyVoice 2 和 3）：Qwen2 语言模型的 q/k/v 与 gate/up 投影各合并为一次乘法（`QwenDecoder.fuse`，与 Qwen3-TTS 的相同），输出中会注明；在 CPU 上结果相同，在 RTX 3060 上用 fp32 时相同且每秒音频快 1%，用 `fp16` 时快 2–5%，音频会改变。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6663":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-49","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"音色提示由参考音频分三路生成：16 kHz 音频 → Whisper log-mel → **语音分词器**的 token；16 kHz 音频 → kaldi fbank → **CAM++** 的 192 维说话人嵌入；以及始终为 24 kHz 的 Matcha mel，即使是 22.05 kHz 的 CosyVoice 1 也一样。**语言模型**把文本（以及提示的文本和 token）变成语音 token；**flow** 用 10 步欧拉、引导强度 0.7 把 token 变成 mel；**HiFT**（带神经源滤波器和逆 STFT 的 HiFi-GAN）把 mel 变成音频。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6664":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-50","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"6665":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-51","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"6666":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-52","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"`engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6667":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-53","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"前端、`CosyVoiceModel.tts`（token、mel、波形）、流式分块、音色转换、流式文本、音色缓存","locale":"zh-CN"},"6668":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-54","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"`config.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6669":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-55","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"把 HyperPyYAML 文件当数据读取（`!new:`/`!name:` 读成字典，解析 `!ref` 表达式）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6670":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-56","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"`frontend.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6671":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-57","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"用 wetext 的 `text_normalize`、清理和切分","locale":"zh-CN"},"6672":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-58","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"`tokenizer.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6673":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-59","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"v2/v3：BlankEN 的 Qwen2 BPE 加 CosyVoice 新增的 token；v1：Whisper 的 tiktoken 词表","locale":"zh-CN"},"6674":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-60","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"`llm.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6675":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-61","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"三种语言模型、重复感知采样（RAS）、流式文本的交错（5 个文本 : 15 个语音）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6676":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-62","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"`flow.py`、`dit.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6677":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-63","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"三种 flow；CosyVoice 3 的 DiT 估计器","locale":"zh-CN"},"6678":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-64","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"`train.py`、`sft.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6679":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-65","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"`CosyVoiceTrainer`（方法 `llm`、`llm_flow`）及其计算","locale":"zh-CN"},"6680":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-66","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"共享：`nn/codecs/s3tokenizer.py`（由 ONNX 文件构建的 v1–v3 语音分词器）、`nn/speaker/campplus.py`（按 ONNX 图的形式实现的 CAM++）、`nn/transformer/wenet.py`、`nn/flow/unet1d.py`、`nn/transformer/dit.py`、`nn/vocoders/hift.py`、`nn/dsp/`（`mel`、`kaldi`、`resample`、`wav`、`flac`）、`runtime/convert/onnx.py`、`runtime/lm/qwen.py`、`runtime/graphs.py`、`text/normalize/wetext.py`、`text/tokenize/`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6681":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-67","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**尺寸来自 yaml。** 各模块的尺寸取自模型自己的 yaml（HyperPyYAML 的标签当数据读取），而不是写在代码里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6682":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-68","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**不用 onnxruntime 的语音 token 和 CAM++。** 语音分词器是 s3tokenizer 的 torch 模型，权重从 ONNX 文件读出；在测试语料上，v1、v2、v3 的编码都与 onnxruntime 相同。CAM++ 照搬导出的计算图（卷积后的 batch norm 已折叠，与导出时一样），与 onnxruntime 的相对误差约 1e-6，并非逐位一致。无论设备是什么，CAM++ 都在 CPU 上运行，与上游一致（上游只用 onnxruntime 的 CPU provider）：在 GPU 上，它的卷积让嵌入偏离 2.4e-4，而不是 5e-7。语音分词器在设备上运行，与上游一致（CUDA provider）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6683":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-69","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**提示 mel** 在每个版本都是 24 kHz 的 Matcha mel；v2/v3 严格保持每个提示 token 对应两帧 mel。v3 丢弃长于五个的静音 token 串，并加上它的系统提示（`You are a helpful assistant.<|endofprompt|>`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6684":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-70","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**按 transformers 4.51 的方式运行 Qwen2。** CosyVoice 2/3 的语言模型原本跑在 transformers 4.51 上，那里的 SDPA 路径总是重复 KV 头，并让 q、k、v 连续（`QwenConfig.sdpa_gqa=False`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6685":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-71","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**噪声。** v2/v3 的 flow 噪声是上游以种子 0 生成的缓冲（前 1×80×15000 个正态抽样）。`randn_like(x)` 保留 `x` 的步长，所以当 `x` 是转置的（HiFT 的正弦源）时，抽样落入元素的顺序与 `randn(shape)` 不同：`nn.vocoders.hift.randn_like` 用生成器填充 `empty_like(x)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6686":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-72","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**CosyVoice 3 的声码器噪声**在上游构建模型时抽取一次，位于 flow 的种子 0 噪声以及 flow 和 F0 预测器的默认初始化之后。`cosyvoice3_noise` 在私有生成器上重放这些抽样，因此数值与上游相同，而那块 259 MB 的缓冲从不真正生成。它的 F0 预测器以 float64 运行，所以权重归一化也在 float64 中折叠。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6687":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-73","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**抽样顺序。** 非流式时按上游的顺序抽样（语言模型、v1 的 flow 噪声、声码器噪声）。流式使用上游的分块：v1 每块 100 个 token，重叠 20 个，用 Hamming 窗交叉淡化；v2/v3 从 25 个 token 起翻倍到 100，向前看三个 token。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6688":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-74","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**文本规范化**是移植到 kaldifst 上的 wetext 规范化器，在语料上结果相同；它的 FST 是共享资源 `cosyvoice/wetext`（ModelScope `pengzhendong/wetext`，固定提交）。含 `<|…|>` 的文本不做规范化，与上游一样跳过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6689":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-75","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#有意的差异","content":"**没有语言模型线程。** 上游把语言模型放在声码器旁边的线程里运行；这里它在请求的线程中运行，token 一到就生成分块。上游流式的 v1/v2 在主线程抽取声码器噪声，同时语言模型在另一个线程采样，所以流式音频取决于线程时序；Mizuoto 的声码器从自己的生成器（种子 + 1）抽样，token 与非流式请求相同。CosyVoice 3 的噪声是固定的，流式结果完全相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6690":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-76","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#有意的差异","content":"**0.1 缺少的规范化。** 上游前端在运行时下载 FST；在 0.1 的 worker 中下载失败，上游便静默跳过了规范化。现在 FST 是共享资源，带数字的中文文本会读出数字，因此这类文本听起来与 0.1 不同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6691":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-77","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#有意的差异","content":"**在没有 float64 的设备上**（Apple MPS、Intel Arc），CosyVoice 3 的 F0 预测器留在 CPU 上，模型其余部分照常移动；声码器在自己的设备上把输入交给它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6692":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-78","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#有意的差异","content":"**TensorRT、vLLM 和 JIT**（0.1 的加载选项 `load_trt`、`trt_concurrent`、`load_vllm`）不可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6693":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-79","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#有意的差异","content":"保留上游的行为：流式文本模式下参考音频较长（7 秒）时，语音开头可能是参考音频的最后几个词；用同一参考音频做普通合成则不会。流式文本需要参考文本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6694":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-80","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#为什么完整链路不是逐位一致","content":"在完整链路中，两边各自计算音色提示，而 CAM++ 的嵌入是唯一不逐位一致的部分：与 onnxruntime 相差最多 7e-6（余弦 0.999999999997）。flow 把它放大为最多 2.7e-3 的 mel 变化，HiFT 的正弦源又把 F0 积分进相位（对整句做 float32 累加，九个谐波），误差沿着句子增长：在一个 CosyVoice 3 英文克隆上，每半秒的 SNR 从 66 dB 降到 20 dB。上游同样敏感：它自己的声码器链喂入 Mizuoto 的嵌入，得到的正是 Mizuoto 的音频；它自己的 onnxruntime CAM++ 用 8 个线程而不是 1 个，得到 31 dB；同等大小的随机扰动得到 20–33 dB。CosyVoice 2/3 的语言模型从不使用说话人嵌入，所以语音 token 相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6695":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-81","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#显存与速度","content":"阶段：前端（语音分词器和 CAM++）只在音色未缓存时和音色转换时使用；语言模型（`kind=\"sequence\"`）生成 token；flow 和 HiFT 把它们说出来。流式时语言模型和 flow 同时在设备上。HiFT 的 F0 预测器标记为 `fixed`（HiFT 会读取它的设备）。语言模型的工作内存是按上游上限（300 个位置的提示之后每个文本 token 20 个语音 token）计算的缓存，按模型实际的 KV 宽度（Qwen2 的两个 KV 头），每个头组重复一层的副本，再加 512 MB。`compute.kv_cache = static` 为 Qwen2 模型预分配缓存（在 CPU 上结果相同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6696":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-82","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#显存与速度","content":"**CUDA 上的解码（CosyVoice 2/3）。** 上游的采样器在排序后的概率上跑 Python 循环：每保留一个 token 就把累计和读回，把概率拷到主机再拷回，在主机上检查重复窗口：每个 token 约 50–80 次等待设备，另外还有 24 层逐个以 eager 方式启动。在 CUDA 上，`llm._Steps` 每个 token 只等待设备一次，抽出相同的 token：nucleus 循环在设备上对排序后的前 25 个 token 重放（在分数的 dtype 中做同样的 0 维加法；抽样用 `multinomial` 自己的 `argmax(p / Exp(1))`，其前 *n* 个指数抽样正是 *n* 元素抽样所用的那些），对 1 到 25 的每个 *n*、在 fp32、fp16 和 bf16 下，token 和生成器状态都与上游循环相同。出现重复后的重采样仍以 eager 方式进行。开启 `compute.cuda_graphs`（NVIDIA，语言模型完整位于设备上）时，单 token 步骤以 CUDA 图运行在注意力调用两侧，抽样作为一个 CUDA 图；每个 token 都把 CUDA 图的生成器与请求的生成器同步，因为 CosyVoice 3 的流式 flow 会在 token 之间从中抽样。真实的 CosyVoice 2 模型在有无 CUDA 图时给出相同的 token，每个 token 约快七倍。其他设备沿用上游的循环。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6697":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-83","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#显存与速度","content":"`compute.compile` 包装 flow 估计器。在 CPU 上没有收益（U-Net 的卷积和矩阵乘法已经是库内核）；mel 与 eager 相差不超过 5.7e-6，HiFT 由 F0 驱动的源把它放大到音频中约 1e-2（47 dB），换一个线程数的 eager 运行也会如此。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6698":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-84","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#训练","content":"方法 `llm` 和 `llm_flow`（阶段 `features`、`llm`、`flow`、`export`；起点为 CosyVoice 1、2 或 3）：上游的 LibriTTS 流程和 `bin/train.py`，不需要 onnxruntime、pyarrow、pyworld、transformers、deepspeed 或 torchrun。在 CPU 上（gloo，world size 1）它与上游的损失、准确率、学习率和 `epoch_<N>_whole.pt` 逐字节相同，覆盖三代模型，数据加载 worker 为 0 或 2 个，以及在 epoch 结束时剩余未满的梯度累积；特征（语音 token 和 CAM++）给出 onnxruntime 的 token，嵌入相差不超过 6e-6。上游只在 CUDA 上训练；这个训练器在所有设备类型上都能运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6699":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-85","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#训练","content":"**参考实现**是在模型构建完成后用阶段的种子给生成器播种的上游：上游在 yaml 中播种 1986（其 v2/v3 flow 在构建时又重新播种 0），然后抽取随机初始化，而这里在训练前不做任何抽样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6700":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-86","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#训练","content":"**数据加载。** 每个加载 worker 对自己的分片跑完整个流水线；分片（每片 1000 段音频）少于 worker 时，每个 worker 都读所有分片，所以默认两个 worker 时每段音频每个 epoch 出现两次，与上游相同。打乱顺序从 `Random(base_seed + k)` 抽样；批次轮流来自各 worker；特征在单线程上生成，与 worker 中一样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6701":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-87","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#训练","content":"**每个 epoch 以一轮验证结束**（在训练列表上，与上游相同），验证同样会抽样（Qwen2LM 的双流选择、flow 的流式选择、条件和噪声）。它的损失写入日志，不作为指标。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6702":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-88","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#训练","content":"**裁剪顺序。** 参数按上游的顺序裁剪（`sft._ORDER`），因为总范数按这个顺序求和；检查点保持上游的键顺序，Qwen 绑定的 `lm_head` 与嵌入共享存储。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6703":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-89","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#训练","content":"**Qwen2 在 transformers 4.51 的加性掩码下训练**（`causal_mask_451`）；记录的 `loss` 除以累积步数，与上游的记录方式相同；CosyVoice 1 保留流程中的 `WarmupLR`（2500 步）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6704":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-90","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#训练","content":"0.1 无法训练 CosyVoice 2 或 3（上游需要一个任何模型都没有附带的 `speech_tokenizer_v*.batch.onnx`）。Mizuoto 的导出在两种实现中都能加载，给定相同的音色提示时两边说出的结果相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6705":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-91","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#训练","content":"`training.memory`：对语言模型或 flow 的各个块做梯度检查点，损失和权重都相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6706":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-92","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#对照结果","content":"参考实现是 torch 2.8 上的上游（在它自己的 torch 2.3.1 上，它与自己在 2.8 上的结果不一致）。把上游的音色提示同时喂给两边时，克隆（英文、带数字的中文）、跨语种克隆、指令、预置说话人、流式音频和音色转换在 v1、v2、v3 上都逐采样相同。在完整链路中两边各自生成提示：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6707":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-93","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#对照结果","content":"大多数 v2 用例：45.5–68.3 dB SNR；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6708":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-94","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#对照结果","content":"CosyVoice 3 英文克隆：约 23 dB（CAM++ 的浮点噪声，见上文）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6709":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-95","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#对照结果","content":"SFT 中文用例和 v2 中文克隆的长度不同，来自文本规范化；两边都关闭规范化时，前者完全相同，后者只差 CAM++ 的噪声；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6710":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-96","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#对照结果","content":"训练交叉加载用例（一种实现的导出由另一种实现说出）：57.4 dB 和 38.1 dB。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6711":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-97","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#对照结果","content":"契约套件通过（18 项测试）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6712":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-98","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#对照结果","content":"在 GPU 上（RTX 3090，2026-10-19，逐阶段与 torch 2.8 上的上游对照）：把上游的 CAM++ 嵌入喂给 Mizuoto 时，v2 和 v3 的英文克隆都逐采样相同；这需要把 HiFT 的权重归一化在设备上按 F0 预测器的 dtype 折叠（上游每次调用都在设备上计算它）。两边各自计算嵌入时，v2 克隆也完全相同（它的 flow 吸收了 CAM++ 的 5e-7），v3 为 14.2 dB，与 CPU 上一样来自 CAM++ 的噪声。上游在它自己的 torch 2.3.1（cuDNN 8.9）上与它在 torch 2.8 上的结果在第一个卷积处就不同，所以对照采用 2.8。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6713":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-99","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#限制","content":"在完整链路中，结果与上游非常接近但不逐位一致，因为 CAM++ 与 onnxruntime 不是逐位一致的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6714":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-100","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#限制","content":"流式的 CosyVoice 1/2 音频不等于上游的流式音频（后者取决于线程时序）；这里的结果可以复现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6715":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-101","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#限制","content":"快速解码路径仅限 CUDA。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6716":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","type":"page","content":"F5-TTS","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","引擎参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-f5tts","locale":"zh-CN"},"6717":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-0","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts","content":"Mizuoto 中实现的 F5-TTS 引擎：v1 Base、v0 Base 和 E2，DiT 与 UNetT，CFM 采样器与 Vocos，哪些做法与上游完全一致，显存与编译说明，全量微调，以及对照结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6718":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-1","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"变体与文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"6719":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-2","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh-CN"},"6720":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-3","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"与上游一致的做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"6721":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-4","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#有意的差异","content":"有意的差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"6722":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-5","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#显存与速度","content":"显存与速度","locale":"zh-CN"},"6723":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-6","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#训练","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"6724":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-7","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#对照结果","content":"对照结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"6725":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-8","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#限制","content":"限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"6726":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-9","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts","content":"一个流匹配语音合成：在参考音频的 mel 谱之后补全新的 mel 谱，再用 Vocos 转成音频（SWivid/F5-TTS；代码 MIT，预训练权重 CC-BY-NC-4.0）。代码：`mizuoto/engines/f5tts`。在 CPU 上以 fp32、同一种子运行时，三个模型的克隆和语音编辑都与 Mizuoto 0.1 完全相同，它的训练器也逐字节给出 0.1 导出的权重。面向用户的说明见引擎详解。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6727":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-10","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"6728":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-11","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"目录中的模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"6729":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-12","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"主干网络","locale":"zh-CN"},"6730":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-13","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"`v1_base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6731":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-14","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"`f5tts/v1-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6732":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-15","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"DiT（宽 1024、22 层），文本填充被掩码","locale":"zh-CN"},"6733":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-16","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"`base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6734":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-17","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"`f5tts/base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6735":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-18","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"只在一个头上用旋转位置编码的 DiT（`pe_attn_head = 1`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6736":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-19","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"`e2_base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6737":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-20","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"`f5tts/e2-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6738":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-21","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"E2-TTS 的 UNetT：带跳连的扁平 transformer，x-transformers 的 RMSNorm","locale":"zh-CN"},"6739":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-22","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"三者都能克隆（必须有参考文本）和编辑语音。模型目录包含检查点（`*.safetensors`，否则 `*.pt`）、`vocab.txt` 以及 `vocos/config.yaml` + `vocos/pytorch_model.bin`。E2 的仓库没有词表，所以上游自带的 `vocab.txt` 作为包数据随引擎发布，供它使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6740":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-23","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"精度：计算能力 7 及以上的 CUDA GPU 上用 fp16，与上游的 `load_checkpoint` 判断相同；其他设备用 fp32。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6741":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-24","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"文本（参考文本加上新文本，汉字转成带声调的拼音）经 ConvNeXtV2 块嵌入；transformer 以参考音频的 mel 为条件，预测从噪声到 mel 帧的流；ODE 求解器在固定的时间网格上积分，无分类器引导作为一个大小为 2 的批次计算；Vocos 把 mel 转成 24 kHz 音频。没有时长模型：长度来自参考音频的语速，或者来自 `duration`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6742":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-25","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"6743":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-26","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"是什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"6744":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-27","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"`engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6745":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-28","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"参考音频预处理、分块、`CFM.sample`（带种子的噪声、EPSS 或 sway 时间网格、Euler 或中点法步、引导）、Vocos、交叉淡化；`edit` 按上游的 `speech_edit.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6746":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-29","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"`text.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6747":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-30","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"字符与拼音（`f5_tts.model.utils`）、上游的分块","locale":"zh-CN"},"6748":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-31","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"`vocab.txt`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6749":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-32","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"上游自带的词表","locale":"zh-CN"},"6750":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-33","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"`train.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6751":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-34","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"`F5Trainer`（方法 `full`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6752":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-35","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"共享：`nn/transformer/dit.py`（AdaLN-zero、ConvNeXtV2 文本块、交错式旋转位置编码）、`nn/transformer/unett.py`、`nn/flow/cfm.py`（`odeint_fixed`、`epss_timesteps`、`sway`）、`nn/vocoders/vocos.py`、`nn/dsp/mel.py`、`nn/dsp/resample.py`、`nn/dsp/tiles.py`、`runtime/compile.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6753":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-36","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**参考音频**按 `preprocess_ref_audio_text` 的方式裁剪和填充，响度调到 `target_rms`，用 torchaudio 的 `Resample` 重采样。pydub 的 50 毫秒填充按 `audioop.ratecv` 的帧数复现（`edge_pad`：24 kHz 下 1198 个采样，而不是 1200），因为 Python 3.13 已经没有 `audioop`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6754":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-37","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**文本。** 以单字节字符结尾的参考文本会补一个空格，与 `infer_batch_process` 相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6755":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-38","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**分块**按上游的方式切分，按顺序生成，并用上游的交叉淡化拼接；`duration` 也按上游的方式分摊到各块。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6756":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-39","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**ODE。** torchdiffeq 固定网格的 Euler 和中点法步即 `nn.flow.cfm.odeint_fixed`；步数为 5、6、7、10、12 或 16 时用上游的 Empirically Pruned Step Sampling 网格，否则用线性网格加 sway 采样。噪声按上游的方式抽取，逐条、以模型的 dtype。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6757":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-40","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**x-transformers 的交错式旋转位置编码和 RMSNorm** 原样移植。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6758":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-41","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**GPU 上的精度。** 与上游相同，模型*先*转换到它的 dtype，再复制检查点，所以在 GPU 上旋转位置编码的 `inv_freq` 也是 fp16，角度以 fp16 计算。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6759":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-42","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#有意的差异","content":"**按顺序生成各块。** 上游在一个共享全局随机数生成器的线程池里生成长文本的各块，所以它自己的输出取决于线程时序；0.1 的适配层按顺序生成，Mizuoto 也是如此。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6760":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-43","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#有意的差异","content":"只提供 Vocos 声码器；上游 v0 模型的 BigVGAN 版本不在模型目录中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6761":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-44","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#显存与速度","content":"两个阶段：transformer 加 mel（每个 ODE 步；引导使批次翻倍）和 Vocos。开启 `compute.oom_fallback` 时，若 Vocos 显存不足，它会以 256 帧为一块分块解码，每块两侧各带上样本所依赖的 29 帧（它的卷积核和逆 STFT 的窗口）：与整段的样本只差求和的舍入（`applied.fallbacks` 会注明）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6762":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-45","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#显存与速度","content":"`compute.compile` 用 `torch.compile(dynamic=True)` 包装 DiT 或 UNetT。在 CPU 上以 fp32、8 线程运行时，transformer 预热后的耗时下降 23 %（一个请求从 60 秒降到 45 秒）；第一个请求要付出约 30 秒的编译时间；音频与 eager 的差异在 9.2e-5 以内（89 dB）。`compute.cpu_allocator` 和 `compute.cpu_threads` 的 CPU 分配器与线程绑定，能让 F5-TTS 在 Linux 上快 10–20 %，且不改变任何结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6763":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-46","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#训练","content":"方法 `full`（阶段 `prepare`、`train`、`export`）：上游的 `finetune_cli` 方案，不需要 accelerate、datasets、wandb 或 ema_pytorch。两边用同样的种子时，它在 CPU 上逐字节给出 0.1 的损失、学习率和导出的 `model_<update>.safetensors`。（0.1 自己从未播种：它的条件丢弃来自未播种的 `random`。）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6764":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-47","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#训练","content":"**按上游的顺序抽样**：按上游的构建顺序做模型的随机初始化（UNetT 最后才创建一层的跳连投影），前两个 epoch 各一个数据加载 worker 的种子（持久化的加载器；accelerate 的 `skip_first_batches` 副本会遍历 epoch 0），然后每个批次依次是片段、噪声、时间、两次 `random()` 调用和 dropout 掩码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6765":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-48","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#训练","content":"**第 *e* ≥ 1 个 epoch 用种子 666 + *e* − 1 打乱**：accelerate 的加载器会把采样器的 epoch 重置为它自己的迭代次数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6766":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-49","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#训练","content":"**mel 在单线程上计算**，与上游的加载 worker 相同；线程更多会改变滤波器组乘积的求和。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6767":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-50","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#训练","content":"**导出**保留使用上游键名的 EMA 权重、词表和声码器，所以 0.1 和 Mizuoto 都能加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6768":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-51","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#训练","content":"`training.memory`：对 transformer 的块做梯度检查点，结果相同；`low` 把 EMA 副本放在内存里；`lowest` 把 AdamW 的状态也放进去（CPU 上相同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6769":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-52","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#对照结果","content":"全部 6 个完整链路用例在 CPU 上以 fp32 与 0.1 逐采样相同：v1 Base、v0 Base 和 E2 的英文与中文克隆、微调后的模型，以及语音编辑。另有两个用例用一种实现合成另一种实现的训练导出，也都相同。契约套件通过（12 项）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6770":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-53","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#限制","content":"预训练权重是 CC-BY-NC-4.0，基于它们的微调结果也是；输出带有标记。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6771":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-54","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#限制","content":"在 GPU 上模型像上游一样以 fp16 运行；Mizuoto 在那里不提供 fp32 的旋转位置编码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6772":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"page","content":"Fish Speech","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","引擎参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","locale":"zh-CN"},"6773":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-0","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","content":"Mizuoto 单独发行包 mizuoto-fishspeech 中实现的 Fish Speech 引擎：S2 Pro 的双自回归 transformer 与 44.1 kHz 编解码器，Drama 3 的混合专家主干与码本塔，哪些做法与上游完全一致，每帧只等待设备一次与 CUDA 图，按行流式加载的专家，LoRA 微调，以及对照结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6774":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-1","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#变体与文件","content":"变体与文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"6775":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-2","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh-CN"},"6776":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-3","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#与上游一致的做法","content":"与上游一致的做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"6777":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-4","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异","content":"有意的差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"6778":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-5","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#显存与速度","content":"显存与速度","locale":"zh-CN"},"6779":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-6","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#训练","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"6780":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-7","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#对照结果","content":"对照结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"6781":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-8","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#限制","content":"限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"6782":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-9","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#drama-3","content":"Drama 3","locale":"zh-CN"},"6783":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-10","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh-CN"},"6784":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-11","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#与上游一致的做法-1","content":"与上游一致的做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"6785":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-12","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#cuda-图","content":"CUDA 图","locale":"zh-CN"},"6786":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-13","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异-1","content":"有意的差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"6787":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-14","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#显存与速度-1","content":"显存与速度","locale":"zh-CN"},"6788":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-15","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#对照结果-1","content":"对照结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"6789":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-16","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","content":"Fish Audio S2 Pro 与 Drama 3（fishaudio/fish-speech）。S2 Pro 及其移植版采用 Fish Audio Research License；Drama 3 及其移植版（`mizuoto_fishspeech/drama3`，移植自 fish-speech 0f8a12e8）采用 Fish Audio Community License 1.0（见 Drama 3）。移植版受这些许可约束，所以作为单独的发行包发布：`mizuoto-fishspeech`（`packages/native/fishspeech`，包名 `mizuoto_fishspeech`，附 `LICENSE.md` 与 `drama3/LICENSE.md`），注册在入口点组 `mizuoto.engines` 下（`fishspeech = mizuoto_fishspeech:FishSpeechEngine`）。下载模型和合成都需要先接受许可。在 CPU 上以 fp32、相同种子运行时，它的编码和音频与 Mizuoto 0.1 所运行的上游带种子 `generate_long` 完全相同，训练器导出的模型与 0.1 逐位相同。面向用户的说明见 引擎详解。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6790":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-17","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#变体与文件","content":"两个变体。`s2_pro`（目录模型 `fishspeech/s2-pro`，本页 Drama 3 之前的内容都关于它）：用一到四段参考音频克隆，每段都带参考文本；行内标签；说话人之间的对话（`<|speaker:i|>`）。模型目录中有 `config.json`、权重（`model.safetensors.index.json` 及其分片、`model.safetensors` 或 `model.pth`）、`codec.pth` 和 BPE 分词器文件。音色缓存是 `codes.pt`，即每段参考音频的编码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6791":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-18","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#变体与文件","content":"精度：与上游相同，CUDA GPU 上用 bf16；其他设备用 fp32（bf16 在 CPU 上是模拟的，慢得多）；`engines.fishspeech.dtype` 可以覆盖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6792":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-19","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"提示是一段 ChatML 对话：一条系统消息，包含每段参考音频的文本及其编码，然后是要说的文本。**慢 transformer**（Qwen3-4B 的形状：36 层，q/k RMSNorm，一个融合的 `wqkv`）生成每帧的语义 token；**快 transformer**（4 层）根据慢模型归一化后的隐藏状态生成其余九个码本。**编解码器**（改造过的 44.1 kHz DAC：因果卷积、窗口化 transformer、下采样残差量化器，含一个 4096 的语义码本和九个 1024 的码本；约每秒 21.5 帧）编码参考音频，并把帧解码成音频。文本按说话人轮次分批生成，每批完成即解码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6793":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-20","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"6794":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-21","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"6795":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-22","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"`engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6796":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-23","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"读取参考音频、重采样到 44.1 kHz 并编码；按说话人轮次分批生成；编解码器解码；`codec_encode` 和 `codec_decode` 操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"6797":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-24","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"`model.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6798":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-25","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"双自回归 transformer","locale":"zh-CN"},"6799":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-26","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"`generate.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6800":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-27","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"对话提示、按上游顺序采样、轮次分组、带 CUDA 图的解码器（`Decoder`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6801":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-28","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"`fused.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6802":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-29","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"`compute.compile`：用 `torch.compile` 编译的解码步骤各部分（`Fused`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6803":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-30","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"`codec.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6804":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-31","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"44.1 kHz 编解码器","locale":"zh-CN"},"6805":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-32","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"`train.py`、`finetune.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6806":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-33","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"`FishSpeechTrainer`（方法 `lora`）及其计算","locale":"zh-CN"},"6807":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-34","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"共享：`text/tokenize/bpe.py`、`runtime/lm/cache.py`、`runtime/graphs.py`、`nn/dsp/`（`resample`、`wav`、`flac`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6808":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-35","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#与上游一致的做法","content":"**提示**是上游的对话，每个文本部分单独分词；每帧的主 token 是 `semantic_begin_id + code`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6809":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-36","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#与上游一致的做法","content":"**采样**按上游的顺序从请求的生成器抽样：主 token 抽两次（先用请求的温度和 top-p，再用 1.0 和 0.9 做重复感知采样），然后是快 transformer 的九次抽样。一次抽样就是 `argmax(probs / -log(u))`。top-k 固定为 30，与上游相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6810":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-37","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#与上游一致的做法","content":"**数值**：Fish 的 RMSNorm 在 float32 中计算；RoPE 作用于相邻元素对，频率表舍入到 bfloat16；预填充用带布尔因果掩码的 SDPA，解码步骤用 SDPA 的 math 内核（直接调用，不改进程级设置；布尔掩码先变成加性掩码，与 `F.scaled_dot_product_attention` 的做法相同：直接给内核布尔掩码时，它会把掩码当作数值相加；在 0.2.6 之前每一步的分数都被加了 1，CPU 上编码相同但数值位不同，GPU 上 bfloat16 下则是另一次生成）；快 transformer 用手写的 softmax。权重归一化保留检查点的两种格式，并在每次前向时重新计算，与上游相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6811":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-38","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#与上游一致的做法","content":"**参考音频**用 torchaudio 的内核重采样到 44.1 kHz。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6812":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-39","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#与上游一致的做法","content":"**WAV 输出。** `codec_decode` 用 `nn.dsp.wav.write_wav` 写 WAV，与 `soundfile.write` 逐字节相同：libsndfile 1.2 存储裁剪后的 `lrint(x × 2³¹) >> 16`，也就是 `floor(x × 32768)`，只有略低于一个台阶的值例外。`codec_encode` 只读 WAV。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6813":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-40","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异","content":"**没有守护线程，也没有预分配 32 768 个位置的缓存。** 缓存通过拼接增长；经过 `repeat_interleave` 后，键和值就是上游构造的那些张量。注意力掩码按调用生成，而不是上游那 4 GiB 的掩码缓冲。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6814":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-41","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异","content":"**不构建上游从不运行的编解码器模块。** 上游的编解码器为解码器第一个块构建了一个 transformer，却从不接上它（没有权重，从不运行）。`codec.pth` 里还有旧版上游保存的 RoPE 表和掩码，上游已不再加载，这里也忽略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6815":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-42","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异","content":"**接受但无效果**：`normalize` 和 `repetition_penalty` 在上游的推理路径中不起任何作用，所以这里也不起作用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6816":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-43","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异","content":"**在 GPU 上编码参考音频。** 上游在 GPU 上以 bf16 加载编解码器，而 `encode_reference` 传给它 float32 的音频，所以在 GPU 上克隆会失败（`Input type (float) and bias type (c10::BFloat16) should be the same`；已用 0.1 在 RTX 3090 上复现）。移植把参考音频转换为编解码器的精度；在 CPU 上（fp32）没有任何变化。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6817":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-44","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异","content":"**GPU 上的 Snake** 是上游的 TorchScript 函数，按 TorchScript 的方式计算，而不是按即时执行同样的代码来计算：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6818":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-45","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异","content":"**在 autocast 下**（以 bf16 或 fp16 解码）全程以 float32 计算。即时执行的 autocast 会让 `alpha · x` 和正弦保持低精度；移植在 mizuoto-fishspeech 0.3.3 之前就是这样，在 RTX 3060 上它解码的音频与上游最多相差 0.036。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6819":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-46","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异","content":"**没有 autocast 时**（编码参考音频）各运算原地执行，结果相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6820":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-47","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异","content":"**与上游对比：** 关闭 TorchScript 的融合器时，在 RTX 3060 上以 bf16 运行，移植的编解码器给出与上游逐位相同的参考编码和解码音频（Drama 3 的 `codec.pth`，S2 Pro 用的是同一个文件；三段音频）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6821":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-48","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异","content":"**上游的融合内核：** 从某个形状的第二次调用起，上游的 TorchScript 会融合 Snake，这会改变舍入，并取决于进程之前运行过什么。与之相比，解码音频相差在 0.01 以内，参考编码约五分之一不同。按融合内核的方式以 float32 计算 Snake 并只舍入一次，仍有 8–14 % 的编码不同，所以没有哪种固定的计算能跟上它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6822":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-49","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#显存与速度","content":"阶段：编解码器编码参考音频并解码每批帧；语言模型（`kind=\"sequence\"`，快 transformer 为 `hot`）生成每一批，生成继续时重新放置。每批的工作内存是慢模型缓存的真实上限：参考音频的编码、每个文本 token、之前各批的帧和 `max_new_tokens`，不超过 `max_seq_len`。在默认设置下（bf16），S2 Pro 最多占用 10.2 GB 显存（性能 上的 G13）；不够时运行时会流式加载部分权重。开启 `compute.oom_fallback` 时，如果编解码器解码显存不足，它的卷积解码器按 256 个潜在帧（约 3 秒）一块解码，每块之前带上第一个样本所依赖的 20 帧（解码器是因果的），量化器部分整段运行：与整段的样本只差求和的舍入（GPU 上 bf16 下 SNR 40 dB，而 bf16 与 float32 相比为 37.9 dB），60 秒只需 275 MB 而不是 5 GB。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6823":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-50","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#显存与速度","content":"一帧是一次慢 transformer 步骤加十个码本。原本的循环每帧约等待设备 22 次：轮次结束检查；把非语义 token 的码本嵌入置零的掩码赋值（`vq_sum[~mask] = 0` 会把掩码读回）；用列表下标取快 transformer 的掩码和旋转编码行（每个码本两次拷贝到设备）；采样器中把 Python 布尔值存入设备张量，每次抽样两次。它们都换成了完全等价的写法（`torch.where`、切片、`fill_`），解码步骤的掩码直接按它本来的样子生成为一行全真。每帧只剩一次等待。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6824":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-51","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#显存与速度","content":"开启 `compute.cuda_graphs`（NVIDIA，模型完整位于设备上）时，`generate.Decoder` 为每个已加载的模型保留固定张量：慢步骤在两次注意力调用之间的每一段作为一个 CUDA 图运行（`LayerSteps`），该帧的抽样、重复感知采样和快 transformer 作为一个 CUDA 图。采样设置是按请求填充的设备张量，所以一套 CUDA 图服务所有请求。编码完全相同，解码循环每帧快 2.2–2.5 倍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6825":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-52","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#显存与速度","content":"在空闲的 RTX 3060 上，使用 CUDA 图时完整模型的一帧约需 64 毫秒。其中约 50 毫秒用于以接近显卡带宽的速度读取 16 GB 权重；其余大部分是数千个小内核。`compute.compile`（可选，不精确；`fused.py`）把它们融合：它在同样的 CUDA 图里编译每层注意力前后的两半、缓存上的注意力、这一步的嵌入和输出头以及采样的概率；关闭时即时执行的代码不变。这样每帧快 1.15 倍。采样不变，但概率的最后几位不同，所以语音是同一文本和音色的另一次生成，在相同种子下仍可重复，并通过契约测试。它只在模型完整位于其设备上时运行，输出会注明（`applied[\"compile\"]`）。详见加速。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6826":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-53","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#训练","content":"方法 `lora`（阶段 `tokens`、`train`、`export`）：上游的 `extract_vq`、`build_dataset`，以及基于 Lightning + Hydra、使用 loralib 的 `train.py` 和 `merge_lora`，但不需要这些库，也不需要 protobuf。以相同方式播种时，它在 CPU 上的编码、损失、LoRA 权重和导出的 `model.pth` 与 0.1 逐位相同，导出的其他文件逐字节相同。（0.1 从不播种，所以只有第一步能复现。）它在所有设备类型上都能运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6827":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-54","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#训练","content":"**跳过初始化抽样。** 上游在加载检查点之前先用随机权重构建模型，并在抽取 `A` 之前把每个 loralib 层初始化两次：约 18 G 次抽样。`initial_lora` 只根据形状算出这些抽样让生成器前进多少（float32 的 `normal_` 或 `uniform_` 前进其大小，大小不是 16 的倍数时 `normal_` 再多 16），然后在 GF(2) 中把 MT19937 向前跳（`mizuoto.training.rng`）：用 2 秒而不是 40 秒的抽样得到同样的状态，在加载权重的同时在另一个线程中计算。随后是加载器的基础种子和每一步的 LoRA dropout 掩码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6828":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-55","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#训练","content":"**与上游相同的混合精度。** 检查点中的张量按上游的方式赋值，所以 S2 的归一化层保持 bfloat16，而 LoRA 层持有 float32 副本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6829":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-56","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#训练","content":"**保留**：上游的训练前向不像推理那样把码本嵌入乘以 1/√11；预热让第一步的学习率为 0，`B` 从零开始，所以前两步的损失相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6830":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-57","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#训练","content":"**填充。** 整理器用 `<|end_of_text|>` 填充，而 S2 的词表里没有它：上游实际以 0 填充，Mizuoto 也是。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6831":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-58","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#训练","content":"**导出**是上游扁平的 `dual_ar` 形式（`config.json` + `model.pth`），0.1 和 Mizuoto 都能加载。最后一轮验证被跳过（它不改变任何保留下来的东西）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6832":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-59","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#训练","content":"`training.memory`：上游的逐层检查点保持原样；在 `bf16-true` 下，LoRA 层直接把检查点自己的 bfloat16 张量当作冻结的权重（从 safetensors 文件内存映射，不复制：数值相同），导出的键顺序从一个在 meta 设备上构建的模型中读取。在 S2 Pro 上实测（2026-10-19，RTX 3090）：训练阶段的进程加载时只占 0.4 GB 自有内存（用 bfloat16 副本时为 8.9 GB，用 float32 副本时为 17 GB），常驻峰值 5 GB；导出阶段持有合并后的权重 9 GB，另有映射的检查点（页缓存）。`lowest` 下，LoRA 线性层的冻结权重留在锁页内存中，每次矩阵乘法时复制到 GPU（`streamed_linear`，模型放到设备时不带它们）：结果相同（在 CPU 上比较微型训练器的损失值和 LoRA 权重）；S2 Pro 的 LoRA 在批量 2 下峰值从 15.6 GB 降到 7.9 GB（RTX 3060，经其 PCIe x4 链路每步 15.6 秒），默认批量 4 估算为 12.6 GB。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6833":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-60","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#对照结果","content":"在 CPU 上以 fp32 运行时，编码与上游带种子的 `generate_long` 相同；分词器、参考音频的重采样和编码以及编解码器的解码也都相同。两个完整链路用例（英文和中文克隆）逐采样相同；另外两个用例让每种实现加载另一种实现的导出，结果也相同。契约套件通过（6 项测试）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6834":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-61","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#限制","content":"完整运行模型（S2 Pro）需要约 10 GB 显存；在 CPU 上以 fp32 运行，速度慢。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6835":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-62","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#限制","content":"`normalize` 和 `repetition_penalty` 没有效果（与上游相同），top-k 不能更改。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6836":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-63","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#限制","content":"结果受 Fish Audio Research License 约束：不可商用，也不能用于训练其他引擎。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6837":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-64","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#drama-3","content":"变体 `drama3`，目录模型 `fishspeech/drama-3`（fishaudio/drama-3 的 78e5ab79，41.5 GB：专家为分块 FP8 的权重，以及 S2 的 `codec.pth`，与 S2 Pro 的逐字节相同）。移植自 fish-speech 0f8a12e8（`fish_speech/models/text2semantic/fish_omni` 与 `generate_long_drama3`），即 `mizuoto_fishspeech/drama3`。它用一到四段参考音频克隆（每段带参考文本），没有参考音频时用自带的音色说话，接受写在文本中的指示（`[whispering]`、`[laughing]`、`<whisper>…</whisper>`），最多十六个说话人（`<|speaker:0|>`…`<|speaker:15|>`；参考文本可以以其说话人标签开头）。许可：Fish Audio Community License 1.0，是该变体自己的许可（`variants.drama3.licence`）；接受引擎的许可即同时接受两份，它的结果标记为 `fish-audio-community`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6838":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-65","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"6839":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-66","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"6840":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-67","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"`drama3/config.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6841":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-68","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"`config.json`：主干的文本配置、码本塔的配置、语义区间，按上游的方式检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"6842":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-69","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"`drama3/layers.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6843":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-70","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"零中心 RMSNorm、部分 RoPE（前后两半）、带门控的 softmax 注意力、Gated DeltaNet（先一个因果深度卷积，再门控 delta 规则：提示按 64 一块分块计算，之后逐 token 递推）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6844":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-71","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"`drama3/moe.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6845":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-72","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"每层 256 个路由专家（每个 token 用 8 个）和一个带门控的共享专家；专家堆叠存放，保持 FP8，按行流式加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"6846":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-73","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"`drama3/backbone.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6847":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-74","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"Qwen3.5-MoE 的混合文本模型（40 层，每第四层为 softmax 注意力）及其 `lm_head`；加载逐专家的 FP8 张量","locale":"zh-CN"},"6848":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-75","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"`drama3/tower.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6849":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-76","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"码本塔：4 个共享层和 9 个残差层，在帧序列上做注意力，每个残差层的输出头抽取下一个编码；两种采样器","locale":"zh-CN"},"6850":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-77","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"`drama3/prompt.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6851":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-78","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"提示（一段对话：带 `[Reference i]` 块的系统轮、作为已完成轮次的前面片段、未结束的语音轮），文本检查，长文本切分及其历史","locale":"zh-CN"},"6852":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-79","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"`drama3/generate.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6853":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-80","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"以 128 行为一块的预填充（同时以教师强制填充码本塔的缓存），解码循环（`Decoder`），一段接一段","locale":"zh-CN"},"6854":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-81","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"`drama3/steps.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6855":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-82","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"解码步骤以围绕注意力调用的 CUDA 图运行（`Stretches`），及其固定张量","locale":"zh-CN"},"6856":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-83","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"`drama3/engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6857":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-84","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"`LoadedDrama3`：S2 的编解码器、参考音频处理与操作（继承 `LoadedFishSpeech`），加上主干和码本塔","locale":"zh-CN"},"6858":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-85","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理-1","content":"一帧是十个编码：主干根据已有的帧预测该帧的主 token（轮次结束，或一个语义 token，它在区间中的位置就是编码 0），提示中每一行的嵌入是其 token 的嵌入，音频行再加上它的编码 1（乘以 1/√2）。然后码本塔接过主干的隐藏状态，逐个抽取编码 1–9，每个编码一个残差层；第一个共享层还会看到上一帧的编码 2–9。文本按约 300 个 UTF-8 字节、每段最多三个说话人切分（先按句末，再按分句标点，再按空格；不会切开标签或方括号），每段生成时都把第一段和最近一段作为历史放进提示；`single_chunk` 一次生成全文。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6859":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-86","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#与上游一致的做法-1","content":"在 CPU 上，上游的模块与移植版给出的隐藏状态、logits、帧和音频逐位、逐采样相同（见下文 对照结果）。具体包括：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6860":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-87","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#与上游一致的做法-1","content":"**每个运算都按上游的顺序**：归一化在 float32 中计算，旋转表每次调用时计算，delta 规则对提示用分块形式（每块 `solve_triangular`），对单步用递推形式，GQA 注意力（单个查询行时把每个键头的查询头折叠成行；多行时重复键头）经 `mizuoto.runtime.accel.attention` 以 SDPA 和布尔掩码计算，码本塔的交错式 RoPE，以及 float16 下输出为 float32 的下投影；float16 下专家先在 float32 中反量化并截到 float16 的范围再转换，与上游的稠密专家相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6861":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-88","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#与上游一致的做法-1","content":"**专家**：不超过 64 个（token, 专家）对时，对取出的专家做一次批量矩阵乘法（解码步）；更多时逐个专家计算，按专家顺序用 `index_add_` 在 float32 中累加（提示）：两条路径的结果位不同，所以两者都保留。路由的 softmax 和 top-k 在 float32 中计算，权重重新归一化。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6862":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-89","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#与上游一致的做法-1","content":"**提示**：每段字面文本单独分词，参考音频按上游的方式检查和加标签；切分（上游测试中的用例即本包的测试）和历史（固定第一段，加上最近一段；提示超过 8192 行时从最旧的开始丢弃）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6863":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-90","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#与上游一致的做法-1","content":"**采样**按上游的顺序从请求的生成器抽取：每帧先抽两次主 token（用请求的设置在“轮次结束 + 语义区间”上抽一次，再用 1.0、top-k 30、top-p 0.95 抽一次；第一次是最近 16 个主 token 中出现过的音频 token 时用第二次的结果），再抽九个编码。每次抽取是 `argmax(p / E)`，`E ~ Exp(1)`。`sampler` 选项可选用 Fish Audio 的参考采样器（`reference_argmax` / `reference_ras`，即上游的 `--reference-sampling`）：主 token 有 epsilon 截断（`epsilon_cutoff`，默认 0.001），任何重复的主 token 都会被替换（包括轮次结束），编码只从编解码器的 1024 个中抽取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6864":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-91","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#与上游一致的做法-1","content":"**上游的限制**：提示最多 8192 行，总共最多 10 240 行（上游 CUDA 图的容量；每段的帧数被截到剩余的行数），默认值与 Fish Audio SDK 相同（temperature 0.7、top-p 0.7、top-k 30、每段 1024 帧；`max_new_tokens = 0` 时为 600，`single_chunk` 时为 2048）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6865":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-92","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#与上游一致的做法-1","content":"**编解码器**：S2 的编解码器，权重归一化在转换到模型精度之前先在 float32 中折叠一次（上游为 Drama 3 加载编解码器的 `load_codec_model`），在该精度的 autocast 下解码；参考音频也用它编码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6866":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-93","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#cuda-图","content":"开启 `compute.cuda_graphs`（NVIDIA GPU 且能完整容纳主干和码本塔：bfloat16 下约 44 GB）时，解码步骤以重放即时执行核函数的 CUDA 图运行（`drama3/steps.py`、`generate.Decoder`）。一步先是码本塔的图（输出头、该帧的抽样，13 层中每两次注意力调用之间一个图），再是主干对这一帧的图（10 个 softmax 注意力层中每两层之间一个图，其间的 Gated DeltaNet 层、路由和专家都在图内）。注意力调用在图与图之间即时执行，读取每步增长一行的缓存，所以缓存和注意力核函数都与即时执行的代码相同。每步只等待设备一次，读取该帧的主 token 以及 logits 是否有限。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6867":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-94","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#cuda-图","content":"**固定张量**随已加载的模型保留：步骤的输入与输出（最后的隐藏状态、位置、上一帧、最近 16 个主 token（不足时以 −1 填充）、该帧及其标志），以及 Gated DeltaNet 层的状态：图会原地更新它们，每个请求从零开始。注意力层的缓存仍然属于各个请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6868":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-95","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#cuda-图","content":"**采样设置按即时执行的代码传入的方式捕获**，即 Python 数值：CUDA 除以一个数时按乘以其倒数计算，除以设备张量时按真正的除法计算，改用张量会改变结果位。请求的 temperature、top-p、top-k、采样器或截断不同时，码本塔的图（14 次捕获）会重新捕获；主干的图保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6869":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-96","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#cuda-图","content":"**上游自己的图没有移植**：它们为几个缓存长度（1024、2048、4096、10 240）捕获整步，在填充并加掩码的缓存上计算注意力，采样设置为设备张量，与上游自己的即时解码相比结果位不同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6870":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-97","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#cuda-图","content":"**流式加载专家时即时解码**：GPU 放不下整个模型时专家按行流式加载，而一步要复制哪些行要从设备读出，图无法等待它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6871":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-98","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#cuda-图","content":"在 CPU 上按 `Graphs` 的约定检查（每段先预热、再捕获，并恢复其状态，然后重放）：两种采样器、多段文本、后续请求以及改变设置时都得到即时执行的音频（`test_the_step_as_graph_stretches_decodes_exactly_as_eagerly`）。在 NVIDIA GPU 上，`test_cuda_graphs_decode_exactly_as_eagerly_on_a_gpu`（bfloat16 和 float16）与 `test_a_failed_capture_falls_back_to_the_same_audio_on_a_gpu` 在小模型上比较图与即时解码；没有 GPU 时跳过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6872":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-99","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异-1","content":"**设备与精度。** 上游只在 NVIDIA GPU 上以 bfloat16 运行 Drama 3（SM80 之前用 float16，残差流为 float32）；它的入口拒绝 CPU 和 float32。移植版在所有设备上运行，在 CPU 上用 float32（与 S2 Pro 相同）：对照的基准是上游的模块原样在 CPU 上以 float32 运行的结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6873":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-100","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异-1","content":"**专家保持 FP8**，每次调用用到的专家在运行时反量化，上游在其 FP8 核函数不运行的地方也是这样做的；上游的另一条路径在加载时把全部专家反量化。两者给出相同的数值（小模型对照把两者都与移植版比较）：专家占 32 GB，而 bfloat16 下是 64 GB，float32 下是 129 GB。**上游的 W8A8 核函数**（Triton，SM89 及以上，它还把激活量化为 FP8）没有移植：它的结果不同，只能作为可选项提供，而且这里无法测量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6874":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-101","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异-1","content":"**没有多 GPU 分层，也不在请求之间保留缓存。** 上游把层分布到最多四块 GPU 上，并按至今最大的请求保留缓存；这里由模型管理器放置各层（放不下的部分流式加载），每个请求有自己的缓存。两种方式下注意力都只读取已关注的前缀。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6875":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-102","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异-1","content":"**非有限的 logits** 与上游一样会被拒绝，但每帧只检查一次（在该帧唯一一次等待设备时），而不是每次抽取前检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6876":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-103","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异-1","content":"**音频是各段音频直接拼接**，不裁剪，与上游相同；S2 Pro 的引擎会裁剪每一批。该变体声明了 `long_text`，所以 Mizuoto 把整段文本交给引擎，上游的切分与历史都会生效（如果由 Mizuoto 切成单独的请求，历史就无法跨越它们）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6877":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-104","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异-1","content":"**Mizuoto 对所有引擎都会做的预处理**在这里同样适用：文本和每段参考文本会去掉首尾空白；参考音频在音色库中存为单声道 16 位 WAV（浮点、24 位或立体声的音频会被转换，因此其编码可能与上游直接读取原文件时不同）；超过 30 秒的参考音频按 `tts.reference_policy` 截短；种子不能为负（上游取绝对值）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6878":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-105","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异-1","content":"**没有移植的**：上游为 Drama 3 写的 CUDA 图（它们会改变结果位；Mizuoto 的图重放即时执行的核函数，见 CUDA 图），它的微调（上游在加入 Drama 3 时删除了训练代码，所以 LoRA 方法只适用于 S2 Pro），以及跨轮次的“导演式修改”（不在开源代码中）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6879":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-106","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#显存与速度-1","content":"句柄：主干（`kind=\"sequence\"`；每层两个单元，注意力为 `hot`，其次是 MoE；输出头为 `hot`）、码本塔（`sequence`）和编解码器。专家**按行流式加载**（开发：显存）：某层的 MoE 单元不常驻时，它的 256 个专家留在页锁定的主机内存中，每次调用只复制其 token 被路由到的专家（一个解码步：每层 8 个，约 25 MB；一个提示块：逐个专家），所以远小于模型的 GPU 也能运行。完整运行模型需要约 44 GB；其稠密部分（注意力、共享专家、嵌入和输出头、码本塔）在 bfloat16 下约 7.5 GB。每个请求的工作内存：softmax 层和码本塔对请求行数（最多 10 240）的缓存、DeltaNet 状态、一个提示块的激活值，以及一步反量化的专家。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6880":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-107","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#显存与速度-1","content":"在 CPU 上以 float32、16 个线程运行时，每帧约 2.1 秒，上游的模块同样如此（一秒语音是 21.5 帧：约 45 秒计算）；230 行的提示约 35 秒。在 GPU 上，放下整个模型需要约 44 GB，否则专家（30 GiB）从内存流式传输；内存也放不下时，放不下的那些层的专家保存在文件中（`runtime.filemap`，见显存）。2026-11-05 第一次在 GPU 上运行：RTX 3060（12 GB，PCIe x4），机器内存 31 GB，bf16：GPU 上 9.1 GB，锁页内存中 17.0 GB 专家，文件中 20.7 GB；预热后合成 5.5–8.3 秒语音用时 128–162 秒（每次请求向 GPU 复制 176–226 GB，1.4 GB/s），两次运行完全相同；其中 15–32 GiB 从磁盘读取，文件中的专家其余部分来自页缓存（72–87%）；可用内存从未低于 7.9 GB。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6881":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-108","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#显存与速度-1","content":"在 RTX 3060 上运行过一个随机模型，形状与真实模型相同，只有 8 个专家（2026-11-03，torch 2.8，bf16，设备上 8.5 GB）。每个 token 仍使用 8 个专家，所以一个解码步骤的工作量与真实模型相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6882":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-109","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#显存与速度-1","content":"**速度：** 150 帧即时执行用 19.2 秒，使用 CUDA 图用 16.3 秒，快 1.18 倍（每帧 128 → 109 毫秒），音频相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6883":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-110","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#显存与速度-1","content":"**使用图时的帧：** 每帧约 7,250 个内核，设备 97 % 的时间在忙。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6884":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-111","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#显存与速度-1","content":"**小型测试模型：** 快 2.1 倍（每个请求 1.56 → 0.74 秒），音频也相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6885":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-112","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#对照结果-1","content":"与上游自己的模块（fish-speech 0f8a12e8）在 CPU 上以 float32、相同种子和线程数、真实模型对照（2026-11-01；工作区 `experiment/fish-drama3`，`scripts/real_upstream.py`、`real_native.py`、`real_compare.py`）：七个用例中，参考音频的编码、每段的编码和音频都**逐采样相同**：英文和中文克隆、无参考音频、行内标签（`[laughing]`、`[whispering]`）、两段参考音频的双人对话、参考采样器（`reference_ras`，截断 0.002），以及带历史、分两段生成的长文本（542 帧，25 秒）。对照之前先确认上游自身能完全重复。上游按其 `TTSInferenceEngine` 处理请求的方式运行（参考音频经它的加载器和编解码器，`set_seed`，`generate_long_drama3`，它的编解码器解码），移植版按服务器的方式运行（`synthesize`）。在小型随机模型上（`scripts/tiny_parity.py`），另外十二个用例（不限制 top-k、temperature 1.2 下 top-k 10、单段、`max_new_tokens = 0`、带成对标签的中文……）在 float32 和 bfloat16 下、与上游的 FP8 专家和反量化专家相比都相同，主干的隐藏状态和 logits 逐位相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6886":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-113","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#对照结果-1","content":"对照上游源码的审查发现 Mizuoto 会自行切分 Drama 3 的长文本（已修复：该变体声明了 `long_text`），以及 float16 下专家没有截断（已修复），另有“有意的差异”中列出的请求层面差异。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6887":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","type":"page","content":"GPT-SoVITS","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","引擎参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","locale":"zh-CN"},"6888":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-0","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","content":"Mizuoto 中 GPT-SoVITS 引擎的实现：v2、v2Pro、v2ProPlus、v4 和 v5 Turbo，带有移植的转换器和模型的文本前端，T2S 模型、SoVITS 与流模型，哪些做法与上游完全一致，GPU 解码，写出上游文件的音色微调，以及对照结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6889":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-1","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"变体与文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"6890":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-2","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh-CN"},"6891":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-3","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"与上游一致的做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"6892":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-4","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#有意的差异","content":"有意的差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"6893":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-5","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#显存与速度","content":"显存与速度","locale":"zh-CN"},"6894":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-6","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#训练","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"6895":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-7","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#对照结果","content":"对照结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"6896":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-8","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#限制","content":"限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"6897":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-9","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","content":"少样本克隆与音色微调（RVC-Boss/GPT-SoVITS，MIT）。代码：`mizuoto/engines/gptsovits`。在 CPU 上以 fp32、相同种子运行时，它在全部 15 个对照用例中都与 Mizuoto 0.1（经适配器调用上游的 `TTS_infer_pack.TTS`）完全相同，训练器写出的上游准备文件和权重也完全一致。面向用户的说明见引擎详解。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6898":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-10","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"6899":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-11","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"目录模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"6900":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-12","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"采样率","locale":"zh-CN"},"6901":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-13","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"第二阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"6902":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-14","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`v2`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6903":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-15","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`gptsovits/v2-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6904":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-16","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"32 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"6905":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-17","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"SoVITS：VITS 解码器（耦合流、HiFi-GAN）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6906":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-18","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`v2pro`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6907":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-19","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`gptsovits/v2pro-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6908":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-20","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"32 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"6909":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-21","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"同 v2，另加说话人验证嵌入（ERes2NetV2）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6910":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-22","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`v2proplus`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6911":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-23","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`gptsovits/v2proplus-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6912":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-24","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"32 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"6913":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-25","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"更大的 v2Pro SoVITS","locale":"zh-CN"},"6914":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-26","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`v4`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6915":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-27","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`gptsovits/v4-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6916":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-28","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"48 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"6917":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-29","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`SynthesizerTrnV3`、带 DiT 的 CFM、48 kHz HiFi-GAN 声码器","locale":"zh-CN"},"6918":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-30","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`v5turbo`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6919":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-31","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`gptsovits/v5turbo-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6920":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-32","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"48 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"6921":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-33","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"同 v4，用 `CFMV5`，四步","locale":"zh-CN"},"6922":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-34","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"变体由模型目录中的基础 GPT 与 SoVITS 权重对决定，目录结构与上游相同：`gsv-v2final-pretrained/…`、`s1v3.ckpt`、`v2Pro/s2Gv2Pro.pth` / `s2Gv2ProPlus.pth`、`gsv-v4-pretrained/{s2Gv4,vocoder}.pth`、`gsv-v5-pretrained/{s2Gv5turbo,vocoder}.pth`。音色自己的权重（`Voice.weights[\"gptsovits\"]`：一个 GPT `.ckpt` 和一个 SoVITS `.pth`，版本从文件读出）会为该音色替换基础权重对。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6923":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-35","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"共享资源：`gptsovits/encoders`（chinese-hubert-base、chinese-roberta-wwm-ext-large、说话人验证检查点）、`gptsovits/g2pw`、`gptsovits/nltk-data`、`gptsovits/open-jtalk`；训练 v2、v2Pro 和 v2ProPlus 还需要预训练判别器 `gptsovits/s2d-v2`、`s2d-v2pro`、`s2d-v2proplus`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6924":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-36","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"精度：在 CUDA GPU 上，`engines.gptsovits.dtype` 为 `auto` 或 `fp16` 时用 fp16，否则用 fp32。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6925":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-37","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"**文本前端**：先做语种切分，再按各语言做字音转换，得到音素 id；中文另有 BERT 特征（chinese-roberta 倒数第三层，按音素重复）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6926":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-38","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"**参考音频**：16 kHz 的音频末尾补 0.3 秒静音；HuBERT 特征经 SoVITS 量化为提示的语义 token；线性频谱供风格编码器使用；v2Pro 另有说话人验证嵌入。v4/v5 还把最后读入的那段音频在 32 kHz 下的梅尔谱作为流模型的提示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6927":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-39","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"**GPT（T2S）**：24 层自回归 transformer，根据提示的音素和 token 以及目标的音素预测 25 Hz 语义 token；批量时左侧补齐，流式时逐行生成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6928":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-40","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"**SoVITS**（v2 系列）把 token、音素和风格解码为 32 kHz 音频；v4/v5 先由流模型生成梅尔谱，再由声码器生成 48 kHz 音频。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6929":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-41","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"**后处理**：每个片段峰值限制为 1，后接片段间停顿，整体截断为 16 位。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6930":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-42","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"6931":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-43","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"6932":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-44","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6933":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-45","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"按 0.1 适配器的调用方式实现的 `TTS.run`：参考音频、文本、长度分桶、T2S、SoVITS 或流模型加声码器、片段、流式","locale":"zh-CN"},"6934":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-46","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`audio.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6935":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-47","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"读取参考音频；用 torchaudio 的内核或上游移植的 resampy `kaiser_best` 重采样","locale":"zh-CN"},"6936":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-48","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`checkpoints.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6937":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-49","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"读取 `.pth`（覆盖在 zip 魔数上的版本标记、MD5 与文件大小规则），以及针对 `HParams` 的受限反序列化器","locale":"zh-CN"},"6938":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-50","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`t2s.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6939":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-51","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"文本到语义模型：批量解码与逐行解码，上游的采样器","locale":"zh-CN"},"6940":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-52","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`sovits.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6941":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-53","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"v2/v2Pro/v2ProPlus 的 `SynthesizerTrn` 解码（不构建后验编码器 `enc_q`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6942":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-54","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`sovits_v3.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6943":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-55","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`SynthesizerTrnV3`、`CFM`/`CFMV5`、GPT-SoVITS 的 DiT 变体、声码器路径、LoRA 合并","locale":"zh-CN"},"6944":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-56","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`vocoder.py`、`sv.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6945":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-57","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"v4/v5 的 48 kHz HiFi-GAN；ERes2NetV2 说话人验证嵌入","locale":"zh-CN"},"6946":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-58","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`text/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6947":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-59","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"前端：`frontend.py`（清洗、`TextPreprocessor`）、切分、语种识别（split-lang、fast-langdetect）、中文（变调、规范化、G2PW）、英文（规范化、词性标注、g2p_en）、日文、韩文（g2pk2）、粤语、符号与数据","locale":"zh-CN"},"6948":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-60","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`train.py`、`train_s1.py`、`train_s2.py`、`s2_modules.py`、`s2_lora.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6949":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-61","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`GptSovitsTrainer`（方法 `speaker`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6950":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-62","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"共享模块：`nn/ssl/hubert.py`、`nn/transformer/`（`bert`、`vits`、`dit`）、`nn/flow/coupling.py`、`nn/speaker/melstyle.py`、`nn/vocoders/hifigan.py`、`nn/dsp/`（`kaldi`、`mel`、`resample`、`swresample`、`wav`、`flac`）、`runtime/convert/onnx.py`（G2PW）、`runtime/graphs.py`、`runtime/compile.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6951":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-63","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"**抽样。** 一个生成器按段重新播种，先抽 T2S 的采样，再抽 SoVITS（或流模型）的噪声，与上游的 `set_seed` 加全局随机流一致。准备参考音频时不抽样（不重放 HuBERT 的层丢弃；0.1 出于同样的原因在播种之前准备参考音频）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6952":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-64","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"**停顿与输出。** 每个片段后的停顿无论输出采样率如何都按 32 kHz 计算，音频截断为 16 位（`(x × 32768).astype(int16)`），与上游的返回值相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6953":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-65","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"**文本前端自己持有用到的一切**，从共享资源路径构建：不改 `nltk.data.path`，没有 fastText 全局变量，也不调用 `logging.basicConfig`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6954":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-66","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"jieba 替代 jieba_fast（同一词典；在 20 446 条文本上结果相同）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6955":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-67","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"OpenCC 用 C++ 版 `opencc==1.4.2`（纯 Python 移植版在 182 814 次转换中有 321 次不同，而这些结果会送入 G2PW）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6956":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-68","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"G2PW 用其 ONNX 权重在 torch 中运行（拼音完全相同）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6957":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-69","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"NLTK 的词性标注器和分词器、g2p_en、g2pk2、split-lang 和 fast-langdetect 都已移植，数据随包提供；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6958":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-70","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"日语需要 `pyopenjtalk==0.4.1`（可选依赖 `mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]`）：pyopenjtalk-plus 修改了 OpenJTalk 的规则，用它时 18 % 的日语句子结果不同。韩语需要 MeCab-ko 和 jamo（可选依赖 `mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]`）。日语用户词典只编译一次，放在共享资源 `gptsovits/open-jtalk` 的 `.mizuoto/` 目录里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6959":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-71","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"**HuBERT 的 float16 检查点**载入 float32 参数，并在 float32 下折叠其权重归一化，与 transformers 的计算方式相同（在 float16 下折叠时特征相差 1e-4）。在 GPU 上，上游对模型调用 `.half()`，transformers 每次调用都在该设备上计算权重归一化，因此在该设备上以 float16 折叠，与其计算结果相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6960":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-72","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"**SoVITS 在 GPU 上的权重归一化**：上游在 v2 和 v4/v5 的合成器上保留它（流模型和解码器的 WaveNet 层、WN 编码器），每次调用都在模型所在设备上按其 dtype（`.half()`）计算；Mizuoto 在加载时于该设备上按该 dtype 折叠（`fold_weight_norm(…, device=)`）。在 CPU 上以 float32 折叠时，约三分之一的权重值不同，输出也随之不同（v2 与 0.1 相比 44 dB）。BERT 走 transformers 的 SDPA 路径，即 transformers 4.57 为 chinese-roberta 选用的路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6961":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-73","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"**微调权重。** 序列化了上游 `utils.HParams` 的 SoVITS 检查点由受限反序列化器读取（张量、`OrderedDict`，`HParams` 作为字典）。v4/v5 的 LoRA 文件不经 peft 合并（在 float32 下 W += B·A·α/r，与 peft 的合并结果相同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6962":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-74","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#有意的差异","content":"**v4/v5 的流模型提示**始终是最后一段辅助参考音频；上游的取决于之前的请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6963":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-75","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#有意的差异","content":"**流式时每段文本都会朗读。** 上游在流式模式下只朗读每组 `batch_size` 中的第一段文本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6964":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-76","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#有意的差异","content":"**出错时抛出错误**，而不是像上游那样返回一秒 16 kHz 静音。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6965":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-77","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#有意的差异","content":"**未移植**：上游的 CUDA 图 T2S（`t2s_accel`，会改变结果）、`set_seed` 对进程级 TF32 的切换，以及超采样（仅 v3，不在模型目录中）。在带 bf16 矩阵单元的 CPU 上，上游的 `set_float32_matmul_precision(\"medium\")` 可能会用到它们；Mizuoto 保持 fp32。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6966":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-78","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#显存与速度","content":"阶段：每次调用文本前端时用 BERT；为参考音频的语义编码同时用 HuBERT 和 SoVITS；说话人验证模型（v2Pro）；GPT；然后是 SoVITS（以及 v4/v5 的声码器）。GPT 整体放置（它的各层直接读取融合后的投影；模型很小，约 150 MB）。音色自己的权重用 `ModelHandle.replace` 换入。GPT 的工作内存按批次中最长的一行估算（其音素、参考音频的编码，以及每个音素 16 个编码，不超过上游的 1500 步）。开启 `compute.oom_fallback` 时，显存不足的批次会改为一次朗读一段文本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6967":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-79","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#显存与速度","content":"GPT 很小，瓶颈在内核启动：一步约 360 个小内核，过去还要等待设备两次（上游的两次序列结束检查），另有 top-p 把一个 Python 布尔值拷到设备上。现在两次检查一起读取（同一个布尔值），拷贝改为 `fill_`：每步只等待设备一次。开启 `compute.cuda_graphs`（NVIDIA，GPT 完整位于设备上）时，单 token 步骤以 CUDA 图运行，图围绕每层的注意力切分，每种行数一组（行在结束后退出）；按拼接增长的缓存和采样仍在请求的生成器上即时执行。音色自己的 GPT 有自己的 CUDA 图。真实的 v2、v2Pro 和 v4 模型在有无 CUDA 图时音频相同，每个请求快 1.3–2.0 倍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6968":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-80","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#显存与速度","content":"`compute.compile` 包装 v4/v5 的 CFM 估计器（每个加载的 SoVITS，包括音色自己的）：在 CPU 上预热后快 7 %，与即时执行相差不超过 3.1e-5（87 dB）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6969":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-81","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#训练","content":"方法 `speaker`（阶段 `text`、`speech`、`semantic`、`sovits`、`gpt`、`export`）：上游自己的流程，不需要 Lightning、torchmetrics、transformers、pandas 或 ffmpeg 程序。导出结果是音色自己的一对权重。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6970":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-82","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#训练","content":"**与上游完全相同的文件。** 每个阶段按上游的目录结构写出上游的文件，与其四个准备脚本的输出完全相同：`inputs.list`、`2-name2text.txt`、`3-bert/`、`4-cnhubert/`、`5-wav32k/`（逐字节）、`7-sv_cn/`、`6-name2semantic.tsv`。上游的 `load_audio` 通过 ffmpeg 程序读取音频；`nn/dsp/swresample.py` 是 libswresample 的默认重采样器，在试过的每种采样率上都与 ffmpeg 7.0.2 相同（soxr 只有 43 dB）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6971":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-83","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#训练","content":"**GPT**（`train_s1.py`）：每一步的损失、准确率、学习率、CPU 生成器状态，以及保存的 `<exp>-e<N>.ckpt`，都与以相同种子运行的 `s1_train.py` 相同（一个和两个 epoch，批大小 1 和 4，DPO）。上游在构建 GPT 时抽样（一个编码器层被深拷贝 24 次，然后是输出头），并为数据加载器的基础种子抽一次；`replay_construction_draws` 重放这些抽样。分桶采样器对全局 `random` 的重新播种改为私有的 `Random(epoch)`。`training_step` 在批次索引大于 0 且能被 4 整除时执行 ScaledAdam 的一步，所以梯度先累积五个批次，并跨越 epoch 边界；学习率调度在第一步之后把学习率锁定为 0.002，而第一步用的是 ScaledAdam 自己的 0.01。这些都保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6972":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-84","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#训练","content":"**SoVITS**（`train_s2.py`）：在 CPU 上以相同种子运行时，每一步的损失与 `s2_train.py` 和 `s2_train_v3_lora.py` 相同，保存的权重逐张量相同（半精度、版本标记、无 `enc_q`），覆盖 v2、v2Pro、v2ProPlus、v4 和 v5 Turbo（梯度累积、梯度检查点、两个 epoch）。v4 和 v5 以 LoRA 训练 SoVITS。上游从一个 `set` 列出音频，顺序随进程变化；这里排序。WaveNet 门控与上游一样用 TorchScript 编译（其梯度与即时执行在最后几位上不同）。没有 `s2d-*` 共享资源时 SoVITS 阶段拒绝运行，与 0.1 相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6973":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-85","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#训练","content":"不写出 Lightning 用于续训的检查点（930 MB）。比较时请使用相同的线程数：CPU 内核按线程数拆分求和。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6974":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-86","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#训练","content":"`training.memory`：speech 阶段在加载说话人模型之前释放 HuBERT；semantic 阶段只把 SoVITS 的 SSL 投影和量化器放到设备上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6975":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-87","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#对照结果","content":"在 CPU 上走完整链路，全部 15 个用例都与 0.1 逐采样相同：克隆（中文、英文）、无参考文本、两段参考音频加语速、在每个标点处切分的批次、串行解码、流式 v2（token 分块、SOLA）和 v4（片段）、v4/v5 的批量与串行流模型，以及带自己 v2Pro 权重的音色。模块层面还包括文本前端（11 种语言模式下的 476 条文本）、HuBERT、BERT、说话人验证模型、LoRA 合并和每条解码路径。另外四个用例让每种实现加载另一种实现训练出的音色，也完全相同。契约套件全部通过（24 项测试）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6976":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-88","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#对照结果","content":"在 GPU 上（RTX 3090，fp16，2026-10-19，逐阶段与 0.1 对照）：码、HuBERT、文本编码器和风格编码器都相同；v2 和 v4 与 0.1 的差别只来自上游的 TorchScript WaveNet 门控（`commons.fused_add_tanh_sigmoid_multiply`）：CUDA 的融合器在它被调用几次之后才编译，所以它的比特取决于进程此前见过的形状。把门控像上游那样脚本化（仅作实验）后，两个用例都与 0.1 逐采样相同；Mizuoto 让门控保持即时执行（v2 48.9 dB，v4 32.4 dB），理由与 VoxCPM 的 Snake 以即时方式运行相同（VoxCPM）：这样每个请求都得到相同的比特。T4 层级判定两者等价。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6977":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-89","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#限制","content":"日语和韩语文本需要对应的可选依赖；缺少时这类文本以 `capability_not_supported` 失败，提示中给出安装命令。pyopenjtalk 0.4.1 是源码包，需要 CMake 和 C++ 编译器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6978":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-90","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#限制","content":"流式时，若中间某块短于 SOLA 重叠长度，会留下一个空片段，上游的后处理会因此报错；保持上游的行为。在 `min_chunk_length` 为 4 时出现过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6979":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","type":"page","content":"IndexTTS","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","引擎参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-indextts","locale":"zh-CN"},"6980":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-0","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts","content":"Mizuoto 单独发行包 mizuoto-indextts 中实现的 IndexTTS 引擎：IndexTTS-1.5、2 和 2.5，带束采样的 GPT-2、条件编码、情感与 s2mel 解码器，哪些做法与上游完全一致，显存与 GPU 解码，以及对照结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6981":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-1","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"变体与文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"6982":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-2","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh-CN"},"6983":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-3","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-indextts#与上游一致的做法","content":"与上游一致的做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"6984":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-4","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-indextts#有意的差异","content":"有意的差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"6985":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-5","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"显存与速度","locale":"zh-CN"},"6986":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-6","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-indextts#训练","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"6987":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-7","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-indextts#对照结果","content":"对照结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"6988":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-8","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-indextts#限制","content":"限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"6989":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-9","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts","content":"哔哩哔哩的零样本语音合成（index-tts/index-tts，bilibili Model Use License）。移植版同样受该许可约束，所以作为单独的发行包发布：`mizuoto-indextts`（`packages/native/indextts`，包名 `mizuoto_indextts`，附 `LICENSE.txt`），注册在 `mizuoto.engines` 下（`indextts = mizuoto_indextts:IndexTtsEngine`）。下载和合成都需要先接受许可，克隆还需要一份同意声明。在 CPU 上以 fp32、相同种子运行时，IndexTTS-1.5、2 和 2.5 在完整链路中与 Mizuoto 0.1 完全相同。面向用户的说明见 引擎详解。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6990":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-10","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"6991":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-11","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"目录模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"6992":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-12","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"采样率","locale":"zh-CN"},"6993":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-13","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"新增内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"6994":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-14","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"`v1_5`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6995":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-15","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"`indextts/v1.5`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6996":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-16","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"24 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"6997":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-17","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"无文本克隆，中文和英文","locale":"zh-CN"},"6998":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-18","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"`v2`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6999":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-19","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"`indextts/v2`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7000":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-20","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"22.05 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"7001":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-21","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"情感来自一段音频、八个权重或一句描述","locale":"zh-CN"},"7002":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-22","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"`v2_5`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7003":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-23","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"`indextts/v2.5`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7004":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-24","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"22.05 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"7005":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-25","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"日语和西班牙语、语言 token，以及语速（`duration_factor = 1 / speed`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7006":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-26","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"1.5 读取 `config.yaml`、其中指定的 GPT 和 BigVGAN 检查点以及 SentencePiece 模型；音色缓存是 `cond_mel.pt`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7007":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-27","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"2 和 2.5 读取 `config.yaml`、`gpt.pth`、`s2mel.pth`、`wav2vec2bert_stats.pt`、说话人与情感矩阵、`glossary.yaml` 和情感模型的目录（`qwen0.6bemo4-merge`）；2.5 还读取 `codec.pth` 和它的 tiktoken 词表。共享资源：`indextts/w2v-bert`、`indextts/campplus`（`campplus_cn_common.bin`）、`indextts/bigvgan`，以及仅 2 需要的 `indextts/semantic-codec`（2.5 从不读取它，所以它的目录条目不下载它）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7008":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-28","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"精度：默认 fp32。在 CUDA GPU 上，`engines.indextts.dtype` 为 `fp16` 时 IndexTTS-2 的 GPT 用 fp16 运行；2.5 在其为 `auto` 或 `bf16` 时用 bf16，与 0.1 的选择相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7009":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-29","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"IndexTTS-2 对每个文本分段：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7010":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-30","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"**音色提示**（随音色缓存）：22.05 kHz 的音频（最多 15 秒）及其 16 kHz 副本；w2v-BERT 2.0 的第 17 层隐藏状态经归一化后作为 GPT 的条件；MaskGCT 语义编解码器把它量化为解码器的提示编码；CAM++ 给出风格；mel 是解码器的提示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7011":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-31","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"**情感**：来自说话人音频本身、另一段音频（按 `emo_alpha` 混合），或通过情感矩阵混入的八个权重（按 CAM++ 相似度选行）；描述由情感模型（Qwen3-0.6B，贪心解码）转换为权重。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7012":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-32","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"**GPT**（`UnifiedVoice`，24 层 GPT-2）：用束采样生成语义编码，再对这些编码做一遍前向以得到隐变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7013":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-33","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"**s2mel**：长度调节器和作为 CFM 的 Seed-VC DiT（25 步欧拉，引导强度 0.7）生成 mel。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7014":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-34","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"**BigVGAN v2** 生成 22.05 kHz 音频；各分段之间插入静音拼接，尾部淡出，结果量化为 16 位，与上游的返回值相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7015":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-35","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"2.5 不用 w2v-BERT 上的 Conformer 和 perceiver，而是用投影后的 CAM++ 嵌入和语言嵌入作为 GPT 的条件；文本通过带 `<|lang|>` 前缀的 tiktoken 读取；编码由它自己的编解码器（RepCodec、Vocos 主干、×2 上采样）转换为解码器特征，而不是用 GPT 的隐变量。1.5 没有情感：参考音频的 log-mel 作为 GPT 的条件，BigVGAN v1 配合其 ECAPA 说话人编码器直接把 GPT 的隐变量变成音频。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7016":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-36","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"7017":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-37","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"7018":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-38","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"`engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7019":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-39","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"`IndexTTS2.infer`（2、2.5）和 1.5 的路径（`LoadedIndexTts15`）：条件编码、情感、分段、DiT、BigVGAN、淡出","locale":"zh-CN"},"7020":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-40","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"`gpt.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7021":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-41","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"`UnifiedVoice`：transformers 4.52 的 GPT-2（`Conv1D` 即 `addmm`、tanh GELU、SDPA）及其基于 `BeamSearchScorer` 的束采样","locale":"zh-CN"},"7022":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-42","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"`conditioning.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7023":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-43","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"IndexTTS 的 Conformer 和 perceiver 重采样器","locale":"zh-CN"},"7024":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-44","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"`codec.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7025":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-45","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"2.5 的 `EnhancedCodec` 解码","locale":"zh-CN"},"7026":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-46","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"`qwen_emotion.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7027":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-47","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"情感模型：Qwen3-0.6B，贪心解码，它的对话模板，把回答解析为八个权重","locale":"zh-CN"},"7028":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-48","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"`text.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7029":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-49","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"1.5/2 的前端：通过 kaldifst 应用的 WeTextProcessing FST（`TnProcessor`）、`TextNormalizer`、SentencePiece、`split_segments`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7030":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-50","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"`text25.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7031":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-51","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"2.5 的前端：标点映射、规范化、日语用 fugashi、带 `<\\|lang\\|>` 的 tiktoken","locale":"zh-CN"},"7032":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-52","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"`assets/tn/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7033":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-53","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"WeTextProcessing 的中英文 tagger 和 verbaliser FST（10 MB）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7034":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-54","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"共享：`nn/ssl/w2vbert.py`、`nn/codecs/repcodec.py`、`nn/transformer/seedvc.py`、`nn/vocoders/bigvgan.py`（v2；v1 配 ECAPA）、`nn/speaker/campplus_torch.py`、`nn/vocoders/vocos.py`、`nn/dsp/`（`seamless`、`kaldi`、`mel`、`resample`、`wav`）、`runtime/lm/qwen.py`、`runtime/sampling.py`、`runtime/graphs.py`、`text/normalize/wetext.py`、`text/tokenize/bpe.py`、`runtime/compile.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7035":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-55","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**按 transformers 4.52 的计算方式实现 GPT-2**：`Conv1D` 即 `addmm`，tanh GELU，SDPA 在提示上因果且不带掩码，在每个新 token 上不带掩码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7036":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-56","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**束采样**，即上游所用的旧版 transformers 路径：log-softmax 依次经过重复惩罚（作用于所有 id，包括提示的占位 id）、温度、top-k 和 top-p（至少保留两个），加上各束的分数，不放回地抽取 `2 × num_beams` 个候选，再由 `BeamSearchScorer` 维护假设。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7037":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-57","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**单束时采样**（`num_beams = 1`），与 transformers 此时的做法相同（`_sample`）：各处理器作用于原始 logits，而不是其 log-softmax（对目前所有 id 的重复惩罚、温度、top-k 和 top-p，至少保留一个），然后每步一次多项式抽样（`gpt.sample_steps`、`runtime.sampling.hf_sample`）。在 CPU 上 1.5、2 和 2.5 都与上游完全相同（用例 `*-beam1`，2026-11-04）。mizuoto-indextts 0.2.6 之前，单束时运行的是只有一束的束采样，上游从不这样做：同一请求得到的是另一种结果（上游 81,920 个样本，当时为 89,088）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7038":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-58","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**IndexTTS-1.5 不用 KV 缓存**，除非以 fp16 运行，与上游相同：每一步都重新计算整个序列，用缓存的话求和结果会不同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7039":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-59","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**在 GPU 上，上游在哪里计算什么就在哪里计算**：1.5 的参考音频 mel 在 CPU 上计算（上游在 CPU 上算好再移到设备；GPU 的 FFT 舍入不同，仅这一点就改变了束搜索最终选定的码）；transformers 的 GPT-2 加上的空位置编码是 float32，所以带缓存的每一步中 fp16 或 bf16 的嵌入会变成 float32，与提示一样（`wpe_zeros`）；权重归一化在加载设备上折叠（上游把 BigVGAN 移到 GPU 后才去掉权重归一化，编解码器和 CFM 的权重归一化则每次调用都在 GPU 上计算；`norm_on`：折叠前把权重归一化的参数对移到该设备）。2.5 的提示按上游在批次中的构造方式：用全零行左填充到最长文本，transformers 的 GPT-2 再用 SDPA 的加性掩码把它屏蔽（填充的键取该 dtype 的最小值，填充行自身的掩码清零），预填充和每一个带缓存的步骤都如此（`padding_masks`）；单个提示没有填充，因而没有掩码。1.5 的 BigVGAN 输出按其自身的 dtype 缩放到 int16，与上游相同：fp16 下 `32767 × wav` 先在 float16 中舍入再截断（−7.99976 变为 −8.0，而不是 −7）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7040":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-60","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**抽样顺序**：所有抽样都按上游的顺序（先 GPT，后 DiT 的噪声）来自请求的生成器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7041":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-61","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**情感嵌入**从音频以 16 kHz 重新读取，而不是由 22.05 kHz 的副本重采样得到：它是音色缓存中单独的一个字段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7042":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-62","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**文本（1.5、2）** 用 WeTextProcessing 自己的 FST 通过 kaldifst 做规范化。上游在 Linux 上运行 pynini，在其他平台用另一套 FST；Mizuoto 在所有平台上都给出 Linux 上的行为。人名和拼音按首次出现的顺序编号（上游用 `set` 的顺序，每次运行都可能不同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7043":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-63","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**2.5 的文本**：zh、en、ja、es 以外的语言（以及未指定语言）根据文本的文字判断（有假名为 ja，有汉字为 zh，含西班牙语特有字母为 es，否则为 en；`applied.lang` 会写明）。上游发送 `zhen`，它不是模型的任何语言 token（分词器把 `<|zhen|>` 逐字拼出，语言嵌入回退到 `common`）。这是有意的差异：在 T4 的 2.5 克隆集（180 段，2026-10-19）上，`zhen` 把错误率从 1.16 % 提高到 7.70 %（p 4e-9），英文约增至十倍，中文增至两到三倍；而判断出的语言给出的音频与指定该语言时完全相同。上游同样没有 NeMo 的日语和西班牙语规范化，所以这类文本原样通过；日语需要 fugashi（`mizuoto-indextts[ja]`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7044":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-64","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#有意的差异","content":"**不做 w2v-BERT 的 layer drop 抽样**：在 eval 模式下它们从不改变输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7045":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-65","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#有意的差异","content":"**尺寸来自配置。** 上游写死的尺寸（w2v-BERT 的宽度、`gpt_layer`）改为取自配置，这样小型测试模型也能构建；真实模型得到的数值相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7046":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-66","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#有意的差异","content":"**严格加载。** 检查点严格加载；上游对缺失的键保留随机权重（已发布的检查点中没有缺失的键）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7047":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-67","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#有意的差异","content":"**未移植**：TensorRT、上游的加速引擎和 BigVGAN 的 CUDA 内核（0.1 的加载选项 `use_accel`、`use_trt`、`trt_precision`、`use_cuda_kernel`；TensorRT 后端的分段内流式输出即下文的选项 `stream_chunk`），以及 2.5 的低显存文本切分（上游在显存不足 10 GB 的 GPU 上把文本切成 40 个字符的片段；Mizuoto 由运行时管理显存）。`use_torch_compile` 会为 s2mel DiT 和 BigVGAN 开启 `compute.compile`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7048":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-68","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"阶段：音色未缓存时依次是 w2v-BERT、CAM++、语义编解码器和长度调节器（情感音频只用 w2v-BERT）；有情感文本时是情感模型；然后是 GPT（`kind=\"sequence\"`；它的 GPT-2 `Conv1D` 层像线性层一样流式加载）、s2mel 和 BigVGAN。克隆已缓存的音色时从不放置 w2v-BERT 或 CAM++。开启 `compute.oom_fallback` 时，若 BigVGAN 显存不足，就按 256 帧一块分块解码，每块两侧各带上样本所依赖的 39 帧：与整段的样本只差求和的舍入（IndexTTS 2/2.5）。GPT 的工作内存按每个分段估算：其文本 token 数和每个 token 24 个编码（实际语速约为 5），不超过 `max_mel_tokens`，计入每一束，按它实际计算所用的 dtype。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7049":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-69","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"束采样原来每一步约等待设备十次（`torch.multinomial` 的检查、评分器用 `.item()` 读取每个候选、停止判断、束重排、位置嵌入的下标张量）。现在只等一次：抽样用 `multinomial` 自己的 `topk(p / Exp(1), 2 × beams)`（`runtime.sampling.multinomial_draws`，在 CPU 和 CUDA 上 id 和生成器状态都相同）；候选的分数、token 和所属束一次读回，评分器在主机上根据这些值做决定；位置嵌入直接取表中的一行。开启 `compute.cuda_graphs`（NVIDIA，GPT 完整位于设备上并使用 KV 缓存：IndexTTS 2/2.5，以及 fp16 下的 1.5）时，所有束的 GPT-2 单 token 步骤以 CUDA 图运行在每层注意力的两侧；缓存、它的束重排和采样仍以 eager 方式进行。音频相同，按 1.5 的尺寸每步快 2.6–3.2 倍。所有层各束的键和值共用一个缓冲区（`BeamCaches`）：每一步把它加长一个位置，各束的行按重排顺序每束复制一次，然后每层在原处写入新的键和值；每层的键和值仍是原来 `index_select` 和 `torch.cat` 得到的连续张量，复制量减半（30 秒语音快 ×1.11）。 CUDA 图按束数分别捕获：mizuoto-indextts 0.2.6 之前，三束请求之后的单束请求会重放三束的图而失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7050":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-70","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"**分段内流式输出**（选项 `stream_chunk`，IndexTTS 2/2.5，仅流式请求；默认 0，关闭）。默认情况下，流式请求在每个分段生成完后才发送它的音频，与上游的 `stream_return` 相同，所以第一段音频要等第一个分段完整生成之后。设 `stream_chunk = n` 时，就是上游 TensorRT 后端的流式方式（`FasterIndexTTS2` 的 `StreamingDecoder`），但运行在原生模型上：GPT 用单束采样（这样每个编码一抽出就是最终的；`num_beams` 必须不设或为 1），每生成 `n` 个编码，就把最近 `n` 个编码组成的窗口（与前一个窗口共享 `stream_overlap` 个编码，默认 5）按整个分段的方式解码：IndexTTS 2 的隐变量由 GPT 对目前所有编码计算（因果模型对前缀给出的隐变量与整段相同），2.5 用语义编解码器处理该窗口；然后是参考音频提示之后的 s2mel 流和 BigVGAN。相邻窗口用 Hann 交叉淡化在 `int(overlap × 1.72)` 帧上拼接，分段最后 512 个样本淡出，与上游相同。解码器在 GPT 的步骤之间抽取噪声，所以同一种子下编码与非流式请求不同。每个窗口的流都要重新处理整个参考提示，所以整个请求总耗时更长。在 RTX 3060 上（2026-11-04），IndexTTS 2 合成一句 13 秒的英文、2.5 合成一句 12 秒的中文，预热后，开启 CUDA 图：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7051":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-71","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"首段音频","locale":"zh-CN"},"7052":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-72","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"整个请求","locale":"zh-CN"},"7053":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-73","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"RTF","locale":"zh-CN"},"7054":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-74","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"IndexTTS 2，按分段（3 束 / 1 束）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7055":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-75","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"12.0 / 11.9 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"7056":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-76","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"12.0 / 11.9 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"7057":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-77","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"0.98 / 0.79","locale":"zh-CN"},"7058":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-78","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"IndexTTS 2，`stream_chunk` 100 / 50","locale":"zh-CN"},"7059":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-79","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"2.6 / 1.9 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"7060":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-80","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"18.2 / 28.1 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"7061":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-81","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"1.35 / 2.07","locale":"zh-CN"},"7062":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-82","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"IndexTTS 2.5，按分段（3 束 / 1 束）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7063":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-83","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"5.7 / 5.0 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"7064":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-84","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"5.8 / 5.1 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"7065":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-85","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"0.47 / 0.43","locale":"zh-CN"},"7066":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-86","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"IndexTTS 2.5，`stream_chunk` 100 / 50","locale":"zh-CN"},"7067":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-87","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"2.2 / 1.7 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"7068":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-88","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"6.6 / 11.1 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"7069":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-89","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"0.55 / 0.91","locale":"zh-CN"},"7070":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-90","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"Whisper 对每一条的转写都与文本一致（2.5 在 50 个编码时有一个同音字）。RTF 大于 1 时音频生成得比播放慢，所以在这块显卡上 IndexTTS 2 会在分块之间停顿；100 个编码（约 1.6 秒语音）是上游的默认值，也是更好的折中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7071":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-91","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"CPU 上以 fp32 运行 `compute.compile`：s2mel DiT 的热启动时间减少 7 %，BigVGAN 减少 20 %；音频与 eager 相差不超过 6.1e-5（87.7 dB）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7072":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-92","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#训练","content":"无：IndexTTS 没有公开其语音合成模型的训练代码，清单中也没有声明任何训练方法。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7073":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-93","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#对照结果","content":"在 CPU 上以 fp32 运行时，IndexTTS-1.5、2 和 2.5 在完整链路的全部四个用例中都与 0.1 逐采样相同：一个 1.5 克隆、一个 2 克隆、带情感权重的 IndexTTS-2 和一个 2.5 中文克隆。在组件层面，情感模型、每个文本前端以及带和不带 KV 缓存的 GPT 也都相同。契约套件通过（18 项测试）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7074":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-94","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#对照结果","content":"在 GPU 上（RTX 3090，2026-10-19，与 0.1 对照，各版本用各自的精度）四个用例逐采样完全相同：fp16 的 1.5（上述修正之前是 2.3 dB）、IndexTTS-2 的两个用例，以及 bf16 的 2.5（加上填充掩码之前是 −2.6 dB）。唯一报告的差别是 `cuda_graphs` 标记：CUDA 图重放的是相同的内核。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7075":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-95","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#限制","content":"没有训练方法。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7076":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-96","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#限制","content":"2.5 的日语和西班牙语文本不做规范化（与上游相同）；日语需要 `ja` 附加依赖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7077":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-97","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#限制","content":"结果不能用于训练其他引擎（`trains_others = false`），克隆需要许可要求的同意声明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7078":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","type":"page","content":"OmniVoice","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","引擎参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","locale":"zh-CN"},"7079":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-0","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","content":"Mizuoto 中实现的 OmniVoice 引擎：迭代解掩码的双向 Qwen3，HiggsAudio v2 分词器（DAC 与 HuBERT），不依赖 pydub 的 pydub 算术，哪些做法与上游完全一致，全量与 LoRA 微调，以及对照结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7080":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-1","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#变体与文件","content":"变体与文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"7081":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-2","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh-CN"},"7082":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-3","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"与上游一致的做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"7083":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-4","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#有意的差异","content":"有意的差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"7084":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-5","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#显存与速度","content":"显存与速度","locale":"zh-CN"},"7085":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-6","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#训练","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"7086":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-7","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#对照结果","content":"对照结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"7087":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-8","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#限制","content":"限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"7088":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-9","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","content":"小米的扩散语言模型语音合成，支持 600 多种语言（k2-fsa/OmniVoice，Apache-2.0）。代码：`mizuoto/engines/omnivoice`。在 CPU 上以 fp32、同一种子运行时，它在每个对照用例中都与 Mizuoto 0.1（运行在 transformers 5.3 上的上游）完全相同，两个训练器也逐字节给出 0.1 的适配器和导出权重。面向用户的说明见引擎详解。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7089":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-10","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#变体与文件","content":"一个变体 `v0`（目录中的模型 `omnivoice/omnivoice`）：克隆（必须有参考文本；缺少时 Mizuoto 用语音识别补全，所以引擎自己从不加载 Whisper）、按封闭的属性词表设计音色、模型自带音色，以及 13 个行内非语言标签。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7090":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-11","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#变体与文件","content":"模型目录包含 `config.json`、`model.safetensors`、BPE 分词器文件和 `audio_tokenizer/`（`config.json`、`model.safetensors`、`preprocessor_config.json`）。音色缓存是 `prompt.pt`，与上游的音色克隆提示相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7091":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-12","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#变体与文件","content":"精度：支持 bf16 的 CUDA GPU 上用 bf16（否则 fp16），其他设备用 fp32；`engines.omnivoice.dtype` 可以覆盖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7092":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-13","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"音频是 HiggsAudio v2 分词器的 8 个码本。语言模型是**双向**运行的 Qwen3-0.6B，它看到风格 token、文本、参考音频的编码，以及作为掩码位置的目标；在固定的步数里（默认 32 步）逐步解开最有把握的编码，采用对数概率空间里的无分类器引导、按码本的惩罚，以及位置上的 Gumbel 噪声。每一步都是对整个序列的完整前向（没有 KV 缓存）。目标长度来自基于规则的估计（按文字系统的字符权重，再按参考音频的语速缩放），或者来自 `speed` 和 `duration`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7093":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-14","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"7094":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-15","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"是什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"7095":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-16","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7096":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-17","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`create_voice_clone_prompt`、时长、`_generate_iterative`、长文本分块、后处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"7097":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-18","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`model.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7098":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-19","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"网络：在文本和音频编码上运行的双向 Qwen3（`audio_embeddings`、`audio_heads`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7099":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-20","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`audio_tokenizer.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7100":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-21","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"按 transformers 5.3 的计算方式实现的 HiggsAudio v2 分词器：DAC 声学编码器 + HuBERT 语义分支、欧氏残差码本；`fc2` + DAC 解码器","locale":"zh-CN"},"7101":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-22","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`audio.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7102":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-23","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"不依赖 pydub 的后处理（`Segment`：在 int16 数组上做 pydub 的毫秒算术、`audioop.rms`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7103":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-24","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`duration.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7104":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-25","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"基于规则的时长估计，上游的表格","locale":"zh-CN"},"7105":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-26","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`text.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7106":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-27","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"在标点处分块、`add_punctuation`、`combine_text`、识别标签的分词","locale":"zh-CN"},"7107":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-28","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`voice_design.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7108":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-29","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"封闭的设计词表和 `_resolve_instruct`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7109":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-30","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`lang_map.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7110":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-31","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"语言名称到 OmniVoice id 的映射","locale":"zh-CN"},"7111":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-32","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`train.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7112":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-33","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`OmniVoiceTrainer`（方法 `full`、`lora`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7113":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-34","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"共享：`runtime/lm/qwen.py`、`nn/codecs/dac.py`、`nn/ssl/hubert.py`、`text/tokenize/bpe.py`、`nn/dsp/resample.py`、`nn/dsp/wav.py`、`nn/dsp/flac.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7114":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-35","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**注意力掩码。** 语言模型是 `runtime/lm/qwen` 的解码器，使用完整的四维布尔掩码：transformers 原样返回四维掩码，SDPA 收到的是重复了 KV 头的掩码，不是因果的。条件行和无条件行在一个批次里运行，与上游的批处理方式相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7115":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-36","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**抽样。** 位置上（以及设了 `class_temperature` 时类别上）的 Gumbel 噪声来自请求的生成器，按步、按条抽取，与上游相同；批次的组成会改变抽样，上游也是如此。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7116":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-37","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**分词器**由 DAC（奇数步幅加输出填充，没有最后的 tanh）、HuBERT（位置卷积的权重归一化沿第 2 维折叠）和欧氏残差码本组成。语义解码器和 `fc1` 只在训练中使用，不加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7117":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-38","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**HuBERT 的抽样。** HuBERT 即使在 eval 模式下，每层也从 CPU 生成器抽取一次 `torch.rand([])`；`HubertModel` 在 `ctx.generator_for(\"cpu\")` 上做同样的抽样。因此没有缓存音色提示的克隆，与有缓存的克隆得到的噪声不同，0.1 和 Mizuoto 都是如此；Mizuoto 总在请求之前先准备好提示，所以这一点从不显现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7118":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-39","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**不依赖 pydub 的 pydub。** 对提示和输出的静音去除，在 int16 数组上按 pydub 的算术复现：毫秒长度四舍五入、位置截断、`audioop.rms` 向下取整。Python 3.13 已经没有 `audioop`，本来就需要移植。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7119":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-40","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**响度与长文本。** 参考音频的响度调到 RMS 0.1，输出再调回去；长输出按文本分块生成，以参考音频（或第一块）为条件，并交叉淡化。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7120":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-41","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**文本分词器**是 `mizuoto.text` 的 BPE，不加 transformers 的 “Mistral fix”（模型声明的是 transformers 5.3，那里不适用）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7121":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-42","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#有意的差异","content":"**没有自由文本设计。** 模型是在封闭的属性词表上训练的；自由文本会被拒绝，与 0.1 相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7122":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-43","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#有意的差异","content":"**没有 FlashInfer 和 CUDA 图。** 0.1 中它们的加载选项已经去掉；SDPA 适用于所有平台。取代 FlashInfer 的是请求选项 `packed_guidance`（见下文）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7123":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-44","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#有意的差异","content":"**上游的文本规范化**（`normalize_text`、WeTextProcessing）Mizuoto 的请求用不到，没有移植。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7124":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-45","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#显存与速度","content":"两个阶段：音频分词器（音色提示，然后解码）和语言模型。开启 `compute.oom_fallback` 时，如果解码显存不足，分词器按 128 帧（约 5 秒）一块解码，每块两侧各带上 DAC 解码器样本所依赖的 12 帧：与整段的样本只差求和的舍入（GPU 上 SNR 64 dB，而 GPU 与 CPU 相比为 63 dB），60 秒只需 108 MB 而不是 1 GB。语言模型每一步都在整个序列上重新运行，所以在权重流式加载中它是一个 `oneshot` 模型（最大的单元留在设备上）。训练：对模型的层做梯度检查点，结果相同，LoRA dropout 也包括在内；`lowest` 把 AdamW 的状态放在内存里（CPU 上相同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7125":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-46","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#显存与速度","content":"**快速模式**（请求选项 `packed_guidance`，默认关闭）：上游把每一项的有条件序列和无条件序列（只有目标部分）作为两行，补齐到相同长度，所以无条件那一行白白计算了整个提示的长度。合并后，两者在同一行中并排，使用块对角掩码，各自的位置都从 0 开始：各自计算的内容与单独一行时相同，但位置更少。在 CPU 上，对照用例的音频相同；在 GPU 上，矩阵乘法和注意力的形状不同，舍入不同，而每一步都揭开最有把握的编码，所以结果是同一请求的另一次生成（如同换了一个种子）。输出中会注明（`applied.packed_guidance`）。在 3090 上：克隆每个请求快 ×1.26–1.27（clone-en 0.77 → 0.61 秒），30 秒语音快 ×1.12；没有参考音频的音色几乎没有补齐，没有收益；CPU 上克隆快 ×1.31。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7126":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-47","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#训练","content":"方法 `full` 和 `lora`（阶段 `tokens`、`train`、`export`；上游的 `extract_audio_tokens` 和使用其 SDPA 微调配置的 `OmniTrainer`；不需要 transformers、peft、accelerate 或 webdataset）。两边用同样的种子时，两者都在 CPU 上逐字节给出 0.1 的编码、批次、损失、学习率、LoRA 适配器和导出的 `model.safetensors`，在梯度累积、多个分片和多个加载 worker 下也是如此。LoRA 会合并进导出的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7127":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-48","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#训练","content":"**上游在构建模型之后用配置中的 42 重新播种**，所以阶段的种子只通过 peft 的 LoRA 初始化起作用，这一初始化首先按模块顺序从进程级生成器抽取（`A` 和 `B` 先作为 `nn.Linear` 创建，`A` 再抽取一次）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7128":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-49","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#训练","content":"**重新播种之后的抽样来自私有生成器**：每个 epoch 加载器的基础种子和 LoRA dropout 掩码共用一个以 42 播种的生成器；第 *w* 个 worker 的 `Random` 和 `Generator` 以 `(base + w) mod 2**32` 播种。在每个 worker 里，webdataset 先花掉一次 `randint(0, 1000000)` 生成一个从不使用的种子，然后处理器才开始抽样。分片列表用 `Random(epoch)` 打乱，样本经过以 epoch 播种的 webdataset 20 000 样本缓冲区；各 worker 的批次轮流到来。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7129":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-50","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#训练","content":"**按长度分批**（`StreamLengthGroupDataset`、`PaddingDataCollator` 的四维掩码），与 SDPA 配置相同，而不是 FlexAttention 的打包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7130":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-51","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#训练","content":"**梯度裁剪**按上游的参数顺序（token 嵌入在先）累加各张量的范数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7131":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-52","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#训练","content":"**token 顺序**遵循 `JsonlDatasetReader` 以 42 为种子的顺序。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7132":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-53","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#训练","content":"检查点不保存优化器状态。加载 worker 多于分片时 0.1 会失败；这里多出的 worker 空闲。预览带种子。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7133":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-54","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#训练","content":"`training.memory`：对 Qwen3 各层做梯度检查点（重放 LoRA 的 dropout 掩码）；对 LoRA，`low` 还把冻结的线性层权重以自动混合精度的类型存放（CUDA：自动混合精度每次矩阵乘法本来就会转换成这个类型），`lowest` 把 LoRA 层冻结的基座权重留在内存中，每次矩阵乘法时复制到 GPU，AdamW 的状态也放在内存中。在 CPU 上结果相同（比较微型训练器的损失值和适配器）；在 GPU 上开启确定性内核时，float32 与 bfloat16 冻结权重的损失值和梯度相同。LoRA 的峰值：7.3 GB，`low` 下 2.1 GB，`lowest` 下 1.1 GB（RTX 3060，2026-11-04）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7134":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-55","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#对照结果","content":"全部 4 个完整链路用例在 CPU 上以 fp32 与 0.1 逐采样相同：克隆、按属性设计、自带音色和微调后的模型。模块层面还包括音色提示的编码、分词器的解码、logits、`class_temperature`、`speed`、`duration`、批量以及长文本分块路径。另有两个用例让一种实现加载另一种实现导出的 LoRA，结果相同。契约套件通过（12 项）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7135":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-56","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#对照结果","content":"在 GPU 上（RTX 3090，bf16，2026-10-19，与 0.1 对照），四个用例也逐采样相同：共用的 Qwen 解码器在转为 bf16 时让 RoPE 的 `inv_freq` 保持 float32，并像 transformers 一样把 q 和 k 分开归一化之后即是如此（见 Qwen3-TTS）；速度不变（×1.01）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7136":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-57","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#限制","content":"每一步都是条件行和无条件行在整个序列上的完整前向；这个引擎没有 CUDA 图路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7137":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-58","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#限制","content":"不能用自由文本设计音色（模型只接受属性）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7138":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","type":"page","content":"Qwen3-TTS","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","引擎参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","locale":"zh-CN"},"7139":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-0","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","content":"Mizuoto 中实现的 Qwen3-TTS 引擎：变体与文件，talker、code predictor、说话人编码器和 12 Hz 编解码器，哪些做法与上游完全一致，显存与 CUDA 图解码，说话人微调，以及对照结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7140":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-1","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"变体与文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"7141":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-2","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh-CN"},"7142":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-3","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"与上游一致的做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"7143":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-4","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#有意的差异","content":"有意的差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"7144":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-5","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#显存","content":"显存","locale":"zh-CN"},"7145":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-6","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#速度","content":"速度","locale":"zh-CN"},"7146":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-7","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#训练","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"7147":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-8","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#对照结果","content":"对照结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"7148":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-9","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#限制","content":"限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"7149":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-10","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","content":"阿里通义千问的 12 Hz 语音语言模型（QwenLM/Qwen3-TTS，Apache-2.0）。代码：`mizuoto/engines/qwen3tts`。在 CPU 上以 fp32、同一种子运行时，它在全部 8 个对照用例中逐采样给出 Mizuoto 0.1（适配层后面的上游 `qwen_tts`）的音频，它的训练器也逐字节给出 0.1 的检查点。各变体能做什么见引擎详解。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7150":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-11","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"7151":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-12","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"目录中的模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"7152":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-13","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"7153":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-14","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"`base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7154":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-15","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"`qwen3tts/1.7b-base`、`qwen3tts/0.6b-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7155":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-16","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"克隆：有参考文本时在上下文中克隆，没有时用说话人嵌入（x-vector）克隆","locale":"zh-CN"},"7156":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-17","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"`custom_voice`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7157":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-18","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"`qwen3tts/1.7b-custom-voice`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7158":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-19","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"九个预置说话人，可用指令控制","locale":"zh-CN"},"7159":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-20","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"`custom_voice_lite`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7160":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-21","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"`qwen3tts/0.6b-custom-voice`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7161":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-22","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"没有指令的预置说话人（上游对 0.6B 静默丢弃指令，所以这个变体不声明指令）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7162":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-23","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"`voice_design`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7163":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-24","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"`qwen3tts/1.7b-voice-design`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7164":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-25","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"按自由文本描述生成音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"7165":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-26","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"变体由 `config.json`（`tts_model_type`、`tts_model_size`）决定；只接受 `tokenizer_type = qwen3_tts_tokenizer_12hz`。模型目录包含 `config.json`、`model.safetensors`、分词器文件（`tokenizer.json`，或 `vocab.json` + `merges.txt` + `tokenizer_config.json`）和 `speech_tokenizer/`（`config.json`、`model.safetensors`）。Base 模型的音色缓存是 `prompt.pt`，即克隆提示（参考音频的编码和说话人嵌入）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7166":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-27","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"精度：支持 bf16 的 CUDA GPU 上用 bf16（否则 fp16），其他设备用 fp32；`engines.qwen3tts.dtype` 可以覆盖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7167":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-28","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"每 80 毫秒的一帧音频是 16 个编码。**talker** 是一个在文本和编解码器嵌入上运行的 28 层 Qwen3 解码器，预测一帧的第一个编码；**code predictor** 是一个 5 层 transformer，依次预测其余 15 个；16 个编码嵌入之和（加上下一个文本 token 的嵌入）是 talker 的下一个输入。**12 Hz 编解码器**把编码还原成 24 kHz 音频（每帧 1920 个采样），克隆时还把参考音频编码。Base 模型另有一个**说话人编码器**（ECAPA-TDNN），它的嵌入放在提示里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7168":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-29","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"7169":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-30","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"是什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"7170":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-31","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"`engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7171":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-32","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"按 `Qwen3TTSForConditionalGeneration.generate` 的方式构建提示、talker 循环、分块解码、音色缓存","locale":"zh-CN"},"7172":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-33","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"`decode.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7173":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-34","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"`FrameDecoder`：在固定张量上运行一帧（采样、code predictor、talker 一步），eager 或 CUDA 图","locale":"zh-CN"},"7174":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-35","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"`config.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7175":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-36","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"不经 transformers 读取 `config.json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7176":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-37","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"`talker.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7177":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-38","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"talker 和 code predictor，基于 `runtime/lm/qwen.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7178":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-39","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"`speaker.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7179":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-40","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"Qwen2.5-Omni 所带的 ECAPA-TDNN：没有 BatchNorm、反射填充，输入 24 kHz 的 128 维 log-mel，输出 2048 维嵌入","locale":"zh-CN"},"7180":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-41","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"`codec.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7181":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-42","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"12 Hz 语音分词器：Mimi 式编码器（transformers `MimiModel` 的编码路径）和因果解码器（72 帧注意力窗口、SnakeBeta 上采样）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7182":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-43","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"`train.py`、`sft.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7183":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-44","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"`Qwen3Trainer`（方法 `speaker`）及其计算","locale":"zh-CN"},"7184":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-45","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"共享：`runtime/lm/qwen.py`（解码器、`hf_sdpa`、`mask_for`）、`runtime/lm/cache.py`、`runtime/sampling.py`、`runtime/graphs.py`、`text/tokenize/bpe.py`、`nn/dsp/mel.py`（`matcha_mel`）、`nn/dsp/resample.py`、`nn/dsp/wav.py`、`nn/dsp/flac.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7185":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-46","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**分词器的切分。** 上游用 `fix_mistral_regex=True` 加载处理器，transformers 4.57.3 对配置中版本号介于 4.57.2 和 5.0 之间的本地模型，会换用它的 “Mistral fix” 预分词正则。`load_bpe(mistral_fix=…)` 根据模型的 `config.json` 做出同样的判断；不这样做，少数文本的分词会不同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7186":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-47","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**相同的张量形状。** 提示按上游 `generate` 的方式构建：三个特殊嵌入在一次调用里查出，编解码器头作用于整个预填充。拆成更小的调用，值虽相同，浮点求和却不同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7187":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-48","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**按 transformers 的方式调用注意力**（`hf_sdpa`）：没有掩码时，多 token 查询用带 `enable_gqa` 和 `is_causal` 的 SDPA；有掩码时重复 KV 头。缓存像 `DynamicCache` 那样靠拼接增长。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7188":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-49","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**采样器。** talker 依次经过 transformers 的处理器链（重复惩罚、min-new-tokens、屏蔽控制 id、温度、top-k、top-p），再在请求的生成器上做 `multinomial`；批量中已结束的行被喂入 EOS，与 transformers 的填充方式相同。每帧接着是 code predictor 的 15 次抽样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7189":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-50","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**编解码器。** 编码器的 transformer 用普通的因果掩码（忽略配置中的 250 帧窗口，与上游的编码路径一样）；解码器的 transformer 应用 72 帧窗口。解码按上游的分块进行（300 帧，左侧 25 帧上下文），在上下文中克隆时，联合解码之后再切掉参考音频那一段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7190":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-51","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**说话人编码器的 mel** 是 Matcha-TTS 的（`nn.dsp.mel.matcha_mel`），与上游的计算相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7191":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-52","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#有意的差异","content":"**没有实现 25 Hz 分词器。** 没有已发布的模型使用它，上游的封装也无法解码它的输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7192":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-53","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#有意的差异","content":"**流式按段进行**，与 0.1 相同：先生成模型的整段，再解码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7193":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-54","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#有意的差异","content":"**帧率是 12.5**（0.1 用的是 12.0；只影响进度估计）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7194":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-55","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#有意的差异","content":"**上游的 `attn_implementation` 不是加载选项**：注意力经过 Mizuoto 的注意力分派器，由 `compute.attention` / `engines.qwen3tts.attention` 选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7195":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-56","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#显存","content":"四个句柄，按阶段放置：talker（`kind=\"sequence\"`，它的 code predictor 标为 `hot`，因为每帧要运行 15 次）、说话人编码器和编解码器的编码器（只用于 Base 模型的音色提示），以及编解码器的解码器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7196":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-57","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#显存","content":"talker 的工作内存按请求估算：每行的提示（指令、参考文本和编码、文本）加上每个文本 token 16 帧（实际语音约 3–4 帧），不超过 `max_new_tokens`，缓存峰值按比其大小多一层计，再加 256 MB。所以在 1.7B 模型上一句话只预留约 300–400 MB，而不是按最坏情况（8192 帧）要求的数 GB，显存紧张时 talker 也不会被无谓地流式加载。`compute.kv_cache = static` 为 talker 和 code predictor 提供预分配的缓存（CPU 上结果相同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7197":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-58","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#速度","content":"一帧是 talker 的一步加 code predictor 的十五步：约 6 000 个小内核，由 CPU 逐个启动。普通循环每帧还要等待设备约 35 次（`torch.multinomial` 每次抽样的两项有效性检查、每步把被屏蔽的 id 复制到设备上、填充检查、EOS 检查），每次等待都会清空 GPU 的队列。`decode.py` 在不改变任何结果的前提下去掉了这些：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7198":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-59","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#速度","content":"**每帧只等待一次。** 单样本抽样采用 `multinomial` 本身的计算（`argmax(p / Exp(1))`），去掉它的检查（`runtime.sampling.multinomial1`；概率为 NaN 仍是错误，在每帧那一次等待时读取）；掩码每个设备只构建一次；重复惩罚作用于已抽取 id 的掩码（`repetition_penalty_seen`，算术相同）；填充情况在主机端已知。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7199":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-60","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#速度","content":"**逐帧流式输出**（只有一段文本的流式请求；`applied.stream = \"frames\"`）。模型本身为流式输出而设计（上游 README：97 ms 即可输出第一段音频），但上游的包只返回完整片段（它的流式选项只影响文本输入的排列方式）；Mizuoto 在 talker 抽出帧的同时解码。talker 和编解码器的解码器一起放到设备上，先在 4 帧之后、然后每 12 帧，解码器从上游分块网格（300 帧，左侧上下文 25 帧）中当前块的常规起点解码，并发送此前没有发送过的采样（`codec.DecodeStream`）。解码器从头到尾都是因果的，所以这些采样就是整体解码给出的采样，只差舍入：在 CPU 上以 fp32 运行时误差在 1e-8 之内；在 GPU 上以 bf16 运行时与整体请求的音频相比 SNR 为 37–41 dB，这是解码器在不同长度下自身的舍入差异（fp32 时为 66 dB），帧码和长度都相同。上下文克隆时，上游按最终长度的比例切掉参考部分，切点可能比 `ref_len × 1920` 早一个采样（约 4 % 的片段）；流式输出无法预知最终长度，所以从 `ref_len × 1920` 开始。在 RTX 3090 上（1.7B，8 秒语音），第一段音频在 0.28–0.33 s 后到达，而整体请求需要 1.7–2.0 s，总耗时多 8–19 %（重复解码的代价）。批量请求不做流式输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7200":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-61","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#速度","content":"**CUDA 图**（`compute.cuda_graphs`，默认开启；NVIDIA）。部分加载的 talker（其余层从锁页内存流式加载）照样使用：每步的图把流式加载的层复制进来（`ModelHandle.graphable`），在 4 GB 限额下比 eager 流式加载快 1.32–1.35 倍，音频相同。采样和 code predictor 的 15 步各是一个图；talker 的一步在两次注意力调用之间各为一个图，注意力在不断增长的缓存上以 eager 方式运行。图从自己的生成器抽样，该生成器从请求的生成器载入状态并写回。图按批大小和采样设置保存，权重移动时丢弃。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7201":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-62","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#速度","content":"**更少的内核，相同的比特**（仅在不需要自动求导时，所以训练不受影响）：在 CPU 上 q 和 k 一起归一化和旋转（在 GPU 上只在 `fused_projections` 下如此：CUDA 按张量大小安排归约，在拼接的头上，归一化的和偶尔会差一个刻度，先是解码中的一个键，然后是整段声音）；code predictor 的旋转表只生成一次；在设备上的自检表明 `F.rms_norm` 给出与 float32 归一化相同的比特时使用它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7202":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-63","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#速度","content":"与 eager 的编码相同；在 1.7B 规模的解码循环上，比带等待的循环快 2.7–3.4 倍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7203":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-64","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#速度","content":"**快速模式**（加载选项 `fused_projections`，默认关闭）：加载时把每层的 q/k/v 和 gate/up 投影各自合成一个带堆叠权重的线性层（它们仍像普通层一样可以流式加载）。在 GPU 上每帧快约 3–4 %，但矩阵乘法会选用其他内核，音频不再逐位相同；在 CPU 对照用例中相同。开启时输出会列出 `fused_projections`。参数名会改变，所以只用于推理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7204":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-65","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#训练","content":"方法 `speaker`（Base 模型；阶段 `prepare`、`train`、`export`）：模型学会一个说话人，成为一个唯一预置说话人就是新音色的 CustomVoice 模型，与上游的 `finetuning/sft_12hz.py` 相同。在真实的 1.7B Base 上，两边用同样的种子时，它在 CPU 上逐字节给出 0.1 的编码、损失和检查点，不需要 transformers 或 accelerate。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7205":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-66","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#训练","content":"音频每次编码八段、补零，与 `Qwen3TTSTokenizer.encode` 的批处理方式相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7206":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-67","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#训练","content":"顺序来自进程级生成器上的普通打乱数据加载器（训练阶段自己的进程）。Accelerate 的梯度累积复现为：损失按步累加，每 N 个批次以及每个 epoch 结束时执行一次优化器步。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7207":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-68","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#训练","content":"两个损失都是 transformers 的 `ForCausalLMLoss`，它会把已经移位的标签再移一次；保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7208":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-69","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#训练","content":"上游把原始的文本嵌入直接加到编解码器嵌入上，没有经过推理时会用的 `text_projection`；保留，这样权重才与上游相同。由此只有文本嵌入宽度与 talker 相同的模型能训练：1.7B Base 可以，0.6B Base 不行（文本 2048，talker 1024）。对这样的模型，该方法显示为不可用并给出原因，也无法从它开始实验（`Trainer.refuses` 在运行前读取模型的 `config.json`；`capability_not_supported`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7209":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-70","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#训练","content":"每次训练前向都用新的缓存：`DynamicCache` 第一次更新时会拼接，所以注意力看到的是连续的键和值，与上游相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7210":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-71","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#训练","content":"`training.memory`：对 talker 和 code predictor 的层做梯度检查点，结果相同；`lowest` 把 AdamW 的状态放在内存里（在那里是 float32）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7211":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-72","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#对照结果","content":"全部 8 个完整链路用例在 CPU 上以 fp32 与 0.1 逐采样相同：预置说话人、指令、音色设计、上下文克隆、x-vector 克隆、语音识别得到的参考文本、方言说话人和微调后的模型。另有两个用例用一种实现合成另一种实现的训练导出，都相同。分词器在分词语料上给出与 transformers 相同的 id。契约套件通过（24 项）。CUDA 图在 GPU 上用小型模型和真实的 0.6B Base 与 eager 路径对照过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7212":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-73","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#对照结果","content":"在 GPU 上（RTX 3090，bf16，2026-10-19，与 0.1 对照），全部 8 个用例也逐采样相同。这需要照上游做四件事：模型转为 bf16 时 RoPE 的 `inv_freq` 保持 float32（`from_pretrained(dtype=…)` 不会改变它自己建立的 float32 缓冲；舍入后的值让靠后的位置转过别的角度）；语音分词器的编码器和解码器使用 transformers 的布尔因果掩码，而不是 `is_causal`（transformers 4.57 的打包序列检查在给出位置 id 却没有填充掩码或缓存时总会保留掩码，而在 GPU 上两者会选不同的内核）；编码器的 q、k、v 与 transformers 一样转为连续存储；q 和 k 分开归一化（见上）。与之前的代码相比，talker 在该 GPU 上慢到 ×0.92–0.96（轮次 `g6-before`、`g6-after`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7213":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-74","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#限制","content":"`fused_projections` 以 GPU 上的逐位一致换取速度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7214":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-75","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#限制","content":"CUDA 图要求 talker 位于一块 NVIDIA GPU 上，且流式加载的层在锁页内存中（受 `compute.max_pinned_mb` 限制）；否则部分加载的 talker 以 eager 方式解码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7215":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","type":"page","content":"VoxCPM","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","引擎参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","locale":"zh-CN"},"7216":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-0","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","content":"Mizuoto 中 VoxCPM 引擎的实现：VoxCPM2、1.5 和 0.5B，MiniCPM-4、局部 DiT 与 AudioVAE，按上游锁定的库版本构建的分词器和文本规范化，哪些做法与上游完全一致，带 CUDA 图的逐块解码，全量与 LoRA 微调，以及对照结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7217":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-1","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"变体与文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"7218":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-2","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh-CN"},"7219":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-3","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"与上游一致的做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"7220":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-4","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#有意的差异","content":"有意的差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"7221":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-5","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#显存与速度","content":"显存与速度","locale":"zh-CN"},"7222":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-6","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#训练","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"7223":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-7","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#对照结果","content":"对照结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"7224":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-8","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#限制","content":"限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"7225":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-9","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","content":"OpenBMB 的无离散分词语音合成（OpenBMB/VoxCPM，Apache-2.0，代码与权重）：逐块（patch）生成连续的语音潜变量，中间没有离散编码。代码：`mizuoto/engines/voxcpm`。Mizuoto 0.1 没有 VoxCPM，所以参考实现是上游自己的包，在同一个 Mizuoto 完整链路中经适配器运行，库版本与上游锁定的一致（transformers 5.3.0、tokenizers 0.22.2、wetext 0.1.2、inflect 7.5.0）。在 CPU 上以相同种子运行时，每个组件和每个请求在 bf16（上游的默认）和 fp32 下都与它完全相同，两个训练器得到的权重也逐位相同。面向用户的说明见引擎详解。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7226":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-10","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"7227":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-11","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"目录模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"7228":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-12","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"参数量","locale":"zh-CN"},"7229":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-13","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"音频","locale":"zh-CN"},"7230":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-14","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"音色方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"7231":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-15","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"`v2`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7232":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-16","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"`voxcpm/2`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7233":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-17","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"2B","locale":"zh-CN"},"7234":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-18","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"输入 16 kHz，输出 48 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"7235":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-19","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"零样本、带参考文本的克隆（参考 + 续写）、无参考文本的克隆（参考）、按描述设计、对克隆音色加指令","locale":"zh-CN"},"7236":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-20","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"`v1_5`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7237":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-21","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"`voxcpm/1.5`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7238":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-22","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"0.6B","locale":"zh-CN"},"7239":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-23","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"44.1 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"7240":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-24","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"零样本、以续写方式克隆（需要参考文本）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7241":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-25","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"`v1`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7242":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-26","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"`voxcpm/0.5b`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7243":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-27","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"0.5B","locale":"zh-CN"},"7244":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-28","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"16 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"7245":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-29","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"零样本、以续写方式克隆（需要参考文本）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7246":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-30","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"模型代际由 `config.json` 的 `architecture` 决定（缺省为 `voxcpm`）；1.5 是第一代中使用 44.1 kHz VAE 的模型。模型目录包含 `config.json`、`model.safetensors`（否则 `pytorch_model.bin`）、`audiovae.pth`（否则 `audiovae.safetensors`）、`tokenizer.json` 和 `tokenizer_config.json`。音色缓存保存提示（左侧补齐）和参考（右侧补齐）的 VAE 潜变量，与上游 `build_prompt_cache` 的做法相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7247":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-31","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"精度：`auto` 采用上游的选择，即配置中的 bf16，适用于包括 CPU 在内的所有设备，Apple MPS 上用 float32；`engines.voxcpm.dtype` 可覆盖。VAE 始终以 float32 运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7248":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-32","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"文本 token 和音频块共用一个序列。每一块中，**文本语义语言模型**（带 LongRoPE 和静态 KV 缓存的 MiniCPM-4）和较浅的**残差声学语言模型**产生两个隐状态；**局部 DiT**（双向运行的 MiniCPM-4，作为条件流模型，约 10 个欧拉步，带无分类器引导）根据它们和上一块预测下一块潜变量；**局部编码器**把这一块重新嵌入语言模型；**停止头**决定是否继续。**AudioVAE** 是类似 DAC 的因果卷积编解码器，使用 Snake 激活，负责解码潜变量（v2 带采样率条件，把 16 kHz 潜变量解码为 48 kHz 音频）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7249":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-33","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"7250":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-34","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"7251":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-35","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"`config.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7252":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-36","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"把 `config.json` 当作数据读取，带上游 pydantic 的默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"7253":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-37","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"`minicpm.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7254":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-38","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"MiniCPM-4：RMSNorm、LongRoPE、GQA SDPA、静态 KV 缓存、muP 残差","locale":"zh-CN"},"7255":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-39","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"`model.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7256":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-40","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"标量量化器、局部编码器、局部 DiT（v1 和 v2）、CFM 的欧拉采样器、提示序列、`PatchDecoder` 和生成循环","locale":"zh-CN"},"7257":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-41","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"`vae.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7258":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-42","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"AudioVAE v1 和 v2（因果卷积、Snake、采样率条件）以及 v2 的有状态流式解码器","locale":"zh-CN"},"7259":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-43","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"`text.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7260":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-44","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"按 transformers 5.3 的方式构建的分词器、上游对多字汉字 token 的拆分、文本规范化","locale":"zh-CN"},"7261":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-45","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"`engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7262":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-46","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"`VoxCpmEngine`、`LoadedVoxCpm`：精度、音色方式、音色缓存、重试、流式","locale":"zh-CN"},"7263":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-47","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"`train.py`、`sft.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7264":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-48","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"`VoxCpmTrainer`（方法 `full`、`lora`）及其计算","locale":"zh-CN"},"7265":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-49","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"`assets/wetext/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7266":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-50","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"wetext 0.1.2 的中文（带 `remove_erhua`）和英文文本规范化 FST（7.7 MB）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7267":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-51","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"共享模块：`runtime/ops.py`、`runtime/loading.py`（折叠权重归一化）、`runtime/graphs.py`、`nn/dsp/resample.py`（librosa 调用方式下的 soxr；torchaudio 的 sinc）、`nn/dsp/wav.py`、`nn/dsp/tiles.py`、`text/normalize/wetext.py`（其 `version=\"0.1\"` 的步骤）、`runtime/compile.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7268":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-52","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"**精度。** 与上游一样，先转换模型的精度再拷入检查点，所以 LongRoPE 表（以 float32 构建）随之舍入为 bf16。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7269":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-53","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"**注意力**使用 SDPA，`enable_gqa`，张量连续：预填充时为因果注意力，局部模块中为双向注意力，逐步生成时在显式布尔掩码下对静态缓存计算。上游对缓存的全部位置计算（超出当前长度的部分为零并被掩码）；在 CPU 上 Mizuoto 只算到当前长度之后第一个 256 的倍数（`minicpm.attend_span`），掩码保留。被掩码的位置只会加上精确的零，而 CPU 上的 SDPA 在任何 64 的倍数处截断都给出相同的结果位（以 bf16 和 fp32 对 3100 以内的每个位置检查过），所以结果完全相同，VoxCPM2 在 CPU 上快 1.5 倍。在 GPU 上则与上游一样对整个缓存计算：这一步走 SDPA 的 math 路径，其矩阵向量乘和 softmax 按键的长度划分求和，所以短于整个缓存的任何截断都不能给出相同的结果位（在 CUDA 上以 bf16、fp16 和 fp32 对 3100 以内的每个位置检查过）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7270":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-54","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"**随机性。** CFM 的噪声是推理时唯一的抽样，每块一次 `randn`，使用模型的精度。每次尝试都从一个以其种子初始化的新生成器抽样，与上游 `torch.manual_seed` 设置进程级随机流的位置相同。没有种子时，从请求的随机流中取一个 32 位种子（上游：`torch.seed()`），并在实际参数中报告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7271":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-55","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"**坏例重试。** 非流式结果若每个文本 token 对应 `retry_badcase_ratio_threshold` 块或更多，就用种子 + 1 重新生成，最多 `retry_badcase_max_times` 次；块数上限为 `min(tokens × ratio + 10, max_len)`。`applied.retries` 记录重新生成的次数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7272":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-56","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"**提示。** VoxCPM2 用 `librosa.load(sr=16000)`（soxr）读取音频；0.5B 和 1.5 用 `torchaudio.load` 和 `torchaudio.functional.resample`。续写提示在左侧补齐到整块，参考在右侧补齐。参考文本与待合成文本之间不加空格拼接，与上游相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7273":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-57","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"**文本。** 换行和连续空白变成一个空格，需要时再做文本规范化。VoxCPM2 的描述或指令变成 `(…)` 前缀，并去掉其中的括号，与上游网页演示相同；请求同时有两者时用 `, ` 连接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7274":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-58","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"**分词器**是 transformers 5.3 的 `LlamaTokenizer` 从词表构建出来的那个，忽略文件自带的流水线：没有 normalizer，`Metaspace` 使用 `prepend_scheme=\"always\"` 且不拆分，BPE 中没有未知 token，配置中的特殊 token 按 id 顺序添加（词表中没有的 token 取下一个空闲 id，所以 VoxCPM2 的 `<|im_end|>` 是 73442，而不是文件中的 73440）。直接使用 `tokenizer.json` 时，以空白开头或位于特殊 token 之后的文本会得到不同的 id。随后上游的包装把多字汉字 token 拆成单字；词表之外的字为 `<unk>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7275":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-59","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"**文本规范化**采用 wetext 0.1.2 的做法：在标注前和每个 FST 之后去掉首尾空白，开启 `remove_erhua` 时也处理含“儿”但不含数字的文本。它的 FST 与 wetext 0.0.4（CosyVoice 的共享资源）和 WeTextProcessing（IndexTTS）的都不同，所以随引擎提供。数字由 `inflect` 读出；Mizuoto 的 7.3.1 与上游的 7.5.0 在语料上给出相同的词。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7276":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-60","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"**解码。** VoxCPM2 从开头去掉解码出的上下文块（提示的最后 `min(3, n)` 块）；第一代只要有提示音频就去掉 `2 × patch × hop` 个采样，与上游一样不管提示多长。流式时每块输出一段：VoxCPM2 经有状态的因果解码器，第一代则解码最后三块并保留最新的一块。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7277":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-61","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"**Snake** 按上游的顺序计算上游的运算，是一个普通函数（上游用 TorchScript 编译它：见有意的差异）；权重归一化用 `torch._weight_norm` 折叠，即上游钩子在每次前向时做的调用，并在 VAE 运行的设备上进行（GPU 的归约与 CPU 给出的比特不同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7278":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-62","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#有意的差异","content":"**未提供**：用 ZipEnhancer 对参考音频降噪（`denoise`；一个 ModelScope 流水线外加第二个模型，上游默认关闭）、时间戳（stable-ts）、上游在 CUDA 上的 `torch.compile`（`optimize`）以及 vLLM 服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7279":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-63","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#有意的差异","content":"**长文本**由 Mizuoto 切分；上游不切分。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7280":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-64","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#有意的差异","content":"**VoxCPM2 带参考文本克隆时**同时使用参考*和*续写，与上游网页演示相同（`reference_prefix`，默认开启）。上游的 Python 接口只在调用方传入 `reference_wav_path` 时才加参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7281":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-65","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#有意的差异","content":"**`compute.compile`** 包装局部 DiT。在 CPU 上以 bf16 运行时没有收益，而且它的浮点差异可能改变语音结束的位置（VoxCPM-0.5B：56 320 对 55 040 个采样）；默认关闭。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7282":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-66","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#有意的差异","content":"**Snake 不再编译为 TorchScript。** 上游的 TorchScript `snake` 在 CUDA 上从某个形状的第二次调用起被融合，相差最多 4.8e-7：一个请求的数值取决于进程见过的形状（第一个请求与之后的不同），融合器还在默认设备上编译，使工作在 `cuda:1` 上的进程在 `cuda:0` 上打开 256 MB 的上下文。作为普通函数，同样的运算以 eager 方式运行：在 CPU 上（从不融合）与原来相同，也与上游在某个形状上的第一次调用相同，每个请求都一样，VAE 慢约 1 %。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7283":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-67","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#显存与速度","content":"阶段：VAE 为音色提示编码并负责解码；模型（`kind=\"sequence\"`；局部编码器和 DiT 标为 `hot`，因为它们每块要运行多次）负责生成；流式时两者同时在位。开启 `compute.oom_fallback` 时，若 VAE 显存不足，就按 256 个潜变量帧一块分块解码，每块之前带上第一个样本所依赖的 20–22 帧（解码器是因果的）：与整段的样本只差求和的舍入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7284":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-68","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#显存与速度","content":"一块包括 DiT 的欧拉步（每步一对引导计算）、局部编码器、停止头和两个语言模型各一步：约 6 000 个小内核，外加三次等待设备（停止标志，以及每个语言模型从 Python 整数拷贝的位置）。`model.PatchDecoder` 在固定张量上运行一块，只等待设备一次，用于读取停止标志。语言模型在读取标志之前就前进一步（上游先读标志，在前进之前就停止）；它们不抽样，生成结束时缓存也会丢弃，所以各块完全相同。缓存满时，在上游那一步会报错的地方同样报错。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7285":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-69","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#显存与速度","content":"开启 `compute.cuda_graphs`（NVIDIA，模型完整位于设备上，`compute.compile` 关闭）时，一块就是一个 CUDA 图，按步数和引导值各一个（那里的注意力跨度是整个缓存）；DiT 的噪声从 CUDA 图自己的生成器抽取，该生成器每块从请求的生成器载入并写回。此时只要保留 CUDA 图，语言模型的静态缓存就随模型保留（这是请求本来就需要的显存），在权重移动或模型卸载时释放。真实的 0.5B 和 1.5 在有无 CUDA 图时音频相同，每个请求快 1.6–1.9 倍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7286":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-70","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#显存与速度","content":"**快速模式**（加载选项 `attention_span`，默认关闭）：在 GPU 上每一步也只关注缓存中已填充的块，与 CPU 上一样，而不是全部 8192 个位置（GPU 上只有关注整个缓存才精确，这使 VoxCPM 在 G1 中慢了 1.4–1.7 倍）。在 RTX 3090 上：VoxCPM2 每个请求 2.13 → 1.26 秒（×1.69），1.5 0.95 → 0.68 秒（×1.40）；那里的音频是同一请求的另一次生成，CPU 上完全相同；输出中会注明（`applied.attention_span`）。安装了 FlashAttention 时，`compute.attention = fast` 通过注意力内核达到同样的效果（×1.64 和 ×1.17）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7287":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-71","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#训练","content":"方法 `full` 和 `lora`（`train.py`，计算在 `sft.py`），即上游的 `train_voxcpm_finetune.py` 及其按模型的方案（`conf/<model>/*.yaml`），留为 0 的超参数由方案填入。不需要 `datasets`、`transformers`、`argbind` 或 tensorboard。阶段：`prepare`（按 VAE 的采样率读取音频，读法与 `datasets` 相同：soundfile 的 float64 和 `librosa.resample` 的 soxr；文本的 token；`max_batch_tokens` 过滤）、`train`、`export`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7288":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-72","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#训练","content":"**按上游的顺序抽样**，使用以 42 播种的私有生成器（上游的 `Accelerator` 用 42 给每个生成器播种）：重放构建时的默认初始化（先 VAE，再模型，然后是用 Kaiming 初始化的 LoRA `A`，其值被保留；其余由检查点覆盖）；每次遍历数据加载器时抽基础种子和采样器的种子；每次前向时抽 CFM 的掩码、条件噪声（即使比例为 0 也会抽）、`r`、`t` 和 `z`，以及 LoRA 的 dropout 掩码。在 CPU 上一个生成器负责全部抽样，与上游的默认生成器相同；在 CUDA 上前向的抽样来自设备生成器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7289":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-73","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#训练","content":"**精度。** 在 CUDA 上与上游相同：float32 权重，bf16 自动混合精度，带梯度缩放器。其他设备全程 float32：上游用它的配置无法在 CUDA 以外训练（前向把输入转成配置中的 bf16，而权重仍是 float32），所以 CPU 上的参考实现是配置 `config.json` 为 float32 的上游。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7290":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-74","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#训练","content":"**保持上游的做法**：每段音频在右侧补齐到整块；停止标签在最后一块，损失只算音频位置；每个微批次的损失除以累积步数；关闭裁剪时梯度按 1e9 裁剪；记录的学习率是下一步的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7291":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-75","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#训练","content":"**导出。** 全量：`model.safetensors`（float32，上游的键名），与基础模型的配置、VAE 和分词器放在一起。LoRA：基础权重（文件系统允许时用硬链接）加 `lora_weights.safetensors` 和 `lora_config.json`，在引擎加载时应用，与上游的 `VoxCPM(lora_weights_path=…)` 相同；上游从不合并它们。没有 3–15 秒的音频时，预览以零样本方式朗读。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7292":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-76","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#训练","content":"`training.memory`：对 MiniCPM 各层、局部编码器和 DiT 做梯度检查点，结果完全相同（重放 LoRA dropout 和 CFM 的抽样）；VAE 的解码器不放到设备上；对 LoRA，`low` 以自动混合精度的类型存放冻结的线性层权重（CUDA），`lowest` 从内存流式载入它们（在 CPU 上结果相同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7293":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-77","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#对照结果","content":"**组件**，每个模型在 bf16 和 fp32 下：分词器和文本规范化在 420 条文本上，VAE 的潜变量和解码；然后是各种方式的完整请求（中英文的零样本和克隆、只用参考、只用续写、设计、带指令的克隆音色、文本规范化、强制重试、有无音色的流式，包括分块长度）。全部完全相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7294":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-78","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#对照结果","content":"**完整链路**，27 个用例（每种音色方式、文本规范化、强制重试、流式、多段、其他步数和引导值、通过 `engines.voxcpm.dtype` 设为 fp32）：音频和行为（实际参数、警告、音色方式、分段、流式分块长度）全部完全相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7295":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-79","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#对照结果","content":"**训练**：VoxCPM-0.5B 全量、VoxCPM-0.5B LoRA 和 VoxCPM2 LoRA 在每一步都与上游脚本相同（两项损失、梯度范数、学习率），保存的权重也相同。每个导出结果无论由上游还是 Mizuoto 加载，朗读结果都相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7296":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-80","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#对照结果","content":"契约套件全部通过（三个模型共 18 项测试）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7297":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-81","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#对照结果","content":"**在 GPU 上**（RTX 3090，2026-10-19，与上游的包对照，每个用例在新进程中运行）：语言模型、局部编码器、DiT 和潜变量都相同；把 Snake 像上游那样脚本化（仅作实验）后，v1.5 fp32 零样本、v2 零样本和 v2 克隆用例都逐采样相同。按发布的做法（Snake 即时执行）与上游相差 72–76 dB，与上游在不同进程历史下与自己的差别相当（v1.5 fp32 零样本为 74.5 dB；一个 v2 克隆甚至长度都变了）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7298":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-82","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#限制","content":"没有参考音频降噪，也没有时间戳。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7299":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-83","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#限制","content":"在 CUDA 上，进程中的第一个请求解码其潜变量（潜变量相同）时，结果位与之后的请求略有不同；之后的请求彼此完全一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7300":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-84","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#限制","content":"VoxCPM2 的全量微调约需 40 GB 内存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7301":{"id":"/docs/engines","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"page","content":"引擎参考","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","引擎参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines","locale":"zh-CN"},"7302":{"id":"/docs/engines-0","page_id":"/docs/engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines","content":"每个内置引擎在 Mizuoto 中怎样实现、与上游一致到什么程度：变体、代码位置、对照结果和训练方法，“一致”如何定义与检查，以及每个引擎都遵守的规则。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7303":{"id":"/docs/engines-1","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines#引擎一览","content":"引擎一览","locale":"zh-CN"},"7304":{"id":"/docs/engines-2","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines#相同指什么","content":"“相同”指什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"7305":{"id":"/docs/engines-3","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines#参考实现","content":"参考实现","locale":"zh-CN"},"7306":{"id":"/docs/engines-4","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines#条件","content":"条件","locale":"zh-CN"},"7307":{"id":"/docs/engines-5","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines#层级","content":"层级","locale":"zh-CN"},"7308":{"id":"/docs/engines-6","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines#怎样检查","content":"怎样检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"7309":{"id":"/docs/engines-7","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines#每个引擎都遵守的规则","content":"每个引擎都遵守的规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"7310":{"id":"/docs/engines-8","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines#共享构件","content":"共享构件","locale":"zh-CN"},"7311":{"id":"/docs/engines-9","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines#需接受许可的引擎","content":"需接受许可的引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"7312":{"id":"/docs/engines-10","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines#限制","content":"限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"7313":{"id":"/docs/engines-11","page_id":"/docs/engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines","content":"Mizuoto 的每个引擎都是一个移植版：把上游项目的模型代码，在 Mizuoto 的运行时（`mizuoto/runtime`）和共享构件（`mizuoto/nn`、`mizuoto/text`）之上重新写一遍。不内嵌任何上游代码，也没有引擎导入 transformers、onnxruntime 或上游的包。每个移植版都遵守同一个标准：在 CPU 上、以 fp32、用同一个种子运行时，它逐采样地给出被它取代的那份代码的输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7314":{"id":"/docs/engines-12","page_id":"/docs/engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines","content":"本节逐个引擎记录：做到这一点需要什么，引擎在哪些地方有意与上游不同，它怎样使用显存、怎样跑得快，怎样训练，以及对照的结果。该选哪个引擎、各自能做什么，见引擎详解；引擎怎样编写和注册，见接入引擎。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7315":{"id":"/docs/engines-13","page_id":"/docs/engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines#引擎一览","content":"引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"7316":{"id":"/docs/engines-14","page_id":"/docs/engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines#引擎一览","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"7317":{"id":"/docs/engines-15","