ale":"zh-CN"},"7547":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型","content":"**内置**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7548":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型","content":"演示引擎的模型，不需要下载","locale":"zh-CN"},"7549":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型","content":"可以做的操作：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7550":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型","content":"**下载**：下载缺少的文件。下载会续传、核对每个文件的大小和 SHA-256，某个来源缺文件时自动换下一个来源（见下载来源）。它需要的共享文件随之一起下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7551":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型","content":"**校验**：重新计算已安装模型所有文件的 SHA-256。完好时提示 **全部 N 个文件完好**，否则列出 **已损坏：文件名**。已损坏的模型可以删除后重新下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7552":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型","content":"删除按钮：删除模型文件（确认提示 **删除 模型名？之后可以重新下载。**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7553":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#导入模型文件夹","content":"已经有模型文件（之前下载的、别处拷来的、微调的结果）时，点 **导入模型文件夹**，选择服务器上的一个文件夹。这个按钮只在服务器本机的浏览器中出现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7554":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#导入模型文件夹","content":"Mizuoto 根据文件判断它属于哪个引擎、哪个变体：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7555":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#导入模型文件夹","content":"文件大小与目录中的某个模型一致时，再核对 SHA-256，通过后作为该目录模型导入；","locale":"zh-CN"},"7556":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#导入模型文件夹","content":"否则作为用户模型导入，id 为 `引擎/文件夹名`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7557":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#导入模型文件夹","content":"命令行可以指定名称，或移动而不是复制：`mizuoto model import <文件夹> [--name 名称] [--move]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7558":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#引擎","content":"每个引擎一张卡片：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7559":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#引擎","content":"标题下方是模型数量和许可名称（语音识别显示 **供 Mizuoto 自身使用**），右侧是 **可用** 或 **不可用**；引擎在远程主机上运行时还显示 **在 主机 上**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7560":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#引擎","content":"一句引擎说明。不可用时说明缺什么：**需要** *torch*（或 *mizuoto-indextts* 等）**，但尚未安装：运行 mizuoto doctor 查看安装方法。** 除了需要接受许可的引擎是单独的发行包，其他引擎都是 Mizuoto 的一部分（见首次运行）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7561":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#设备精度启用","content":"**设备**：**自动**，本机上该引擎支持的设备（如 `cuda:0`、`cpu`），以及已添加的、该引擎在其上可用的远程主机的设备（显示为“主机 · 设备”）。选了远程设备后，这个引擎在那台机器上运行，卡片显示 **在 主机 上**，其依赖也由那台机器管理（见远程主机）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7562":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#设备精度启用","content":"**精度**：**自动**、`bf16`、`fp16`、`fp32`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7563":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#设备精度启用","content":"**已启用**：关闭后这个引擎的模型不能使用，合成页底部会改为提供 **启用** 按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7564":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#设备精度启用","content":"修改这些设置会卸载该引擎的模型，下次使用时按新设置加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7565":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"引擎有加载选项时，卡片上有 **选项**：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7566":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"7567":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"7568":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"CosyVoice","locale":"zh-CN"},"7569":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"`fp16`：在 GPU 上用半精度，更快，结果略有不同；`fused_projections`（2 和 3）：快速模式，在 GPU 上快 1–5%，结果可能不再逐位一致","locale":"zh-CN"},"7570":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"IndexTTS 2 / 2.5","locale":"zh-CN"},"7571":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"`use_qwen_emo`（把文字描述的情感转成权重的情感模型，约 1.2 GB）、`use_torch_compile`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7572":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"F5-TTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"7573":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"`ode_method`（`euler` 或 `midpoint`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7574":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"Qwen3-TTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"7575":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"`fused_projections`：快速模式，在 GPU 上快几个百分点，结果不再逐位一致","locale":"zh-CN"},"7576":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"VoxCPM","locale":"zh-CN"},"7577":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"`attention_span`：快速模式，在 GPU 上快 1.4–1.7 倍，那里的结果不再逐位一致","locale":"zh-CN"},"7578":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"**更改在模型下次加载时生效（其模型现在会被卸载）。** **设置 › 计算** 中的 **编译模型（torch.compile）** 可以同时为多个引擎提速。详见性能。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7579":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查本机","content":"展开 **检查本机**，列出这个引擎在本机上的检查结果：torch 及其构建是否与显卡匹配、引擎是否可用、它能用到的可选扩展（如 GPT-SoVITS 的日语前端），有问题的项后面附带修复命令。命令行：`mizuoto doctor <引擎>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7580":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#许可","content":"需要接受许可的引擎（Fish Speech、IndexTTS）卡片上有 **接受许可** 按钮，打开许可全文；接受后显示 **已接受许可**。见首次运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7581":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#共享文件","content":"**同一引擎的多个模型共用的文件，随第一个需要它们的模型一起下载一次。** 例如 GPT-SoVITS 的编码器、G2PW、NLTK 数据、Open JTalk 词典和训练用的判别器，IndexTTS-2 的 w2v-BERT、语义编解码器、CAM++、BigVGAN，以及 CosyVoice 的文本规范化语法。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7582":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#共享文件","content":"每行显示名称、大小、说明和 **用于 模型列表**。可以单独 **下载** 或删除。缺少某个共享文件的模型显示为 **部分下载**。共享文件保存在数据文件夹的 `models/_assets/<引擎>/` 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7583":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"page","content":"项目","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects","locale":"zh-CN"},"7584":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects","content":"项目页：由一组角色逐句朗读整本书、剧本或对话，包括导入脚本、编辑台词、生成、管理版本与导出带字幕的音频。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7585":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#项目列表","content":"项目列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"7586":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#新建项目","content":"新建项目","locale":"zh-CN"},"7587":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"脚本格式","locale":"zh-CN"},"7588":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#导入脚本","content":"导入脚本","locale":"zh-CN"},"7589":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#编辑脚本","content":"编辑脚本","locale":"zh-CN"},"7590":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#章节","content":"章节","locale":"zh-CN"},"7591":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"台词","locale":"zh-CN"},"7592":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"台词状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"7593":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"角色","locale":"zh-CN"},"7594":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#生成","content":"生成","locale":"zh-CN"},"7595":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#版本","content":"版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"7596":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"导出","locale":"zh-CN"},"7597":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#删除","content":"删除","locale":"zh-CN"},"7598":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#命令行","content":"命令行","locale":"zh-CN"},"7599":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects","content":"**项目** 用来朗读长篇内容：一本书、一份剧本或一段多人对话。一个项目由两部分组成：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7600":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects","content":"**脚本**：若干章节，每章是一句一句的台词。每句有文本和说话的角色，可以单独加风格指令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7601":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects","content":"**角色表**：每个角色有自己的模型、音色（音色库中的音色、预置说话人或模型自带的音色）、语言、说话方式和参数。**第一个角色是旁白**：没有指定角色的句子都由旁白朗读。没有选模型的角色使用项目的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7602":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects","content":"每一句单独生成，生成结果称为一个**版本**。改了某句的文本、角色或设置后，只需重新生成这一句；最后把所有句子按设定的停顿拼成一个文件，并附带字幕。不同角色可以用不同引擎的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7603":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects","content":"项目保存在数据文件夹的 `projects/<名称>/project.json` 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7604":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#项目列表","content":"在导航栏打开 **项目**。每张卡片显示项目名称、已生成句数/总句数（有失败的句子时显示为红色）、描述、**N 章 · N 句**、**N 个角色**、已生成部分的时长，以及一条按句子状态着色的进度条。点卡片打开项目。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7605":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#新建项目","content":"点 **新建项目**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7606":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#新建项目","content":"填写 **项目名称**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7607":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#新建项目","content":"选择 **模型**：项目的默认模型，旁白和其他没有单独选模型的角色都用它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7608":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#新建项目","content":"可选：在 **脚本** 中粘贴一份脚本（格式见下一节），并在 **按此切分台词** 中选择 **每行文本** 或 **每个句子**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7609":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#新建项目","content":"点 **创建**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7610":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#新建项目","content":"新项目自带一个名为 **旁白** 的角色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7611":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"导入的脚本是纯文本，规则如下（输入框下方也有提示）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7612":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"写法","locale":"zh-CN"},"7613":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"7614":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"`# 标题`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7615":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"开始新的一章，标题为 `#` 之后的文字","locale":"zh-CN"},"7616":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"`名字：文本`（全角或半角冒号），或 `[名字]: 文本`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7617":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"该角色的一句台词（见下方规则）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7618":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"其他行","locale":"zh-CN"},"7619":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"旁白的台词","locale":"zh-CN"},"7620":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"空行","locale":"zh-CN"},"7621":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"结束一个段落（导出时段落之后的停顿更长）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7622":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"`名字：` 前缀在以下任一情况下才被当作角色名，否则整行原样作为旁白的台词：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7623":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"这个名字已经在角色表中；","locale":"zh-CN"},"7624":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"同一个名字出现在两行或更多行的开头；","locale":"zh-CN"},"7625":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"脚本是一段对话（已有某个名字满足上面两条之一），并且这个前缀**看起来像名字**：以字母或汉字开头、最多三个词，例如 `Dr. Watson`、`林黛玉`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7626":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"因此，在不是对话的脚本中，偶尔出现的“注意：明天停电”不会被当作角色；但在对话脚本中，任何看起来像名字的前缀都会成为角色。每个名字都只出现一次的对话不会被识别，这时先在 **角色** 中添加同名角色再导入即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7627":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"新出现的名字自动加入角色表。它们还没有模型和音色（使用项目的模型），导入后在 **角色** 中为它们选择音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7628":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"第一个 `#` 之前的台词放进一章：项目还没有任何章节时，这章以项目名为标题，否则不加标题。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7