-CN"},"7673":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"**修改后未重新生成**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7674":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"有版本，但之后改过文本、角色、角色的模型、音色或参数，或者所用的音色库音色本身改过","locale":"zh-CN"},"7675":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-91","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"**未生成**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7676":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-92","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"还没有版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"7677":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-93","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"**失败**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7678":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-94","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"最近一次生成失败，原因显示在句子下方","locale":"zh-CN"},"7679":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-95","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"**生成中**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7680":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-96","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"正在生成","locale":"zh-CN"},"7681":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-97","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"**空**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7682":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-98","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"没有文本，生成和导出时跳过","locale":"zh-CN"},"7683":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-99","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"**角色** 标签页上方的 **项目** 部分可以修改项目的 **模型**、**项目名称** 和 **描述**。下面是每个角色一张卡片：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7684":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-100","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"**角色名称**；第一个角色带有 **旁白** 标记；旁边显示这个角色的句数和移除按钮。移除角色后，它的台词交给旁白。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7685":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-101","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"**模型**：没选时标签显示 **模型（使用项目的：…）**；选了之后可以点 **使用项目的模型** 改回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7686":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-102","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"音色：**音色库中的音色**、**预置说话人** 或 **模型自带音色**，只列出这个模型支持的方式。选音色库音色时，选择器同样标出这个模型能否使用每个音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7687":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-103","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"**语言**：**使用项目的语言**，或模型支持的某种语言。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7688":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-104","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"**说话方式**：这个角色每句话的风格指令（模型支持指令时才显示）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7689":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-105","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"**参数**：展开后与合成页的参数面板相同；有改动时显示 **已设置 N 项**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7690":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-106","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"角色的模型（或项目的模型）变化时，它的设置会保留，换回原来的模型就会恢复。每句话的请求只带上它的模型支持的风格指令、参数和引擎选项；其余的保留但不使用。保留着但模型不遵循的指令（或在当前音色下不遵循）会在栏下注明，这个角色的句子也不再提供 **添加风格指令**。新模型没有的预置说话人或语言会在卡片上标出：它们决定说出来的内容，所以在重新选择之前，这些句子会生成失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7691":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-107","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"**添加角色** 新建一个角色。项目本身的语言在同一标签页的 **项目** 中设置（**语言**；**由各模型决定** 表示交给各模型），也可以用 `mizuoto project set --lang`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7692":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-108","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"角色的模型、音色、语言、说话方式或参数变化后，这个角色已生成的句子都会变为 **修改后未重新生成**。导出设置中的 **每句音量统一** 也属于生成设置，修改它会让所有句子过期。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7693":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-109","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#生成","content":"页面底部有两个按钮：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7694":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-110","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#生成","content":"**生成本章（N）**：生成当前章节中所有不是 **已生成** 的句子（未生成、过期、失败的）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7695":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-111","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#生成","content":"**全部生成（N）**：对整个项目做同样的事。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7696":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-112","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#生成","content":"生成是一个 **生成项目** 任务，每章一个步骤。它为每句提交一个普通的合成任务，同时保持最多 8 个在排队，这样 **设置 › 语音 › 合并等待中的请求** 可以把模型、音色和设置都相同、只有文本不同的句子合并为一批运行（在支持批处理的引擎上，例如 Qwen3-TTS、GPT-SoVITS、OmniVoice）。这些合成任务不会逐个弹出提示，只有整个生成任务结束时提示一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7697":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-113","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#生成","content":"一句失败不影响其他句子：失败的句子标为 **失败** 并记下原因，其余继续生成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7698":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-114","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#生成","content":"取消生成任务会一并取消它已提交的合成任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7699":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-115","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#生成","content":"生成过程中仍可以编辑脚本；改过的句子会按新的内容判断是否过期。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7700":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-116","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#版本","content":"每次生成一句都会新增一个版本并立即使用它。每句最多保留 5 个版本，更早的、未在使用的版本会被删除。在台词菜单中点 **第 N 版** 可以换回旧版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7701":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-117","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#版本","content":"版本是 FLAC 格式的结果，不显示在历史中。删除句子、章节或项目时，它们的版本一并删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7702":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-118","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"**导出** 标签页：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7703":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-119","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"7704":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-120","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"默认","locale":"zh-CN"},"7705":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-121","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"7706":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-122","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"**句间停顿（毫秒）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7707":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-123","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"350","locale":"zh-CN"},"7708":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-124","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"同一段落内两句之间的静音","locale":"zh-CN"},"7709":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-125","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"**段间停顿（毫秒）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7710":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-126","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"800","locale":"zh-CN"},"7711":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-127","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"段落结尾之后的静音","locale":"zh-CN"},"7712":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-128","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"**章间停顿（毫秒）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7713":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-129","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"2000","locale":"zh-CN"},"7714":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-130","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"一次导出多章时，章与章之间的静音","locale":"zh-CN"},"7715":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-131","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"**格式**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7716":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-132","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"WAV","locale":"zh-CN"},"7717":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-133","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"WAV、FLAC、MP3、OGG、M4A","locale":"zh-CN"},"7718":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-134","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"**采样率**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7719":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-135","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"24000","locale":"zh-CN"},"7720":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-136","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"所有版本重采样到这个采样率（不同角色的模型采样率可能不同）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7721":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-137","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"**每句音量统一**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7722":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-138","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"**按响度**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7723":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-139","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"**按响度**、**按峰值** 或 **保持原样**；在生成每句时应用","locale":"zh-CN"},"7724":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-140","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"**导出已生成的部分**：关闭时（默认），要导出的范围内每一句都必须是 **已生成**，否则报错；打开后，从未生成的句子不导出，修改后未重新生成的句子使用它们现有的录音。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7725":{"id":"/