"content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"7887":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-speak#模型还没准备好时","content":"模型还没准备好时","locale":"zh-CN"},"7888":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"7889":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色库","content":"音色库","locale":"zh-CN"},"7890":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-speak#一段音频","content":"一段音频","locale":"zh-CN"},"7891":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-speak#参考文本与语音识别","content":"参考文本与语音识别","locale":"zh-CN"},"7892":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-speak#文本","content":"文本","locale":"zh-CN"},"7893":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-speak#风格","content":"风格","locale":"zh-CN"},"7894":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-speak#参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"7895":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-speak#预设","content":"预设","locale":"zh-CN"},"7896":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-speak#计划合成与流式播放","content":"计划、合成与流式播放","locale":"zh-CN"},"7897":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"7898":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-speak#命令行","content":"命令行","locale":"zh-CN"},"7899":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak","content":"**合成** 页把文本变成语音。页面从上到下依次是 **模型**、**音色**、**文本**、**风格**（模型支持时）、**参数** 和 **结果**；**合成** 按钮固定在页面底部。各部分只显示所选模型支持的选项，换模型后界面会随之变化。换模型时已设置的内容会保留，换回原来的模型就会恢复，但只有界面上显示的内容才会发给模型：比如为 IndexTTS-2 设置的情感不会发给 Qwen3-TTS。参数例外：每个模型都从自己的默认值（或它的默认预设）开始。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7900":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#模型","content":"点 **模型** 打开选择器，可以搜索。列表包含所有语音合成引擎的全部模型（包括还没安装的），每项显示引擎、变体、大小和所需显存，并用标记说明还缺什么：**演示**（演示引擎）、**不可用**（引擎还缺需要安装的内容）、**许可**（需要接受许可）、模型状态（如 **未下载**）、**推荐**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7901":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#模型","content":"模型下方的标签列出它的能力，例如 **克隆音色**、**预置说话人**、**指令**、**流式输出**、**长文本**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7902":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#模型","content":"第一次打开时，界面选择 **设置 › 语音 › 默认模型**；没有设置时选第一个已就绪的模型。之后记住你上次的选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7903":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#模型还没准备好时","content":"没准备好的模型也可以选。此时底部的 **合成** 按钮会换成它缺少的**第一步**，点一下就开始，并显示进度：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7904":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#模型还没准备好时","content":"按钮","locale":"zh-CN"},"7905":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#模型还没准备好时","content":"原因","locale":"zh-CN"},"7906":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#模型还没准备好时","content":"**启用**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7907":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#模型还没准备好时","content":"该引擎在 **模型 › 引擎** 中被停用了","locale":"zh-CN"},"7908":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#模型还没准备好时","content":"**接受 引擎名 的许可**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7909":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#模型还没准备好时","content":"需要接受许可的引擎（Fish Speech、IndexTTS），打开许可对话框","locale":"zh-CN"},"7910":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#模型还没准备好时","content":"**引擎名 需要 torch**…，附安装命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"7911":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#模型还没准备好时","content":"引擎不可用：torch 或需要接受许可的引擎的发行包还没安装。请把它装到 Mizuoto 所用的 Python 中，然后重启 Mizuoto","locale":"zh-CN"},"7912":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#模型还没准备好时","content":"**下载 模型名（大小）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7913":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#模型还没准备好时","content":"模型还没下载","locale":"zh-CN"},"7914":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#模型还没准备好时","content":"都完成后 **合成** 按钮回来。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7915":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"模型取得音色的方式不同，**音色** 部分会列出它支持的几种：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7916":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"7917":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"用法","locale":"zh-CN"},"7918":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"**音色库**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7919":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"从音色库中选一个音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"7920":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"**一段音频**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7921":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"上传或录一段参考音频，克隆它的声音","locale":"zh-CN"},"7922":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"**预置说话人**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7923":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"选择模型自带的说话人（如 Qwen3-TTS CustomVoice、CosyVoice 300M SFT）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7924":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"**描述音色**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7925":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"用文字描述（Qwen3-TTS VoiceDesign、VoxCPM2），或从固定的属性中选择（OmniVoice）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7926":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"**自带音色**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7927":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"不指定音色，模型用自己的声音说话","locale":"zh-CN"},"7928":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"换模型后，界面会自动选一个合适的方式：如果之前选的音色库音色适合新模型就保留它，否则依次尝试预置说话人、描述、一段音频。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7929":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色库","content":"选择器中每个音色都带有标记，说明**这个模型**能否、以何种方式使用它：**克隆**、**克隆（无文本）**、**预置说话人**、**设计** 等；需要额外处理时另有 **先识别文本**（参考音频缺少文本，合成前先转写）或 **裁剪以适配**（音频太长，会被截短）。不能使用的音色显示为灰色并附带原因。音色库为空时可以点 **新建音色**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7930":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#一段音频","content":"把音频拖到 **将音频文件拖放到这里**，或点击选择文件（WAV、FLAC、MP3、M4A、OGG 等）。也可以：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7931":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#一段音频","content":"点 **录音** 用麦克风录一段，录音时显示 **输入电平**，提示 **参考音频以 3 到 30 秒的清晰语音为佳**；点 **停止并添加** 或 **放弃**。浏览器只在 HTTPS 或本机（localhost）上允许使用麦克风。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7932":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#一段音频","content":"点 **服务器文件** 选择服务器上的文件（只在服务器本机的浏览器中可用）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7933":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#一段音频","content":"点 **之前的结果** 选择一个合成结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7934":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#一段音频","content":"在 **音频中说的内容** 中填写音频的文本。可以点 **识别文本** 让语音识别现在就填好，再自己修改。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7935":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#参考文本与语音识别","content":"多数模型克隆时需要参考音频的文本。文本留空时：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7936":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#参考文本与语音识别","content":"**设置 › 语音 › 自动识别没有文本的参考音频** 打开、且已安装语音识别：Mizuoto 先查转写缓存，没有就在合成任务中先转写（计划中显示 **先识别文本**）。音色库音色的转写结果会保存回音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7937":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#参考文本与语音识别","content":"没有语音识别：模型支持无文本克隆时按 **克隆（无文本）** 处理；否则报错，并提示如何安装语音识别。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7938":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#参考文本与语音识别","content":"参考音频超出模型允许的时长时，按 **设置 › 语音 › 参考音频对模型来说过长时** 处理：默认 **裁剪以适配**（在限制之前最安静的位置截断，原文本随之作废），也可以改为 **拒绝**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7939":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#文本","content":"**文本** 框最多 20000 个字符。在框中按 Ctrl+Enter 直接合成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7940":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#文本","content":"**语言**：**自动识别**，或模型支持的某种语言。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7941":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#文本","content":"**每行一个结果**：支持批量的模型（Qwen3-TTS、GPT-SoVITS、OmniVoice）才有这个开关；打开后每行文本各生成一个结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7942":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#文本","content":"停止输入片刻后，文本框下方会显示 Mizuoto 将如何切分长文本（**N 段**，每段一个标签）；如果模型自己处理长文本，则显示 **引擎会自行切分长文本**。段与段之间的停顿由参数 **段间停顿（毫秒）** 决定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7943":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#风格","content":"模型支持指令或情感时才显示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7944":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#风格","content":"**怎么说**：一句风格指令，例如“开心地，稍快一些”（Qwen3-TTS 1.7B CustomVoice、CosyVoice 2 和 3、CosyVoice 300M Instruct）。有些模型只在某类音色下遵循指令（CosyVoice 2 和 3 需要参考音频，CosyVoice 300M Instruct 需要预置说话人）；用其他音色时这一栏变灰，并说明需要哪类音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7945":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#风格","content":"情感（IndexTTS-2 和 2.5）有三种给法，按模型支持的显示：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7946":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#风格","content":"**情感权重**：每种情感一个 0–1 的滑块（**高兴**、**愤怒**、**悲伤**、**恐惧**、**厌恶**、**忧郁**、**惊讶**、**平静**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7947":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#风格","content":"**来自音频**：一段 **情感参考音频**，只借用它的情感，不借用它的音色；**强度** 0–2。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7948":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#风格","content":"**文字描述**：在 **描述情感** 中用文字写出来。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7949":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#参数","content":"**参数** 部分只列出这个模型接受的参数；不动的参数不会发送，由引擎使用自己的默认值。引擎特有的选项收在 **引擎选项** 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7950":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#参数","content":"**种子**：留空表示 **每次使用新的种子**；填一个数则 **保持这个种子**，同样的输入会得到同样的结果。骰子按钮 **随机一个种子**，解锁按钮回到每次新种子。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7951":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#参数","content":"**输出**：**格式**（WAV、FLAC、MP3、OGG、M4A）、**采样率**（**模型原生**，或 16–48 kHz）和 **音量均衡**（**峰值**、**响度**、**不处理**）。默认值来自 **设置 › 语音**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7952":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#预设","content":"点 **预设** 打开菜单：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7953":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#预设","content":"列表中的预设点一下即应用（标有 **默认** 或 **所有模型**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7954":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#预设","content":"**另存为预设…**：填 **预设名称**；勾选 **仅用于 模型名** 则保存全部参数，否则只保存通用参数，适用于所有模型（含有引擎选项的预设只能用于当前模型）。勾选 **选中此模型时自动应用** 则设为该模型的默认预设。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7955":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#预设","content":"**管理预设…**：**设为默认**、**取消默认**、删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7956":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#预设","content":"选中一个模型时，界面自动应用它的默认预设；所选音色有自己的默认预设时优先用音色的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7957":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#计划合成与流式播放","content":"**计划**：不真正合成，只显示 **将要执行的操作**：模型、音色方式、语言、设备、分段数、发送的参数、每段参考音频（以及是否 **先识别文本**）和 **提示**。参数不合适时在这里就会报错。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7958":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#计划合成与流式播放","content":"**合成**：提交一个合成任务。任务卡片显示在页面底部，完成后结果出现在 **结果** 中。有多个任务时，它们收成一行 **… 个任务**，显示运行中和排队的数量（**… 个运行中 · … 个排队**）、总体进度和一个全部取消的按钮；展开后在可滚动的列表中显示每个任务的卡片。默认跨所有引擎和设备一次只运行一个合成任务，其余任务按顺序排队，显示 **等待其他合成任务**（**设置 › 计算 › 同时运行的合成任务**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7959":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#计划合成与流式播放","content":"**流式**：打开这个开关（位于 **计划** 和 **合成** 旁）后，**合成** 会边生成边播放。悬停可以看到当前模型的方式：CosyVoice 在首批词语生成后即开始播放；其他引擎每句生成好就播放；或由 Mizuoto 拆分文本，每段生成好就播放。播放条显示 **已播放 … · 已就绪 …**，可以 **停止**。模型跟不上时播放会暂停等待，不会丢掉语音；完整的结果照样保存在 **结果** 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7960":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#计划合成与流式播放","content":"流式播放需要浏览器支持 AudioWorklet，并通过 HTTPS 或服务器本机的 localhost 访问。若播放失败，展开错误提示中的 **详情**，可查看页面来源、安全上下文、浏览器和采样率，以及缺少的接口或初始化时的浏览器异常。点 **复制** 可将诊断信息附在问题报告中。已提交的合成任务会继续，完成后可在 **结果** 中播放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7961":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"**结果** 列出本次在合成页生成的语音。每条显示文本、时长、波形（点击或拖动跳转）、模型、耗时、实时率（RTF）和种子，以及警告和许可声明。右侧菜单：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7962":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"7963":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"7964":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"**收藏** / **取消收藏**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7965":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"在历史中可以只看收藏","locale":"zh-CN"},"7966":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"**下载**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7967":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"下载文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"7968":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"**在文件夹中显示**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7969":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"只在服务器本机的浏览器中出现","locale":"zh-CN"},"7970":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"**分析**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7971":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"显示频谱图（声音的高频截止、噪声、咔嗒声）和音高曲线（八度跳变、单调的段落），以及格式、音高中位数和有声部分的比例；由服务器计算一次后缓存","locale":"zh-CN"},"7972":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"**用作参考音频**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7973":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"把这条结果作为 **一段音频** 的参考，文本一并填入","locale":"zh-CN"},"7974":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"**保存为音色**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7975":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"输入 **新音色的名称**，把它存进音色库","locale":"zh-CN"},"7976":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-91","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"**用这些设置重新运行**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7977":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-92","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"把生成它的模型、音色、文本和参数载回合成页","locale":"zh-CN"},"7978":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-93","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"**删除**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7979":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-94","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"删除这条结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"7980":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-95","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"结果多于一条时，**全部下载** 打包下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7981":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-96","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#命令行","content":"`mizuoto speak --help` 列出所有选项（`--describe`、`--attr`、`--emotion-audio`、`--batch`、`--use-preset` 等），完整参考见命令参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7982":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","type":"page","content":"工具","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-tools","locale":"zh-CN"},"7983":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools","content":"工具页：用 CosyVoice 把录音换成另一个音色，用 F5-TTS 替换录音中的部分词句。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7984":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-tools#音色转换","content":"音色转换","locale":"zh-CN"},"7985":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-tools#语音编辑","content":"语音编辑","locale":"zh-CN"},"7986":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools","content":"**工具** 页有两个标签页：**音色转换** 和 **语音编辑**。两者都以一段已有的录音为输入，结果和合成结果一样出现在页面下方的 **结果** 中（也出现在历史中），菜单操作相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7987":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#音色转换","content":"**用另一个音色说出录音里的话，保留原话和节奏。** 需要支持音色转换的模型：CosyVoice（300M、300M SFT、2、3）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7988":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#音色转换","content":"在 **模型** 中选择一个 CosyVoice 模型。选择器只列出支持音色转换的模型；还没准备好时，底部按钮会先提供它还缺的步骤，例如下载（见合成）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7989":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#音色转换","content":"在 **录音** 中添加要转换的音频：拖放、选择文件、**录音**、**服务器文件** 或 **之前的结果**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7990":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#音色转换","content":"在 **目标音色** 中选择：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7991":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#音色转换","content":"**音色库**：音色库中的一个音色，使用它的参考音频作为目标声音；","locale":"zh-CN"},"7992":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#音色转换","content":"**一段音频**：直接提供一段目标声音的音频。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7993":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#音色转换","content":"点底部的 **转换**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7994":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#音色转换","content":"命令行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7995":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#语音编辑","content":"**用同一音色把录音中的部分内容替换成新的词句。** 需要支持语音编辑的模型：F5-TTS（v1 Base、Base、E2-TTS）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7996":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#语音编辑","content":"在 **模型** 中选择一个 F5-TTS 模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7997":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#语音编辑","content":"在 **录音** 中添加要编辑的音频。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7998":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#语音编辑","content":"在 **修改** 中填写 **编辑后的完整文本**：整段录音在修改之后应该说的全部内容。最方便的做法是先点 **识别文本** 转写录音，再改动要替换的词句。模型读的是这段文本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7999":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#语音编辑","content":"标出每一处要替换的部分：","locale":"zh-CN"},"8000":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#语音编辑","content":"**起点（秒）** 和 **终点（秒）**：被替换的语音在录音中的位置；","locale":"zh-CN"},"8001":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#语音编辑","content":"**新的词句**：这一处的新内容（作为记录；模型依据的是上面的完整文本）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"8002":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#语音编辑","content":"**时长（秒）**：新语音的长度，留空（**自动**）则与原来的片段等长。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8003":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#语音编辑","content":"**添加一处修改** 增加一行，行尾的按钮删除一行。只有填了起点和终点、且终点大于起点的行才会提交。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8004":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#语音编辑","content":"点底部的 **编辑**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8005":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#语音编辑","content":"缺少内容时底部会提示：**请添加录音**、**请填写编辑后的文本**、**请标出要替换的部分：起点和终点，单位为秒**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8006":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#语音编辑","content":"命令行（`--span` 可重复，格式为 `起点:终点[:时长]`，单位为秒）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"8007":{"id":"/docs/guide-train","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","type":"page","content":"训练","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-train","locale":"zh-CN"},"8008":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train","content":"训练页：建立并预处理数据集，再用实验逐阶段运行各引擎自己的微调流程，查看损失曲线与试听，导出为音色权重或新模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8009":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-train#能训练什么","content":"能训练什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"8010":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-train#数据集","cont