ain-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#能训练什么","content":"新模型（仍受 Fish Audio 研究许可约束）","locale":"zh-CN"},"8059":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#能训练什么","content":"建议 24 GB 显存的 GPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"8060":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#能训练什么","content":"训练方式的名称和阶段名称来自引擎的说明文件，界面中显示为英文。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8061":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#能训练什么","content":"训练不需要 Mizuoto 和 torch 之外的任何东西：所有训练方式都在 Mizuoto 自己的 Python 中运行，每个阶段一个单独的进程。有的方式需要只在训练时用到的共享文件，例如 GPT-SoVITS 的预训练判别器（`mizuoto asset download gptsovits/s2d-v2pro`）。缺少什么时，新建实验对话框会把这种方式标为 **不可用**，并写明要运行的命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8062":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#能训练什么","content":"训练始终在本机运行，不会使用远程主机；引擎设为远程设备时，它的训练方式不可用。微调运行时会独占所用的设备。训练用哪个设备在 **设置 › 训练 › 训练设备** 中选择，默认使用 **引擎所用设备**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8063":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建数据集","content":"在 **数据集** 标签页点 **新建数据集**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8064":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建数据集","content":"填写 **数据集名称**、选择 **语言**，可选填写 **描述**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8065":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建数据集","content":"点 **创建**，打开数据集页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8066":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建数据集","content":"数据集保存在数据文件夹的 `datasets/<名称>/` 中：`dataset.json`、每行一个片段的 `manifest.jsonl`，以及 `audio/` 中的 FLAC 片段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8067":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"数据集页的 **添加片段** 部分提供几种来源：","locale":"zh-CN"},"8068":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"**音频文件或录音**：拖放、选择文件、**录音**，或 **服务器文件**。可以在 **说话人** 中写明这些片段是谁说的（可选），然后点 **添加（N）**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8069":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"**某个音色的片段**：选择音色库中的一个音色，点 **添加**，加入它的参考音频及文本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8070":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"**之前的结果**：从合成结果中挑选。结果会带着它的许可标记加入；许可不允许用来训练其他引擎的结果（例如 Fish Speech 的结果），训练时会被拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8071":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"**添加服务器文件夹**（只在服务器本机的浏览器中出现）：先选择 **文件夹格式**，再选择文件夹：","locale":"zh-CN"},"8072":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"文件夹格式","locale":"zh-CN"},"8073":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"8074":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"**自动识别**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8075":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"按文件夹内容判断","locale":"zh-CN"},"8076":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"**音频文件（旁边可有同名 .lab 或 .txt）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8077":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"普通的音频文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"8078":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/