":"zh-CN"},"8115":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-107","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#编辑片段","content":"**片段** 列表每页 50 条，可以搜索文本或按问题筛选。每条片段：","locale":"zh-CN"},"8116":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-108","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#编辑片段","content":"播放按钮和时长；","locale":"zh-CN"},"8117":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-109","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#编辑片段","content":"文本框（标签为说话人名，没有文本时提示 **没有文本：请转写或手动输入**），改完点保存按钮或按回车；","locale":"zh-CN"},"8118":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-110","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#编辑片段","content":"**用于训练** / **不用于训练**：排除的片段保留在数据集中但不参与训练；","locale":"zh-CN"},"8119":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-111","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#编辑片段","content":"删除按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8120":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-112","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#编辑片段","content":"**详情** 中可以修改名称、语言和描述。页面底部有 **删除**（移到回收站；用它建立的实验将无法再运行）和 **用它训练**（以这个数据集新建实验）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8121":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-113","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"在 **实验** 标签页点 **新建实验**（或在数据集页点 **用它训练**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8122":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-114","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"**起始模型**：只列出可以训练的已安装模型。没有时提示安装可训练的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8123":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-115","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"**训练方式**：这个模型可用的方式；不可用的带有 **（不可用）** 并写明原因（缺少共享文件、引擎不可用或在远程主机上等）。下方显示这种方式的说明、阶段、结果类型（**生成音色专属权重** 或 **生成新模型**）和所需的最少语音时长。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8124":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-116","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"**数据集**；数据集中可用的语音时长不足时，创建会失败，并说明现有与所需的时长。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8125":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-117","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"**实验名称**：默认是“数据集-模型”，只能用字母、数字、`-`、`_` 和 `.`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8126":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-118","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"结果是音色权重时，还有 **权重所属音色**：选音色库中的一个音色，或 **新建音色**（用数据集中三段 3 到 10 秒的片段新建一个）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8127":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-119","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"主要设置（轮数、学习率等）可以在这里修改，**更多设置（包括高级设置）在实验页面中。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8128":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-120","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"点 **创建**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8129":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-121","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"实验保存在 `experiments/<引擎>/<名称>/` 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8130":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-122","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"实验页上方显示起始模型、数据集、结果类型和语言。**阶段** 部分是一排步骤，每个阶段的状态为 **未运行**、**运行中**、**已完成**、**已过期** 或 **失败**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8131":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-123","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"按钮","locale":"zh-CN"},"8132":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-124","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"8133":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-125","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"**运行**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8134":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-126","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"从第一个未完成（或已过期）的阶段运行到最后；全部完成后显示 **已完成**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8135":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-127","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"**运行此阶段**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8136":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-128","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"只运行选中的阶段；它之前的阶段必须已完成","locale":"zh-CN"},"8137":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-129","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"**从头开始**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8138":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-130","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"确认后从第一个阶段起重新运行所有阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"8139":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-131","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"点一个阶段查看它的说明、完成时间和结果；失败时显示错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8140":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-132","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"一次运行是一个 **训练** 任务，它的步骤就是各个阶段，任务卡片显示在阶段下方。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8141":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-133","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"**已过期**：每个完成的阶段都记录了它读取的内容——数据集、起始模型的版本和它用到的设置，以及之前阶段的结果。这些内容变化后，这个阶段及其后的阶段都标为 **已过期**（**此阶段运行后，它读取的内容（数据集、模型或它用到的设置）已改变：请重新运行。**）。重新运行某个阶段时，它之后已完成的阶段也会过期，因为它们读的是这个阶段的旧文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8142":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-134","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#损失曲线","content":"**损失** 部分在训练阶段运行时实时显示曲线；有多个训练阶段时可以切换，有多条曲线时可以用标签逐条开关。还没有数据时显示 **训练阶段运行时，损失曲线显示在这里**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8143":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-135","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#设置","content":"**设置** 中是这种训练方式的超参数（数字输入框），**高级** 中是其余的。**修改设置会使用到它的阶段及其后的阶段过期。** 改完点 **保存**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8144":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-136","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#试听与导出","content":"**试听**：导出阶段会用训练结果朗读一段（**设置 › 训练 › 训练后合成试听** 打开时），结果列在这里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8145":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-137","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#试听与导出","content":"**已导出**：导出的 **音色**（可以 **打开** 或 **在合成中使用**）或 **模型**（点 **模型** 跳到模型页）。导出的权重会加到所选音色上；导出的新模型以 `引擎/名称` 出现在模型列表中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8146":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-138","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#试听与导出","content":"页面底部的 **删除** 把实验及其工作文件移到回收站，已导出的内容保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8147":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-139","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"微调实际上需要 GPU。按 **内存** 设置，各微调在其配方默认批大小下能运行的最小显卡如下（峰值在 RTX 3090 上测得，加上估算的余量：多一成再加 512 MB）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"8148":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-140","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"微调","locale":"zh-CN"},"8149":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-141","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"标准","locale":"zh-CN"},"8150":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-142","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"低","locale":"zh-CN"},"8151":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-143","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"最低","locale":"zh-CN"},"8152":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-144","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"CosyVoice 2 / 3, `llm` （2 的 `llm_flow` 相同）","locale":"zh-CN"},"8153":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-145","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"12 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"8154":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-146","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"12 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"8155":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-147","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"12 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"8156":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-148","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"