","content":"从什么都没有到听到第一句合成的语音：安装、启动、看一眼设置、用演示引擎合成，再换成真正的引擎。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8509":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-1","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#安装-mizuoto","content":"安装 Mizuoto","locale":"zh-CN"},"8510":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-2","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#启动网页界面","content":"启动网页界面","locale":"zh-CN"},"8511":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-3","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#看一眼设置","content":"看一眼设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"8512":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-4","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示引擎合成","content":"用演示引擎合成","locale":"zh-CN"},"8513":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-5","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#换成真正的引擎","content":"换成真正的引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"8514":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-6","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#命令行中的同样操作","content":"命令行中的同样操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"8515":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-7","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#接下来","content":"接下来","locale":"zh-CN"},"8516":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-8","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start","content":"本页走最短的路线。每一步的细节见安装和首次运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8517":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-9","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#安装-mizuoto","content":"需要 Python 3.10–3.14。先安装 torch 2.8 或更新版本中适合本机硬件的构建，再从 PyPI 安装 Mizuoto：","locale":"zh-CN"},"8518":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-10","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#安装-mizuoto","content":"AMD、Intel、Apple 芯片和纯 CPU 的 torch 构建，以及从源码或用 Docker 安装，见安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8519":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-11","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#启动网页界面","content":"服务器就绪后终端会打印 `SERVER_READY url=http://127.0.0.1:7869`，浏览器随后自动打开这个地址。默认端口是 **7869**，默认只允许本机访问。按 Ctrl+C 停止服务器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8520":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-12","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#看一眼设置","content":"界面打开后直接进入 **合成** 页，试用之前不需要做任何设置。下载真正的模型之前，值得看一眼两项设置：","locale":"zh-CN"},"8521":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-13","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#看一眼设置","content":"**设置 › 下载 › 下载来源**：模型从哪里下载（**Hugging Face**、**hf-mirror.com**、**ModelScope**；在中国大陆，后两者通常更快）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8522":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-14","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#看一眼设置","content":"**设置 › 计算**：本机的显卡和正在使用的 torch 构建，不合适时给出安装正确构建的命令（与 `mizuoto doctor` 的检查相同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8523":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-15","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#看一眼设置","content":"要立即下载，见下面第 5 步或首次运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8524":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-16","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示引擎合成","content":"演示引擎随 Mizuoto 自带，不需要下载，也不需要 torch，它用音调代替语音，但走的是和真实引擎完全相同的流程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8525":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-17","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示引擎合成","content":"在左侧导航栏打开 **合成**（界面默认就在这里）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8526":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-18","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示引擎合成","content":"在 **模型** 中选择 **Dummy voice**（带 **演示** 标记）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8527":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-19","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示引擎合成","content":"在 **音色** 中选择 **预置说话人**，**说话人** 选 `alto`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8528":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-20","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示引擎合成","content":"在 **文本** 中输入任意内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8529":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-21","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","u