_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"Files downloaded at once","locale":"en"},"9063":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-125","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"Each file goes where Mizuoto's mirror source asks for it. A copy in a models folder with the same size and SHA-256 is hard-linked (else copied); anything else is downloaded from the official sources by Mizuoto's own downloader: resumed, retried and checked against its SHA-256.","locale":"en"},"9064":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-126","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"Archive-type shared files are kept as published; a machine using the mirror unpacks them after downloading.","locale":"en"},"9065":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-127","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"`HF_TOKEN`, when set, is sent to huggingface.co only.","locale":"en"},"9066":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-128","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"Running it again skips what is already there. `MIRROR.json` (as `build` writes it, archives marked `archive`) is written once every file is in place; when a file fails, the run lists it and exits with 1.","locale":"en"},"9067":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-129","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_readmepy-the-card-and-licence-files","content":"It reads `MIRROR.json` (from `build` or `mirror_fetch.py`) and writes:","locale":"en"},"9068":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-130","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_readmepy-the-card-and-licence-files","content":"`README.md`: the Hugging Face card: metadata, how to use the mirror, each engine's licence notes and a table of every model and shared-file folder with its size and origin repositories. It replaces the shorter README that `build` writes;","locale":"en"},"9069":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-131","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_readmepy-the-card-and-licence-files","content":"`LICENSES.md`: each engine's licence and its link;","locale":"en"},"9070":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-132","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_readmepy-the-card-and-licence-files","content":"for each licence-gated engine in the mirror, its licence text as `<engine>/LICENSE.*` and, for Fish Speech, the `NOTICE.txt` its licence asks for.","locale":"en"},"9071":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-133","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_readmepy-the-card-and-licence-files","content":"`--repo` (default `licyk/mizuoto-model`) goes into the card's licence link, which Hugging Face requires to be an `https` address.","locale":"en"},"9072":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-134","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#upload-publish","content":"Option","locale":"en"},"9073":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-135","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#upload-publish","content":"Default","locale":"en"},"9074":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-136","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#upload-publish","content":"Meaning","locale":"en"},"9075":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-137","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs