"url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#what-each-engine-needs","content":"`mizuoto-indextts[ja]` (IndexTTS-2.5's Japanese: fugashi, unidic-lite)","locale":"en"},"9374":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-107","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#what-each-engine-needs","content":"GPU (NVIDIA, AMD, Intel, Apple), CPU","locale":"en"},"9375":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-108","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#what-each-engine-needs","content":"The licence-gated engines are distributions of their own because of their licences; they register themselves with Mizuoto when installed in the same environment. Their models still need the licence accepted (below).","locale":"en"},"9376":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-109","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#what-each-engine-needs","content":"A text in a language whose optional extra is missing fails with `capability_not_supported` and the install command in the hint, for instance `pip install 'mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]'`.","locale":"en"},"9377":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-110","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#what-each-engine-needs","content":"Every engine runs on a CPU too, much more slowly. The speed-up option is `compute.compile`, in Performance.","locale":"en"},"9378":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-111","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"Licence","locale":"en"},"9379":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-112","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"Engines","locale":"en"},"9380":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-113","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"What it means","locale":"en"},"9381":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-114","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"Gated","locale":"en"},"9382":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-115","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"Fish Speech (`fish-audio-research+fish-audio-community@2026-03-07+1.0`), IndexTTS (`bilibili-model-use@2025-09-09`)","locale":"en"},"9383":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-116","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"The engine is a distribution of its own (`mizuoto-fishspeech`, `mizuoto-indextts`); downloading models and shared files, and synthesis, need the licence accepted first: **Accept the licence** in **Models** › **Engines**, or `mizuoto engine accept-licence <id>`. `mizuoto engine licence <id>` prints the full text","locale":"en"},"9384":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-117","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"Non-commercial weights","locale":"en"},"9385":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-118","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"F5-TTS","locale":"en"},"9386":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-119","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"The pretrained weights are CC-BY-NC-4.0; nothing to accept, but results are tagged and carry a notice","locale":"en"},"9387":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-120","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"Not for training other engines","locale":"en"},"9388":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-121","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"Fish Speech, IndexTTS (`trains_others = false`)","locale":"en"},"9389":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-122","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"Their results cannot be added to another engine's training datasets","locale":"en"},"9390":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-123","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"Results carry the engine's licence tags and notices (Fish Speech's \"Built with Fish Audio\", for instance), shown under the result.","locale":"en"},"9391":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-124","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"Alibaba Qwen's 12 Hz speech LLM. Best for: high-quality cloning in ten languages, preset speakers steered by instructions (emotion, pace, style), and new voices from a one-sentence description.","locale":"en"},"9392":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-125","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"Model","locale":"en"},"9393":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-126","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"Variant","locale":"en"},"9394":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-127","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"Size","locale":"en"},"9395":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-128","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"GPU memory","locale":"en"},"9396":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-129","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"Recommended","locale":"en"},"9397":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-130","page_id":"/e