cosyvoice","content":"v3","locale":"en"},"9471":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-204","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"24 kHz","locale":"en"},"9472":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-205","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"as v2, plus **Pronunciation**, without **Long text**","locale":"en"},"9473":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-206","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**Languages**: zh, en, ja, ko, yue; v3: zh, en, ja, ko, de, es, fr, it, ru, yue.","locale":"en"},"9474":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-207","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**Preset speakers** (v1 SFT / Instruct): 中文女, 中文男, 日语男, 粤语女, 英文女, 英文男, 韩语女.","locale":"en"},"9475":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-208","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**Inline tags**: v1 `[laughter]`, `[breath]`, `<strong></strong>`; v2 adds `<laughter></laughter>`; v3 has eleven, such as `[breath]`, `[laughter]`, `[cough]`, `[sigh]`.","locale":"en"},"9476":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-209","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**Reference clips**: 1–30 s, at least 16 kHz.","locale":"en"},"9477":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-210","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**Streaming**: v2/v3 stream token by token; streamed text input needs the reference clip's transcript (zero-shot cloning or instruct2).","locale":"en"},"9478":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-211","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**Training** (GPU or CPU): **Fine-tune the language model** (`llm`) and **Fine-tune the LLM and the flow** (`llm_flow`), from v1_base, v2 or v3, following upstream's LibriTTS recipe; at least 60 s of data; exported as a new model. The LLM alone makes prosody and pronunciation follow the dataset; with the flow the timbre follows too.","locale":"en"},"9479":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-212","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**Shared files**: `cosyvoice/wetext` (13 MB, the text normalisation grammars that write out numbers, dates and units), downloaded with the first model.","locale":"en"},"9480":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-213","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**Load options**: `fp16` (half precision on the GPU: faster, slightly different); `fused_projections` (CosyVoice 2 and 3, off): a fast mode, the language model's q/k/v and gate/up projections one product each, 1–5 % faster on a GPU, where the audio may then no longer be bit-identical (outputs list `fused_projections`).","locale":"en"},"9481":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-214","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"A flow-matching TTS that clones a voice from a short clip and its transcript. Best for: exact control of the generated duration, and replacing a few words of a recording (speech editing).","locale":"en"},"9482":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-215","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"Model","locale":"en"},"9483":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-216","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"Variant","locale":"en"},"9484":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-217","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-e