ined weights (trained on Emilia): not for commercial use. Nothing to accept; results carry a notice.","locale":"en"},"9504":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-237","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"**Training**: **Fine-tune the model** (`full`): upstream's `finetune_cli` recipe, the whole model trained further and exported as a new model of the same kind. Best with an hour of speech or more; a GPU is all but required. The result inherits CC-BY-NC-4.0.","locale":"en"},"9505":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-238","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"**Load option**: `ode_method` (`euler` or `midpoint`).","locale":"en"},"9506":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-239","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"Few-shot cloning from a 3–10 s clip, and the classic fine-tuning path: a voice can have its own GPT and SoVITS weights, switched in per request. Best for: a voice of your own trained on a few minutes of recordings.","locale":"en"},"9507":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-240","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"Model","locale":"en"},"9508":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-241","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"Variant","locale":"en"},"9509":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-242","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"Size","locale":"en"},"9510":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-243","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"GPU memory","locale":"en"},"9511":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-244","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engine