opment-design-195","page_id":"/en/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-design#jobs-interfaces-and-data","content":"One synthesis path serves every feature, so micro-batching and every engine come for free","locale":"en"},"12274":{"id":"/en/docs/development-design-196","page_id":"/en/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-design#jobs-interfaces-and-data","content":"A remote agent owns its models and engines; requests carry files by content (SHA-256); training stays local","locale":"en"},"12275":{"id":"/en/docs/development-design-197","page_id":"/en/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-design#jobs-interfaces-and-data","content":"A path on one machine means nothing on another","locale":"en"},"12276":{"id":"/en/docs/development-design-198","page_id":"/en/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-design#jobs-interfaces-and-data","content":"The model mirror (`mizuoto-model`) is a source in front of the official ones, laid out as Mizuoto keeps files","locale":"en"},"12277":{"id":"/en/docs/development-design-199","page_id":"/en/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-design#jobs-interfaces-and-data","content":"A partial mirror works: what it lacks comes from the official repositories file by file, checked against the same SHA-256","locale":"en"},"12278":{"id":"/en/docs/development-design-200","page_id":"/en/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-design#jobs-interfaces-and-data","content":"Accepting a licence is also required to download the weights and assets; the full text ships with the package and the command line can show it","locale":"en"},"12279":{"id":"/en/docs/development-design-201","page_id":"/en/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-design#jobs-interfaces-and-data","content":"The licences cover the we