"content":"Sections","locale":"en"},"16839":{"id":"/en/docs-4","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs","content":"Mizuoto puts open text-to-speech engines — CosyVoice, F5-TTS, GPT-SoVITS, OmniVoice, Qwen3-TTS, VoxCPM, Fish Speech and IndexTTS — into **one platform**: one local server, one web UI and one command line, `mizuoto`. Use it to speak text, clone and design voices, have a cast of voices read a whole book or script, convert and edit recordings, and fine-tune models on your own recordings.","locale":"en"},"16840":{"id":"/en/docs-5","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs","content":"Every engine is implemented in Mizuoto itself, on its own runtime over torch, and runs inside the server's process; there is one Python environment and nothing to build per engine. Requests, voices, parameters, jobs and results look the same whichever engine serves them.","locale":"en"},"16841":{"id":"/en/docs-6","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs","content":"<Card title=\"First time here\" href=\"/docs/quick-start\" description=\"From nothing to the first spoken sentence, the short way.\" />","locale":"en"},"16842":{"id":"/en/docs-7","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs","content":"<Card title=\"Installation\" href=\"/docs/installation\" description=\"Requirements, and installing from release wheels, from source or with Docker.\" />","locale":"en"},"16843":{"id":"/en/docs-8","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs","content":"<Card title=\"First run\" href=\"/docs/first-run\" description=\"Where to start, checking torch and the engines, downloading models and licence-gated engines.\" />","locale":"en"},"16844":{"id":"/en/docs-9","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs","content":"<Card title=\"FAQ\" href=\"/docs/advanced-faq\" description=\"Ports, downloads, GPU memory, devices and other common questions.\" />","locale":"en"},"16845":{"id":"/en/do