xt.py` builds every service in dependency order and returns the `Services` dataclass:"],[11806,"`build_services(start_background=True)`, kept on `app.state.services`; routes get it through `ServicesDep`"],[3268,"`build_services(start_background=True)`，存在 `app.state.services`；路由通过 `ServicesDep` 取得"],[14146,"`build` (Ubuntu, Python 3.11, uv; bun for Mizuoto's web UI): `build_wheels.py host` and/or `build_wheels.py native <id>…`, only what is released; `twine check dist/*`; `dist/` is uploaded as the `dist` artifact."],[14180,"`build` lays the installed catalogue models and shared assets out under `OUT` (hard links where possible), checks each file against its pinned size and SHA-256 (`--no-verify`: sizes only), and writes `MIRROR.json` (each file's path, size, SHA-256 and official origin) and a README. Archive parts (`unpack`) are not kept after unpacking, so they stay official-only. Licence-gated engines are left out unless `--gated`."],[5642,"`build` 把已安装的目录模型和共享资源排到 `OUT` 下（尽量用硬链接），每个文件对照固定的大小和 SHA-256 检查（`--no-verify` 只查大小），并写出 `MIRROR.json`（每个文件的路径、大小、SHA-256 和官方来源）与 README。压缩包部分（`unpack`）解压后不保留，所以只从官方下载。需要接受许可的引擎默认不包含，除非 `--gated`。"],[8947,"`build`: lay out the installed models"],[409,"`build`：整理已安装的模型"],[5608,"`build`（Ubuntu、Python 3.11、uv；构建 Mizuoto 的 Web UI 时还有 bun）：只构建要发布的，`build_wheels.py host` 和/或 `build_wheels.py native <id>…`；`twine check dist/*`；`dist/` 作为 `dist` 产物上传。"],[14790,"`bun install --frozen-lockfile`, `bun run check`, `bun run test`, `bun run build` in `site/`"],[14406,"`bun run test` (vitest) and `bun run typecheck` (vue-tsc)"],[5868,"`bun run test`（vitest）和 `bun run typecheck`（vue-tsc）"],[336,"`bun`"],[5631,"`bun`"],[8874,"`bun`"],[14169,"`bun`"],[8495,"`cache/`"],[17032,"`cache/`"],[3846,"`call(op, payload, ctx)`"],[3862,"`call(op, payload, ctx)`"],[12384,"`call(op, payload, ctx)`"],[12400,"`call(op, payload, ctx)`"],[12344,"`call` operation names; a helper engine (ASR) not offered for synthesis"],[3806,"`call` 操作名；内部辅助引擎（ASR），不用于合成"],[169,