le` wraps v4/v5's CFM estimator (each SoVITS loaded, a voice's own too): 7 % faster warm on the CPU, within 3.1e-5 of eager (87 dB)."],[6697,"`compute.compile` 包装 flow 估计器。在 CPU 上没有收益（U-Net 的卷积和矩阵乘法已经是库内核）；mel 与 eager 相差不超过 5.7e-6，HiFT 由 F0 驱动的源把它放大到音频中约 1e-2（47 dB），换一个线程数的 eager 运行也会如此。"],[6968,"`compute.compile` 包装 v4/v5 的 CFM 估计器（每个加载的 SoVITS，包括音色自己的）：在 CPU 上预热后快 7 %，与即时执行相差不超过 3.1e-5（87 dB）。"],[6762,"`compute.compile` 用 `torch.compile(dynamic=True)` 包装 DiT 或 UNetT。在 CPU 上以 fp32、8 线程运行时，transformer 预热后的耗时下降 23 %（一个请求从 60 秒降到 45 秒）；第一个请求要付出约 30 秒的编译时间；音频与 eager 的差异在 9.2e-5 以内（89 dB）。`compute.cpu_allocator` 和 `compute.cpu_threads` 的 CPU 分配器与线程绑定，能让 F5-TTS 在 Linux 上快 10–20 %，且不改变任何结果。"],[13935,"`compute.compile`, fp32, 8 threads; time of the compiled module, warm:"],[5397,"`compute.compile`，fp32，8 线程；被编译模块预热后的耗时："],[15340,"`compute.compile`: the decoding step's pieces under `torch.compile` (`Fused`)"],[6802,"`compute.compile`：用 `torch.compile` 编译的解码步骤各部分（`Fused`）"],[2739,"`compute.compile`（关）"],[4447,"`compute.compile`（可选，不精确；加速）在同样的 CUDA 图里把这些小内核融合起来。显卡和条件相同："],[1322,"`compute.compile`（默认关，界面为 **设置** › **计算** › **编译模型（torch.compile）**）用 `torch.compile` 编译部分引擎最耗时的模块："],[1377,"`compute.cpu_allocator`"],[2358,"`compute.cpu_allocator`"],[2987,"`compute.cpu_allocator`"],[9915,"`compute.cpu_allocator`"],[10896,"`compute.cpu_allocator`"],[11525,"`compute.cpu_allocator`"],[12795,"`compute.cpu_allocator` and `compute.cpu_threads` (Acceleration)"],[4257,"`compute.cpu_allocator` 和 `compute.cpu_threads`（加速）"],[11262,"`compute.cpu_allocator`, `compute.cpu_threads` (`auto`)"],[2724,"`compute.cpu_allocator`、`compute.cpu_threads`（`auto`）"],[1380,"`compute.cpu_threads`"],[2362,"`compute.cpu_threads`"],[2990,"`compute.cpu_threads`"],[9918,"`compute.cpu_threads`"],[10900,"`compute.cpu_threads`"],[11528,"`compute.cpu_threads`"],[1311,"`compute.cuda_allocator`"],[2354,"`compute.cuda_allocator`"],[9849,"`compute.cuda_allocator`"],[10892,"`compute.cuda_allocator`"],[12653,"`compute.cuda_allocator` (`native`, `async`: cudaMallocAsync, `expandable`: expandable segments; `auto` is `native`) is set by the host in `PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF` before CUDA is first used, never by engine code, and handed to training stages in their environment (`allocator_env`), whether or not the host has loaded a model. A value the environment already sets wins; a change applies at the next start. Under `async` no CUDA graphs are captured (`graphs.usable`): the stream-ordered allocator frees a capture's warm-up temporaries in a way that made replays fault with an illegal memory access."],[4115,"`compute.cuda_allocator`（`native`；`async`：cudaMallocAsync；`expandable`：可扩展段；`auto` 即 `native`）由主机在第一次使用 CUDA 之前写入 `PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF`，从不由引擎代码设置，并通过环境传给训练阶段（`allocator_env`），无论主机是否已加载模型。环境中已设置的值优先；修改在下次启动时生效。在 `async` 下不捕获 CUDA Graph（`graphs.usable`）：这种按流排序的分配器释放捕获预热时的临时张量的方式，曾使重放因非法内存访问而出错。"],[1299,"`compute.cuda_graphs`"],[2350,"`compute.cuda_graphs`"],[9837,"`compute.cuda_graphs`"],[10888,"`compute.cuda_graphs`"],[11256,"`compute.cuda_graphs` (on)"],[2718,"`compute.cuda_graphs`（开）"],[1223,"`compute.default_device`"],[2298,"`compute.default_device`"],[9761,"`compute.default_device`"],[10836,"`compute.default_device`"],[1226,"`compute.devices`"],[2294,"`compute.devices`"],[9764,"`compute.devices`"],[10832,"`compute.devices`"],[2390,"`compute.fast`"],[2707,"`compute.fast`"],[2771,"`compute.fast`"],[10928,"`compute.fast`"],[11245,"`compute.fast`"],[11309,"`compute.fast`"],[9901,"`compute.fast` (**Settings** › **Compute** › **Acceleration**) turns on GPU speed switches for the whole process, after ComfyUI's `--fast`: `tf32`, `fp16_accumulation`, `cudnn_benchmark` and `sdpa_reduced_precision`. Each changes results slightly. They take effect when Mizuoto next starts, and outputs list them (`params.fast`). Measured on an RTX 3090, all four made VoxCPM, F5-TTS, IndexTTS 1.5, Fish Speech, CosyVoice 3 and GPT-SoVITS v4 1.1–1.3× faster, while `fp16_accumulation` made GPT-SoVITS v2 about 5 % slower (v4 6–9 % faster) and `tf32` left GPT-SoVITS's speed alone (measured again on a quiet GPU, alternating with the default: an earlier 1.3–1.6× slowdown was other work on the machine)."],[14732,"`compute.fast` (all four flags)"],[11274,"`compute.fast` (none)"],[1363,"`compute.fast`（**设置** › **计算** › **加速**）为整个进程开启 GPU 提速开关，参照 ComfyUI 的 `--fast`：`tf32`、`fp16_accumulation`、`cudnn_benchmark` 和 `sdpa_reduced_precision`。每一项都会使结果略有不同。它们在下次启动 Mizuoto 时生效，输出会记录它们（`params.fast`）。在 RTX 3090 上测量，四项全开使 VoxCPM、F5-TTS、IndexTTS 1.5、Fish Speech、CosyVoice 3 和 GPT-SoVITS v4 快 1.1–1.3 倍，而 `fp16_accumulation` 使 GPT-SoVITS v2 慢约 5 %（v4 快 6–9 %），`tf32` 不影响 GPT-SoVITS 的速度（在空闲 GPU 上与默认设置交替重测：之前测得的慢 1.3–1.6 倍来自机器上的其他工作）。"],[6194,"`compute.fast`（全部四个开关）"],[2736,"`compute.fast`（无）"],[1251,"`compute.gpu_jobs`"],[2370,"`compute.gpu_jobs`"],[3356,"`compute.gpu_jobs`"],[9789,"`compute.gpu_jobs`"],[10908,"`compute.gpu_jobs`"],[11894,"`compute.gpu_jobs`"],[1281,"`compute.host_copies`"],[2326,"`compute.host_copies`"],[9819,"`compute.host_copies`"],[10864,"`compute.host_copies`"],[1254,"`compute.inference_jobs`"],[2374,"`compute.inference_jobs`"],[3359,"`compute.inference_jobs`"],[9792,"`compute.inference_jobs`"],[10912,"`compute.inference_jobs`"],[11897,"`compute.inference_jobs`"],[2751,"`compute.kv_cache = static`"],[11289,"`compute.kv_cache = static`"],[12652,"`compute.kv_cache = static` gives the Qwen-family caches (Qwen3-TTS, CosyVoice 2/3) preallocated buffers that double when full (`BufferCache`): no per-step concatenation, no transient copy, less fragmentation. Attention reads views with the buffer's strides, which some kernels sum in another order. Identical on the CPU; opt-in until it is checked identical on a GPU."],[13296,"`compute.kv_cache = static` is identical on CUDA and no faster (Qwen3-TTS 1.28 → 1.30 s, CosyVoice 3 0.95 → 0.95 s), with the same peak: `dynamic` stays the default."],[4758,"`compute.kv_cache = static` 在 CUDA 上结果相同，但并不更快（Qwen3-TTS 1.28 → 1.30 秒，CosyVoice 3 0.95