ctions`"],[109,"`internal_error`"],[2641,"`internal_error`"],[3375,"`internal_error`"],[8647,"`internal_error`"],[11179,"`internal_error`"],[11913,"`internal_error`"],[3391,"`invalid_input`"],[11929,"`invalid_input`"],[8659,"`invalid_input`, `invalid_path`"],[11588,"`invalid_input`, `invalid_path`"],[11188,"`invalid_input`, `invalid_path`, `capability_not_supported`, `parameter_not_supported`, `parameter_out_of_range`, `reference_invalid`, `language_not_supported`"],[121,"`invalid_input`、`invalid_path`"],[3050,"`invalid_input`、`invalid_path`"],[2650,"`invalid_input`、`invalid_path`、`capability_not_supported`、`parameter_not_supported`、`parameter_out_of_range`、`reference_invalid`、`language_not_supported`"],[3387,"`invalid_path`"],[11925,"`invalid_path`"],[3386,"`InvalidPathError`"],[11924,"`InvalidPathError`"],[3352,"`io`"],[11890,"`io`"],[11567,"`is_local(request)` means \"a browser on the server's own machine\": the client address is loopback **and** the requested host name is a loopback name. A tunnel or reverse proxy on the same machine also connects from loopback, but forwards its public `Host`, so it is not local. Routes that need it (browsing server folders, registering audio by server path, `/models/identify`, `/models/import`, `reveal`, `POST /voices/{id}/weights`, `/engines/{id}/ops/{op}`, a dataset's folder import) declare `dependencies=[LocalDep]` and fail with 403 `not_local`. Server paths must also lie within `paths.browse_roots`; that check is in the core."],[3029,"`is_local(request)` 的含义是\"服务器本机上的浏览器\"：客户端地址是回环地址，**并且**请求的主机名也是回环名。同一台机器上的隧道或反向代理也从回环地址连进来，但会转发公网的 `Host`，所以不算本地。需要本地的路由（列出服务器目录、按服务器路径登记音频、`/models/identify`、`/models/import`、`reveal`、`POST /voices/{id}/weights`、`/engines/{id}/ops/{op}`、数据集的文件夹导入）用 `dependencies=[LocalDep]` 声明，失败时是 403 `not_local`。服务器路径还要求位于 `paths.browse_roots` 之内，这一层检查在核心层。"],[14243,"`is_oom(error)`: whether an exception means a device ran out of memory, without importing torch."],[5705,"`is_oom(error)`：一个异常是否表示设备内存不足，不导入 