,"`manager.after_oom`: every other idle component on the device leaves it, the streamer's cached copies go, and each of the phase's components is capped at half of what it had on the device (`ModelHandle.cap_bytes`, kept until it is offloaded, so the next requests do not run out too);"],[4053,"`manager.after_oom`：该设备上其他所有空闲组件移出设备，Streamer 缓存的副本丢弃，该阶段的每个组件被限制为它原先在设备上的一半（`ModelHandle.cap_bytes`，保留到它被移出设备为止，这样后面的请求不会再次显存不足）；"],[15173,"`MaskedDiffWithXvec`: Conformer, length regulator, Matcha U-Net"],[6635,"`MaskedDiffWithXvec`：Conformer、长度调节器、Matcha U-Net"],[11319,"`math_kernel`: SDPA's math kernel called directly"],[2781,"`math_kernel`：直接调用 SDPA 的 math 内核"],[2817,"`math`"],[11355,"`math`"],[2848,"`memory_efficient_attention`"],[11386,"`memory_efficient_attention`"],[3864,"`memory_required(task)`"],[12402,"`memory_required(task)`"],[5974,"`memory.py`"],[14512,"`memory.py`"],[14240,"`memory(device)`: (free, total) bytes; on CUDA, memory torch holds but does not use counts as free."],[5702,"`memory(device)`：（空闲，总量）字节数；在 CUDA 上，torch 占着但没用的显存也算空闲。"],[6362,"`metric(epoch, step, values, lr)`"],[14900,"`metric(epoch, step, values, lr)`"],[6283,"`min_seconds`"],[14821,"`min_seconds`"],[7253,"`minicpm.py`"],[15791,"`minicpm.py`"],[8948,"`mirror_fetch.py`: the whole catalogue"],[410,"`mirror_fetch.py`：下载整个目录"],[8949,"`mirror_readme.py`: the card and licence files"],[411,"`mirror_readme.py`：说明页和许可文件"],[9044,"`MIRROR.json` (every file's path, size, SHA-256 and official origin: repository, revision, path) and a `README.md` are written."],[447,"`missing`"],[8985,"`missing`"],[9690,"`mizuoto config set` writes `settings.toml`; the server reads the change within about a second. The server's address and port take effect at its next start. A change to an engine's `engines.<id>.*` unloads that engine's models, which load with the new settings on next use."],[1152,"`mizuoto config set` 直接写 `settings.toml`，服务器约 1 秒内读到改动；服务器地址和端口要在下次启动时才生效。改动某个引擎的 `engines.<id>.*` 设置会卸载该引擎的模型，下次使用时按新设置加载。"],[12286,"`mizuoto doctor [engine]` checks in one place the torch build against the hardware, what each engine misses, extras and 0.1's old environments"],[14344,"`mizuoto doctor [ENGINE]` is `RuntimeService.doctor`: the installed torch build against the machine's hardware (CUDA, ROCm, XPU, MPS, CPU) with the install command for the right build (`mizuoto/core/compute/torch_index.py`), each engine available or missing (and what is missing), optional extras that do not import (`Engine.EXTRAS`) and a trainer's missing requirements. The same is `GET /api/v1/runtime/doctor` and `GET /api/v1/engines/{id}/doctor`."],[5806,"`mizuoto doctor [ENGINE]` 就是 `RuntimeService.doctor`：已安装的 torch 构建与本机硬件（CUDA、ROCm、XPU、MPS、CPU）是否匹配，并给出安装正确构建的命令（`mizuoto/core/compute/torch_index.py`）；每个引擎可用还是缺失（以及缺什么）；导入不了的可选附加依赖（`Engine.EXTRAS`）；以及训练器缺的依赖。对应 `GET /api/v1/runtime/doctor` 和 `GET /api/v1/engines/{id}/doctor`。"],[3748,"`mizuoto doctor [引擎]` 一处检查 torch 构建与硬件、各引擎缺什么、附加依赖、0.1 的旧环境"],[12651,"`mizuoto doctor` has a `memory` finding with the policy in effect (mode, reserve, limit, RAM reserve, host copies, pinned budget, streams, retry and fallbacks), and per engine with installed models a `fits` finding: on each GPU, which of them load whole and which only partly (the rest streaming from RAM), from each model's catalogue `vram_mb` against the GPU's memory less `compute.vram_reserve_mb`, within `vram_limit_mb`, half under `low` (`gpu_budget_mb`; fields in `data`). The catalogue's `vram_mb` is measured: the GPU memory a process takes for the model's short and long parity cases with the defaults on an RTX 3060 (G13, performance), the most of the two, rounded up."],[16989,"`mizuoto doctor` lists the GPUs it finds (with `nvidia-smi`, `rocm-smi` or `amd-smi`, or by asking torch; see Performance), reports the torch build against them (with the exact install command when they do not match), whether each engine is available or what it still needs (torch, or a licence-gated engine's distribution), and the optional extras that are missing. In the web UI, **Settings › Compute** shows the torch check, and **Check this machine** on each engine card under **Models › Engines** shows that engine's."],[9855,"`mizuoto doctor` prints the memory settings in effect."],[14130,"`mizuoto doctor` reports an installed gated engine that does not go with this Mizuoto (its range excludes it, or its `OPTION_SCHEMA` and the manifest disagree) as an error with `pip install --upgrade mizuoto mizuoto-<id>`, and `mizuoto version` lists each distribution's version."],[8452,"`mizuoto doctor` 会列出找到的 GPU（通过 `nvidia-smi`、`rocm-smi` 或 `amd-smi`，或询问 torch；见 性能），对照它们检查 torch 的构建（不匹配时给出准确的安装命令），报告每个引擎是否可用、还缺什么（torch，或需要接受许可的引擎的发行包），以及缺少的可选扩展。在网页界面中，**设置 › 计算** 显示 torch 的检查结果，**模型 › 引擎** 中每个引擎卡片的 **检查本机** 显示该引擎的检查结果。"],[1317,"`mizuoto doctor` 打印当前生效的内存设置。"],[4113,"`mizuoto doctor` 有一项 `memory` 检查结果，列出当前生效的策略（模式、保留量、上限、内存保留量、主机副本、锁页预算、复制流、重试与回退）；每个装有模型的引擎还有一项 `fits`：在每块 GPU 上，哪些模型能整个加载，哪些只能部分加载（其余从内存流式读取），依据是模型目录中的 `vram_mb` 与 GPU 显存减去 `compute.vram_reserve_mb`、不超过 `vram_limit_mb`、`low` 下取一半（`gpu_budget_mb`；字段在 `data` 中）。目录中的 `vram_mb` 是实测值：在 RTX 3060 上使用默认设置，进程为该模型的短、长一致性用例所占的显存，取两者较大值并向上取整（G13，见性能）。"],[10737,"`mizuoto env vars` lists the environment variables Mizuoto reads, and the `MIZUOTO_*` variables set now:"],[2199,"`mizuoto env vars` 列出 Mizuoto 读取的环境变量，以及当前已设置的 `MIZUOTO_*` 变量："],[9689,"`mizuoto job cancel` reaches only its own process's jobs; for a job the server runs it answers \"is not running\". Cancel the server's jobs in the web UI or with `POST /api/v1/jobs/{id}/cancel`."],[1151,"`mizuoto job cancel` 只能取消本进程的任务，对服务器正在运行的任务会报 \"is not running\"。取消服务器的任务请用 Web UI，或 `POST /api/v1/jobs/{id}/cancel`。"],[11225,"`mizuoto job retry` runs a failed, cancelled or interrupted job again in the foreground (its stored request is planned again)."],[2687,"`mizuoto job retry` 在前台重新运行一个失败、已取消或已中断的任务（它保存的请求会重新规划）。"],[12458,"`mizuoto model download <id>/<name>`, then the contract suite on the real models; record the port and its parity on the engine's page (`engines-<id>`, both languages), add it to the sidebars (`meta.json`, `meta.en.json`) and to the engine reference table, and add rules to `AGENTS.md` if there are any."],[3920,"`mizuoto model download <id>/<名字>`，然后在真实模型上跑契约套件；把移植情况和对照结果记进该引擎的页面（`engines-<id>`，中英文都要），把它加进侧边栏（`meta.json`、`meta.en.json`）和引擎参考的表格；如有新的规则，再记进 `AGENTS.md`。"],[12366,"`mizuoto model import` identifies the engine and variant from file contents alone: `mizuoto/core/models/detect.py` reads configuration files (OmniVoice: `model_type == \"omnivoice\"` in `config.json`), and the engine's `detect_variant` must agree."],[3828,"`mizuoto model import` 只凭文件内容判断引擎和变体：`mizuoto/core/models/detect.py` 读取配置文件（OmniVoice：`config.json` 里 `model_type == \"omnivoice\"`），引擎的 `detect_variant` 必须与它一致。"],[16274,"`mizuoto project cast <project> <speaker-id> [--name] [-m] [-v] [--preset] [-l] [--instruct] [-p name=value] [-O name=value] [--remove]`"],[7736,"`mizuoto project cast <项目> <角色id> [--name] [-m] [-v] [--preset] [-l] [--instruct] [-p 参数=值] [-O 选项=值] [--remove]`"],[16288,"`mizuoto project delete <project>`"],[7750,"`mizuoto project delete <项目>`"],[16280,"`mizuoto project export <project> [-o file] [-c chapter-id] [-f format] [--srt file] [--allow-missing]`"],[7742,"`mizuoto project export <项目> [-o 文件] [-c 章节id] [-f 格式] [--srt 字幕文件] [--allow-missing]`"],[16272,"`mizuoto project import <project> <script> [--split …] [--replace] [--chapter chapter-id]`"],[7734,"`mizuoto project import <项目> <脚本> [--split …] [--replace] [--chapter 章节id]`"],[7748,"`mizuoto project list`"],[16286,"`mizuoto project list`"],[16270,"`mizuoto project new <name> [-m model] [--voice voice \\| --preset speaker] [-l lang] [--script file] [--split line\\|sentence]`"],[7732,"`mizuoto project new <名称> [-m 模型] [--voice 音色 \\| --preset 说话人] [-l 语言] [--script 文件] [--split line\\|sentence]`"],[16278,"`mizuoto project render <project> [-c chapter-id] [--line line-id] [--force]`"],[7740,"`mizuoto project render <项目> [-c 章节id] [--line 句子id] [--force]`"],[16284,"`mizuoto project script <project>`"],[7746,"`mizuoto project script <项目>`"],[16276,"`mizuoto project set <project> [--name] [-m] [-l] [--line-pause] [--paragraph-pause] [--chapter-pause] [-f] [--sample-rate] [--normalize]`"],[7738,"`mizuoto project set <项目> [--name] [-m] [-l] [--line-pause] [--paragraph-pause] [--chapter-pause] [-f] [--sample-rate] [--normalize]`"],[16282,"`mizuoto project show <project>`"],[7744,"`mizuoto project show <项目>`"],[12288,"`mizuoto runtime` asks the running server (`server.json`) first, and reports its own process only when there is none"],[14343,"`mizuoto runtime` asks the running server (found through `server.json` in the data folder), since its process holds the models; without a server it reports the command's own process. The same is `GET /api/v1/runtime` and `POST /api/v1/runtime/unload`, and the web UI's **Models in memory** sheet (`LoadedModelsSheet`)."],[9798,"`mizuoto runtime` lists the loaded models of the running server (device, memory, how much of it is on the device, last use, busy or idle); `mizuoto runtime --unload [MODEL]` unloads one, or every model not in use. In the web UI the **Models in memory** panel does the same, with a bar for how much of each model is on its GPU, and **Free GPU memory** releases the memory idle models hold. The API is `GET /api/v1/runtime` and `POST /api/v1/runtime/unload`."],[3750,"`mizuoto runtime` 先问正在运行的服务器（`server.json`），没有才报告本进程"],[1260,"`mizuoto runtime` 列出正在运行的服务器已加载的模型（设备、内存、有多少在设备上、上次使用、忙碌或空闲）；`mizuoto runtime --unload [MODEL]` 卸载一个模型，或所有未在使用的模型。网页界面的 **内存中的模型** 面板做同样的事，并用进度条显示每个模型有多少在 GPU 上，其中的 **释放显存** 释放空闲模型占用的显存。对应接口为 `GET /api/v1/runtime` 和 `POST /api/v1/runtime/unload`。"],[5805,"`mizuoto runtime` 询问正在运行的服务器（通过数据目录里的 `server.json` 找到它），因为模型在服务器进程里；没有服务器时报告命令自身进程的情况。对应 `GET /api/v1/runtime` 和 `POST /api/v1/runtime/unload`，以及 Web UI 的**内存中的模型**面板（`LoadedModelsSheet`）。"],[16519,"`mizuoto speak --help` lists every option 