ull). The reference is Mizuoto 0.1's engine workers (git tag `v1-engine-workers`, each engine running upstream code in its original environment); for VoxCPM, which 0.1 never had, it is upstream's own package, put into the same stack by `stack.py --impl upstream`. The code is in the repository; the data lives in a workspace outside it, `MIZUOTO_PARITY_DIR` (default `~/code_workspace/experiment/kodama-refactor`), which holds:"],[5958,"`scripts/parity/` 把原生引擎与它们的参照实现逐采样比较（它的 README 有完整说明）。参照是 Mizuoto 0.1 的引擎 worker（git 标签 `v1-engine-workers`，各引擎在自己原来的环境里运行上游代码）；0.1 没有的 VoxCPM，参照是上游自己的包，经 `stack.py --impl upstream` 套进同一条链路。代码在仓库里；数据放在仓库之外的工作区 `MIZUOTO_PARITY_DIR`（默认 `~/code_workspace/experiment/kodama-refactor`），其中有："],[4176,"`scripts/parity/perf.py run <cases.jsonl>… --name NAME [--only ID] [--repeat N] [--device D] [--setting k=v] [--reference NAME] [--profile] [--torch-profile [--keep-trace]] [--deterministic]`"],[12714,"`scripts/parity/perf.py run <cases.jsonl>… --name NAME [--only ID] [--repeat N] [--device D] [--setting k=v] [--reference NAME] [--profile] [--torch-profile [--keep-trace]] [--deterministic]`"],[14555,"`scripts/parity/quality.py` runs the tier (commands in `scripts/parity/README.md`). The corpus (`scripts/parity/corpus/t4.json`) is 17 sets, each a model and a voice mode: three voices (for cloning the corpus's two English clips and one Chinese clip; three preset speakers; three designed voices) read 20 texts (10 English, 10 Chinese, no digits) with seeds 1–3, 180 clips a set and side. Native runs in this checkout; the reference is 0.1 for every engine it had and upstream's package for VoxCPM, each in its own production dtype on its own RTX 3090. The judges: Whisper large-v3-turbo through Mizuoto's ASR (English by words, Chinese by characters, traditional characters mapped to simplified with OpenCC's table), CAM++ (CosyVoice's), UTMOS22 strong (SpeechMOS), BS.1770 loudness and YIN F0."],[6017,"`scripts/parity/quality.py` 运行这一层（命令见 `scripts/parity/READM