t}`"],[10563,"`train status {experiment}`"],[266,"`train_metrics`"],[8804,"`train_metrics`"],[5970,"`train.py compare <engine> <name>`"],[14508,"`train.py compare <engine> <name>`"],[5968,"`train.py run <engine> --impl reference\\|native --model <id> --method <m> --hp k=v --name <n>`"],[14506,"`train.py run <engine> --impl reference\\|native --model <id> --method <m> --hp k=v --name <n>`"],[3904,"`train.py`"],[6750,"`train.py`"],[7111,"`train.py`"],[12442,"`train.py`"],[15288,"`train.py`"],[15649,"`train.py`"],[15343,"`train.py`, `finetune.py`"],[15216,"`train.py`, `sft.py`"],[15720,"`train.py`, `sft.py`"],[15801,"`train.py`, `sft.py`"],[15486,"`train.py`, `train_s1.py`, `train_s2.py`, `s2_modules.py`, `s2_lora.py`"],[6805,"`train.py`、`finetune.py`"],[6678,"`train.py`、`sft.py`"],[7182,"`train.py`、`sft.py`"],[7263,"`train.py`、`sft.py`"],[6948,"`train.py`、`train_s1.py`、`train_s2.py`、`s2_modules.py`、`s2_lora.py`"],[1571,"`train`"],[10109,"`train`"],[14916,"`train`: upstream's fine-tune loop with its SDPA configs: the shards read by data-loader workers seeded as upstream seeds them, length-grouped batches under a 4-D mask, the masked cross-entropy, AdamW with the cosine schedule, gradient clipping and accumulation. LoRA is peft's, written without peft. Each update's loss is a `ctx.metric`. It ends with `out/checkpoint-<steps>` in upstream's layout."],[6378,"`train`：上游的微调循环及其 SDPA 配置：分片由数据加载 worker 读取，worker 的播种方式与上游相同；按长度分组成批，使用四维掩码；带掩码的交叉熵、带余弦调度的 AdamW、梯度裁剪和梯度累积。LoRA 就是 peft 的那种，但不依赖 peft 实现。每次更新的损失记为一次 `ctx.metric`。最后以上游的目录结构写出 `out/checkpoint-<步数>`。"],[3838,"`TRAINER`"],[12376,"`TRAINER`"],[2537,"`training.attention`"],[2795,"`training.attention`"],[11075,"`training.attention`"],[11333,"`training.attention`"],[2549,"`training.deterministic`"],[11087,"`training.deterministic`"],[2525,"`training.devices`"],[11063,"`training.devices`"],[2541,"`training.keep_checkpoints`"],[11079,"`training.keep_checkpoints`"],[2533,"`training.memory`"],[11071,"`training.memory`"],[15243,"`training.memory`: gradient checkpointing over the language model's or the flow's blocks gives identical losses and weights."],[15830,"`training.memory`: gradient checkpointing over the MiniCPM layers, the local encoder's and the DiT's gives identical results (LoRA dropout and CFM draws replayed); the VAE's decoder stays off the device; for LoRA, `low` stores the frozen linear weights in the autocast dtype (CUDA) and `lowest` streams them from RAM (identical on the CPU)."],[15671,"`training.memory`: gradient checkpointing over the Qwen3 layers (LoRA's dropout masks replayed); for LoRA, `low` also stores the frozen linear weights in the autocast dtype (CUDA: autocast casts them to it at every product anyway) and `lowest` keeps the LoRA layers' frozen base weights in RAM, copied to the GPU for each product, and AdamW's state in RAM. Identical on the CPU (the tiny trainer's losses and adapter); on a GPU with deterministic kernels, the same loss and gradients with float32 and bfloat16 frozen weights. The LoRA's peak: 7.3 GB, 2.1 GB under `low`, 1.1 GB under `lowest` (RTX 3060, 2026-11-04)."],[15748,"`training.memory`: gradient checkpointing over the talker's and code predictor's layers gives identical results; `lowest` keeps AdamW's state in RAM (float32 there)."],[15306,"`training.memory`: gradient checkpointing over the transformer's blocks gives identical results; `low` keeps the EMA copy in RAM; `lowest` also AdamW's state (identical on the CPU)."],[15512,"`training.memory`: the speech stage frees HuBERT before the speaker model; the semantic stage puts only SoVITS's SSL projection and quantiser on the device."],[15370,"`training.memory`: upstream's per-layer checkpointing stays as it is; under `bf16-true` the LoRA layers keep the checkpoint's own bfloat16 tensors as their frozen weights (memory-mapped from the safetensors files, no copy: the same values), and the export's key order is read from a model built on the meta device. Measured on S2 Pro (2026-10-19, an RTX 3090): the training stage's process holds 0.4 GB of its own memory while loading (8.9 GB with bfloat16 copies, 17 GB with float32 ones) and peaks at 5 GB resident; the export holds the merged weights, 9 GB, beside the mapped checkpoint (page cache). Under `lowest` the LoRA linear layers' frozen weights stay in page-locked RAM and are copied to the GPU for each product (`streamed_linear`, the model placed without them): identical (the tiny trainer's losses and LoRA weights on the CPU); S2 Pro's LoRA at batch 2 then peaks at 7.9 GB instead of 15.6 (an RTX 3060, 15.6 s a step there over its PCIe x4 link), and the default batch 4 is estimated at 12.6 GB."],[6974,"`training.memory`：speech 阶段在加载说话人模型之前释放 HuBERT；semantic 阶段只把 SoVITS 的 SSL 投影和量化器放到设备上。"],[6832,"`training.memory`：上游的逐层检查点保持原样；在 `bf16-true` 下，LoRA 层直接把检查点自己的 bfloat16 张量当作冻结的权重（从 safetensors 文件内存映射，不复制：数值相同），导出的键顺序从一个在 meta 设备上构建的模型中读取。在 S2 Pro 上实测（2026-10-19，RTX 3090）：训练阶段的进程加载时只占 0.4 GB 自有内存（用 bfloat16 副本时为 8.9 GB，用 float32 副本时为 17 GB），常驻峰值 5 GB；导出阶段持有合并后的权重 9 GB，另有映射的检查点（页缓存）。`lowest` 下，LoRA 线性层的冻结权重留在锁页内存中，每次矩阵乘法时复制到 GPU（`streamed_linear`，模型放到设备时不带它们）：结果相同（在 CPU 上比较微型训练器的损失值和 LoRA 权重）；S2 Pro 的 LoRA 在批量 2 下峰值从 15.6 GB 降到 7.9 GB（RTX 3060，经其 PCIe x4 链路每步 15.6 秒），默认批量 4 估算为 12.6 GB。"],[7292,"`training.memory`：对 MiniCPM 各层、局部编码器和 DiT 做梯度检查点，结果完全相同（重放 LoRA dropout 和 CFM 的抽样）；VAE 的解码器不放到设备上；对 LoRA，`low` 以自动混合精度的类型存放冻结的线性层权重（CUDA），`lowest` 从内存流式载入它们（在 CPU 上结果相同）。"],[7133,"`training.memory`：对 Qwen3 各层做梯度检查点（重放 LoRA 的 dropout 掩码）；对 LoRA，`low` 还把冻结的线性层权重以自动混合精度的类型存放（CUDA：自动混合精度每次矩阵乘法本来就会转换成这个类型），`lowest` 把 LoRA 层冻结的基座权重留在内存中，每次矩阵乘法时复制到 GPU，AdamW 的状态也放在内存中。在 CPU 上结果相同（比较微型训练器的损失值和适配器）；在 GPU 上开启确定性内核时，float32 与 bfloat16 冻结权重的损失值和梯度相同。LoRA 的峰值：7.3 GB，`low` 下 2.1 GB，`lowest` 下 1.1 GB（RTX 3060，2026-11-04）。"],[7210,"`training.memory`：对 talker 和 code predictor 的层做梯度检查点，结果相同；`lowest` 把 AdamW 的状态放在内存里（在那里是 float32）。"],[6768,"`training.memory`：对 transformer 的块做梯度检查点，结果相同；`low` 把 EMA 副本放在内存里；`lowest` 把 AdamW 的状态也放进去（CPU 上相同