er ones, Escape and outside clicks close only the topmost, everything under a modal layer is `inert`, and focus moves into a layer and back when it closes. A new overlay component registers there instead of setting its own z-index. A tooltip (`Tooltip`) takes no place in the stack: it is rendered at the end of the document, fixed against its content and kept inside the window, at `tooltipZ` (over every open layer and the snackbar), so a sticky footer or a pane beside the navigation rail cannot clip or cover it."],[6429,"`ui/layers.ts` 是所有浮层（对话框、侧栏、菜单、选择器）的唯一记录，按打开顺序决定绘制层级、Escape 和外部点击只关闭最上层、模态层下面的内容设为 `inert`、焦点打开时进入并在关闭时归还。新的浮层组件要通过它注册，而不是自己设 z-index。提示（`Tooltip`）不入栈：它渲染在文档末尾、按内容的位置固定定位并限制在窗口内，层级取 `tooltipZ`（高于所有已打开的浮层和提示条），因此底栏或导航栏旁的面板不会裁切或遮住它。"],[15559,"`UnifiedVoice`: transformers 4.52's GPT-2 (`Conv1D` as `addmm`, tanh GELU, SDPA) and its beam sampling with `BeamSearchScorer`"],[7021,"`UnifiedVoice`：transformers 4.52 的 GPT-2（`Conv1D` 即 `addmm`、tanh GELU、SDPA）及其基于 `BeamSearchScorer` 的束采样"],[14987,"`unwrap(call)` returns the data or throws `ApiError(status, code, message, detail)`; FastAPI's own 422 validation errors become `invalid_input`. `components/errors.ts` turns it into a title (`errors.<code>`), a hint (`detail.hint`) and details on screen."],[6449,"`unwrap(call)` 返回数据，失败时抛 `ApiError(status, code, message, detail)`；FastAPI 自己的 422 校验错误被转成 `invalid_input`。`components/errors.ts` 把它变成界面上的标题（`errors.<code>`）、提示（`detail.hint`）和详情。"],[14181,"`upload` publishes with `hf upload-large-folder` (it needs `hf auth login`) and, with `--modelscope`, with `modelscope upload`."],[5643,"`upload` 用 `hf upload-large-folder` 发布（需要 `hf auth login`），`--modelscope` 时再用 `modelscope upload`。"],[8950,"`upload`: publish"],[412,"`upload`：发布"],[9252,"`url`, `port`, `running`"],[714,"`url`、`port`、`running`"],[8811,"`usage`: devices and memory"],[273,"`usage`：设备与显存占用"],[16109,"`use_qwen_emo` (the emotion model for described emotions, about 1.2 GB), `use_torch_compile`"],[7571,"`use_qwe