"fastapi、starlette、socketio、uvicorn、pydantic、anyio"],[11561,"FastAPI's Swagger page and the schema"],[5506,"fastapi（≥ 0.115.3）、starlette（≥ 0.40）、uvicorn、websockets、python-socketio、pydantic 2、httpx、typer（\\< 0.28）、rich、tomli-w、tomli（Python \\< 3.11）、send2trash"],[16335,"Faster synthesis on F5-TTS, CosyVoice, GPT-SoVITS v4/v5, IndexTTS and Fish Speech S2 Pro; the first synthesis of each new length is slower while it compiles. Needs a C++ compiler, else the engines run as before (with one warning). Applies to models loaded afterwards"],[11252,"Feature"],[11434,"Feature"],[16845,"Feature"],[15435,"Few-shot cloning and voice fine-tuning (RVC-Boss/GPT-SoVITS, MIT). Code: `mizuoto/engines/gptsovits`. On the CPU in fp32 with the same seed it is identical to Mizuoto 0.1 (upstream's `TTS_infer_pack.TTS` behind its adapter) in all 15 parity cases, and its trainer writes upstream's preparation files and weights identically. User-facing details: Engines in depth."],[9315,"few-shot cloning from 3–10 s, a voice's own weights"],[9506,"Few-shot cloning from a 3–10 s clip, and the classic fine-tuning path: a voice can have its own GPT and SoVITS weights, switched in per request. Best for: a voice of your own trained on a few minutes of recordings."],[16897,"few-shot cloning, a voice's own GPT and SoVITS weights"],[8762,"Field"],[8839,"Field"],[11745,"Field"],[12333,"Field"],[14811,"Field"],[12409,"Fields"],[11660,"File"],[14114,"File"],[14940,"File"],[11856,"Files a request names (references, voice caches, weights) cross once by SHA-256 (`have` / `put`, 8 MB parts); the agent keeps them in `cache/remote/files` and prunes those unused for 30 days. The folder a `prepare_voice` writes comes back file by file. The agent beats every 5 s."],[16008,"Files are downloaded into `.part` files and resume after an interruption; each finished file is checked against its size and SHA-256."],[9043,"Files are hard-linked where possible, else copied; each is checked against its manifest, and an incomplete or mismatching model is skipped with the reason."],[9062,"Files downloaded at once"],[10951,"Files downloaded at once (1–8)"],[9003,"Files several models of an engine share (GPT-SoVITS's encoders and text front-end data; IndexTTS-2/2.5's w2v-BERT, semantic codec, CAM++ and BigVGAN; CosyVoice's text normalisation grammars) are shared files, kept in `<models folder>/_assets/<engine>/<name>/` with an `asset.json`."],[16010,"Files several models of an engine share (GPT-SoVITS's encoders, for example) are downloaded with the first model that needs them; the **Shared files** tab lists them."],[9029,"Files the mirror lacks (models it does not hold; archive-type shared files in a mirror made with `build`) come from each model's official repositories, so a partial mirror works."],[16359,"Fill a missing transcript with speech recognition (when installed)"],[8819,"Finally `{\"type\": \"end\", \"job_id\": …, \"output_ids\": […], \"output_id\": …}` or `{\"type\": \"error\", \"code\", \"message\", \"detail\"}`."],[16026,"Finding results"],[13338,"Fine-tune"],[13716,"Fine-tune"],[16685,"Fine-tune"],[8033,"Fine-tune a voice"],[16571,"Fine-tune a voice"],[16591,"Fine-tune the language model, Fine-tune the LLM and the flow"],[8053,"Fine-tune the language model、Fine-tune the LLM and the flow"],[8037,"Fine-tune the model"],[16575,"Fine-tune the model"],[16583,"Fine-tune the model, Fine-tune with LoRA"],[16587,"Fine-tune the model, Fine-tune with LoRA"],[8045,"Fine-tune the model、Fine-tune with LoRA"],[8049,"Fine-tune the model、Fine-tune with LoRA"],[8057,"Fine-tune with LoRA"],[16595,"Fine-tune with LoRA"],[16735,"Fine-tuned weights"],[15589,"First audio"],[12699,"First audio and memory against 0.1 (G8)"],[13517,"First audio is never later than 0.1's; where 0.1 returned whole clips (Qwen3-TTS) it comes 12–18× sooner. Peak memory of one model per run (one case per stack), 0.1 → native → native with `compute.host_copies = off`:"],[13486,"First audio, 0.1 → native"],[10765,"First port to try (1–65535)"],[10672,"First port to try, `[0, 65535]`; `0` picks any"],[13077,"First request s (load)"],[13440,"First request, 0.1 → native"],[9665,"First run"],[15979,"First run"],[11701,"First-party modules it may import"],[9338,"Fish Audio Research License; Drama 3: Fish Audio Community License (gated)"],[16914,"Fish Audio Research License; Drama 3: Fish Audio Community License (licence-gated)"],[800,"Fish Audio Research License；Drama 3：Fish Audio Community License（需接受）"],[8377,"Fish Audio Research License；Drama 3：Fish Audio Community License（需接受许可）"],[15327,"Fish Audio S2 Pro and Drama 3 (fishaudio/fish-speech). S2 Pro and its port are under the Fish Audio Research License; Drama 3 and its port (`mizuoto_fishspeech/drama3`, ported from fish-speech 0f8a12e8) under the Fish Audio Community License 1.0 (see Drama 3). The ports are under these licences, so they ship as a distribution of its own, `mizuoto-fishspeech` (`packages/native/fishspeech`, package `mizuoto_fishspeech`, with `LICENSE.md` and `drama3/LICENSE.md`), registered under the entry-point group `mizuoto.engines` (`fishspeech = mizuoto_fishspeech:FishSpeechEngine`). Downloading the model and speaking need the licence accepted. On the CPU in fp32 with the same seed its codes and audio are identical to upstream's seeded `generate_long` as Mizuoto 0.1 ran it, and its trainer gives 0.1's exported model bit for bit. User-facing details: Engines in depth."],[6789,"Fish Audio S2 Pro 与 Drama 3（fishaudio/fish-speech）。S2 Pro 及其移植版采用 Fish Audio Research License；Drama 3 及其移植版（`mizuoto_fishspeech/drama3`，移植自 fish-speech 0f8a12e8）采用 Fish Audio Community License 1.0（见 Drama 3）。移植版受这些许可约束，所以作为单独的发行包发布：`mizuoto-fishspeech`（`packages/native/fishspeech`，包名 `mizuoto_fishspeech`，附 `LICENSE.md` 与 `drama3/LICENSE.md`），注册在入口点组 `mizuoto.engines` 下（`fishspeech = mizuoto_fishspeech:FishSpeechEngine`）。下载模型和合成都需要先接受许可。在 CPU 上以 fp32、相同种子运行时，它的编码和音频与 Mizuoto 0.1 所运行的上游带种子 `generate_long` 完全相同，训练器导出的模型与 0.1 逐位相同。面向用户的说明见 引擎详解。"],[9585,"Fish Audio S2 Pro, a dual-autoregressive model trained on about ten million hours in some fifty languages, and Drama 3, a 35B mixture-of-experts model (3B active per token) for directed performance. Best for: expressive cloning, free-form inline tags such as `[laughing]` or `[whispering]`, and dialogue between speakers."],[1047,"Fish Audio S2 Pro：双自回归模型，约一千万小时、五十种左右语言的训练数据；以及 Drama 3：面向按指示表演的 35B 混合专家模型（每个 token 激活 3B）。适合：富有表现力的克隆、自由形式的行内标签（如 `[laughing]`、`[whispering]`）和多说话人对话。"],[5037,"Fish S2 Pro"],[5093,"Fish S2 Pro"],[5458,"Fish S2 Pro"],[5473,"Fish S2 Pro"],[13575,"Fish S2 Pro"],[13631,"Fish S2 Pro"],[13996,"Fish S2 Pro"],[14011,"Fish S2 Pro"],[739,"Fish Speech"],[829,"Fish Speech"],[4151,"Fish Speech"],[5255,"Fish Speech"],[6321,"Fish Speech"],[6772,"Fish Speech"],[7340,"Fish Speech"],[8056,"Fish Speech"],[8373,"Fish Speech"],[9277,"Fish Speech"],[9367,"Fish Speech"],[12689,"Fish Speech"],[13793,"Fish Speech"],[14859,"Fish Speech"],[15310,"Fish Speech"],[15878,"Fish Speech"],[16594,"Fish Speech"],[16910,"Fish Speech"],[9382,"Fish Speech (`fish-audio-research+fish-audio-community@2026-03-07+1.0`), IndexTTS (`bilibili-model-use@2025-09-09`)"],[9332,"Fish Speech (`fishspeech`)"],[11496,"Fish Speech (`mizuoto_fishspeech/generate.py`)"],[13874,"Fish Speech (6 GB)"],[9712,"Fish Speech (Fish Audio Research License) and IndexTTS (bilibili Model Use License) need their licence accepted before their models and shared files are downloaded, or they synthesize (exit code 5, HTTP 403). Read it, then:"],[12604,"Fish Speech (S2 Pro, Drama 3)"],[12186,"Fish Speech and IndexTTS are distributions of their own (`mizuoto-fishspeech`, `mizuoto-indextts`), installed into the same environment and registered under the entry-point group `mizuoto.engines`"],[8932,"Fish Speech and IndexTTS are in the image only when it was built with `--build-arg GATED=1`; otherwise their cards say **Not available** (`mizuoto-fishspeech` or `mizuoto-indextts` missing). Even then, their licence must be accepted before downloading their models or speaking:"],[15976,"Fish Speech and IndexTTS are ports of code whose licences (the Fish Audio Research License and, for Drama 3, the Fish Audio Community License; the bilibili Model Use License) also cover the port. They are therefore separate distributions, `mizuoto-fishspeech` and `mizuoto-indextts`, each shipping its licence, installed into the same environment and registered under the entry-point group `mizuoto.engines`. Their manifests ship with `mizuoto`, so the catalogue and the licence text are there before the distribution is installed. They follow the same rules as the built-in engines and import nothing from another engine."],[4232,"Fish Speech clone-en"],[4295,"Fish Speech clone-en"],[4605,"Fish Speech clone-en"],[4766,"Fish Speech clone-en"],[12770,"Fish Speech clone-en"],[12833,"Fish Speech clone-en"],[13143,"Fish Speech clone-en"],[13304,"Fish Speech clone-en"],[13203,"Fish Speech clone-en, bf16"],[4665,"Fish Speech clone-en，bf16"],[11499,"Fish Speech Drama 3 (`mizuoto_fishspeech/drama3/steps.py`)"],[2961,"Fish Speech Drama 3（`mizuoto_fishspeech/drama3/steps.py`）"],[16020,"Fish Speech results show \"Built with Fish Audio\" beneath them, and cannot be used as training data for other engines."],[1335,"Fish Speech S2 Pro"],[2919,"Fish Speech S2 Pro"],[5290,"Fish Speech S2 Pro"],[5370,"Fish Speech S2 Pro"],[9873,"Fish Speech S2 Pro"],[11457,"Fish Speech S2 Pro"],[13828,"Fish Speech S2 Pro"],[13908,"Fish Speech S2 Pro"],[4835,"Fish Speech S2 Pro LoRA"],[13373,"Fish Speech S2 Pro LoRA"],[12883,"Fish Speech S2 Pro LoRA (2 steps): 207.4 s before the CPU rounds, 172–173 s after round 1, 128.5–130.6 s after round 2 (training stage 146.8 → 83 s), metrics and weights identical. Its warm request went from 110.4 to 85.7 s (the codec 3.3 → 2.0 s), its parity cases unchanged."],[12858,"Fish Speech S2 Pro LoRA, 2 steps"],[13242,"Fish Speech S2 Pro LoRA, 2 steps"],[16697,"Fish Speech S2 Pro LoRA, batch 1 / 2"],[13728,"