d yet"],[9387,"Not for training other engines"],[16979,"Note"],[8956,"Notes"],[10013,"Notes"],[12351,"Notes"],[14042,"Notes"],[14762,"nothing"],[13410,"nothing compiled"],[14334,"Nothing refuses a model on an estimate of GPU memory: it always tries to load, and only a real allocation failure is an error. When a job fails for running out of memory (after the exact retries), `ComputeService.release_after_oom` unloads every model not in use from every GPU (ComfyUI's `unload_all_models`); models on the CPU stay. How components share a device below this level is in Memory."],[12663,"nothing: each recipe exactly"],[14095,"numpy ports with integer semantics"],[11726,"numpy, torch"],[11714,"numpy, torch, safetensors, and the optional attention packages flash_attn, flash_attn_interface, xformers, sageattention, sageattn3 (imported on demand inside `runtime/accel` only)"],[11723,"numpy, torch, safetensors, tokenizers, sentencepiece, tiktoken, soxr, yaml, inflect, regex, and the text front ends' packages (pypinyin, rjieba, jieba, opencc, wordsegment, budoux, fasttext, ToJyutping, fugashi, pyopenjtalk, jamo, mecab)"],[11717,"numpy, torch, soxr"],[3188,"numpy、torch"],[3176,"numpy、torch、safetensors，以及可选的注意力包 flash_attn、flash_attn_interface、xformers、sageattention、sageattn3（只在 `runtime/accel` 里按需导入）"],[3185,"numpy、torch、safetensors、tokenizers、sentencepiece、tiktoken、soxr、yaml、inflect、regex，以及各文本前端的包（pypinyin、rjieba、jieba、opencc、wordsegment、budoux、fasttext、ToJyutping、fugashi、pyopenjtalk、jamo、mecab）"],[3179,"numpy、torch、soxr"],[14101,"NVIDIA (CUDA)"],[11393,"NVIDIA (sm ≥ 8.0), head dims 64/96/128"],[11399,"NVIDIA Blackwell (sm ≥ 10.0), more than 1024 queries"],[2861,"NVIDIA Blackwell（sm ≥ 10.0），查询超过 1024 个"],[5563,"NVIDIA（CUDA）"],[2855,"NVIDIA（sm ≥ 8.0），头维度 64/96/128"],[9058,"off"],[9079,"off"],[9095,"off"],[9098,"off"],[9101,"off"],[9832,"off"],[11338,"off"],[16334,"off"],[16367,"off"],[737,"OmniVoice"],[781,"OmniVoice"],[1009,"OmniVoice"],[4070,"OmniVoice"],[5012,"OmniVoice"],[5137,