ns the engine here again. See Remote hosts."],[11015,"Requests waiting for the same model that differ only in their text run as one batch, on engines that take one"],[12388,"Required"],[14027,"Required"],[16938,"Requirement"],[16928,"Requirements"],[16927,"Requirements, torch for your hardware, installing Mizuoto from PyPI, from source or with Docker, where the data lives, and updating and uninstalling."],[10174,"Resample the result"],[11884,"Resource"],[8542,"Resources"],[11883,"Resources have names and capacities. The scheduler runs a job only when every resource it needs has room; otherwise the job is `waiting`, with `waiting_for` naming the full one:"],[8825,"Response"],[11747,"Responsibility"],[9151,"Responsible for"],[8561,"REST API"],[14993,"REST is the source of truth; events only patch or invalidate queries:"],[23,"REST 接口"],[8336,"REST 接口、事件与流式音频的 WebSocket、兼容 OpenAI 的 `/v1/audio/speech`，以及 Python 调用。"],[6455,"REST 是事实来源，事件只修补或作废查询："],[17040,"Restart the server. Prepared voices are rebuilt once, automatically, the next time they are used."],[16568,"Result"],[16057,"Result files are in `outputs/` in the data folder (change it under **Settings › Storage › Results**); where each came from (model, parameters, timings, licence tags) is recorded in the database."],[10971,"Result format: `wav`, `flac`, `mp3`, `ogg`, `m4a`"],[10975,"Result sample rate (8000–192000); empty: the model's own"],[8611,"Results"],[11254,"Results"],[12661,"Results"],[16435,"Results"],[11431,"Results are cached per process and device. `mizuoto doctor` has an `acceleration` finding: the settings, each package (read from its metadata, without importing it), whether it runs on each GPU (`python -m mizuoto.runtime.accel` in a child process, when a GPU is there), and an install command that keeps torch (`--no-deps`; xFormers pinned to the release built for the installed torch)."],[15374,"Results are under the Fish Audio Research License: not for commercial use, and not for training other engines."],[9390,"Results carry the engine's licence tags and notices (Fish Speech's \"Built with Fish Audio\", for instance), shown under the result."],[9718,"Results carry the engine's licence tags and notices (such as \"Built with Fish Audio\"), shown under the result."],[15615,"Results may not be used to train other engines (`trains_others = false`), and cloning needs the consent statement the licence requires."],[9717,"Results of Fish Speech and IndexTTS cannot train other engines: datasets keep the outputs' licence tags and training refuses those clips."],[9171,"Results: `get`, `path_of`"],[8941,"Resuming and verification"],[8754,"Retry"],[11638,"Returns"],[11411,"ROCm, fp16/bf16"],[2873,"ROCm，fp16/bf16"],[11297,"Role"],[11661,"Role"],[11827,"Role"],[12480,"Role"],[14209,"Role"],[12346,"Roles and suffixes of a voice's own fine-tuned weights (GPT-SoVITS: `gpt = \".ckpt\"`, `sovits = \".pth\"`)"],[13004,"Round 1"],[13254,"round 1 → round 2 (`60776a4`)"],[13005,"Round 2"],[13256,"round 2 → the attention dispatcher (`7600f61`)"],[8632,"Route"],[8729,"Route"],[8747,"Route"],[8832,"Route"],[11636,"Route"],[11532,"Route every attention through `accel.attention` with a `Site` per call site; give a hand-written upstream attention as the site's `reference`; pass `mask_info` where the mask is built from a structure."],[12028,"Routes and commands are thin: parse the input, call **one** core method, shape the output. Each operation has one core method, so the API's JSON has the shape of the command line's `--json`. Business logic never goes into `api/` or `cli/`."],[8547,"Routes for the server machine only"],[12884,"Routing every attention call through `mizuoto.runtime.accel` (Acceleration) costs about 1 µs a call under `auto`: +1.11 µs on a decode-sized call (16 heads, 1 query, 300 keys, head dim 128: 28.8 → 30.0 µs), +0.82 µs on a small one. The most calls a request made in the set is 7,152 (Fish Speech), well under 0.1 % of its time. All thirteen cases and all seven fine-tun