`mizuoto-<id>-v<version>`) for the GitHub release (its upload finds the files already on PyPI). Bumping several version files in one push releases them together, Mizuoto first."],[14930,"Socket events"],[11649,"Socket events are not HTTP routes, so FastAPI would leave them out of the schema. `MizuotoAPI` in `openapi.py` overrides `openapi()`: it walks `EventBase.get_events()` (every subclass in `mizuoto/core/events/models.py` with an `__event_name__`), adds each model to `components.schemas`, and adds a `ServerEvents` object mapping event names to models:"],[6392,"Socket 事件"],[3111,"socket 事件不是 HTTP 路由，FastAPI 本不会把它们写进模式。`openapi.py` 的 `MizuotoAPI` 覆盖 `openapi()`：遍历 `EventBase.get_events()`（`mizuoto/core/events/models.py` 中每个带 `__event_name__` 的子类），把各自的模型加入 `components.schemas`，再加一个 `ServerEvents` 对象，事件名 → 模型："],[3113,"socket 只推送变化。客户端收到事件后修补或作废对应的查询，重连后重新拉取屏幕上的内容；任何状态都必须能通过 REST 读到。"],[8724,"socket.io connection"],[186,"socket.io 连接"],[9895,"Some attention keeps its own computation whatever the setting, because no fused kernel computes it: relative positions inside the scores (wenet's, w2v-BERT's, GPT-SoVITS's VITS) and a few hand-written encoders."],[14363,"Some front ends need packages that are not in the default install. Without them those languages fail with `capability_not_supported` and the install command in the hint, and `mizuoto doctor` lists them as warnings:"],[16004,"Some languages need an optional extra (GPT-SoVITS's Japanese and Korean, IndexTTS-2.5's Japanese); `mizuoto doctor` lists the missing ones with their install command, see Optional extras."],[16976,"Some languages need packages that are not installed by default. Without them, text in those languages fails with the install command in the error's hint; `mizuoto doctor` lists the missing ones."],[9006,"Some shared files are archives (GPT-SoVITS's G2PW, NLTK data and Open JTalk dictionary): verified, unpacked into the folder, then deleted; verification and new downloads work on the unpacked file