e.compile, CUDA graphs for decoding steps, sync-free sampling, and the CPU's allocator and thread placement; which opt-in features are not bit-identical."],[12711,"Speed work on the inference and training code follows one rule: **the results do not change**. Every optimisation recorded here gives the same audio sample for sample, and the same losses and saved weights bit for bit, as the code before it on the CPU, where the engines' parity with upstream is established. On a GPU, \"the same\" means identical to the code before on the same GPU, driver, torch and settings. Faster paths that change the arithmetic are opt-in features, described in Acceleration; the user-facing settings are in Performance."],[12808,"Speed-up"],[12851,"Speed-up"],[12967,"Speed-up"],[13035,"Speed-up"],[3558,"Stable Diffusion 模型管理器"],[8871,"Stage"],[14167,"Stage"],[8860,"Stages"],[14833,"Stages"],[16556,"Stages"],[14908,"Stages must be re-runnable: each clears its own output folder first."],[14882,"Stages run in their own process, not in the server's: a run gives all its memory back when it ends, a crash in a stage cannot take the server down, and a stage may seed the process-wide generators (dropout masks and data shuffling draw from them in the upstream recipes) without touching anyone else's randomness."],[16686,"Standard"],[9734,"standard error (the terminal that started `mizuoto webui`)"],[5507,"Starlette 0.40 起 `FileResponse` 支持 Range，播放器可以拖动；uvicorn 要有 websockets 才能处理 WebSocket；typer 锁上限，因为命令行用到它的私有模块"],[14045,"Starlette 0.40's `FileResponse` honours Range, so the player seeks; uvicorn speaks WebSocket only with websockets installed; typer has an upper bound because the command line uses its private modules"],[9245,"Start on a background thread; return the web UI's address once listening"],[9147,"Start the job scheduler and the unloading of idle models"],[14287,"Start the request's streams again (an engine that reseeds per segment, as GPT-SoVITS's upstream did)"],[10664,"Start the serv