m both CosyVoice's and IndexTTS's"],[14918,"Upstream reseeds everything with its config's seed after building the model; the native trainer makes those later draws on private generators seeded the same way (the data-loader workers' seeds, the LoRA dropout masks), while the LoRA initialisation draws from the stage process's global generator in module order, as upstream does; so a seeded run gives upstream's losses and weights."],[12221,"Upstream's accelerated path changes results; replaying the eager kernels does not"],[15287,"Upstream's bundled vocabulary"],[12206,"Upstream's quirks are reproduced first and fixes land as separate changes; even quirks of no product value are reproduced (IndexTTS-1.5 using no KV cache below fp16)"],[11858,"Usage is in Remote hosts; the client side in Runtime."],[14251,"Use"],[16455,"Use"],[9706,"use another GPU: `mizuoto config set engines.<id>.device cuda:1` (**Models** › **Engines** › **Device**);"],[9815,"use at most this much of each GPU (MB; `0`: all of it), for sharing a GPU with other programs"],[10858,"Use at most this much of each GPU (MB; 0: all)"],[14351,"Use that interpreter from then on"],[9707,"use the CPU: `mizuoto config set engines.<id>.device cpu`;"],[8573,"Use the port the server actually started on (7869 by default; the next one when it is taken, see Command line overview). With `mizuoto webui --api-prefix /voice`, every address above (the API, the documentation, the socket and the web UI) moves under that prefix, for example `http://127.0.0.1:7869/voice/api/v1/...` and `http://127.0.0.1:7869/voice/v1/audio/speech`."],[10128,"Use this data directory instead of `MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR` or the default; before or after the command's name (`webui` has its own, the same)"],[16511,"Use this result as **A clip**, with its text as the transcript"],[11886,"Used by"],[12550,"Used by"],[8846,"Used only when the model has **Instructions**; ignored otherwise"],[16990,"Useful options:"],[12201,"Users choose only torch's build; the lic